#: cuts/afailed.sve:10
msgid "Chosen. The village dies. All of our futures die, too."
msgstr "Vyvolený. Vesnice umírá. Celá naše budoucnost umírá s ní."

#: cuts/artimer1.sve:20
msgid "Chosen, the spirits of our ancestors guide me to world of dreams"
msgstr "Vyvolený, duchové našich předků mě přivedly do světa snů"

#: cuts/artimer1.sve:70
msgid "that I may touch thoughts."
msgstr "odkud se mohu dotknout tvé mysli."

#: cuts/artimer1.sve:100
msgid " Our village suffers without the holy GECK."
msgstr " Naše vesnice strádá bez svatého GECKu."

#: cuts/artimer1.sve:170
msgid "Your hands hold our lives as a father holds his children."
msgstr "Tak jako otec bdí nad svými dětmi, i ty třímáš ve svých rukou naše životy."

#: cuts/artimer2.sve:15
msgid "Once again my spirit touches you from the void."
msgstr "Znovu se tě můj duch dotýká z prázdnoty, Vyvolený."

#: cuts/artimer2.sve:60
msgid "Chosen, our crops fail, our reserves are meager."
msgstr "Naše úroda vadne, naše zásoby mizí."

#: cuts/artimer2.sve:140
msgid "Return to us with the GECK."
msgstr "Vrať se k nám a přines GECK."

#: cuts/artimer2.sve:175
msgid "Your failure is our lost light."
msgstr "Tvůj neúspěch je naším ztraceným světlem."

#: cuts/artimer3.sve:10
msgid "Chosen. The village weakens. It is harder to touch your dreams."
msgstr "Vyvolený. Vesnice hyne. Je stále těžší dotknout se tvých snů."

#: cuts/artimer3.sve:85
msgid "You must hurry or we will all..."
msgstr "Musíš si pospíšit, jinak my všichni..."

#: cuts/artimer4.sve:10
msgid "Chosen? Chosen? Do you hear me?"
msgstr "Vyvolený? Vyvolený? Slyšíš mě?"

#: cuts/artimer4.sve:90
msgid "The village dies. All of our futures die, too."
msgstr "Vesnice umírá. Celá naše budoucnost umírá s ní."

#: cuts/artimer4.sve:180
msgid "We have little left in both time and essence."
msgstr "Zbývá nám už jen málo času."

#: cuts/artimer4.sve:270
msgid "Hurry. Hurry..."
msgstr "Pospěš si. Pospěš si..."

#: cuts/boil1.sve:1
msgid "RemindBoy message: Water supplies running low in Vault 13.  Find the water chip quickly."
msgstr "RemindBoy message: Ve Vaultu 13 dochází zásoby vody. Najdi rychle vodní čip."

#: cuts/boil2.sve:1
msgid "RemindBoy message: Water supplies nearly gone in Vault 13.  Situation critical."
msgstr "RemindBoy zpráva: Ve Vaultu 13 brzo dojdou zásoby vody. Situace je kritická."

#: cuts/boil3.sve:1
msgid "RemindBoy message: Water supplies exhausted. Vault 13 is dead.  Mission over."
msgstr "RemindBoy zpráva: Zásoby vody došly. Vault 13 je mrtvý. Mise skončila."

#: cuts/credits.sve:20
msgid "War. War never changes."
msgstr "Válka. Válka je vždycky stejná."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:70 cuts/narrate.txt:3
msgid "The end of the world occurred pretty much as we had predicted."
msgstr "Konec sveta byl, jak jsme predpokladali."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:125 cuts/narrate.txt:4
msgid "Too many humans, not enough space or resources to go around."
msgstr "Mnoho lidi, malo prostoru a mista k zivotu."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:190 cuts/narrate.txt:5
msgid "The details are trivial and pointless, the reasons, as always, purely human ones."
msgstr "Podrobnosti jsouy banalni a nesmyslne, duvody, jako vzdy lidsky jedinec."

#: cuts/credits.sve:285
msgid "The Earth was nearly wiped clean of life."
msgstr "Země byla téměř vyčištěna od života."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:360 cuts/narrate.txt:7
msgid "A great cleansing, an atomic spark struck by human hands, quickly raged out of control."
msgstr "Velke cisteni, atomova jiskra uderila z lidskych rukou, hnev se dostal mimo kontrolu."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:460 cuts/narrate.txt:8
msgid "Spears of nuclear fire rained from the skies."
msgstr "Hroty nuklearniho ohne prsely z oblohy."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:520 cuts/narrate.txt:9
msgid "Continents were swallowed in flames and fell beneath the boiling oceans."
msgstr "Kontinenty zanikly v plamenech a zmizely pod varicimi se oceany."

#: cuts/credits.sve:600
msgid "Humanity was almost extinguished,"
msgstr "Lidstvo bylo téměř vyhubeno"

#: cuts/credits.sve:630
msgid "their spirits becoming part of the background radiation that blanketed the Earth."
msgstr "a jejich duše se staly součástí záření, které přikrylo celou Zemi."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:720 cuts/narrate.txt:11
msgid "A quiet darkness fell across the planet, lasting many years."
msgstr "Ticha noc se snesla na planetu, jako pred davnymi lety."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:810 cuts/narrate.txt:12
msgid "Few survived the devastation."
msgstr "Nekolik prezilo devastaci."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:840 cuts/narrate.txt:13
msgid "Some had been fortunate enough to reach safety, taking shelter in great underground vaults."
msgstr "Nekteri meli tolik stesti, ze se jim podarilo ukryt ve velkych podzemnich sklepenich."

#: cuts/credits.sve:920
msgid "When the great darkness passed, these vaults opened,"
msgstr "Když temnota opadla, kryty se otevřely"

#: cuts/credits.sve:980
msgid "and their inhabitants emerged to begin their lives again."
msgstr "a jejich obyvatelé se vydali vstříc novému životu."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1040 cuts/narrate.txt:15
msgid "One of the northern tribes claims they are descended from one such Vault."
msgstr "Jeden z kmenu na severu pochazi taky z jednoho tohoto sklepeni."

#: cuts/credits.sve:1100
msgid "They hold that their founder and ancestor,"
msgstr "V jejich bájích se traduje, že jejich předek,"

#: cuts/credits.sve:1140
msgid "one known as the \"Vault Dweller,\" once saved the world from a great evil."
msgstr "známý také jako \"Zakladatel\", kdysi zachránil svět před velikým zlem."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1210 cuts/narrate.txt:17
msgid "According to their legend, this evil arose in the far south."
msgstr "Podle jejich legend, toto zlo vzniklo na dalekem jihu."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1280 cuts/narrate.txt:18
msgid "It corrupted all it touched, twisting men inside, turning them into beasts."
msgstr "Znicilo vsechno, ceho se dotklo, zkroutilo lidi uvnitr, zmenilo je ve zvirata."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1370 cuts/narrate.txt:19
msgid "Only through the bravery of this Vault Dweller was the evil destroyed."
msgstr "Jen diky odvaze tohoto \"Zakladatele\", byl dabel znicen."

#: cuts/credits.sve:1440
msgid "But in so doing, he lost many of his friends and suffered greatly,"
msgstr "Ale jak už to bývá, on sám ztratil přátele a velmi trpěl,"

#: cuts/credits.sve:1500
msgid "sacrificing much of himself to save the world."
msgstr "Obětoval se pro záchranu světa."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1570 cuts/narrate.txt:21
msgid "When at last he returned to the home he had fought so hard to protect, he was cast out."
msgstr "Kdyz se konecne vratil domu, tak za to, ze tak tvrde bojoval, byl vyhosten."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1650 cuts/narrate.txt:22
msgid "Exiled."
msgstr "Do exilu."

#: cuts/credits.sve:1685
msgid "In confronting that which they feared,"
msgstr "Naplnilo se totiž to, čeho se všichni báli,"

#: cuts/credits.sve:1740
msgid "he had become something else in their eyes... and no longer their champion."
msgstr "Stal se v jejich očích něčím jiným... a už nebyl jejich hrdina."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1795 cuts/narrate.txt:24
msgid "Forsaken by his people, he strode into the wasteland."
msgstr "Opusten od svych lidi, odesel do pustiny."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1860 cuts/narrate.txt:25
msgid "He traveled far to the north, until he came to the great canyons."
msgstr "Cestoval daleko na sever, dokud nedosel k velikemu kanyonu."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:1930 cuts/narrate.txt:26
msgid "There, he founded a small village, Arroyo, where he lived out the rest of his years."
msgstr "Tam nasel malou vesnici, Arroyo, kde zil po mnoho let."

#: cuts/credits.sve:2025
msgid "And so, for a generation since its founding, Arroyo has lived in peace,"
msgstr "A zde, oddělena od světa hlubokou propastí,"

#: cuts/credits.sve:2095
msgid "its canyons sheltering it from the outside world."
msgstr "žila od svého založení vesnice v klidu a míru."

#. indexed_txt
#: cuts/credits.sve:2165 cuts/narrate.txt:28
msgid "It is home. Your home."
msgstr "Je to domov. Tvuj domov."

#: cuts/credits.sve:2225
msgid "But the scars left by the war have not yet healed. And the Earth has not forgotten."
msgstr "Avšak rány okolního světa se dosud nezahojily. Země nezapomněla."

#: cuts/elder.sve:25
msgid "Come in, Chosen One. There are things you must know."
msgstr "Pojď dál, Vyvolený. Je tu něco, co musíš vědět."

#: cuts/elder.sve:120
msgid "The village is dying. The signs are everywhere."
msgstr "Naše vesnice umírá. Znamení jsou všude kolem."

#: cuts/elder.sve:170
msgid "withering crops..."
msgstr "Vadnoucí úroda..."

#: cuts/elder.sve:210
msgid "dying brahmin..."
msgstr "Umírající brahmíny..."

#: cuts/elder.sve:310
msgid "sick children."
msgstr "Nemocné děti."

#: cuts/elder.sve:370
msgid "There is hope, however. A slim hope that few know of."
msgstr "Avšak je zde naděje. Nepatrná naděje, o které ví jen několik z nás."

#: cuts/elder.sve:470
msgid "The old disks speak of an item called the Garden of Eden Creation Kit."
msgstr "Staré disky mluví o věci zvané G.E.C.K., \"Soupravě k vytvoření rajské zahrady\"."

#: cuts/elder.sve:570
msgid "It is said it can bring life to the wasteland."
msgstr "Říká se, že dokáže vrátit do pustiny život."

