#: dialog/abelaine.msg:300
msgid "If you want to know more about our order, talk to the Abbot. You can find him in his quarters on the third floor."
msgstr "Jestli se chceš o našem řádu dozvědět víc, promluv si s Opatem. Najdeš ho ve třetím patře."

#: dialog/abelaine.msg:301 dialog/abelaine.msg:501
msgid "I see. A few more questions..."
msgstr "Rozumím. Ještě se chci zeptat..."

#: dialog/abelaine.msg:400
msgid "Of course. What would you like to know?"
msgstr "Jistě, co chceš vědět?"

#: dialog/abelaine.msg:401 dialog/ecbridge.msg:110
msgid "What is your name?"
msgstr "Jak se jmenuješ?"

#: dialog/abelaine.msg:402
msgid "Nothing really, bye."
msgstr "Vlastně nic, nashle."

#: dialog/abelaine.msg:500
msgid "My name is Elaine."
msgstr "Jmenuji se Elaine."

#: dialog/abelaine.msg:600
msgid ""
"Hey! Before you go, perhaps you could do me a favor. I'm supposed to bring this machine part to Max in the\n"
" basement copy room. But you see, my left knee has been acting up lately, and it's a real pain for me to go up and down\n"
" all those stairs. Would it trouble you too much to bring him this part for me?"
msgstr "Počkej! Než odejdeš, můžeš mi prokázat malou laskavost? Potřebuji donést tuto součástku Maxovi do tiskárny ve sklepě, ale jak vidíš, moje levé koleno není co bývalo a chození po schodech je velmi bolestivé. Nevadilo by ti zanést mu tu součástku?"

