#: dialog/rcdick.msg:215 dialog/rcdick.msg:221 dialog/rclou.msg:166
#: dialog/rclou.msg:172 dialog/rclou.msg:177 dialog/rclou.msg:182
#: dialog/rcmarge.msg:136 dialog/rcmarge.msg:139 dialog/rcmodjes.msg:108
#: dialog/rcmodjes.msg:112 dialog/rcmodjes.msg:116 dialog/rcmodjes.msg:121
#: dialog/rcmodjes.msg:125 dialog/rcmodjes.msg:151 dialog/rcmodjes.msg:215
#: dialog/rcmodjes.msg:218 dialog/rcmodjes.msg:221 dialog/rcmodjes.msg:227
