msgid "You see Dogmeat."
msgstr "Vidíš Dogmeata."

#: dialog/ecdogmet.msg:103
msgid "The dog gives a low whine when it sees the vault suit. It looks like it wants to come with you."
msgstr "Pes hluboce zakňučí jakmile spatří kombinézu vaultu. Zdá se, že chce jít s tebou."

