#: dialog/ncangbis.msg:290
msgid "Aw, come on! Pleeeease? I really wanted to show you my room. It'll just take a second, I promise."
msgstr "Ale no ták! Prosííím? Hrozně moc ti chci ukázat svůj pokoj. Zabere to jenom chviličku, slibuju."

#: dialog/ncangbis.msg:291
msgid "No go! Me no go! No make me go! No take me bad place! No!"
