#: dialog/ncangbis.msg:310
msgid "You NEW or something? I'm Angela BISHOP. My Dad is the HEAD of Family Bishop. "
msgstr "Ty jsi tady NOVEJ nebo co? Já jsem Angela BISHOPOVÁ. Můj otec je HLAVOU rodiny Bishopů. "

#: dialog/ncangbis.msg:311
msgid "You work for him, which means you work for ME. "
msgstr "Ty pracuješ pro něho, což znamená, že pracuješ i pro MĚ. "

#: dialog/ncangbis.msg:312
msgid "You better do what I say, and I say you're coming with me. Now."
msgstr "Radši udělej, co ti říkám a já ti říkám, abys šel se mnou. Hned."

#: dialog/ncangbis.msg:313
msgid "You're right: Your Dad IS head of Family Bishop. That's why we're not going anywhere."
