#: dialog/ncangbis.msg:520
msgid "Kind of like shit through the intestines, huh? Don't stay too long, bitch, or you're gonna get hurt."
msgstr "Jako sračky střevama, co? Nezůstávej tady dlouho, děvko, nebo by se ti mohlo něco stát."

#: dialog/ncangbis.msg:522
msgid "Bitch..."
