#: dialog/ncwritee.msg:326
msgid "How do you go to the bathroom with that thing on?"
msgstr "Jak s tou zbrojí na sobě chodíš na záchod?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:220 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:222 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:220
#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:222 dialog/ncwritee.msg:240 dialog/ncwritee.msg:242
msgid "Howdy, "
msgstr "Zdárec, "

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:221 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:221
msgid "Damn hot, innit, "
msgstr "Je hrozný vedro, co, "

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:230 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:230 dialog/nckeiwri.msg:240
msgid "I still can't believe Dad is dead. There's so much that I wanted to say to him..."
msgstr "Pořád nemůžu uvěřit, že je táta mrtvej. Chtěl jsem mu toho ještě tolik říct..."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:235 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:235
msgid "Piss off."
msgstr "Odpal."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:236 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:236
msgid "Piss off. I mean it."
msgstr "Odpal. Myslím to vážně."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:237 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:237
msgid "I ain't got nothing to say to you."
msgstr "Nemám ti co říct."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:246 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:246
msgid "Hey! How's it going, "
msgstr "Hej! Jak to jde, "

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:247 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:247
msgid "Hey, you got my thanks for finding who killed Richard, "
msgstr "Hej, jsem ti vděčnej, že se ti podařilo zjistit, kdo zabil Richarda, "

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:248 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:248
msgid ". I owe you big, and the Wright family always pays its debts. What can I do for you?"
msgstr ". Jsem tvůj velkej dlužník a Wrightova rodina vždycky svoje dluhy splatí. Co pro tebe můžu udělat?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:249 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:249 dialog/nckeiwri.msg:255
msgid "Mattah. Man is Mattah!"
msgstr "Mattah. Chlap je Mattah!"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:250 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:250
msgid "Hoobajuube"
msgstr "Kdo ty?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:253 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:276
msgid "Actually, yes. I'm looking for a job. Is Family Wright hiring?"
msgstr "Vlastně ano. Hledám práci. Nabírají Wrightovi?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:254 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:254
msgid "Say, I ran into your mom."
msgstr "Poslyš, potkal jsem tvoji matku."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:255 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:255
msgid "Can you tell me about Richard?"
msgstr "Můžeš mi říct něco o Richardovi?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:256 dialog/ncpitbos.msg:291 dialog/ncpitbos.msg:329
#: dialog/ncpitbos.msg:352 dialog/ncpitbos.msg:1339
msgid "Nothing, thanks. Sorry to bother you."
msgstr "Nic, díky. Promiň, že obtěžuju."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:265 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:265
msgid "Piss off, retard. I ain't got time to do sign language with you."
msgstr "Zmizni, retarde. Nemám čas si s tebou povídat znakovou řečí."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:275 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:275
msgid "I'm Chris. Chris Wright. Of the Family Wright. Glad you asked?"
msgstr "Já jsem Chris. Chris Wright. Z rodiny Wrightů. Máš radost?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:277 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:277
msgid "Family Wright? Who's that?"
msgstr "Rodina Wrightů? To je kdo?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:278 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:278
msgid "Chris Wright, huh? Say, I ran into your mom."
msgstr "Chris Wright jo? Poslyš, potkal jsem tvoji matku."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:279 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:294 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:309
#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:328 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:279
msgid "Can you tell me what happened to your brother Richard?"
msgstr "Můžeš mi říct, co se stalo tvému bratrovi Richardovi?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:280 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:280
msgid "Not really. Sorry to bother you."
msgstr "Ani ne. Sorry že sem otravoval."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:290
msgid ""
"You ain't heard of Family Wright? You musta been out in the desert too long. Family Wright\n"
" is the biggest crime family in Reno. We're gonna rule this city."
msgstr "Ty neznáš rodinu Wrightových? Musels být v poušti pěkně dlouho. Wrightova rodina je největší kriminální rodina v Renu. Brzy budeme šéfovat celýmu městu."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:291 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:291
msgid "Really? Sounds like the Wright family holds all the cards. Are they hiring?"
msgstr "Opravdu? To zní, jako kdyby měli všechny esa. Nabírají lidi?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:292
msgid ""
"Actually, I got the impression they were one of the weakest of the families... I mean, they\n"
" only deal in alcohol, they have no casino or drug trade, and their numbers are much less than\n"
" other families."
msgstr "Vlastně mi přijde, že jsou nejslabší rodina... chci říct, kšeftujou jenom s chlastem, nemají ani kasíno nebo fet a dohromady jich je mnohem méně než v ostatních rodinách."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:293 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:293
msgid "Speaking of family, I ran into your mom."
msgstr "Když už mluvíme o rodině, potkal jsem tvoji matku."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:295 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:295
msgid "Really? How interesting... well, look, I have to be going."
msgstr "Opravdu? To je zajímavé... poslyš, už musím jít."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:306 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:306
msgid "Can you tell me about Family Wright?"
msgstr "Můžeš mi říct něco o rodině Wrightových?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:307 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:307
msgid "Is Family Wright hiring?"
msgstr "Nabírají Wrightovi lidi?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:308 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:308
msgid "I ran into your mom not long ago. Nice lady."
msgstr "Před nedávnem jsem potkal tvoji matku. Fajn dáma."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:310 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:310
msgid "No, no other questions. I better be going."
msgstr "Ne, žádné další otázky. Raději už půjdu."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:315
msgid ""
"(The young man turns to you, looks you up and down. His eyes stop at the mark on your forehead.) Well, now.\n"
" (He sneers, then spits on your feet.) Why don't you make yourself useful and lick that up, slaver?"
msgstr "(Mladík se k tobě otočí a prohlédne si tě od hlavy k patě. Jeho oči se zastaví na tetování na tvém čele.) No. (Odrfkne si a potom ti plivne na nohu.) Buď taky trochu k něčemu a slízni to, otrokáři."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:316
msgid ""
"(The young man turns to you, looks you up and down.) Well, now. (He sneers, then spits on your feet.) Why don't you\n"
" make yourself useful and lick that up, you piece of [FA] dogshit?"
msgstr "(Mladík se k tobě otočí a prohlédne si tě od hlavy k patě.) No. (Odrfkne si a potom ti plivne na nohu.) Buď taky trochu k něčemu a slízni to, ty psí sračko."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:317 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:318
msgid "Kick him with the boot he spat on."
msgstr "Kopnout ho botou, na kterou ti plivl."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:318
msgid "Wander off "
msgstr "Odstoupit "

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:319 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:320
msgid "Let it alone and walk away. This time. "
msgstr "Nechat to být a odejít. Tentokrát."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:325
msgid ""
"Well... I...I mean, the Wright family... my family... might have an opening. I ain't promising nothing, but go to the mansion\n"
" south of here, find my brother Keith and tell him I sent you. Name's Chris. Chris Wright."
msgstr "No... já... teda, Wrightova rodina... moje rodina... by mohla mít volnej flek. Nic ti neslibuju, ale zajdi do toho baráku na jih odsud, najdi mýho bráchu Keitha a řekni mu, že tě posílám. Jmenuju se Chris. Chris Wright."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:326 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:326
msgid "Uh, Family Wright? Who's that?"
msgstr "Eh, Wrightova rodina? To je kdo?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:327 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:327
msgid "Wright, huh? I ran into your mom."
msgstr "Wright, jo? Potkal jsem tvoji matku."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:329
msgid "Thanks. I'll go talk to him."
msgstr "Díky, půjdu za ním."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:335
msgid "Naw, I can't think of any place that's hiring.  Most of the families in town are pretty close-knit."
msgstr "Nee, nevím o žádným volným fleku. Většina rodin ve městě drží pospolu a cizí k sobě neberou."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:336 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:336 dialog/nccorbro.msg:594
#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:359 dialog/ncmason.msg:308 dialog/ncmason.msg:440
#: dialog/ncmcgee.msg:350 dialog/ncorvill.msg:583 dialog/vcmoore.msg:211
msgid "All right then."
msgstr "Tak dobře."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:345
msgid "Oh, great. Did she give you a speech?"
msgstr "No skvělý. Udělala ti přednášku?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:346 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:346
msgid "A little. Do you not like your mother?"
msgstr "Tak trochu. Ty nemáš rád svoji matku?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:347 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:347
msgid "No. Does she usually?"
msgstr "Ne. To někdy dělává?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:348 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:348
msgid "Not really. Look, I better be going. "
msgstr "Vlastně ne. No, už musím jít."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:355
msgid ""
"That a *joke?* If so, it damn well missed the funny mark by a mile. You trying to start something with Family\n"
" Wright, wise guy?"
msgstr "Děláš si *srandu?* Jestli jo, tak se ti ten fórek ani TROCHU nepovedl. Zkoušíš si něco začínat s Wrightovýma, chytráku?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:356
msgid "Start something? No, just *finish* it."
msgstr "Začnout si něco? Ne, jenom *dokončit*."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:357 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:357
msgid "No, I'm sorry. I didn't mean it like that. Look, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Ne, promiň. Tak jsem to nemyslel. Poslyš, mám ještě nejaké otázky..."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:358 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:358
msgid "No, not at all. I think I better be going. "
msgstr "Ne, vůbec ne. No, raději půjdu."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:365
msgid "She just doesn't pay attention to what's going on around her. I love her n' all, but sometimes, she's as blind as a mule."
msgstr "Ona se zkrátka nezajímá o věci, co se dějou kolem. Mám ji rád, ale občas je slepá jako netopýr."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:366
msgid "Well, not long ago, she charged into our alcohol still here and busted up the place, destroying our entire cash crop! I love her n' all, but sometimes she's as blind as a mule."
msgstr "No, nedávno vletěla do naši palírny a celý to tam zničila! Mám ji rád, ale občas je slepá jako netopýr."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:367 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:367
msgid "Heh-heh. And she looks like one, too."
msgstr "Haha. A taky tak vypadá."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:368 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:368
msgid "Blind? How do you mean?"
msgstr "Slepá? Jak to myslíš?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:369 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:369 dialog/nclabish.msg:288
#: dialog/ncrenesc.msg:1041 dialog/vckohl.msg:165 dialog/vckohl.msg:170
#: dialog/vckohl.msg:175 dialog/vckohl.msg:179 dialog/vcnancy.msg:222
#: dialog/vcnancy.msg:230
msgid "Oh. I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Aha. Chci se ještě na něco zeptat..."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:370 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:370
msgid "I suppose. Look, I better be going. "
msgstr "Hmm. No, už půjdu."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:380
msgid ""
"She goes around and preaches all about sinning and stuff, but she doesn't even really know what Dad does.\n"
" Either that, or she ignores it."
msgstr "Chodí kolem a káže o hřešení a tak, ale ani neví, co vlastně táta dělá. A nebo to ignoruje."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:381 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:381
msgid "What does your Dad do?"
msgstr "A co tvůj táta dělá?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:382 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:392 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:382
msgid "Hmmmm. Say, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Hmmm. Dobře, chci se ještě zeptat..."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:383 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:393 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:383
msgid "Interesting. Well, I have to be going. "
msgstr "Zajímavé. No, já už musím jít."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:390
msgid ""
"Makes alcohol, runs guns, rubs out people who fuck with him... typical family stuff. Mom'd be pissed\n"
" if she actually paid mind to what was going on. And 'specially if she found this still, here."
msgstr "Pálí chlast, prodává kvéry, mlátí lidi, kteří s ním chtějí vymrdat...typický rodinný záležitosti. Matka by byla nasraná, kdyby se dozvěděla, co vlastně děláme. A zvlášť, kdyby našla tuhle palírnu."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:391 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:391
msgid "How pissed would she be?"
msgstr "Jak moc nasraná by byla?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:400
msgid ""
"Probably pissed enough to wreck this place... at least. Then she'd give us all a tongue lashing and a few\n"
" solid days of preaching. Heh."
msgstr "Dost na to, aby to tady rozkopala. A pak by nám nadávala a několik dní bysme museli poslouchat její kázání. Hehe."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:401 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:401 dialog/ncjimmyj.msg:512
#: dialog/ncjules.msg:547
msgid "Interesting. Say, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Zajímavé. Mám ještě nějaké otázky..."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:402 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:402
msgid "Hmmmmm. Thanks. "
msgstr "Hmmmmm. Díky."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:410
msgid ""
"Rich? Aw, you know, he was found like one of those Jet crashers, dead in one of the gutters. Near as we can\n"
" figure, someone pumped him with drugs until he was dead."
msgstr "Rik? No víš, našli ho mrtvýho ve škarpě jako nějakýho feťáka. Myslíme si, že ho někdo pumpoval drogama, dokud neumřel."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:411
msgid "'Someone' gave him too much? How do you know he didn't overdose because he took too much?"
msgstr "'Někdo' mu dal moc? Jak víte, že se nepředávkoval sám?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:412 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:424 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:412
#: dialog/ncliljes.msg:953
msgid "Who do you figure might have done it?"
msgstr "Kdo myslíte, že to udělal?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:413 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:413 dialog/vcstark.msg:301
msgid "Sorry to hear that. I had some other questions..."
msgstr "To je mi líto. Chci se ještě na něco zeptat..."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:414 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:414
msgid "Nasty. Look, I have to be going. "
msgstr "To je nepříjemné. No, už musím jít."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:420
msgid ""
"Cause he was a clean kid... Mom taught him THAT much. And if you feel like saying any different, maybe you and I\n"
" should settle it right here."
msgstr "Protože byl čistej...matka ho to naučila. A jestli na to máš jiný názor, můžeme to spolu vyřešit hned na místě."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:421 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:421
msgid "I didn't mean it like that. Sorry I brought it up."
msgstr "Tak jsem to nemyslel. Promiň."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:422 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:436 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:422
msgid "Don't blind yourself to the possibility he might have been taking it. Jet is extremely addictive."
msgstr "Nenech se zaslepit přehnanou vírou ve svého bratra. Klidně to mohl brát. Jet je vysoce návykový."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:423
msgid ""
"Look, KID, if you know what's good for you, you'll stop throwing down every time a little truth comes along\n"
" and bites you in the ass."
msgstr "Poslyš, chlapče, jestli víš, co je pro tebe dobré, přestaň zavírat oči pokaždé, když se stane nějaká ošklivá událost a kopne tě do prdele."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:425 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:425
msgid "I'm not looking for any trouble. I'll be going. "
msgstr "Nestojím o problémy. Půjdu."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:435
msgid "Yeah, well, just watch it. Them's fighting words to any Wright, so don't go shooting off your mouth like that, awright?"
msgstr "No, dávej si pozor. To jsou slova, který se nelíbí žádnýmu Wrightovi, takže je z huby radši nepouštěj, jasný?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:437
msgid ""
"Look, KID, don't start with me. If you know what's good for you, you'll stop trying to throw down every time\n"
" a little truth comes along and bites you in the ass."
msgstr "Poslyš, chlapče, nech mě na pokoji. Jestli víš, co je pro tebe dobré, přestaň zavírat oči pokaždé, když se stane nějaká ošklivá událost a kopne tě do prdele."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:438 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:438
msgid "Sorry, no offense intended. Say, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Promiň, neber si to špatně. Chci se ještě zeptat..."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:439 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:439
msgid "Understood. I better be going. "
msgstr "Rozumím. Raději půjdu."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:445 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:445
msgid "Piss off. I ain't got nothing more to say to you."
msgstr "Odpal, nebudu se s tebou bavit."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:446 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:446
msgid "Wait, I just had one more question..."
msgstr "Počkej, jenom jednu otázku..."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:447 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:447
msgid "I'm leaving, I'm leaving. "
msgstr "Už jdu, už jdu."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:455 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:455
msgid "(Chris stares at you for a moment, then lunges at you!)"
msgstr "(Chris na tebe chvíli zírá a poté se na tebe vrhne!)"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:456
msgid "So THIS is how it's gonna BE, huh? ALL RIGHT THEN, LET'S G --"
msgstr "Tak takhle ty, jo? FAJN, TAK POJĎ..."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:465 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:465
msgid "My guess is the Mordinos, either one of their dealers or one of the Mordino family themselves. Bastards make tons of Jet."
msgstr "Řekl bych že Mordinové. Buď některej z jejich dealerů nebo přímo jeden z Mordinovic rodiny. Ti hajzlové mají tuny Jetu."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:466 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:477 dialog/ncchiwri.msg:496
#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:466
msgid "Got it. Say, I had some other questions..."
msgstr "Rozumím. Poslyš, chci se zeptat..."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:467 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:467
msgid "Which of the dealers do you think sold it to Richard?"
msgstr "Který z dealerů?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:468 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:468
msgid "I see. I better be going. "
msgstr "Aha. Tak já půjdu."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:475
msgid ""
"Could have been any one of them: Jagged Jimmy J, that scarred son of a bitch at the corner of Virgin Street, or\n"
" Renesco 'the Rocketman,' that weasel who sells Jet outta that fortified shell up on the West Side."
msgstr "Mohl to být kdokoliv z těchle: zjizvenej zkurvysyn Pořezanej Jimmy J na rohu panenský ulice, nebo tchoř Renesco 'Rakeťák', co prodává Jet z tý svý pevnosti v západní ulici."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:476 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:476
msgid "Any other dealers?"
msgstr "Nějací další dealeři?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:485
msgid "Hey, man, thank YOU."
msgstr "Hej, kámo, DÍKY."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:486
msgid "Hey, lady, thank YOU."
msgstr "Hej, dámo, DÍKY."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:487 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:487
msgid "You find out who killed my brother, and all of Family Wright'll be thanking you. And that's no small thanks, understand?"
msgstr "Díky tobě víme, kdo zabil Rika a celá rodina Wrigtů ti za to děkuje. A to nejsou žádný malý díky, jasný?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:488 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:488
msgid "I understand. Catch you later, Chris. "
msgstr "Rozumím. Uvidíme se později, Chrisi."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:495
msgid ""
"Jules at the head of town also sells Jet, but he mostly sells to tourists... then there's Little Jesus Mordino:\n"
" he mighta pushed drugs on Rich while Rich was out alone. He hangs out at the Desperado."
msgstr "Ještě Jules na kraji města prodává Jet, ale většinou jen turistům... a pak je tady Malej Ježíš Mordino. Mohl ho napumpovat drogama, když byl Rich sám venku. Poflakuje se kolem Desperada."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:497 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:497
msgid "Jagged Jimmy J, Renesco the Rocketman, Jules and Little Jesus... I'll check them out. Thanks for the info, Chris. "
msgstr "Pořezanej Jimmy J, Renesco Rakeťák, Jules a Malej Ježíš...podívám se na ně. Díky za informace, Chrisi."

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:1201 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:1201
msgid "! You rock!"
msgstr "! Jseš nejlepší!"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:1220 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:1220 dialog/ncwritee.msg:1240
msgid ". What you been up to?"
msgstr ". Na co se chystáš?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:1222 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:1222 dialog/ncwritee.msg:1242
msgid ". How's things?"
msgstr ". Jak to jde?"

#: dialog/ncchiwri.msg:1246 dialog/ncchrwri.msg:1246
msgid "? Everybody treating you all right? Anything you need?"
msgstr "? Všichni se k tobě chovaj dobře? Nepotřebuješ něco?"

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:150
msgid "You see a grease-covered mechanic."
msgstr "Vidíš špinavého mechanika."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:151
msgid "You see one of the chop shop boyz."
msgstr "Vidíš jednoho z mechaniků."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:152
msgid "You see a shifty-looking mechanic. You can barely make out his features beneath the grease and oil."
msgstr "Vidíš odpudivého mechanika. Kvůli vrstvě oleje a špíny se jeho obličej skoro nedá rozeznat."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:200 dialog/ncchpboy.msg:267
msgid "Holy shit. *Gulp* Look what just walked in."
msgstr "A do prdele. *Polk* Podívejte se, kdo přišel."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:201
msgid "Well, if ain't Mr. Fucking Coffee Can."
msgstr "No jestlipak to není pan Zkurvená Plechovka."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:202 dialog/ncjunkie.msg:457
msgid "Anybody in that thing?"
msgstr "Je tam někdo?"

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:203 dialog/ncchpboy.msg:269
msgid "Can we get you anything? A beer? Some water? A danish?"
msgstr "Můžem ti něco donýst? Pivo? Vodu? Cukroví?"

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:204
msgid "I hope nothing's wrong, uh, sir... or ma'am. Whatever you are inside there."
msgstr "Doufám, že je všechno v pořádku, eh, pane... nebo madam. Ať už je uvnitř kdokoliv."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:205 dialog/ncchpboy.msg:270
msgid "Whatever's wrong, T-Ray's responsible. I'd see him."
msgstr "Jestli je něco špatně, může za to T-Ray. Promluv si s ním."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:206
msgid "Is that some kind of new car?"
msgstr "To je nějakej novej druh auta?"

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:207
msgid "We don't want any trouble."
msgstr "Nechceme žádný problémy."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:208 dialog/ncchpboy.msg:272
msgid "Maybe you came looking for T-Ray. He's in the back."
msgstr "Jestli hledáš T-Raye, tak je vzadu."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:220
msgid "Well, helloooo there, little lady. Damn fine performance you give."
msgstr "Nazdárek, krásná dámo. To byl ale zatraceně dobrej výkon."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:221
msgid "Wow. Don't get many visitors. What can we do for you, Miss "
msgstr "Páni. Nemíváme moc návštěvníků. Co pro vás můžeme udělat, slečno "

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:222
msgid "How did you get your legs over your head like that?"
msgstr "Jak to děláš, že si dokážeš dát nohy za hlavu?"

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:223
msgid "Are those real tits? Can I make sure?"
msgstr "Jsou ty kozy pravý? Můžu se přesvědčit?"

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:224
msgid "Would it be too much trouble for you to check under my hood?"
msgstr "Nevadilo by ti, kdyby ses mi podívala na podvozek?"

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:225
msgid "Aw, hell, I look like crap, then you show up. Don't mind the grease, miss."
msgstr "Zatraceně. Vypadám hrozně a pak se ukážeš zrovna ty. Tý špíny si nevšímej."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:226
msgid "You looking for talent? T-Ray's in the back, so don't bother going there."
msgstr "Nehledáš novej talent? T-Ray je vzadu, takže tam ani nechoď."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:227
msgid "I knew I should have washed today..."
msgstr "Já věděl, že jsem se měl osprchovat..."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:228
msgid "Check your oil? Heh-heh."
msgstr "Můžu ti zkontrolovat mazání? Hehe."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:229
msgid "Wanna see my lil' grease monkey?"
msgstr "Chceš vidět mýho ochočenýho ptáčka?"

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:232
msgid "Well, helloooo there, little lady."
msgstr "Nazdárek, krásná dámo."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:233
msgid "Wow. Don't get many visitors. What can we do for you, miss?"
msgstr "Páni. Nemíváme moc návštěvníků. Co pro vás můžeme udělat, slečno?"

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:234
msgid "You looking for some hot love? T-Ray's in the back, so don't bother going there."
msgstr "Hledáš nějaký vášnivý milování? T-Ray je vzadu, takže tam ani nechoď."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:247
msgid "You don't look so tough for a prizefighter."
msgstr "Na šampióna moc drsně nevypadáš."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:251
msgid "Wanna beer? We usually save them for when we're working."
msgstr "Nechceš pivo? Většinou si je šetříme na pracovní dobu, ale pro tebe..."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:252
msgid "T-Ray said you ain't so tough. I'll give you 5 chips if you go punch him."
msgstr "T-Ray říkal, že nejseš zas tak drsnej. Dám ti 5 babek, když mu jednu vrazíš."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:253
msgid "T-Ray said you got a glass jaw. He's in the back if you want to go talk to him."
msgstr "T-Ray říkal, že máš hubu ze skla. Jestli s ním chceš mluvit, je vzadu."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:254
msgid "That Mastictor's a big wuss. Uh, don't tell him I said that, though."
msgstr "Ždímačka je pěknej posera. Eh, neříkej mu, že jsem to říkal."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:265
msgid "I hope nothing's wrong, ma'am."
msgstr "Doufám, že je všechno v pořádku, madam."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:266
msgid "We meant no disrespect, ma'am."
msgstr "Nechtěli jsme se vás dotknout, madam."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:268
msgid "What can we do for you, "
msgstr "Co pro tebe můžeme udělat, "

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:271
msgid "Tell your boss hello from all us."
msgstr "Pozdravuj od nás svýho šéfa."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:273
msgid "I hope nothing's wrong, sir."
msgstr "Doufám, že je všechno v pořádku, pane."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:274
msgid "We meant no disrespect, sir."
msgstr "Nechtěli jsme se vás dotknout, pane."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:300
msgid "Sorry about that misunderstanding with the Highwayman."
msgstr "Omlouváme se za to nedorozumění s Higwaymanem."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:301
msgid "We didn't know the Highwayman was yours."
msgstr "Nevěděli jsme, že je ten Highwayman tvůj."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:302
msgid "Yeah, the Highwayman's not a bad car, but I'd rather have an Omni."
msgstr "Jó, Highwayman není špatná kára, ale já bych radši Omni."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:303
msgid "You looking to sell the Highwayman?"
msgstr "Nechceš toho Higwaymana prodat?"

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:304
msgid "Go, greased lightning, go."
msgstr "Jeď, namazanej blesku, jeď."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:305
msgid "Grease is the word that I heard... dum dum dum dum..."
msgstr "Namazanej je to slovo... tády dády dááá..."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:306
msgid "The Highwayman's a sweet car; Chryslus sure knew how to make them back then."
msgstr "Highwayman je parádní kára. Chryslus moc dobře věděl, jak je tenkrát vyrobit."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:307
msgid "T-Ray's \"working\" in the back again. Lazy bastard."
msgstr "T-Ray už zase \"pracuje\" vzadu. Zatracenej parchant."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:308
msgid "I'm sick of picking up T-Ray's slack."
msgstr "Už je mi blbě z toho makání za T-Raye."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:309
msgid "T-Ray's been scoping my woman again."
msgstr "T-Ray zase očumoval moji starou."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:310
msgid "T-Ray slept with my sister. And my mother. And my dog."
msgstr "T-Ray chrápal s mojí sestrou. A matkou. A psem."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:311
msgid "T-Ray's hornier than a four-headed goat."
msgstr "T-Ray je nadrženější než býk na tvrdolínu."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:312
msgid "T-Ray's in the back. On the phone."
msgstr "T-Ray je vzadu. Telefonuje."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:313 dialog/nctray.msg:254
msgid "Engine's still good."
msgstr "Motor fachá pořád dobře."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:314
msgid "Interior smells like someone took a dump in there."
msgstr "Vevnitř to smrdí, jako by se tam někdo vysral."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:315
msgid "Interior smells like gecko."
msgstr "Interiér smrdí jako geckon."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:316
msgid "Not a bad car, but I'd rather have an Omni."
msgstr "Slušná kára, ale já bych radši Omni."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:317 dialog/nctray.msg:262
msgid "The Highwayman's got a full analog system, 800 + Horsepower, 0 to 60 in less than a second."
msgstr "Highwayman má plně analogovej systém, přes 800 koní a dá stovku pod sekundu."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:318 dialog/nctray.msg:263
msgid "Fast? The Highwayman goes from 0 to 60 in less than a second."
msgstr "Rychlej? Highwayman dá stovku pod sekundu."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:319 dialog/nctray.msg:264
msgid "The Highwayman's got the power: 800+, in fact."
msgstr "Highwayman má fakt sílu: přes 800 koní."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:320
msgid "You supposed to be here?"
msgstr "Máš tu něco na práci?"

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:321
msgid "Feel sorry for the idiot who left this Highwayman lying around."
msgstr "Fakt lituju toho idiota, kterej nechal tohohle Higwaymana jen tak ležet."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:322
msgid "I wouldn't sweat it; the Highwayman's got a full analog system and no computers. None of the fancy stuff."
msgstr "Highwayman má plně analogovej systém, žádný počítače a žádný moderní vymoženosti."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:330
msgid "Hands off or your hands come off. Understand?"
msgstr "Ruce pryč, nebo tvý ruce budou pryč. Rozumíš?"

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:331
msgid "Get the HELL away from that car."
msgstr "Vypadni SAKRA od toho auta."

#: dialog/ncchpboy.msg:332
msgid "Your life ain't worth more than that car. Touch it again, and I'll prove it to you."
msgstr "Tvůj život nemá větší cenu než to auto. Dotkni se ho ještě jednou a dokážu ti to."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:253 dialog/nckeiwri.msg:258
msgid "I'm looking for a job. Is Family Wright hiring?"
msgstr "Hledám práci. Nabírají Wrightovi?"

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:256 dialog/nccorbro.msg:788 dialog/ncftully.msg:262
#: dialog/ncmcgee.msg:397 dialog/vcskeeve.msg:122
msgid "Nothing. Sorry to bother you."
msgstr "Nic. Promiň, že obtěžuju."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:257
msgid "Can you tell me about the Wright Family?"
msgstr "Můžeš mi říct něco o Wrightově rodině?"

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:290
msgid ""
"You ain't heard of Family *Wright?* You musta been out in the desert too long. Family Wright is the biggest crime family\n"
" in Reno. We're gonna rule this city."
msgstr "Ty neznáš rodinu Wrightů? To jsi musel být v poušti asi pěkně dlouho. Wrightova rodina je největší zločinecká rodina v Renu. Brzy budem šéfovat celýmu městu."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:292
msgid "Actually, I got the impression they were one of the weakest of the families... I mean, they only deal in alcohol, they have no casino or drug trade, and their numbers are much less than other families."
msgstr "Vlastně mi přijde, že jsou nejslabší rodina... chci říct, kšeftujou jenom s chlastem, nemají ani kasíno nebo fet a dohromady jich je mnohem méně než v ostatních rodinách."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:296
msgid "Family Wright is the biggest crime family in Reno. We're gonna rule this city."
msgstr "Wrightova rodina je největší zločinecká rodina v Renu. Brzy budem šéfovat celýmu městu."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:315
msgid ""
"(The young man looks you up and down. His eyes stop at the mark on your forehead.) Well, now. (He sneers, then spits\n"
" on your feet.) Why don't you make yourself useful and lick that up, slaver?"
msgstr "(Mladík se k tobě otočí a prohlédne si tě od hlavy k patě. Jeho oči se zastaví na tetování na tvém čele.) Ale ale. (Odfrkne si a poté ti plivne na nohu.) Slízni to, otrokáři."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:316
msgid ""
"(The young man looks you up and down.) Well, now. (He sneers, then spits on your feet.) Why don't you make yourself\n"
" useful and lick that up, you piece of "
msgstr "(Mladík se k tobě otočí a prohlédne si tě od hlavy k patě.) Ale ale. (Odfrkne si a poté ti plivne na nohu.) Slízni to, ty psí "

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:317
msgid " dogshit?"
msgstr " sračko."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:325
msgid ""
"Well, I... I mean, the Wright family... my family... might have an opening. I ain't promising nothing, but go to the mansion\n"
" south of here, find my brother Keith and tell him I sent you. Name's Chris. Chris Wright."
msgstr "No... já... teda, Wrightova rodina... moje rodina... by mohla mít volnej flek. Nic ti neslibuju, ale zajdi do toho baráku na jih odsud, najdi mýho bráchu Keitha a řekni mu, že tě posílám. Jmenuju se Chris. Chris Wright."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:330
msgid "Thanks. Can I ask you some questions?"
msgstr "Díky. Můžu se na něco zeptat?"

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:335
msgid ""
"Naw... we don't usually hire muscle that's not family. You can try asking Pa at the house, but he'll most likely\n"
" just say no."
msgstr "Ne... většinou nenabíráme nikoho, kdo není členem rodiny. Zkus se zeptat táty v baráku, ale nejspíš stejně řekne ne."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:345
msgid "(Cringes.) *Greeeat.* Did she give you a speech?"
msgstr "(Otřepe se.) *No skvělý.* Udělala ti přednášku?"

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:355
msgid "That a JOKE? If so, it damn well missed the funny mark by a mile. You trying to start something with Family Wright?"
msgstr "Děláš si SRANDU? Jestli jo, tak se ti ten fórek ani trochu nepovedl. Chceš si snad začnout s rodinou Wrightů?"

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:356
msgid "Start something? No, just FINISH it."
msgstr "Začnout? Ne, jenom DOKONČIT."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:365
msgid "(Shrugs.) She just doesn't pay attention to what's going on around her. I love her n' all, but sometimes, she's as blind as a mule."
msgstr "(Pokrčí rameny.) Ona se zkrátka nezajímá o věci, co se dějou kolem ní. Mám ji rád, ale občas je slepá jako netopýr."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:366
msgid ""
"Well, not long ago, she charged into our alcohol still here and busted up the place, destroying our entire cash crop!\n"
" I love her n' all, but sometimes she's as blind as a mule."
msgstr "No, nedávno vletěla do naší palírny a celý to tam zničila! Mám ji rád, ale občas je slepá jako netopýr."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:380
msgid "She goes around and preaches all about sinning and stuff, but she doesn't even really know what Dad does. Either that, or she ignores it."
msgstr "Chodí kolem a káže o hříchu a tak, ale vůbec neví, co vlastně táta dělá. A nebo to ignoruje."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:390
msgid ""
"Makes alcohol, runs guns, rubs out people who fuck with him... typical family stuff. Mom'd be pissed if she actually paid\n"
" mind to what was going on. And 'specially if she found this still, here."
msgstr "Pálí chlast, prodává kvéry, mlátí lidi, kteří s ním chtěj vymrdat... typický rodinný záležitosti. Matka by byla nasraná, kdyby se dozvěděla, co vlastně děláme. Obzvlášť kdyby našla naši palírnu."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:400
msgid ""
"Probably pissed enough to wreck this place... at least. Then she'd give us all a tongue lashing and a few solid days of\n"
" preaching. Heh. "
msgstr "Dost na to, aby to tady rozmlátila. A pak by nám nadávala a několik dní bysme museli poslouchat to její kázání. Hehe. "

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:410
msgid ""
"Richard? We found him dead in one of the gutters like one of those Jet crashers. Near as we can figure,\n"
" someone pumped him with drugs until he was dead."
msgstr "Richard? Našli jsme ho mrtvýho ve škarpě jako nějakýho feťáka. Myslíme si, že ho někdo napumpoval drogama, dokud neumřel."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:411
msgid "'Someone' gave him too much? How do you know he didn't overdose because HE took too much?"
msgstr "'Někdo' mu toho dal moc? Jak víš, že se nepředávkoval SÁM?"

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:420
msgid ""
"Cause he was a clean kid... Mom taught him THAT much. And if you feel like saying any different, maybe you and I should settle\n"
" it right here, huh?!"
msgstr "Protože byl čistej... matka ho to naučila. A jestli na to máš jinej názor, můžeme to spolu vyřešit hned teď."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:423
msgid "Look, *kid,* if you know what's good for you, you'll stop throwing down every time a little truth comes along and bites you in the ass."
msgstr "Poslyš, *chlapče*, jestli víš, co je pro tebe dobré, přestaň zavírat oči nad každou malou pravdou, která se objeví a dá ti facku."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:435
msgid "Yeah... well, just watch it. Them's fighting words to any Wright, so don't go shooting off your mouth like that, okay?"
msgstr "Jo... no, dávej si pozor. To jsou slova, který se nelíbí žádnýmu Wrightovi, takže je z huby radši nepouštěj, jasný?"

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:437
msgid "Look, KID, don't start with me. If you know what's good for you, you'll stop trying to throw down every time a little truth comes along and bites you in the ass."
msgstr "Poslyš, chlapče, nezačínej si se mnou. Jestli víš, co je pro tebe dobrý, přestaň zavírat oči nad každou malou pravdou, která se objeví a dá ti facku."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:456
msgid "So THIS is how it's gonna BE, huh? ALL RIGHT THEN, LET'S GO, MOTHER FU -- "
msgstr "Tak TAKHLE ty, jo? FAJN, TAK POJĎ, TY ZMR..."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:475
msgid ""
"Could have been any one of them: Jagged Jimmy J, that scarred prick at the corner of Virgin Street, or Renesco\n"
" 'the Rocketman,' that weasely old shit who sells Jet outta that fortified shell up on the West Side."
msgstr "Mohl to bejt kdokoliv z těhlech: zjizvenej zkurvysyn Pořezanej Jimmy J na rohu ulice Panen nebo starej syčák Renesco 'Rakeťák', co prodává Jet v tý svý pevnosti v Obchodní čtvrti."

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:485
msgid "Hey, man, thank YOU. "
msgstr "Hej, kámo, DÍKY. "

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:486
msgid "Hey, lady, thank YOU. "
msgstr "Hej, dámo, DÍKY. "

#: dialog/ncchrwri.msg:495
msgid "Jules at the head of town also sells Jet, but he mostly sells to tourists... then there's Little Jesus Mordino: he mighta pushed drugs on Rich while Rich was out alone. He hangs out at the Desperado."
msgstr "Ještě Jules na kraji města prodává Jet, ale většinou jen turistům... a pak je tady Malej Ježíš Mordino. Mohl ho napumpovat drogama, když byl Rich sám venku. Poflakuje se kolem Desperada."

#: dialog/nccody.msg:125
msgid "You see Cody."
msgstr "Vidíš Codyho."

#: dialog/nccody.msg:175
msgid "You see a ragged-looking orphan. On the remains of his tattered shirt is scribbled \"Cody.\""
msgstr "Vidíš zanedbaného sirotka. Na zbytcích jeho otrhaného trička je načmáráno \"Cody.\""

#: dialog/nccody.msg:176
msgid "You see Cody. He glares at you sullenly."
msgstr "Vidíš Codyho. Pozoruje tě mrzutým pohledem."

#: dialog/nccody.msg:177
msgid "You see Cody. His gaze could make mountains get out of the way."
msgstr "Vidíš Codyho. Jeho pohled by dokázal lámat kameny."

#: dialog/nccody.msg:178
msgid "You see Cody. His name is scribbled on the remains of his tattered shirt."
msgstr "Vidíš Codyho. Jeho jméno je načmárané na zbytcích jeho otrhaného trička."

#: dialog/nccody.msg:200
msgid ""
"(The child glares at you sullenly as you approach... you can barely see his face beneath all the dirt. On the remains of\n"
" his shirt is scribbled \"Cody.\")"
msgstr "(Chlapec se zamračí, jakmile se k němu přiblížíš. Jen stěží rozeznáš jeho obličej pod tou vší špínou. Na zbytcích svého trička má načmáráno \"Cody.\")"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:201
msgid "(Cody glares at you sullenly as you approach.)"
msgstr "(Cody se zamračí, jakmile se k němu přiblížíš.)"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:202
msgid "Kootchie kootchie"
msgstr "Kuky kuk!"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:203
msgid "Glare back at 'im"
msgstr "Upřeně se na něj dívat."

#: dialog/nccody.msg:204
msgid " lost car. "
msgstr " ztratit auto. "

#: dialog/nccody.msg:205
msgid "Cody, can you take "
msgstr "Cody, můžeš ty vzít "

#: dialog/nccody.msg:207
msgid "Hey, Cody. You all right? You want something to eat maybe?"
msgstr "Ahoj, Cody. Jsi v pořádku? Nechceš něco k jídlu?"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:208
msgid "Hey, Cody. You thirsty? Want something to drink?"
msgstr "Ahoj, Cody. Nemáš žízeň? Nechceš něčeho napít?"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:209 dialog/ncwriply.msg:325
msgid "Where are your parents?"
msgstr "Kde máš rodiče?"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:210
msgid "Hey, Cody. Have you seen my car?"
msgstr "Ahoj, Cody. Neviděl jsi moje auto?"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:211
msgid "Cody, can you take me to my car now?"
msgstr "Cody, můžeš mě teď dovést k mému autu?"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:212
msgid "Cody, can you take me to the place where my car is?"
msgstr "Cody, můžeš mě dovést k mému autu?"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:213
msgid "Cody, can you take me to the place where my car was?"
msgstr "Cody, můžeš mi ukázat, kde bylo moje auto?"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:214
msgid "Can you tell me who stole it?"
msgstr "Můžeš mi říct, kdo ho ukradl?"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:220
msgid "(Cody gives you the finger and runs away.)"
msgstr "(Cody ti ukáže vztyčený prostředník a uteče pryč.)"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:221
msgid "(Cody's eyes get wide, and he runs away.)"
msgstr "(Codymu se rozšíří zorničky strachem a uteče pryč.)"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:223
msgid "ME KILL YOU ME KILL YOU ME KILL YOU ME KILL --"
msgstr "JÁ ZABÍT TY, JÁ ZABÍT TY, JÁ ZABÍT TY..."

#: dialog/nccody.msg:224
msgid "Maybe next time, then."
msgstr "Tak někdy jindy."

#: dialog/nccody.msg:225
msgid "Little shit..."
msgstr "Sráč jeden malej..."

#: dialog/nccody.msg:230
msgid "(Cody continues to stare at you.)"
msgstr "(Cody na tebe stále zírá.)"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:231
msgid "Uh, you all right, Cody?"
msgstr "Eh, jsi v pořádku, Cody?"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:239
msgid "Well, see you later, Cody. Take care."
msgstr "No, uvidíme se později, Cody. Měj se."

#: dialog/nccody.msg:251
msgid "Hey, Cody. Want some Nuka-Cola?"
msgstr "Ahoj, Cody. Nechceš trochu Nuka-Coly?"

#: dialog/nccody.msg:252
msgid "Want a brewski, kid? Never too young to start, Mom used to say. Uh, when she was sober, that is."
msgstr "Nedáš si trochu chlastu, chlapče? Nikdy není moc brzo na to začít, říkávala moje máma. Eh, teda když byla střízlivá."

#: dialog/nccody.msg:253
msgid "I got some Jet here, Cody. You want to fly high with Uncle "
msgstr "Mám tady trochu Jetu, Cody. Nechceš si trochu zalítat se strejdou "

#: dialog/nccody.msg:254
msgid "I got some Jet here, Cody. You want to fly high with Auntie "
