#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:292
msgid "DING DONG! DING DONG!"
msgstr "DING DONG! DING DONG!"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:300
msgid "I warned you, dim..."
msgstr "Varoval jsem tě..."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:310
msgid "I'm Keith Wright of the Family Wright. Now, you gonna tell me what yer doing here?"
msgstr "Jsem Keith Wright z rodiny Wrightů. Řekneš mi už konečně co tady chceš?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:312
msgid "Chris told me to stop by. I'm looking for work. Can you help me?"
msgstr "Chris mi řekl, ať se tu zastavím. Hledám práci. Můžeš mi pomoct?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:313
msgid "Keith Wright, huh? I ran into your mother."
msgstr "Keith Wright, jo? Potkal jsem tvou mámu."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:325
msgid "This is the Family Wright HOUSE. Now, you gonna tell me what yer doing here?"
msgstr "Tohle je DOMOV rodiny Wrightů. Řekneš mi už, co tady chceš?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:335
msgid "Chris sent you, huh?"
msgstr "Chris tě poslal, jo?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:336
msgid "That's right. He said you might have some work for me."
msgstr "Přesně tak. Říkal, že by se pro mě možná našla nějaká práce."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:345
msgid "I don't know if it'd do any good, but I guess I could ask Pa..."
msgstr "Sice nevím, jestli to má vůbec smysl, ale můžu se táty zeptat..."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:346
msgid "If you could, I'd appreciate it."
msgstr "To by bylo fajn."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:355
msgid "Naw... we don't hire muscle like the other families, 'least not now. "
msgstr "Ne... nenabíráme nový lidi jako ostatní rodiny. Alespoň zatím ne. "

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:356
msgid "Naw... we don't traffic with slaver trash like the other families. "
msgstr "Ne... my s otrokářskou verbeží nespolupracujeme jako to dělají ostatní rodiny. "

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:357
msgid "You better git."
msgstr "Radši zmiz."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:358
msgid "I'm not leaving until I see Mr. Wright."
msgstr "Nepůjdu, dokud si nepromluvím s panem Wrightem."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:365
msgid "Naw, I reckon you WILL be leaving, 'cause you look like the kinda person who likes living. Now get."
msgstr "Ne, já si myslím, že ODEJDEŠ, pač vypadáš jako někdo, kdo rád žije. A teď padej."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:366
msgid "I'm NOT leaving."
msgstr "Já NEODEJDU."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:375
msgid "I WARNED you..."
msgstr "VAROVAL jsem tě..."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:376
msgid "You want some of THIS, BOY?! You want some of THIS?! Then come GET s --"
msgstr "Chceš si se mnou zahrávat, hajzle?! Tak pojď..."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:380
msgid "Uh... what about her? Has she gotten herself in trouble again?"
msgstr "Eh... co je s ní? Zase je v nějakým průšvihu?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:381
msgid "No. Is that a common occurrence?"
msgstr "Ne. To je u ní časté?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:383
msgid "No, I was just curious. Later, Keith."
msgstr "Ne, není. Zatím, Keithe."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:390
msgid ""
"Sometimes. She's always preachin' and hollerin' about the evils o' drink and gamblin' and damn\n"
" near everything else. Causes quite a stir, sometimes, and gets Dad real upset."
