#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:391
msgid "Does your Mom have any idea what your family does?"
msgstr "Ví vůbec tvoje máma, co dělá vaše rodina?"

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:392
msgid "I'll bet. Well, thanks for talking with me, Keith."
msgstr "To věřím. No, díky za rozhovor, Keithe."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:400
msgid ""
"Naw, she don't know half of it. She thinks Dad's all clean and above the board, but she ain't too\n"
