msgstr "Ne, nemá o tom ani páru. Myslí si, že je táta čistej a nedělá nic nelegálního, ale není zrovna moc všímavá. Kdyby našla tu palírnu pod nádražím, udělala by tu peklo."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:401
msgid "I see. Thanks, Keith."
msgstr "Aha. Díky, Keithe."

#: dialog/nckeiwri.msg:410
msgid ""
"(Shakes head.) She done it this time, wrecking Pa's stills n' all. The workers were too afraid\n"
" ta stop her, and Pa threw a fit, and she threw one right back at him. (Shrugs.) It'll take Pa a while to\n"
