msgstr "Gr. Gr? Grrrrrrr."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:168
msgid "Gr?"
msgstr "Gr?"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:169
msgid "Rrrgggg"
msgstr "Rrrgggg."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:170
msgid "Me eat ears."
msgstr "Já jíst uši."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:171
msgid "Ears yum."
msgstr "Uši mňam."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:172
msgid "Gr... grrrgr?"
msgstr "Gr... grrrgr?"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:173
msgid "Snrggg"
msgstr "Snrggg."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:174
msgid "Me hate Robbin' Givens."
msgstr "Já nemít rád Robbin' Givens."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:175
msgid "Grrrrrgrrrrgrrr... grrr... grrr... grr! Grr! Grrr?"
msgstr "Grrrrrgrrrrgrrr... grrr... grrr... grr! Grr! Grrr?"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:176
msgid "What does 'percentage' mean?"
msgstr "Co znamenat 'podíl na zisku'?"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:200
msgid "::Mike cowers as you approach::"
msgstr "::Mike se schoulil, jakmile tě uviděl::"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:201
msgid "::Mike whines as you approach::"
msgstr "::Mike zakňučel, když si tě všiml::"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:202
msgid "::Mike holds up his hands in surrender as you approach::"
msgstr "::Mike zvedá ruce na znamení, že se vzdává::"

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:203
msgid "You cute."
msgstr "Ty heská."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:204
msgid "Me like your ears."
msgstr "Mike rád tvoje uši."

#: dialog/nctyson.msg:206
msgid "Robin? That you?"
msgstr "Robin? To ty?"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:100
msgid "You see Coffin Willie."
msgstr "Vidíš Coffin Willieho."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:150
msgid "You see an old, stinky, crusty ghoul. And boy, does he SMELL."
msgstr "Vidíš starého, páchnoucího a strupovitého ghoula. Jde z něj příšerný SMRAD."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:200
msgid "Whoa. This grave SMELLS."
msgstr "Fíha. Tenhle hrob ale pěkně SMRDÍ."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:201
msgid "Oh, well... better keep digging."
msgstr "No nic... raději budu kopat dál."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:202
msgid "What th-?"
msgstr "Co to...?"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:203
msgid "About friggin' time! Could you dig any SLOWER, idjit?"
msgstr "No konečně! POMALEJC kopat neumíš, idiote?"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:204
msgid "Outta my way, smoothie."
msgstr "Uhni mi z cesty, hezoune."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:205
msgid "D'dad?"
msgstr "T... tati?"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:206
msgid "Not now, Lenny, I ain't in th' mood to be talkin'."
msgstr "Teď ne, Lenny, nemám náladu si s tebou povídat."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:300
msgid "Jest pop inta Reno fer a lil' drinking n' whoring, n' damned smoothies jam me inna goddamn grave..."
msgstr "Jen jsem si skáknul do Rena na drink a nějakou tu kurvičku a ti zatracení hezouni mě hodili do hrobu..."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:301
msgid "Good thing I ain't got no nose, or I woulda choked on my own stink."
msgstr "Ještě že nemám nos, jináč bych se udusil vlastním smradem."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:302
msgid "Ghouls don't get no damn r'spect."
msgstr "Ghouly vůbec nikdo nerespektuje."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:303
msgid "Just stopped in the city for a drink, n' those Reno assholes bury me alive."
msgstr "Jen jsem si skáknul na drink do Rena a ti kreténi mě pohřbili zaživa."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:304
msgid "Nothing more boring than bein' in a coffin for months."
msgstr "Nejni na světě nic nudnějšího, než bejt zavřenej pár měsíců v rakvi."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:305
msgid "Hands off, smoothie. I got places to go."
msgstr "Uhni, hezoune. Mám něco na práci."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:306
msgid "Get your smoothie mitts offa me, smoothie."
msgstr "Dej ty svoje hezký pazoury pryč, hezoune."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:500
msgid "The headstone reads: \"Here lies the dumbest son of a bitch ever to set foot in New Reno.\""
msgstr "Na kříži stojí: \"Tady leží ten nejblbější zkurvysyn, který kdy vstoupil do New Rena.\""

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:550
msgid "There's a horrible odor flowing from the grave."
msgstr "Z hrobu se dere příšerný zápach."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:601
msgid "I ken hear someome movin' round out there!"
msgstr "Já vím, že tam někdo nahoře je!"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:602
msgid "Don't step onna grave! It packs the dirt in!"
msgstr "Nešlapej mi po hrobu! Tlačíš na mě hlínu!"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:603
msgid "Quick, GET A SHOVEL!"
msgstr "Rychle, DONES LOPATU!"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:604
msgid "Would somebody dig me up already? I need a drink!"
msgstr "Tak vyhrabe mě už někdo? Mám strašnou žízeň!"

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:605
msgid "That a worm I feel? Oh... nevermind."
msgstr "Že bych už cítil červy? Eh... tak nic."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:700
msgid "Ug, smellie in hole."
msgstr "Eh, to smrdět v díra."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:701
msgid "Me dig more for smellie shinies."
msgstr "Já kopat hodně pro smrdlavá blýskavá věcička."

#: dialog/ncwillie.msg:702
msgid "Huh, You not shini-!?"
msgstr "Co? Ty se neblýskat!?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:100
msgid "You see one of the Wright children. "
msgstr "Vidíš jedno z Wrightových dětí."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:150
msgid "You see a black-haired little boy."
msgstr "Vidíš černovlasého chlapce."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:151
msgid "You see a black-haired little girl."
msgstr "Vidíš černovlasou holčičku."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:155
msgid "He sticks his tongue out at you."
msgstr "Vyplazuje na tebe jazyk."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:156
msgid "He is glaring at you sullenly."
msgstr "Mrzutě se na tebe dívá."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:157
msgid "She sticks her tongue out at you."
msgstr "Vyplazuje na tebe jazyk."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:158
msgid "She looks at you suspiciously."
msgstr "Podezíravě se na tebe dívá."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:159
msgid "She is glaring at you sullenly."
msgstr "Mrzutě se na tebe dívá."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:175 dialog/ncwriply.msg:272
msgid "Fallout 2 was brought to you by the letter Z."
msgstr "Fallout 2 vám přináší písmeno Z."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:178 dialog/ncwriply.msg:279
msgid "Thanks fer savin us, "
msgstr "Díky za záchranu, "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:179 dialog/ncwrichi.msg:290
msgid "I wanna save th'world just like you when I grow up."
msgstr "Až vyrostu, tak chci taky zachránit svět jako ty."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:180 dialog/ncwrichi.msg:291 dialog/ncwriply.msg:281
msgid "Can I be a hero like you when I grow up?"
msgstr "Můžu bejt taky hrdina jako ty až vyrostu?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:181 dialog/ncwriply.msg:282
msgid "I wanna be "
msgstr "Já chci bejt "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:190
msgid "Are you a ROBOT?"
msgstr "Ty jseš ROBOT? "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:191
msgid "How do you go pee-pee in that thing?"
msgstr "Jak s tou zbrojí čůráš?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:192
msgid "Can I ride around on your shoulders? Pleeease?"
msgstr "Můžu se ti povozit na ramenech? Prosííím!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:193
msgid "Will you come play with us? Pleeease?"
msgstr "Budeš si s náma chvíli hrát? Prosíííím!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:200 dialog/ncwriply.msg:310
msgid "You better run 'fore my Daddy sees you."
msgstr "Radši uteč, než tě táta uvidí."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:201 dialog/ncwriply.msg:311
msgid "You better run 'fore my brothers see you."
msgstr "Radši uteč, než tě starší brácha uvidí."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:202 dialog/ncwriply.msg:312
msgid "Yer a bad person. You better leave 'fore I tell on you."
msgstr "Jseš zlej člověk. Radši odejdi, nebo to na tebe řeknu."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:210
msgid "I see you! I see you!"
msgstr "Já tě vidím! Já tě vidím!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:211
msgid "Are you playin' hide and go seek? Can I play, too?"
msgstr "Hraješ si na schovávanou? Můžu taky?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:215
msgid "Look at the robot! Look at the robot!"
msgstr "Hele, robot! Hele, robot!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:216
msgid "Is that a reeeal brain inside that robot?"
msgstr "Je v tom robotovi opravdickej mozek?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:217
msgid "Oooooooh. Look at the robot!"
msgstr "Týýýýjo. Podívejte se na toho robota!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:218
msgid "Look at the mutant! Look at the mutant!"
msgstr "Podívejte, mutant! Mutant!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:219
msgid "Mutant, stoopant, mutant, stoopant"
msgstr "Mutant, lulant, mutant, lulant."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:220
msgid "Is that a reeeal mutant? He's fugly."
msgstr "To je opravdickej mutant? Je ošklivej."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:221
msgid "Oooooooh. Look at the mutant!"
msgstr "Týýýýjo. Podívejte se na toho mutanta!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:222
msgid "That mutant's BIG. Bigger than Daddy."
msgstr "Ten mutant je VELKEJ! Větší než táta."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:230
msgid "Ghoul! Look, itz a ghoul!"
msgstr "Ghoul! Podívejte, to je ghoul!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:231
msgid "Ewwwwwww! Ghoul! Ghoul!"
msgstr "Fůůůj! Ghoul! Ghoul!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:232
msgid "Ghoul-eee ghoul-eee ghoul-eee!"
msgstr "Ghoul-ík ghoul-ík ghoul-ík!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:233
msgid "Look at the metal doggie!"
msgstr "Podívejte, železnej pejsek!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:234
msgid "Doggie! Here, doggie!"
msgstr "Pejsku! Pejsku, chceš kostičku?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:235
msgid "I want a doggie, too!"
msgstr "Já chci taky pejska!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:292
msgid "I wanna be you when I grow up."
msgstr "Až vyrostu, chci bejt jako ty."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:293
msgid "Why you wanna be me? Me DUMB"
msgstr "Proč ty chtít být já? Já BLBEC."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:294
msgid "Me once wear girl head like hat."
msgstr "Já jednou nosit hlava holky jako čepice."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:295
msgid "[Wander off]"
msgstr "Odbelhat se."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:296
msgid "Heh-heh. Why thank you, little one. But take a tip from "
msgstr "Hehe. Díky, maličký, ale raději poslouchej "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:297
msgid "Follow your dreams. You can achieve your goals. I'm living proof."
msgstr "Následuj své sny. Můžeš je dosáhnout. Já jsem toho důkazem."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:298
msgid "Sure you can. Say, I was sorry to hear about your brother, Richie. Do you know what happened to him?"
msgstr "To určitě můžeš. Poslyš, je mi líto tvého bratra Richieho. Nevíš náhodou, co se mu stalo?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:299
msgid "I once drove through three states wearing this one little girl's head like a hat."
msgstr "Jednou jsem projel tři státy a místo čepice jsem měl nasazenou hlavu malý holčičky."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:300
msgid "[Let him go back to playing.]"
msgstr "[Nechat ho, ať si hraje]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:301
msgid "[Let her go back to playing.]"
msgstr "[Nechat ji, ať si hraje]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:310
msgid "Uh-uh! Yer SMART! Yer a HERO and yer BRAVE and I wanna be YOU when I grow up. Thanks fer savin' us, "
msgstr "Ne-e! Ty jseš CHYTREJ! Jseš HRDINA a ODVÁŽNEJ a já chci být jako TY. Díky za záchranu, "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:311
msgid "Thankzzz little pershun. You make "
msgstr "Díky hodnej malej člověku. Ty "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:315
msgid "Okay, "
msgstr "Tak jo, "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:316
msgid "You take care now, you hear, little one? I've got some more hero things to do."
msgstr "Dávej na sebe pozor, ano? Já mám na práci ještě pár hrdinských věcí."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:320
msgid "(The kid stops you.) Um... "
msgstr "(Dítě tě zastaví.) Ty... "

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:321
msgid "Uh... no. I promise."
msgstr "Eh... ne. Slibuju."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:322
msgid "Uh... not as far as you know."
msgstr "Eh... pokud vím, tak ne."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:323
msgid "Don't worry, little one. I'll come back and visit you as a different character."
msgstr "Neboj se, maličký. Navštívím tě s jinou postavou."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:324
msgid "Don't worry, little one. You won't feel a thing."
msgstr "Neboj se, nic neucítíš."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:330
msgid "Will we dream?"
msgstr "Budeme snít?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:331
msgid "Uh... sure. Sure you will."
msgstr "Eh... určitě. Určitě budete."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:332
msgid "Beats me. I don't seem to dream, so you probably don't either. Life's a bitch, huh?"
msgstr "Co já vím? Mně se nic nezdá, takže tobě asi taky ne. Život je ale svině, co?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:341
msgid "Watz a rowboat?"
msgstr "Co být roubot?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:344
msgid "Heh-heh. Aren't you cute. No, I'm not a robot, little one."
msgstr "Hehe. To je roztomilé. Ne, nejsem robot."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:345
msgid ""
"No, no, I'm a regular person under this armor. By the way, I was sorry to hear about your brother, Richie.\n"
" Do you know what happened to him?"
msgstr "Ne, ne, pod tou zbrojí jsem normální člověk. Mimochodem, je mi líto tvého bratra Richieho. Nevíš, co se mu stalo?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:355
msgid "Yer DUMB."
msgstr "Ty jseš ale BLBEJ."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:356
msgid "SO ARE YOU"
msgstr "TY TAKY."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:357
msgid "Same to you, cept more of it"
msgstr "Ty taky, akorát víc."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:358
msgid "Yer dumb-errrr"
msgstr "Ty jseš blbější."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:359
msgid "He who smelt it dealt it"
msgstr "Kdo první křičí, od toho to fičí."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:360
msgid "Takes one t'know one!"
msgstr "Kdo to říká, ten to je!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:361
msgid "Run away crying"
msgstr "[S brekotem utéct]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:370
msgid "Yer the dumbest. Yer dumbest!"
msgstr "Ty jseš nejblbější! Ty jseš nejblbější!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:395
msgid "Nuh-uh, DUMBHEAD! (The kid runs off, his laughter ringing cruelly in your ears.)"
msgstr "Ne-e, TUPEC! (Dítě uteče pryč a jeho krutý smích ti neustále zvoní v uších.)"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:396
msgid ""
"Me no want to talk to you ANYWAY... *snfff*... me... *snfff*... have a PARTY...\n"
" with *snfff* CAKE and ICE CREAM... and YOU can't come [Leave.]"
msgstr "Já STEJNĚ nechtít mluvila s tebou *smrk*... já... *smrk*... udělám PÁRTY... s *smrk* DORT a ZMRZLINA... a TY nemůžeš přijít [Odejít]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:405
msgid "(The kid blinks, opens his mouth, then closes it. A tear wells up and turns into a full sob.)"
msgstr "(Dítě zamrká, otevře pusu a poté ji zase zavře. Po tvářích mu začnou téct slzy, které se posléze promění v pláč.)"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:406
msgid "Hee hee ME win"
msgstr "Hee hee JÁ vyhrát."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:410
msgid "Oh. (Thinks for a moment, then squints at you.) Why ARENCHA a robot?"
msgstr "Aha. (Chvíli o tom přemýšlí a poté se na tebe zašklebí.) Jak to, že NEJSI robot?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:411
msgid "Uh... because... well, robots and people have different... uh, parts."
msgstr "Eh... protože... no, roboti a lidé mají různé... eh, části."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:425
msgid "Oh, yeah? (Seems suspicious.) Like what?"
msgstr "Fakt jo? (Tváří se podezíravě.) Jaký třeba?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:426
msgid "Uh... well... say, kid, didn't your Mommy and Daddy explain this to you?"
msgstr "Eh... no... poslyš, tobě to táta s mámou ještě nevysvětlili?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:427
msgid "Uh... well! Look at the time! I must be going."
msgstr "Eh... to už je tolik hodin? Musím letět."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:435
msgid "Explain what?"
msgstr "Co mi měli vysvětlit?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:436
msgid "Uh... well... robots... have oil inside. Humans... well, humans... bleed."
msgstr "Eh... no... roboti... mají uvnitř olej. A lidi... no, lidi... krvácejí."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:445
msgid "Mommy an' my big sisters bleed every month or so. Then they get really mean. I wish they were robots."
msgstr "Máma a moje velký ségry krvácej každej měsíc a jsou přitom vždycky strašně naštvaný. Škoda, že nejsou roboti!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:446
msgid "Uh... yeah. Great, kid. Look, I have to be going - don't tell yer Mom I was talking to you."
msgstr "Eh... jo. Fajn. Poslyš, už musím jít. Neříkej mamince, že jsme spolu mluvili."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:456
msgid "I just pee but haveta get used to th'smell"
msgstr "Já prostě čůrat dovnitř, ale muset si zvyknout na smrad."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:459
msgid ""
"Heh-heh. Actually, I just urinate in the armor, and it recycles everything. Isn't that interesting?\n"
" Do you know what 'recycling' means, little one?"
msgstr "Hehe. Ve skutečnosti močím do zbroje a ta všechno zrecykluje. No není to zajímavé? Víš, co znamená 'recyklovat'?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:460
msgid ""
"Not comfortably, that's for sure. Say, I was sorry to hear about your brother, Richie.\n"
" Do you know what happened to him?"
msgstr "No, moc příjemné to není, to každopádně. Poslyš, je mi líto tvého bratra Richieho. Nevíš, co se mu stalo?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:475
msgid "That's GROSS."
msgstr "To je ODPORNÝ."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:476
msgid "Yes! Recycling means you drink pee!"
msgstr "Ano! Recyklace znamená, že piješ moč!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:477
msgid "YER gross, pee-pee FACE"
msgstr "TY ODPORNEJ počůránku."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:479
msgid "Uh, heh... heh. No actually, it means..."
msgstr "Eh, hehe... hehe. Ne, ve skutečnosti to znamená..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:485
msgid "You drink pee-pee! You drink pee-pee!"
msgstr "Ty piješ čůránky! Ty piješ čůránky!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:486
msgid "Uh, heh... heh... keep your voice down, little one... recycling doesn't mean that I drink p... well, not EXACTLY... look..."
msgstr "Eh, hehe... hehe... ztiš se trochu... recyklování neznamená, že piju m... no, ne DOSLOVA... poslyš..."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:487
msgid "Let the little shit go back to playing."
msgstr "[Nechat toho malého sráče, ať si hraje sám]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:495
msgid "Is that a REAL robot?"
msgstr "To je OPRAVDICKEJ robot?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:499
msgid "The Robobrain? Why, yes it is."
msgstr "Robomozek? Ano, je."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:500
msgid "It THINKS it is. Don't even get me started."
msgstr "On si MYSLÍ, že ano, ale netuším proč."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:501
msgid "Yeah, but don't bother it. I think it wants to destroy the human race."
msgstr "Jo, ale neobtěžuj ho. Myslím, že chce vyhubit lidskou rasu."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:502
msgid "Yes, it is. Say, I was sorry to hear about your brother, Richie. Do you know what happened to him?"
msgstr "Jo, je. Poslyš, je mi líto tvého bratra Richieho. Nevíš, co se mu stalo?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:515
msgid "Are YOU a robot, too?"
msgstr "TY jseš taky robot?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:525
msgid "Is that a REAL mutant?"
msgstr "To je OPRAVDICKEJ mutant?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:526
msgid "Mootant?"
msgstr "Můtant?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:529
msgid "Why, yes it is. His name is Marcus. Don't worry, he doesn't bite."
msgstr "Ano, je. Jmenuje se Marcus. Neboj se, nekouše."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:530
msgid "Why, yes it IS a mutant. Gosh, I sure hope he isn't hungry for little children."
msgstr "Ano, JE mutant. Jen doufám, že zase nedostal chuť na malé děti."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:531
msgid "Why, yes. A very HUNGRY mutant. And it's right about snack time, too. How convenient."
msgstr "Ano, je to mutant. VELMI hladový mutant. A zrovna je čas na svačinu. Jak příhodné."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:532
msgid "Yes, he is. Say, I was sorry to hear about your brother, Richie. Do you know what happened to him?"
msgstr "Ano, je. Poslyš, je mi líto tvého bratra Richieho. Nevíš, co se mu stalo?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:540
msgid "The kid stops and looks at you."
msgstr "Dítě se zastaví a podívá se na tebe."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:541
msgid "Helloooo"
msgstr "Ahóóój."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:544
msgid "Hello, little man."
msgstr "Ahoj, človíčku."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:545
msgid "Hello there, little girl."
msgstr "Ahoj, holčičko."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:546
msgid "I was sorry to hear about your brother, Richie. Do you know what happened to him?"
msgstr "Je mi líto tvého bratra Richieho. Nevíš, co se mu stalo?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:555
msgid "Are you sick?"
msgstr "Není ti špatně?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:556
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr "Proč se ptáš?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:560
msgid "You LOOK sick."
msgstr "VYPADÁŠ nemocně."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:561
msgid "I am sick."
msgstr "Jsem nemocný."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:565
msgid "Do you take medicine?"
msgstr "Bereš léky?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:566
msgid "There is no medicine for what I have."
msgstr "Na moji nemoc neexistují léky."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:570
msgid "Wanna sing?"
msgstr "Chceš si zazpívat?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:571
msgid "Sing?"
msgstr "Zazpívat?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:575
msgid "Do you know 'He's Got the Whole World in His Hands?'"
msgstr "Znáš 'Prší prší, jen se leje?'"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:580
msgid "::Sings:: 'He's got the whole world in his hands. He's got the whole wide world in his hands.' Come on."
msgstr "::Zpívá::: 'Prší prší, jen se leje. Prší prší, jen se leje.' No ták, přidej se."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:581
msgid "::Sing:: He's got the whole world in his hands. He's got the whole wide world in his hands."
msgstr "::Zpívat:: Prší prší, jen se leje. Prší prší, jen se leje."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:585
msgid "::Singing Together:: He's got the whole world in his hands. ::Singing winds down:: He's got the whole world in his hands."
msgstr "::Zpíváte dohromady:: Prší prší, jen se leje. Prší prší, jen se leje. ::Zpěv utichá:: Prší prší, jen se leje."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:586
msgid "Thank you for singing with me. I might be back later... if I need a hat."
msgstr "Díky, že jsme si mohli zazpívat. Možná se ještě vrátím... až budu potřebovat novou čepici."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:590
msgid "(The kid blinks at you.)"
msgstr "(Dítě na tebe mrkne.)"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:591
msgid "All right, then. Talk to you later."
msgstr "Tak dobře. Promluvíme si později."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:595
msgid "(The child runs off.)"
msgstr "(Dítě uteče pryč."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:650
msgid "Really? What else?"
msgstr "Vážně? Co ještě?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:665
msgid "Is that a REAL ghoul?"
msgstr "To je OPRAVDICKEJ ghoul?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:666
msgid "Gool?"
msgstr "Gůl?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:669
msgid "Why, yes it is. His name is Lenny. Don't worry, he doesn't bite."
msgstr "Ano, je. Jmenuje se Lenny. Neboj se, nekouše."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:670
msgid "Why, yes it IS a ghoul. Gosh, I sure hope he isn't hungry for little children."
msgstr "Ano, JE to ghoul. Jen doufám, že zase nedostal chuť na malé děti."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:671
msgid "Why, yes. A very HUNGRY ghoul. And it's right about snack time, too. How convenient."
msgstr "Ano, je to ghoul. VELMI hladový ghoul. A zrovna teď je čas na svačinu. Jak příhodné."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:685
msgid "Hello, Mar-cus mutant. Yer awful big. Hee-hee... and yer fidget animation is funny."
msgstr "Ahoj, Markusi mutante. Jseš fakt hrozně velkej. Híhí... a tvoje animace, když se nudíš, je fakt srandovní."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:686
msgid "Hello, Len-ee ghoul. Phew... yer reeally smelly."
msgstr "Ahoj, Lený ghoule. Fůj... hrozně smrdíš."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:687
msgid "It sure is, isn't it? So... what's up, kid?"
msgstr "Jo, to je. Takže... jak to jde?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:688
msgid "He sure is, isn't he? So... what's up kid?"
msgstr "Jo, to teda. Takže... jak to jde?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:689
msgid "Well, gotta go. See you later."
msgstr "No nic, musím jít. Uvidíme se později."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:695
msgid "(The kid turns pale, then runs away, screaming.)"
msgstr "(Dítě zbledne a dá se s řevem na útěk."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:696
msgid "Heh heh heh heh. \"Izzat a REAL mutant?\" Teach her not to ask questions."
msgstr "Hehehehe. \"To je OPRAVDICKEJ mutant?\" To jí naučí ptát se na takové blbosti."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:697
msgid "\"Hungry\" mutant! Sheesh. Everyone knows that mutants don't eat hum - uh, why're you looking at me like that, Marcus?"
msgstr "\"Hladový\" mutant! Pche. Každý přece ví, že mutanti nejedí li... eh, proč se na mě tak díváš, Marcusi?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:698
msgid "Heh heh heh heh. \"Izzat a REAL ghoul?\" Teach her not to ask questions."
msgstr "Hehehehe. \"To je OPRAVDICKEJ ghoul?\" To jí naučí ptát se na takové blbosti."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:699
msgid "\"Hungry\" ghoul! Sheesh. Everyone knows that ghouls don't eat hum - uh, why're you looking at me like that, Lenny?"
msgstr "\"Hladový\" ghoul! Pche. Každý přece ví, že ghoulové nejedí li... eh, proč se na mě tak díváš, Lenny?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:710
msgid ""
"Uh-uh. Daddy's real mad about it cuz he doesn't know who killed Richie. He says if he ever catches us\n"
" doing Jet, he'll give us a whippin'."
msgstr "E-he. Táta je fakt vzteklej, protože neví, kdo Richieho zabil. Říká, že jestli nás někdy chytí s Jetem, naplácá nám na zadek."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:711
msgid "Do you know WHO might have given Richie the Jet that killed him?"
msgstr "Nevíš, KDO mohl dát Richiemu ten Jet, který ho zabil?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:712
msgid "Do you know WHERE Richie got that Jet that killed him?"
msgstr "Nevíš, KDE získal Richie ten Jet, který ho zabil?"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:713
msgid "Let the child go back to playing."
msgstr "[Nechat dítě, ať si jde hrát]"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:720
msgid "Uh-uh."
msgstr "E-he."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:730
msgid "Uh-uh. He was hangin' out a lot on th' West side of town, around Commercial Row, and Dad told us not ta go over there."
msgstr "E-he. Často se potuloval na západě města kolem Obchodní čtvrti. Táta nám tam zakázal chodit."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:800
msgid "*Shhh* I'm supposed to be sleeping."
msgstr "*Pššššst* Už mám dávno spát."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:801
msgid "I need to get some sleep. I've got a big game of metal insect warrior tomorrow."
msgstr "Musím se trochu vyspat. Zítra si hrajem na ocelovou mouchu."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:802
msgid "If daddy finds out I'm not asleep, he'll be really, really mad."
msgstr "Jestli táta zjistí, že ještě nespím, bude fakt zlej."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:900
msgid "My ding-a-ling, my ding-a-ling."
msgstr "Můj šulínek, můj šulínek."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:901
msgid "::Holds up fake gun:: Reach for the skies, varmit!"
msgstr "::Drží napodobeninu pistole:: Ruce vzhůru, lumpové!"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:902
msgid "One good turn deserves another, between your legs hangs your mother."
msgstr "Skákal pes, přes oves, na velikou holku."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:903
msgid "I wanna be a pimp when I grow up."
msgstr "Chci být pasák, až vyrostu."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:904
msgid "I'm gonna rule New Reno when I grow up, just like Daddy."
msgstr "Až vyrostu, budu šéfovat Renu jako táta."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:905
msgid "I want a doggie. Daddy says he'll get me a bitch when I'm older."
msgstr "Chci pejska. Táta říkal, že dostanu čubku až vyrostu."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:906
msgid "I wish Dad was as cool as Tommy the Balls."
msgstr "Škoda, že táta není tak hustej jako Tommy Tvrďák."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:907
msgid "I have a penis."
msgstr "Já mám penis."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:908
msgid "::Shriek::"
msgstr "::Vřísk::"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:909
msgid "::Sticks out tongue::"
msgstr "::Vyplazuje jazyk::"

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:910
msgid "Daddy calls Mommy a baby factory."
msgstr "Táta říká mámě továrna na děcka."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:911
msgid "Daddy said he'd whip us if he ever caught us taking Jet."
msgstr "Táta říká, že nás seřeže, jestli nás někdy chytne, jak bereme Jet."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:912
msgid "Daddy says we got to be careful when we go outside."
msgstr "Táta říká, že si máme dávat venku pozor."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:913
msgid "Daddy'll whip us if we sneak out again."
msgstr "Táta nás zbije, jestli ještě jednou utečeme."

#: dialog/ncwrichi.msg:914
