#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1504 game/combatai.msg:1504
msgid "My head is on fire!"
msgstr "Moje hlava hořet!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1505 game/combatai.msg:1505
msgid "It burns, it burns!"
msgstr "To pálí, to pálí!"

