msgid "I didn't need that many fingers anyway."
msgstr "Já stejně tolik prstů nepotřebuju."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1514 game/combatai.msg:1514
msgid "That arm was a little too long anyhow."
msgstr "Ta ruka byla stejně moc dlouhá."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1515 game/cmbatai2.msg:1525 game/combatai.msg:1515
#: game/combatai.msg:1525
msgid "I will take both your arms for that."
msgstr "Za to si vezmu obě tvoje ruce."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1516 game/cmbatai2.msg:1524 game/combatai.msg:1516
#: game/combatai.msg:1524
msgid "For that, I kill you slow."
msgstr "Za tohle tě budu zabíjet pomalu."

