msgstr "Aspoň se můžu pochlubit děckám."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1520 game/combatai.msg:1520
msgid "I will kill you with my left hand."
msgstr "Zabiju tě levou rukou."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:1521 game/combatai.msg:1521
