msgid "Fresh meat!"
msgstr "Čerstvý maso!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2322 game/combatai.msg:2322
msgid "You just made my day!"
msgstr "Dneska je skvělej den!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2323 game/combatai.msg:2323
msgid "You're gonna be my bitch!"
msgstr "Budeš moje děvka!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2325 game/combatai.msg:2325
msgid "I'm gonna settle your hash!"
msgstr "Udělám z tebe sekanou!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2340 game/combatai.msg:2340
msgid "Gonna get cha!"
msgstr "Já tě dostanu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2341 game/combatai.msg:2341
msgid "Time to play!"
msgstr "Pobavíme se!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2342 game/combatai.msg:2342
msgid "Please don't beg. Death should be dignified."
msgstr "Nežebrej o život. Zemřeš důstojně."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2343
msgid "I hope you don't die too quickly."
msgstr "Doufám, že nechcípneš moc rychle."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2344 game/combatai.msg:2344
msgid "Got any last words?"
msgstr "Nějaký poslední přání?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2346 game/combatai.msg:2346
msgid "Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!"
msgstr "Chcípni! Chcípni! Chcípni! Chcípni! Chcípni!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2348 game/combatai.msg:2348
msgid "Let's open you up a little..."
msgstr "Trochu si tě otevřu..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2349 game/combatai.msg:2349
msgid "You're dogfood, friend."
msgstr "Bude z tebe žrádlo pro psy, příteli."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2360 game/combatai.msg:2360
msgid "You didn't even wing me."
msgstr "Vedle jak ta jedle."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2361
msgid "You bore me to tears"
msgstr "Nudíš mě k smrti."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2362 game/combatai.msg:2362
msgid "C'mon, punk. Give me a fight!"
msgstr "No tak, hajzle, bojuj!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2363 game/cmbatai2.msg:2561 game/cmbatai2.msg:2761
#: game/combatai.msg:2363 game/combatai.msg:2561 game/combatai.msg:2761
msgid "Is that the best you can do?"
msgstr "Líp to neumíš?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2365
msgid "This is gonna be easier than I thought"
msgstr "Bude to lehčí, než jsem si myslel."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2400 game/cmbatai2.msg:26005 game/combatai.msg:2400
#: game/combatai.msg:26005
msgid "I'm outta here!"
msgstr "Já odsud mizím!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2401
msgid "Maybe this wasn't a good idea."
msgstr "Možná to nebyl až tak dobrej nápad!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2402 game/combatai.msg:2402
msgid "Attack someone else, okay!"
msgstr "Zaútoč si na někoho jinýho, ano?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2403 game/combatai.msg:2403 game/combatai.msg:42160
msgid "Yikes!"
msgstr "Sakrapes!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2405 game/combatai.msg:2405
msgid "That's too much for me!"
msgstr "To je na mě trochu moc!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2421 game/cmbatai2.msg:2722 game/combatai.msg:2421
#: game/combatai.msg:2722
msgid "I'm gonna teach you some manners!"
msgstr "Naučím tě správnýmu chování!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2423 game/combatai.msg:2423
msgid "You need to learn some respect!"
msgstr "Naučím tě trochu respektu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2424 game/combatai.msg:2424
msgid "Time to earn my pay..."
msgstr "Čas zasloužit si žold..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2426 game/combatai.msg:2426
msgid "Why'd you go and hafta do that?"
msgstr "Za to si tě podám."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2427 game/combatai.msg:2427
msgid "There's always idiots like you around to mess up a shift."
msgstr "Vždycky se najdou kreténi jako ty, co mi pokazej šichtu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2441 game/combatai.msg:2441
msgid "Feels good huh?"
msgstr "To bylo dobrý, co?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2442 game/combatai.msg:2442
msgid "Shoulda left it alone."
msgstr "Nemáš se motat do cizích věcí."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2444 game/combatai.msg:2444
msgid "Where's your mama now?"
msgstr "Běž za maminkou."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2445 game/combatai.msg:2445
msgid "Take it all!"
msgstr "Tady máš!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2446 game/combatai.msg:2446
msgid "Let's see how tough you are..."
msgstr "Tak ukaž, co umíš..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2447 game/combatai.msg:2447
msgid "Punk!"
msgstr "Hajzle!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2448 game/combatai.msg:2448
msgid "Skag!"
msgstr "Sráči!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2449
msgid "I'm putting you away for good!"
msgstr "Bude od tebe nadobro klid."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2460
msgid "Your Mamma teach you that move?"
msgstr "To tě naučila maminka?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2461 game/combatai.msg:2461
msgid "You just suck!"
msgstr "Prostě stojíš za prd!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2462 game/combatai.msg:2462
msgid "You ain't good enough."
msgstr "To bylo chabý."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2464 game/combatai.msg:2464
msgid "Amateur."
msgstr "Amatére."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2465 game/combatai.msg:2465
msgid "You learn to fight in bars?"
msgstr "To tě naučili v hospodě?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2500 game/cmbatai2.msg:12100 game/combatai.msg:2500
#: game/combatai.msg:3100 game/combatai.msg:12100
msgid "Gotta get outta here!"
msgstr "Musím odsud zmizet!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2501 game/cmbatai2.msg:3101 game/cmbatai2.msg:12101
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36101 game/cmbatai2.msg:36201 game/combatai.msg:2501
#: game/combatai.msg:3101 game/combatai.msg:12101 game/combatai.msg:36101
#: game/combatai.msg:36201
msgid "I'll be back..."
msgstr "Já se vrátím..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2502 game/cmbatai2.msg:3102 game/cmbatai2.msg:12102
#: game/combatai.msg:2502 game/combatai.msg:3102 game/combatai.msg:12102
msgid "You ain't killing me today!"
msgstr "Dneska mě nezabiješ!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2504 game/combatai.msg:2504
msgid "You ain't seen the last of me!"
msgstr "Ještě se uvidíme!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2505 game/cmbatai2.msg:3105 game/cmbatai2.msg:12105
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36105 game/cmbatai2.msg:36205 game/cmbatai2.msg:36305
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36405 game/combatai.msg:2505 game/combatai.msg:3105
#: game/combatai.msg:12105 game/combatai.msg:36105 game/combatai.msg:36205
#: game/combatai.msg:36305 game/combatai.msg:36405
msgid "You'll pay for this -- later!"
msgstr "Za to zaplatíš... někdy jindy!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2520 game/cmbatai2.msg:2723 game/cmbatai2.msg:3120
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12120 game/combatai.msg:2520 game/combatai.msg:2723
#: game/combatai.msg:3120 game/combatai.msg:12120
msgid "You're history!"
msgstr "Jseš historie!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2521 game/cmbatai2.msg:2921 game/cmbatai2.msg:3121
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12121 game/combatai.msg:2521 game/combatai.msg:2921
#: game/combatai.msg:3121 game/combatai.msg:12121
msgid "Fresh meat..."
msgstr "Čerstvý maso..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2522
msgid "I'm gonna dance on your grave!"
msgstr "Zatancuju si na tvým hrobě."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2523 game/combatai.msg:2523
msgid "Everybody! It's target practice!"
msgstr "Hej všichni! Cvičná střelba!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2524
msgid "You ready bitch!"
msgstr "Připravená, děvko?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2525 game/combatai.msg:2525
msgid "I'm going to enjoy this..."
msgstr "Tohle si vychutnám..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2540 game/combatai.msg:2540
msgid "Take it all!!!"
msgstr "Tady máš!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2541 game/cmbatai2.msg:3141 game/cmbatai2.msg:12141
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36241 game/combatai.msg:2541 game/combatai.msg:3141
#: game/combatai.msg:12141 game/combatai.msg:36241
msgid "Don't bother screaming for mercy..."
msgstr "Ani se neobtěžuj prosit o slitování..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2542 game/combatai.msg:2542
msgid "This is the best part..."
msgstr "Tohle je ta nejlepší část..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2543
msgid "You want more of this!!! Huh?!"
msgstr "Chceš ještě?!! Co?!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2544
msgid "Gonna feed you to the dogs"
msgstr "Bude z tebe žrádlo pro psy!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2545
msgid "Shouldn't start what you can't finish"
msgstr "Příště nezačínej, co nedokončíš."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2546 game/cmbatai2.msg:3146
msgid "Hope you don't die too quick"
msgstr "Doufám, že budeš chcípat pomalu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2547 game/combatai.msg:2547
msgid "Only one of us is walking away."
msgstr "Jenom jeden z nás odsud odejde po svejch."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2549 game/combatai.msg:2549
msgid "I eat punks like you for breakfast."
msgstr "Takový hajzly, jako jseš ty, si dávám k snídani."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2550
msgid "I'm gonna feed you to my pet iguana"
msgstr "Nakrmím s tebou svoji ještěrku."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2551 game/combatai.msg:2551
msgid "The last thing you'll see is my grinnin' face."
msgstr "Poslední věc, co uvidíš, bude můj širokej úsměv."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2552 game/combatai.msg:2552
msgid "This is my favorite job."
msgstr "Tohle je moje oblíbená práce."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2560 game/combatai.msg:2560
msgid "You're a joke."
msgstr "Jseš k smíchu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2562 game/combatai.msg:2562
msgid "You're making this easy."
msgstr "Tohle je moc jednoduchý."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2563 game/combatai.msg:2563
msgid "Just pathetic..."
msgstr "Ubohý..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2565 game/combatai.msg:2565
msgid "Loser!"
msgstr "Blbečku!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2600 game/combatai.msg:2600
msgid "Run from the Evil One!"
msgstr "Utíkám od Zlého!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2601
msgid "The spirits bid me to save myself!"
msgstr "Duchové mi nařídit utéct."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2602 game/combatai.msg:2602
msgid "Our foe has used powerful magic--Run! Someone get the Shaman!"
msgstr "Nepřítel používá silnou magii! Utíkejte! Zavolejte někdo šamana!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2603 game/combatai.msg:2603
msgid "The dark-spirit runs strong in this one. Death walks the earth!"
msgstr "Temní duchové oni silní tady. Smrt chodí kolem!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2604 game/combatai.msg:2604
msgid "The dark one is here!"
msgstr "Temnota je tady!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2605 game/combatai.msg:2605
msgid "The dark one seeks to punish us. Run! My soul flees and I must follow!"
msgstr "Temnota nás přišla potrestat. Utíkejte! Má duše utíká a já za ní!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2606 game/combatai.msg:2606
msgid "Aiiieeeee!!"
msgstr "Jaůůůůůůů!!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2620 game/combatai.msg:2620
msgid "Ancestor guide my weapon arm!"
msgstr "Předkové, veďte mé zbraně!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2621 game/combatai.msg:2621
msgid "Your strength will be mine."
msgstr "Tvá síla bude brzy má."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2622 game/combatai.msg:2622
msgid "Great will be my glory."
msgstr "Velká bude má sláva."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2623 game/combatai.msg:2623
msgid "I shall dishonor your tribe."
msgstr "Zneuctím tvůj kmen."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2624 game/combatai.msg:2624
msgid "Ayah! Nabataluk!"
msgstr "Áhjá! Nabataluk!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2625 game/combatai.msg:2625
msgid "Spirits be with me!"
msgstr "Duchové býti se mnou!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2626 game/combatai.msg:2626
msgid "Come, let our blades dance."
msgstr "Pojď, zkřížíme své zbraně."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2627 game/combatai.msg:2627
msgid "Let it begin!"
msgstr "Začneme!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2628 game/combatai.msg:2628
msgid "U-Suthoooo!"
msgstr "Ú-Sutóóóó!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2629 game/combatai.msg:2629
msgid "The spirits are with me!"
msgstr "Duchové jsou se mnou!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2640 game/combatai.msg:2640
msgid "Your ancestors have deserted you."
msgstr "Tví předkové tě opustili."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2641 game/combatai.msg:2641
msgid "Your defeat will bring me great honor. My magic knows not defeat!"
msgstr "Tvá porážka mi přinese velkou čest. Má magie nezná porážku!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2642 game/combatai.msg:2642
msgid "Give up now and we will not eat your heart."
msgstr "Vzdej se hned a my nesníme tvé srdce."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2643 game/combatai.msg:2643
msgid "You fight bravely--I will eat your courage. The Shamans will sing of my victory."
msgstr "Bojuješ odvážně... sním tvou odvahu. Šamani budou zpívat o mém vítězství."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2644 game/combatai.msg:2644
msgid "I will bathe in your blood!"
msgstr "Vykoupu se v tvé krvi!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2645 game/combatai.msg:2645
msgid "I do not fear you!"
msgstr "Nebojím se tě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2646 game/combatai.msg:2646
msgid "I bring you peace, lost one."
msgstr "Přináším ti mír, ztracený."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2647 game/combatai.msg:2647
msgid "Glory in battle buys life everlasting! I honor you, strange one."
msgstr "Sláva v bitvě přináší nekonečný život! Uctívám tě, podivný."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2648 game/combatai.msg:2648
msgid "The mists beckon to you."
msgstr "Mlha tě volá k sobě."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2649 game/combatai.msg:2649
msgid "Our ancestors thirst for your soul."
msgstr "Naši předkové už žízní po tvé duši."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2650 game/combatai.msg:2650
msgid "My blade grows thirsty!"
msgstr "Má zbraň žízní!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2651 game/combatai.msg:2651
msgid "Let us drink from the cup of battle!"
msgstr "Napijme se z poháru bitvy!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2660
msgid " Your eyes are clouded with hatred."
msgstr "Tvé oči jsou zaslepeny nenávistí."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2661
msgid " Your spirits have abandoned you."
msgstr "Tví duchové tě opustili."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2662
msgid " Our magic is working!"
msgstr "Naše magie funguje!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2663
msgid " My magic makes me invincible!"
msgstr "Moje magie ze mě dělá nesmrtelného!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2664
msgid " Your life-force is weakening!"
msgstr "Tvá životní síla slábne!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2665
msgid " Fear is the mind-killer "
msgstr "Strach zabíjí mysl."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2666
msgid " My battle-song is working!"
msgstr "Má válečná píseň funguje!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2667
msgid " Our children know more of battle!"
msgstr "Naše děcka znají umění boje lépe než ty!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2668
msgid " You have known peace too long."
msgstr "Žiješ v míru příliš dlouho."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2669
msgid " Are all of your tribe so weak?"
msgstr "Jsou všichni tvého kmene tak slabí?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2700 game/combatai.msg:2700
msgid "Reinforcements!"
msgstr "Posily!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2701 game/combatai.msg:2701
msgid "They can court martial me.."
msgstr "Klidně mě můžou postavit před válečnej soud..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2703 game/combatai.msg:2703
msgid "Retreat! Retreat!"
msgstr "Ústup! Ústup!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2704 game/combatai.msg:2704
msgid "Fall back! Fall back!"
msgstr "Stáhněte se! Stáhněte se!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2705 game/combatai.msg:2705
msgid "You may have won the battle..."
msgstr "Jedna vyhraná bitva neznamená vyhranou válku..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2721 game/combatai.msg:2721
msgid "Hoo-Yah!"
msgstr "Hůů-Jááá!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2724 game/cmbatai2.msg:2925 game/combatai.msg:2724
#: game/combatai.msg:2925
msgid "Attack!"
msgstr "Do útoku!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2725 game/combatai.msg:2725
msgid "Let's bury this loser!"
msgstr "Sundejte toho sráče!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2726 game/combatai.msg:2726
msgid "Lock and Load!"
msgstr "K palbě připravit!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2727 game/combatai.msg:2727
msgid "We'll let god sort out what's left of ya."
msgstr "Až s tebou skončím, moc toho po tobě nezbyde."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2741 game/combatai.msg:2741
msgid "Now I have you!"
msgstr "A mám tě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2744
msgid "This ain't just a job to us"
msgstr "Pro nás to není jenom práce."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2745 game/combatai.msg:2545 game/combatai.msg:2745
msgid "Shouldn't start what you can't finish."
msgstr "Příště nezačínej, co nedokončíš."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2746 game/combatai.msg:2746
msgid "You better pray to the gods!"
msgstr "Radši se pomodli k bohům!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2747
msgid "You ain't even gonna make it to 6am!"
msgstr "Nedožiješ se příštího rána."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2748 game/combatai.msg:2748
msgid "Feel good?"
msgstr "Líbí?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2749
msgid "See you in Hell!"
msgstr "Uvidíme se v pekle."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2760 game/combatai.msg:2760
msgid "Try training some."
msgstr "Potřebuješ trochu potrénovat."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2762 game/combatai.msg:2762
msgid "C'mon loser. Gimme a fight!"
msgstr "No tak, sráči. Snaž se trochu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2763 game/combatai.msg:2763
msgid "Try aiming next time."
msgstr "Příště zkus mířit."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2764 game/combatai.msg:2764
msgid "Civilian..."
msgstr "Civilista..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2765 game/combatai.msg:2765
msgid "Leave it to the professionals next time."
msgstr "Příště to nech na profesionály."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2900 game/cmbatai2.msg:26000 game/cmbatai2.msg:32603
#: game/combatai.msg:2900 game/combatai.msg:26000 game/combatai.msg:32603
msgid "Flee! Flee!"
msgstr "Zdrháme! Zdrháme!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2902 game/cmbatai2.msg:26002 game/cmbatai2.msg:26102
#: game/combatai.msg:2902 game/combatai.msg:26002 game/combatai.msg:26102
msgid "Regroup!"
msgstr "Přeskupte se!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2903 game/cmbatai2.msg:12004 game/cmbatai2.msg:26003
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:26103 game/cmbatai2.msg:32602 game/cmbatai2.msg:44903
#: game/combatai.msg:2903 game/combatai.msg:12004 game/combatai.msg:26003
#: game/combatai.msg:26103 game/combatai.msg:32602 game/combatai.msg:44903
msgid "Fall back!"
msgstr "Ustupte!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2904 game/cmbatai2.msg:26004 game/cmbatai2.msg:26104
#: game/combatai.msg:2904 game/combatai.msg:26004 game/combatai.msg:26104
msgid "Withdraw!"
msgstr "Stáhněte se!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2905 game/combatai.msg:2905
msgid "Aaaaghhh!"
msgstr "Aááááááá!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2920 game/cmbatai2.msg:26020 game/combatai.msg:2920
#: game/combatai.msg:26020
msgid "Kill this fool!"
msgstr "Zabte toho hlupáka!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2922 game/combatai.msg:2922
msgid "Plunder!"
msgstr "Kořist!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2923 game/cmbatai2.msg:26023 game/cmbatai2.msg:26109
#: game/combatai.msg:2923 game/combatai.msg:26023 game/combatai.msg:26123
msgid "This one's mine!"
msgstr "Nechte to na mně!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2924 game/combatai.msg:2924
msgid "Ahhhhhhh!"
msgstr "Aáááááá!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2940 game/cmbatai2.msg:26040 game/combatai.msg:26040
msgid "Enjoy the last few seconds of your life!"
msgstr "Užij si poslední sekundy svýho života!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2941 game/cmbatai2.msg:26041 game/combatai.msg:2941
#: game/combatai.msg:26041
msgid "Blood! Blood! Blood!"
msgstr "Krev! Krev! Krev!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2942 game/cmbatai2.msg:26042 game/combatai.msg:2942
#: game/combatai.msg:26042
msgid "Your heart is mine!"
msgstr "Tvoje srdce je moje!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2943 game/combatai.msg:2943
msgid "RAAAAAAARRRR!!"
msgstr "RAAAAAAARRRR!!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2944 game/cmbatai2.msg:26044 game/combatai.msg:2944
#: game/combatai.msg:26044
msgid "Your weapons will be my trophies!"
msgstr "Z tvejch zbraní si udělám trofeje!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2945 game/combatai.msg:2945
msgid "Death!"
msgstr "Smrt!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2946 game/cmbatai2.msg:26046 game/cmbatai2.msg:26119
#: game/combatai.msg:2946 game/combatai.msg:26046 game/combatai.msg:26146
msgid "You are mine to kill!"
msgstr "Zabiju tě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2947 game/cmbatai2.msg:26047 game/combatai.msg:2947
#: game/combatai.msg:26047
msgid "Your bones shall bleach in the wastes!"
msgstr "Nechám tvou mrtvolu shnít v pustině!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2948 game/cmbatai2.msg:26048 game/cmbatai2.msg:26121
#: game/combatai.msg:2948 game/combatai.msg:26048 game/combatai.msg:26148
msgid "Blood and darkness!"
msgstr "Krev a temnota!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2949 game/combatai.msg:2949
msgid "YAAAAAAAAAAAAH!"
msgstr "UAAAAAAAAAAAAA!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2950 game/cmbatai2.msg:26050 game/combatai.msg:2950
#: game/combatai.msg:26050
msgid "Drill the scraggin' bastard!"
msgstr "Provrtejte toho parchanta jako cedník!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2960 game/combatai.msg:2960
msgid "Wasted effort!"
msgstr "Zbytečná námaha!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2961 game/combatai.msg:2961
msgid "You have failed!"
msgstr "Marný pokus!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2962 game/cmbatai2.msg:26126 game/combatai.msg:2962
#: game/combatai.msg:26163
msgid "My blood is stronger than yours!"
msgstr "Moje krev je silnější než tvoje!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2963 game/combatai.msg:2963
msgid "I live!!"
msgstr "Já žiju!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:2964 game/combatai.msg:2964
msgid "Your body is weak and pitiful!"
msgstr "Tvý tělo je slabý a ubohý!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3000 game/combatai.msg:3000
msgid "Retreat option initiated."
msgstr "Zahájen program ústupu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3001 game/combatai.msg:3001
msgid "Tactical plan: retreat."
msgstr "Taktický plán: Ústup."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3002
msgid "Combat effective minimal. Retreat advised."
msgstr "Bojová efektivita minimální. Doporučen ústup."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3003 game/combatai.msg:3003
msgid "Tactical analysis complete. Retreat recommended."
msgstr "Taktická analýza hotova. Doporučen ústup."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3004 game/combatai.msg:3004
msgid "Downloading escape program."
msgstr "Nahrávám únikový program."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3005 game/combatai.msg:3005
msgid "Retreat sequence initiated."
msgstr "Ústupová sekvence zahájena."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3020 game/cmbatai2.msg:12020 game/combatai.msg:3020
#: game/combatai.msg:12020
msgid "Target acquired!"
msgstr "Cíl zaměřen!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3021 game/combatai.msg:3021
msgid "Terminate! Terminate!"
msgstr "Zneškodnit! Zneškodnit!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3022 game/combatai.msg:3022
msgid "The humanoid must not escape!"
msgstr "Humanoid nesmí uniknout!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3023 game/combatai.msg:3023
msgid "Terminate the intruder!"
msgstr "Zneškodnit vetřelce!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3024 game/cmbatai2.msg:3040 game/combatai.msg:3024
#: game/combatai.msg:3040
msgid "Combat sequence initiated."
msgstr "Bojová sekvence zahájena."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3025 game/combatai.msg:3025
msgid "Uploading combat program."
msgstr "Nahrávám bojový program."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3041 game/combatai.msg:3041
msgid "Attacking target."
msgstr "Útočím na cíl."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3042 game/combatai.msg:3042 game/combatai.msg:44543
msgid "Initiating attack sequence."
msgstr "Zahajuji útočnou sekvenci."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3043 game/combatai.msg:3043
msgid "The intruder must be destroyed!"
msgstr "Narušitel musí být zničen!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3044 game/combatai.msg:3044
msgid "Tactical options selection completed."
msgstr "Taktický rozbor dokončen."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3045 game/combatai.msg:3045 game/combatai.msg:44548
msgid "Commencing attack."
msgstr "Zahajuji útok."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3046
msgid "The target will be destroyed!"
msgstr "Cíl bude zničen."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3047 game/combatai.msg:3047
msgid "Enemy termination sequence begun."
msgstr "Likvidace nepřítele započala."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3048
msgid "Target must be eliminated!"
msgstr "Cíl musí být zneškodněn."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3049 game/combatai.msg:3049
msgid "Offensive selection completed."
msgstr "Ofenzivní program zvolen."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3060
msgid "Analysis. Defensive program success."
msgstr "Analýza. Defenzivní program úspěšný."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3061
msgid "Analysis. Target offense negligible."
msgstr "Analýza. Útok cíle neefektivní."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3062 game/combatai.msg:3062
msgid "Target attack failed. Calculating response."
msgstr "Cíl zaútočil neúspěšně. Vypočítávám protiakci."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3063 game/combatai.msg:3063
msgid "Unit was unharmed by attack."
msgstr "Jednotka nepoškozena."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3064 game/combatai.msg:3064
msgid "Recalculating target's offensive abilities."
msgstr "Přepočítávám útočné schopnosti cíle."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3065
msgid "Analysis. Target erred in tactical selection. Unit undamaged."
msgstr "Analýza. Cíl neúspěšný ve svém útoku. Jednotka nepoškozena."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3100
msgid "Gotta get outa here!"
msgstr "Musím odsud vypadnout!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3103 game/cmbatai2.msg:12103 game/combatai.msg:3103
#: game/combatai.msg:12103
msgid "Later, normie!"
msgstr "Příště, normále!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3104 game/cmbatai2.msg:12104 game/cmbatai2.msg:36104
#: game/combatai.msg:3104 game/combatai.msg:12104 game/combatai.msg:36104
msgid "You ain't heard the last of me!"
msgstr "Ještě o mě uslyšíš!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3106 game/combatai.msg:3106
msgid "I ain't dyin' twice."
msgstr "Podruhý umírat nebudu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3107 game/cmbatai2.msg:44905 game/combatai.msg:3107
#: game/combatai.msg:42117 game/combatai.msg:44905
msgid "Feet don't fail me now!"
msgstr "Nožičky, nezklamte mě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3108 game/combatai.msg:3108
msgid "I'm just executing a retrograde advance."
msgstr "Jenom postupuju kupředu obráceně."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3109 game/combatai.msg:3109
msgid "Uh, time for a tactical withdrawal here."
msgstr "Eh, čas na taktickej ústup."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3110 game/combatai.msg:3110
msgid "Exit, stage left."
msgstr "Odcházím ze scény."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3111 game/combatai.msg:3111
msgid "It's later than I thought."
msgstr "Už se nějak stmívá."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3113 game/combatai.msg:3113
msgid "Run awaaaaay!"
msgstr "Utíkejte pryyyyyč!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3114 game/combatai.msg:3114
msgid "I've gotta go reattach some parts."
msgstr "Musím si jít přišít pár odpadlejch kousků."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3115 game/combatai.msg:3115
msgid "These old bones can't take this anymore."
msgstr "Moje starý kosti už toho maj dost."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3116 game/combatai.msg:3116
msgid "It's not the years, it's the mileage."
msgstr "To není věkem, ale opotřebováním."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3117 game/combatai.msg:3117
msgid "What a world, what a world...."
msgstr "To je svět, to je svět..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3118 game/combatai.msg:3118
msgid "I guess, you've learned your lesson, I'm outa here!"
msgstr "Myslím, že už ti to stačilo. Mizím odsud!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3119 game/combatai.msg:3119
msgid "Hey, stop backing away from me."
msgstr "Hej, neutíkej přede mnou."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3122 game/combatai.msg:3122
msgid "Beef, beef, beef--beef bologna!"
msgstr "Hovězí, hovězí, hovězí... hovězí salám!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3123 game/cmbatai2.msg:12123 game/combatai.msg:3123
#: game/combatai.msg:12123
msgid "Brains..."
msgstr "Mozkýýý..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3124 game/cmbatai2.msg:12124 game/combatai.msg:3124
#: game/combatai.msg:12124
msgid "I'm gonna dig your grave..."
msgstr "Vykopu ti hrob..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3125 game/cmbatai2.msg:12125 game/combatai.msg:3125
#: game/combatai.msg:12125
msgid "Hope I can keep your head intact..."
msgstr "Snad ti zůstane hlava celá..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3126
msgid "More Brains...."
msgstr "Další mozkýýýý..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3127 game/combatai.msg:3127
msgid "Send more cops!"
msgstr "Pošlete sem víc poldů!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3128 game/combatai.msg:3128
msgid "Send more paramedics!"
msgstr "Pošlete sem víc doktorů!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3129 game/combatai.msg:3129
msgid "I could use some fresh parts."
msgstr "Hodilo by se mi pár novejch částí."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3130 game/combatai.msg:3130
msgid "Steak Tartar comin' up."
msgstr "Bude tatarskej biftek."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3131 game/combatai.msg:3131
msgid "Come an' get it!"
msgstr "Tak pojď!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3132 game/combatai.msg:3132
msgid "Is it soup yet?"
msgstr "To už je polívka?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3133 game/combatai.msg:3133
msgid "Where's the beef?"
msgstr "Kde je hovězí?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3134 game/combatai.msg:3134
msgid "Mmm, I just love smoothskins."
msgstr "Mmmm, miluju lidi."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3135 game/combatai.msg:3135
msgid "You crossed my shadow... or sumthin'"
msgstr "Zakryl jsi mi výhled... nebo něco takovýho."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3136 game/combatai.msg:3136
msgid "I knew I heard the chow-bell."
msgstr "Slyším zvonek na oběd."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3137 game/combatai.msg:3137
msgid "Guess who's comin' to dinner."
msgstr "Hádej, kdo přijde na večeři."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3138 game/combatai.msg:3138
msgid "Parts is parts."
msgstr "Části jsou části."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3139 game/combatai.msg:3139
msgid "So, you're my next organ donor huh?"
msgstr "Hele, novej dárce orgánů!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3140 game/cmbatai2.msg:12140 game/combatai.msg:3140
#: game/combatai.msg:12140
msgid "Your number is up!"
msgstr "Jseš na řadě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3142 game/cmbatai2.msg:12142 game/cmbatai2.msg:36442
#: game/combatai.msg:3142 game/combatai.msg:12142
msgid "I'm gonna enjoy this"
msgstr "Tohle si vychutnám!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3143 game/cmbatai2.msg:12143 game/combatai.msg:3143
#: game/combatai.msg:12143
msgid "Oooo, that's gotta hurt!"
msgstr "Oooo, to bude bolet!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3144 game/combatai.msg:3144
msgid "Slicin' & Dicin' time."
msgstr "Čas na sváču."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3145 game/cmbatai2.msg:12145 game/cmbatai2.msg:36144
#: game/combatai.msg:3145 game/combatai.msg:12145 game/combatai.msg:36144
msgid "I'm gonna eat your liver!"
msgstr "Sežeru ti játra!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3147 game/cmbatai2.msg:12147 game/combatai.msg:3147
#: game/combatai.msg:12147
msgid "Dinnertime!"
msgstr "Večeře!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3149
msgid "I eat punks like you for breakfast, and lunch"
msgstr "Takový sráče, jako jsi ty, si dávám k snídani a obědu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3150 game/combatai.msg:3150
msgid "How can anything this messy be bad?"
msgstr "Že jsem špinavej ještě neznamená, že jsem špatnej."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3151 game/combatai.msg:3151
msgid "Lemme' just have a taste!"
msgstr "Dej mi kousnout!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3152 game/combatai.msg:3152
msgid "Give Daddy some sugar, baby!"
msgstr "Pojď k tatínkovi!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3153 game/combatai.msg:3153
msgid "I got sumpin' for ya!"
msgstr "Mám tu něco pro tebe!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3154 game/combatai.msg:3154
msgid "Stay still! It'll hurt less."
msgstr "Nehejbej se! Nebude to tolik bolet."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3155 game/combatai.msg:3155
msgid "Stop your twitchin', the chef's in the kitchen!"
msgstr "Bude z tebe tajemství šéfkuchaře!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3156 game/combatai.msg:3156
msgid "I loves to watch 'em squirm."
msgstr "Miluju, když se jídlo ještě hejbe na talíři."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3157 game/combatai.msg:3157
msgid "Delicious & nutritious too!"
msgstr "Chutný a taky výživný!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3158 game/combatai.msg:3158
msgid "You sure bleed a lot. Must be tender & juicy."
msgstr "Dost krvácíš. To budeš mít určitě měkký a pěkně šťavnatý maso."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3159 game/combatai.msg:3159
msgid "I'm guessin' that's more fear than excitement."
msgstr "Aspoň tě nebudu muset naklepávat jako řízky."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3160 game/cmbatai2.msg:12160 game/cmbatai2.msg:36160
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36260 game/cmbatai2.msg:36360 game/cmbatai2.msg:36460
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36560 game/combatai.msg:3160 game/combatai.msg:12160
#: game/combatai.msg:36160 game/combatai.msg:36260 game/combatai.msg:36360
#: game/combatai.msg:36460 game/combatai.msg:36560
msgid "You cannot hurt me!"
msgstr "Mně nemůžeš ublížit!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3161 game/combatai.msg:3161
msgid "And you think *Ghouls* are slow?"
msgstr "Ty si myslíš, že jsou *ghoulové* pomalí?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3162 game/cmbatai2.msg:3163 game/cmbatai2.msg:12162
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12163 game/combatai.msg:3162 game/combatai.msg:3163
#: game/combatai.msg:12162 game/combatai.msg:12163
msgid "You missed, normie!"
msgstr "Vedle, normále!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3164 game/cmbatai2.msg:12164 game/cmbatai2.msg:36164
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36264 game/cmbatai2.msg:36364 game/cmbatai2.msg:36464
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36564 game/combatai.msg:3164 game/combatai.msg:12164
#: game/combatai.msg:36164 game/combatai.msg:36264 game/combatai.msg:36364
#: game/combatai.msg:36464 game/combatai.msg:36564
msgid "You can't kill what you can't hit!"
msgstr "Nemůžeš zabít to, co netrefíš!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3166 game/combatai.msg:3166
msgid "OK, let's try that at full speed now."
msgstr "Fajn, a teď to zkusíme na ostro."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3167 game/combatai.msg:3167
msgid "Were you actually aiming at me?"
msgstr "Šla ta rána vůbec na mě?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3169 game/combatai.msg:3169
msgid "This is not a charade."
msgstr "Tohle není žádná šaráda."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3170 game/combatai.msg:3170
msgid "Combat requires total concentration."
msgstr "Na boj se musíš plně soustředit."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3171
msgid "Shame that your first time is gonna' be your last too."
msgstr "Škoda, že tvoje první bitka bude zároveň i tvoje poslední."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3172 game/combatai.msg:3172
msgid "Are you lookin' at me?"
msgstr "Díváš se vůbec na mě?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3173 game/combatai.msg:3173
msgid "You wanna try this again when you know what you're doin'?"
msgstr "Nechceš to zkusit, až budeš vědět, co máš dělat?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3174 game/combatai.msg:3174
msgid "No, no, no, the *pointy-end* goes towards *me.* Got it?"
msgstr "Ne, ne, ne, ten *špičatý konec* musí mířit na *mě*. Chápeš?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3175 game/combatai.msg:3175
msgid "What were you aimin' at, or were you aimin' at all?"
msgstr "Na co míříš, teda jestli vůbec míříš?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3176 game/combatai.msg:3176
msgid "What is your major malfunction numb-nuts?"
msgstr "Co máš za problém, tupče?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3177 game/combatai.msg:3177
msgid "You ain't never did this before have ya?"
msgstr "Dneska je tvoje první bitka, co?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3178 game/combatai.msg:3178
msgid "My turn's next!"
msgstr "A teď já!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3179 game/combatai.msg:3179
msgid "Was that really your *best* shot? Man, are you in trouble."
msgstr "*Líp* to neumíš? Tak to máš fakt problém."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3200 game/combatai.msg:3200
msgid "Whoa. I am SO outta here."
msgstr "Jejda. Musím odsud vypadnout."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3201 game/combatai.msg:3201
msgid "I'll be back... after I get another hit."
msgstr "Já se vrátím... až si šlehnu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3202 game/combatai.msg:3202
msgid "Knew I should have taken more Buffout..."
msgstr "To chtělo víc Buffoutu..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3203 game/combatai.msg:3203
msgid "I can't shoot up when I'm dead..."
msgstr "Nemůžu si šlehnout, když chcípnu..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3204 game/combatai.msg:3204
msgid "Aieeeeeee! Don't hurt me! Don't hurt me!"
msgstr "Jaůůůůůů! Neubližuj mi! Neubližuj mi!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3205 game/combatai.msg:3205
msgid "This hallucination just became way too real for me..."
msgstr "Tahle halucinace na mě začíná bejt trochu moc skutečná..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3221 game/combatai.msg:3221
msgid "You better hope you have some stimpaks... or some Jet."
msgstr "Doufej, že máš nějaký Stimpaky... nebo Jet."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3222 game/combatai.msg:3222
msgid "Maybe I can sell your body for some Jet..."
msgstr "Možná si za tvoje tělo budu moct koupit Jet..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3223 game/combatai.msg:3223
msgid "Gonna... hit... you... when... I...catch... you."
msgstr "Až... tě... chytim... tak... tě... praštím."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3224 game/combatai.msg:3224
msgid "Maybe killing you will be the fix I need..."
msgstr "Třeba mi tvoje smrt nahradí dávku, kterou potřebuju..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3225 game/cmbatai2.msg:3241 game/combatai.msg:3225
#: game/combatai.msg:3241
msgid "I'll kill you! I'll kill you! I'll kill you!"
msgstr "Zabiju tě! Zabiju tě! Zabiju tě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3226 game/combatai.msg:3226
msgid "Killing you will top off my high nicely..."
msgstr "Tvoje vražda bude jako další dávka..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3243
msgid "Nrrrg"
msgstr "Nrrrg!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3244
msgid "Hiyaaaaaa"
msgstr "Hajááááá!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3245 game/combatai.msg:3245
msgid "I'll kill you slow..."
msgstr "Zabiju tě pomalu..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3246 game/combatai.msg:3246
msgid "You're going down like a 2-cap whore..."
msgstr "Padneš na kolena jako laciná kurva..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3260 game/combatai.msg:3260
msgid "Close, but no Jet."
msgstr "Blízko, ale vedle."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3261 game/combatai.msg:3261
msgid "I'm so high, you'll never touch me!"
msgstr "Lítám tak vysoko, že na mě nikdy nedosáhneš!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3262 game/combatai.msg:3262
msgid "Which one of me are you aiming at?"
msgstr "Na který moje já to vlastně míříš?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3263 game/combatai.msg:3263
msgid "Whoa. Nearly got me."
msgstr "Jéje. Těsně vedle."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3264 game/combatai.msg:3264
msgid "I knew that Jet would make me faster..."
msgstr "Jet mě dělá rychlejší..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:3265 game/combatai.msg:3265
msgid "You fight pretty badly for a drug-induced hallucination."
msgstr "Na drogovou halucinaci se biješ pěkně mizerně."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12000 game/combatai.msg:12000
msgid "No way am I staying in this clusterfuck..."
msgstr "V týhle šlamastice nehodlám zůstat..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12002 game/combatai.msg:12002
msgid "Time to get the hell outta Dodge..."
msgstr "Čas prásknout do bot..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12003 game/combatai.msg:12003
msgid "Scatter!"
msgstr "Rozestupte se!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12005 game/combatai.msg:12005
msgid "I'll wait to get these fuckers when Fallout 3 comes out..."
msgstr "Počkám si na ty sráče ve Falloutu 3..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12006 game/combatai.msg:12006
msgid "Bishop can keep his fucking money..."
msgstr "Bishop si klidně může nechat ty svoje zasraný prachy..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12021 game/combatai.msg:12021
msgid "Somebody cover me!"
msgstr "Kryjte mě někdo!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12022 game/cmbatai2.msg:12023 game/cmbatai2.msg:12024
#: game/combatai.msg:12022 game/combatai.msg:12023 game/combatai.msg:12024
msgid "Hut hut hut hut hut hut"
msgstr "Ráz dva, ráz dva, ráz dva!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12025 game/cmbatai2.msg:12049 game/combatai.msg:12025
#: game/combatai.msg:12049
msgid "Kiss your ass good-bye..."
msgstr "Rozluč se se svým životem..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12026 game/combatai.msg:12026
msgid "Time to dust this mother fucker..."
msgstr "Čas sundat dalšího zmrda..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12027 game/combatai.msg:12027
msgid "Lock and load!"
msgstr "Nabít zbraně!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12028 game/combatai.msg:12028
msgid "Rock and roll!"
msgstr "Bude nářez!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12029 game/combatai.msg:12029
msgid "Look who just walked into the free fire zone..."
msgstr "Podívejte, kdo se nám to courá po střelnici..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12030 game/cmbatai2.msg:12048 game/combatai.msg:12030
#: game/combatai.msg:12048
msgid "Better hope you packed some stimpaks, tribal..."
msgstr "Doufám, že máš nějaký Stimpaky, divochu..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12036 game/combatai.msg:12036
msgid "By the numbers, people, by the numbers."
msgstr "Popořadě, chlapi, popořadě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12037 game/combatai.msg:12037
msgid "Attention to detail, people!"
msgstr "Cit pro detail, lidi!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12038 game/combatai.msg:12038
msgid "Lay down some suppressing fire! Keep their heads down!"
msgstr "Pokropte je trochu! Ať na nás nestřílej!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12040 game/combatai.msg:12040
msgid "Waste 'em!"
msgstr "Sejměte je!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12041 game/combatai.msg:12041
msgid "You're shit out of luck, tribal..."
msgstr "Jseš v prdeli, divochu..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12042 game/combatai.msg:12042
msgid "I'm going to put my boot so far up your ass, you'll be smelling shoe polish for a week."
msgstr "Kopnu tě do prdele tak hluboko, že ještě tejden ucejtíš leštěnku na boty."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12043
msgid "::I wanna be an airborn ranger...::"
msgstr "::Tak jdem! Tak jdem! Všechno tu rozbijem!::"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12045 game/combatai.msg:12045
msgid "You want some of this?! YOU WANT SOME OF THIS?!"
msgstr "Chceš?! CHCEŠ?!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12046 game/combatai.msg:12046
msgid "Hiyaaaaaa!!!"
msgstr "Hajááááá!!!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12060 game/combatai.msg:12060
msgid "You fight like old people fuck!"
msgstr "Biješ se jako když šukaj důchodci!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12061 game/combatai.msg:12061
msgid "Ha! Missed!"
msgstr "Ha! Vedle!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12062 game/combatai.msg:12062
msgid "Too fast for you..."
msgstr "To bylo na tebe moc rychlý..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12063 game/combatai.msg:12063 game/combatai.msg:12487
#: game/combatai.msg:40927
msgid "You're gonna be a long time dying..."
msgstr "Budeš chcípat dlouho..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12064 game/combatai.msg:12064
msgid "Sloppy..."
msgstr "O ničem..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12065 game/combatai.msg:12065
msgid "Weak AND slow, I see."
msgstr "To bylo ubohý A pomalý."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12122 game/combatai.msg:12122
msgid "Ah, dinner's arrived."
msgstr "A hele, přišla večeře."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12146 game/combatai.msg:3146 game/combatai.msg:12146
msgid "Hope you don't die too quickly!"
msgstr "Doufám, že budeš chcípat pomalu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12149 game/combatai.msg:3149 game/combatai.msg:12149
msgid "I eat punks like you for breakfast, and lunch."
msgstr "Takový hajzly, jako jsi ty, si dávám k snídani a obědu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12200 game/combatai.msg:12200
msgid "Whoa, this shit's getting too heavy."
msgstr "Uf, začíná to jít pěkně do hoven."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12201 game/combatai.msg:12201
msgid "Time to go get some of the other boys..."
msgstr "Čas zajít pro posily..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12202 game/combatai.msg:12202
msgid "I'll get you next time!"
msgstr "Příště tě dostanu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12203 game/combatai.msg:12203
msgid "You're just lucky I ain't got no stimpaks on me..."
msgstr "Máš štěstí, že mi došly Stimpaky..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12204 game/combatai.msg:12204
msgid "Time to get the hell outta Dodge."
msgstr "Čas odsud vypadnout."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12205 game/combatai.msg:12205
msgid "Need to find some stimpaks, fast..."
msgstr "Musím rychle sehnat nějaký Stimpaky..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12220 game/combatai.msg:12220
msgid "I'm gonna roll you like dice."
msgstr "Přejedu tě jako parní válec."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12221 game/combatai.msg:12221
msgid "And here I was, thinking I wasn't gonna get to kill no one today..."
msgstr "A já už myslel, že dneska nikoho nezabiju..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12222 game/combatai.msg:12222
msgid "Looks like Golgotha just got a new resident..."
msgstr "Golgota dostane dalšího obyvatele..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12223 game/combatai.msg:12223
msgid "Looks like we'll be doing this the hard way..."
msgstr "Asi to po dobrým nepůjde..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12224 game/combatai.msg:12224
msgid "I'm gonna knock out your teeth and make dice out of them."
msgstr "Vymlátím ti zuby a udělám si z nich hrací kostky."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12225 game/combatai.msg:12225
msgid "Looks like someone's gambling with their life..."
msgstr "Někdo si tady zahrává se životem..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12226 game/combatai.msg:12226
msgid "I'm gonna kill you, your family, then your dog."
msgstr "Zabiju tebe, tvoji rodinu a potom tvýho psa."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12227 game/combatai.msg:12227
msgid "Time to take out the trash..."
msgstr "Čas zatočit s pakáží..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12228 game/combatai.msg:12228
msgid "Gonna snap you like a wishbone..."
msgstr "Udělám s tebou krátkej proces..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12240 game/combatai.msg:12240
msgid "I'm going to kick your ass so hard you'll be wearing your ass as a hat."
msgstr "Kopnu tě do prdele tak silně, že ji budeš nosit jako klobouk."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12241 game/combatai.msg:12241
msgid "Lady Luck ain't with you today..."
msgstr "Štěstěna dnes není na tvý straně..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12242 game/combatai.msg:12242
msgid "I'm gonna beat you until you're ugly."
msgstr "Zmlátím tě tak, že tě ani vlastní matka nepozná."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12243 game/combatai.msg:12243
msgid "Time to put your ass in a grave."
msgstr "Je načase tě dostat do hrobu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12244 game/combatai.msg:12244
msgid "I'm gonna kick your heart out and stomp on it."
msgstr "Vykopnu ti srdce a pak ho rozšlapu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12245 game/combatai.msg:12245
msgid "Wish I had time to put your head in a vise..."
msgstr "Škoda, že nemám čas ti sevřít hlavu do svěráku..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12246 game/combatai.msg:12246
msgid "Let me show you what we do with garbage around here..."
msgstr "Ukážu ti, co tu děláme s pakáží..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12247 game/combatai.msg:12247
msgid "I'm going to hit you so hard you'll think it's an earthquake..."
msgstr "Dostaneš tak strašně na hubu, že si budeš myslet, že je zemětřesení..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12248 game/combatai.msg:12248
msgid "I've had enough of this turd..."
msgstr "Už mám dost tohodle sráče..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12249 game/combatai.msg:12249
msgid "Say hello to the angels for me..."
msgstr "Pozdravuj ode mě anděly..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12260 game/combatai.msg:12260
msgid "Moves like that'll put you in the hospital..."
msgstr "Začni se trochu snažit, nebo skončíš v nemocnici..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12261 game/combatai.msg:12261
msgid "You hit like a bitch..."
msgstr "Biješ se jako děvka..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12262 game/combatai.msg:12262
msgid "Nice one. I'll show you how it's done in a sec."
msgstr "Hezký. Hned ti ukážu, jak se to má dělat."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12263 game/combatai.msg:12263
msgid "You blind and stupid?"
msgstr "Jseš slepej a blbej?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12264 game/combatai.msg:12264
msgid "You flying on Jet or something?"
msgstr "Jseš na Jetu nebo co?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12265 game/combatai.msg:12265
msgid "You couldn't hit the broad side of a casino."
msgstr "Netrefíš ani vrata od kasína."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12266 game/combatai.msg:12266
msgid "If you tried to hit the air, you'd miss."
msgstr "Nebij do vzduchu, bij do mě."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12310 game/combatai.msg:12310
msgid "My... arm... my... beautiful... arm."
msgstr "Moje... ruka... moje... krásná... ruka."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12312 game/combatai.msg:12312
msgid "*hffff*"
msgstr "*hffff*"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12320 game/combatai.msg:12320
msgid "My stroke hand! Have you no shame?!"
msgstr "Touhle rukou honím! To se nestydíš?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12322 game/combatai.msg:12322
msgid "Looks like I can't polish my gun with that hand anymore..."
msgstr "No, s touhle rukou si už asi nevyleštím..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12331
msgid "Hnrgggg"
msgstr "Hnrgggg."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12332 game/combatai.msg:12332
msgid "*hff*"
msgstr "*hff*"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12334 game/combatai.msg:12334
msgid "*Ooooof*"
msgstr "*Uuuuuf*"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12361 game/cmbatai2.msg:12371 game/combatai.msg:12361
#: game/combatai.msg:12371
msgid "*Ergg*"
msgstr "*Ergg*"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12380 game/combatai.msg:12380
msgid "My eye! My beautiful eye!"
msgstr "Moje oko! Moje krásný oko!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12391 game/combatai.msg:12391
msgid "Now I can't sound off like a got a pair."
msgstr "Tak a teď už nikdy nebudu mluvit jako chlap."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12394 game/combatai.msg:12394
msgid "Great. A player character with a ball fixation."
msgstr "No skvělý. Bojuju s někým, kdo je zaměřenej na koule."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:12396 game/combatai.msg:12396
msgid "Nuts!"
msgstr "Vejce!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:26021 game/combatai.msg:26021
msgid "You're already dead..."
msgstr "Už teď je z tebe mrtvola..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:26022 game/combatai.msg:26022
msgid "I'm gonna fuck you up!"
msgstr "Vyjebu s tebou jako nikdo!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:26024 game/combatai.msg:26024
