#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32845 game/combatai.msg:32845
msgid "Die, unwashed one!"
msgstr "Zemři, nečistá osobo!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32846 game/combatai.msg:32846
msgid "Sully not our sanctum!"
msgstr "Naši svatyni neposkvrníš!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32847
msgid "This is for OZ-9!"
msgstr "Tohle je za AHS-9!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32860 game/combatai.msg:32860
msgid "Your energy is misaligned."
msgstr "Tvoje energie je vychýlená."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32861 game/combatai.msg:32861
msgid "If you were one of us, you'd've hit me."
msgstr "Kdybys byl jedním z nás, zasáhl bys mě."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32862 game/combatai.msg:32862
msgid "You have dirty energy."
msgstr "Tvá energie je nečistá."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32863 game/combatai.msg:32863
msgid "Do not strike a true believer!"
msgstr "Nepokoušej se zasáhnout pravého věřícího!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32864 game/combatai.msg:32864
msgid "That will reset your anodynes!"
msgstr "To vyruší tvé anodyny!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32865 game/combatai.msg:32865
msgid "Impure one!"
msgstr "Nečistý!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32900 game/combatai.msg:32900
msgid "I'm a movie star!"
msgstr "Já jsem přece filmová hvězda!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32901 game/combatai.msg:32901
msgid "Celebrity coming through!"
msgstr "Celebrita prochází, uhněte!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32902 game/combatai.msg:32902
msgid "This isn't in the script!"
msgstr "Tohle není ve scénáři!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32903 game/combatai.msg:32903
msgid "Star Father! Help!"
msgstr "Hvězdný otče! Pomoz mi!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:32904 game/combatai.msg:32904
msgid "But I'm famous!"
msgstr "Ale já jsem slavná osobnost!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33001 game/combatai.msg:33001
msgid "No! Not me!"
msgstr "Ne! Mě ne!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33002 game/combatai.msg:33002
msgid "Please kill someone else!"
msgstr "Prosím, zabij někoho jiného!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33003
msgid "Don't kill me! I'm OZ-9!"
msgstr "Nezabíjej mě! Já jsem AHS-9!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33004 game/combatai.msg:33004
msgid "Guards! Help me!"
msgstr "Stráže! Pomozte mi!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33005 game/combatai.msg:33005
msgid "You can't kill me! I'm too important!"
msgstr "Mě nemůžeš zabít! Jsem příliš důležitá osoba!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33020 game/combatai.msg:33020
msgid "You could've been one of us."
msgstr "Mohl jsi být jedním z nás."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33021 game/combatai.msg:33021
msgid "The stupid always turn on their betters."
msgstr "Hlupáci vždy zradí ty úspěšnější."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33022 game/combatai.msg:33022
msgid "Your impurity shines!"
msgstr "Tvá nečistota přímo září!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33023 game/combatai.msg:33023
msgid "If only you had taken the oaths..."
msgstr "Kéž bys tak složil přísahu..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33024 game/combatai.msg:33024
msgid "The Star Father will strike you down."
msgstr "Hvězdný Otec tě srazí na kolena."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33025 game/combatai.msg:33025
msgid "You will never see planet Quetzel."
msgstr "Nikdy neuvidíš planetu Quetzel."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33026 game/combatai.msg:33026
msgid "You are a traitor to humanity's evolution."
msgstr "Jsi zrádce lidské evoluce."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33028 game/combatai.msg:33028
msgid "Unworthy and impure."
msgstr "Nehodný a nečistý."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33040 game/combatai.msg:33040
msgid "My touch will purify you!"
msgstr "Můj dotek tě očistí!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33041 game/combatai.msg:33041
msgid "I will strike you dead!"
msgstr "Dostaneš smrtící ránu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33042
msgid "In the name of Elron!"
msgstr "Ve jménu Hubbella!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33043 game/combatai.msg:33043
msgid "For the glory of Star Father!"
msgstr "Za slávu Hvězdného Otce!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33044
msgid "Feel the wrath of Elron!"
msgstr "Pociť hněv Hubbella!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33045 game/combatai.msg:33045
msgid "This will optimize you!"
msgstr "Tohle tě zoptimalizuje!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33060 game/combatai.msg:33060
msgid "The Star Father saves me!"
msgstr "Hvězdný Otec mě zachránil!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33061
msgid "Elron protects me!"
msgstr "Hubbell mě chrání!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33062 game/combatai.msg:33062
msgid "Your anodynes are clogged!"
msgstr "Tvoje anodyny jsou zablokované!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33063 game/combatai.msg:33063
msgid "Your energy is no good."
msgstr "Tvoje energie je špatná."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33064 game/combatai.msg:33064
msgid "Don't you know how to focus?"
msgstr "Copak nevíš jak se soustředit?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33101 game/combatai.msg:33101
msgid "I'd rather be on Quetzel!"
msgstr "Raději bych byl na Quetzelu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33102 game/combatai.msg:33102
msgid "Not me! Don't kill me!"
msgstr "Mě ne! Nezabíjej mě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33103 game/combatai.msg:33103
msgid "I'm just a lackey!"
msgstr "Já jsem jenom poskok!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33104 game/combatai.msg:33104
msgid "I don't make the decisions!"
msgstr "Nejsem nikdo důležitý!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33105 game/combatai.msg:33105
msgid "I'm not the one you want!"
msgstr "Já nejsem ten, kterého hledáš!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33120 game/combatai.msg:33120
msgid "I'd rather not do this..."
msgstr "Nechce se mi do toho, ale..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33121 game/combatai.msg:33121
msgid "Are you sure you wouldn't rather give up?"
msgstr "Nechceš se raději vzdát?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33122 game/combatai.msg:33122
msgid "We can work this out, can't we?"
msgstr "Nemůžeme se nějak domluvit?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33123
msgid "If OZ-9 says you're bad, you must be bad."
msgstr "Když AHS-9 říká, že jsi špatný, musíš být špatný."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33124
msgid "For ... um... the glory of Elron!"
msgstr "Za... eh... slávu Hubbella!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33125 game/combatai.msg:33125
msgid "Fighting is bad for your anodynes..."
msgstr "Boj je špatný pro tvoje anodyny..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33126 game/combatai.msg:33126
msgid "I'm no good at this threatening stuff."
msgstr "Vyhrožování mi zrovna moc nejde."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33128 game/combatai.msg:33128
msgid "My apologies if I'm about to hurt you."
msgstr "Omlouvám se, pokud ti ublížím."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33140 game/combatai.msg:33140
msgid "Look out!"
msgstr "Pozor!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33141 game/combatai.msg:33141
msgid "::he squints his eyes shut and attacks::"
msgstr "::zamhouří oči a zaútočí::"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33142 game/combatai.msg:33142
msgid "Here comes another attack..."
msgstr "A je tu další útok..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33143 game/combatai.msg:33143
msgid "If you just run away, I wouldn't have to do this."
msgstr "Když utečeš, nebudu na tebe muset útočit."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33144 game/combatai.msg:33144 game/combatai.msg:41729
msgid "Go on! Get out of here!"
msgstr "No tak! Uteč!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33145 game/combatai.msg:33145
msgid "Shoo! Shoo!"
msgstr "Kšá! Kšá!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33146 game/combatai.msg:33146
msgid "Stop fighting!"
msgstr "Přestaň bojovat!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33147 game/combatai.msg:33147
msgid "Hoooooooowdy ho!"
msgstr "Bu bu bu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33148 game/combatai.msg:33148
msgid "You smell like flowers."
msgstr "Voníš jako květiny."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33149 game/combatai.msg:33149
msgid "We can work this out!"
msgstr "Nějak už se dohodneme!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33160 game/combatai.msg:33160
msgid "Why are you trying to hurt me?"
msgstr "Proč mi chceš ublížit?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33161 game/combatai.msg:33161
msgid "What have I ever done to you?"
msgstr "Co jsem ti udělal?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33162 game/combatai.msg:33162
msgid "We don't have to fight, you know!"
msgstr "Víš, nemusíme bojovat!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33163 game/combatai.msg:33163
msgid "I don't want to hurt you!"
msgstr "Nechci ti ublížit!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33164 game/combatai.msg:33164
msgid "I don't want you to hurt me!"
msgstr "Neubližuj mi!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33165 game/combatai.msg:33165
msgid "Can we settle this like adults?"
msgstr "Nemůžeme to vyřešit jako dospělí lidé?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33200 game/combatai.msg:33200
msgid "I think you broke my jaw!"
msgstr "Mám zlomenou čelist!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33201 game/combatai.msg:33201
msgid "My cheekbone!"
msgstr "Moje lícní kost!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33202 game/combatai.msg:33202
msgid "That'll leave an unpleasant scar."
msgstr "Zůstane mi tam pěkně ošklivá jizva."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33210 game/combatai.msg:33210
msgid "My writing hand!"
msgstr "Moje ruka! S tou píšu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33211 game/combatai.msg:33211 game/combatai.msg:41621
msgid "My elbow!"
msgstr "Můj loket!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33212 game/combatai.msg:33212
msgid "Hey! Watch it!"
msgstr "Hej! Dávej pozor!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33220 game/combatai.msg:33220
msgid "Ahhh! Aiee! Ahh!"
msgstr "Ách! Jaůůů! Ach!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33222 game/combatai.msg:33222
msgid "Ow! My ulna!!"
msgstr "Au! Můj loket!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33230 game/combatai.msg:33230
msgid "I think you got my kidney!"
msgstr "Trefili mě do ledviny!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33231 game/combatai.msg:33231 game/combatai.msg:41649
msgid "My solar plexus!"
msgstr "Můj solar plexus!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33232 game/combatai.msg:33232
msgid "::panting::"
msgstr "::funění::"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33234 game/combatai.msg:33234
msgid "You don't have to do this..."
msgstr "To opravdu nebylo nutný..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33235 game/combatai.msg:33235
msgid "Okay, that hurt."
msgstr "Dobře... tohle bolelo."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33236 game/combatai.msg:33236
msgid "Ohhh... owwww"
msgstr "Occh... auuuu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33260 game/combatai.msg:33260
msgid "My fibia!"
msgstr "Můj kotník!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33270 game/combatai.msg:33270
msgid "Oooh, my femur!"
msgstr "Och, moje stehno!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33272 game/combatai.msg:33272
msgid "That'll be a limper.."
msgstr "Budu kulhat..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33280 game/combatai.msg:33280
msgid "I think you detached my retina!"
msgstr "Myslím, že mám utrženou sítnici!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33281 game/combatai.msg:33281
msgid "My aqueous humor! My vitreous humor!"
msgstr "Moje nitrooční tekutina! Můj sklivec!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33282 game/combatai.msg:33282 game/combatai.msg:41681
msgid "I'm blind! I'm blind!"
msgstr "Nevidím! Nevidím!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33290 game/combatai.msg:33290
msgid "That's... that's... painful..."
msgstr "To je... to je... bolestivé..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33291 game/combatai.msg:33291
msgid "Mother..."
msgstr "Matko..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33293 game/combatai.msg:33293
msgid "Sweet mother of GOD!"
msgstr "Svatá Matko BOŽÍ!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33294 game/combatai.msg:33294
msgid "Hmmm. Ow. Hmmm."
msgstr "Hmmm. Au. Hmmm."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:33295 game/combatai.msg:33295
msgid "I think I'll go into shock now."
msgstr "Myslím, že za chvíli dostanu šok."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36000 game/combatai.msg:36000
msgid "Gawd! That hit me in the head!"
msgstr "Hoho! To mě zasáhlo do hlavy!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36001 game/combatai.msg:36001
msgid "Ow! My head!"
msgstr "Au! Moje hlava!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36002 game/combatai.msg:36002
msgid "Oof! Kaga's head is on fire!"
msgstr "Uuf! Kagova hlava hoří!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36010 game/combatai.msg:36010
msgid "My hand!"
msgstr "Moje ruka!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36011
msgid "Ow! Good thing I'm right handed"
msgstr "Au! Ještě, že jsem pravák!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36012 game/combatai.msg:36012
msgid "Ow!!"
msgstr "Au!!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36020
msgid "Ow, my arm"
msgstr "Au, moje ruka!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36030 game/combatai.msg:36030
msgid "(Grunt!)"
msgstr "(Vrrr!)"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36031 game/combatai.msg:36031
msgid "It's only a flesh wound!"
msgstr "To je jenom škrábnutí!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36034 game/combatai.msg:36034
msgid "You should stop while you're ahead!"
msgstr "Nech toho, dokud se ti daří!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36035
msgid "Good shot. My turn!"
msgstr "Dobrá rána. Teď já."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36062 game/combatai.msg:36062
msgid "Ah! MY LEG!"
msgstr "Och! MOJE NOHA!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36071 game/combatai.msg:36071
msgid "Unh! Aiming a little low aren't you?"
msgstr "Uf! Míříš trochu nízko, ne?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36072 game/combatai.msg:36072
msgid "You weren't trying to hit my leg were you!?!"
msgstr "Snažíš se mě trefit do nohy!?!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36090
msgid "Oooooo, time out, I have to pick something up"
msgstr "Ooooo! Přestávka, musím si něco zvednout."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36091 game/combatai.msg:36091
msgid "Ooo! Kaga gotta learn that move..."
msgstr "Ooo! Kaga se tenhle útok musí naučit..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36092 game/combatai.msg:36092
msgid "Urg! Petey! You OK down there?"
msgstr "Urg! Frantíku! Jseš tam dole v pořádku?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36093 game/combatai.msg:36093
msgid "That... wheeeeze... hurt!"
msgstr "To... fakt... bolelo!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36095 game/combatai.msg:36095
msgid "Gasp!"
msgstr "Síp!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36103 game/combatai.msg:36103
msgid "I will dedicate myself to hunting you down!"
msgstr "Zasvětím svůj život tvým pronásledováním!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36121 game/combatai.msg:36121
msgid "Arroyo will regret casting me out!"
msgstr "Arroyo bude litovat, že mě vyhnalo!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36122 game/combatai.msg:36122
msgid "I will have my revenge on YOU!"
msgstr "Pomsta bude MÁ!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36123 game/combatai.msg:36123
msgid "Kaga will send you to the next life!"
msgstr "Kaga tě pošle do dalšího života!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36124 game/cmbatai2.msg:36146 game/cmbatai2.msg:36247
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36346 game/cmbatai2.msg:36447 game/combatai.msg:36124
#: game/combatai.msg:36146 game/combatai.msg:36247 game/combatai.msg:36346
#: game/combatai.msg:36447
msgid "Another Chosen One to kill!"
msgstr "Další Vyvolený na zabití!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36140 game/combatai.msg:36140
msgid "Your momma's not here to help you!"
msgstr "Tvoje maminka ti nepomůže!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36141 game/cmbatai2.msg:36242 game/cmbatai2.msg:36341
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36542 game/combatai.msg:36141 game/combatai.msg:36242
#: game/combatai.msg:36341 game/combatai.msg:36442
msgid "I'm gonna enjoy this!"
msgstr "To si vychutnám!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36142 game/combatai.msg:36142
msgid "Oooo, that gotta hurt!"
msgstr "Oooo, to muselo bolet!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36143 game/cmbatai2.msg:36244 game/cmbatai2.msg:36343
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36444 game/combatai.msg:36143 game/combatai.msg:36244
#: game/combatai.msg:36444 game/combatai.msg:36544
msgid "I'm gonna take your head back to the Elder!"
msgstr "Tvoji hlavu vezmu zpátky ke Starší!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36145
msgid "Hope you don't die as quickly as the others."
msgstr "Doufám, že nezemřeš tak rychle jako ostatní!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36148 game/cmbatai2.msg:36348 game/cmbatai2.msg:36449
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36548
msgid "Scream for me"
msgstr "Řvi pro mě."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36161 game/cmbatai2.msg:36261 game/cmbatai2.msg:36361
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36461 game/cmbatai2.msg:36561 game/combatai.msg:36161
#: game/combatai.msg:36261 game/combatai.msg:36361 game/combatai.msg:36461
#: game/combatai.msg:36561
msgid "The spirits are protecting me."
msgstr "Duchové mě ochraňují."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36162 game/cmbatai2.msg:36262 game/cmbatai2.msg:36362
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36462 game/cmbatai2.msg:36562 game/combatai.msg:36162
#: game/combatai.msg:36262 game/combatai.msg:36362 game/combatai.msg:36462
#: game/combatai.msg:36562
msgid "Hope that ain't your best shot."
msgstr "Doufám, že to nebyla tvoje nejlepší rána."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36163 game/cmbatai2.msg:36263 game/cmbatai2.msg:36363
#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36463 game/cmbatai2.msg:36563 game/combatai.msg:36163
#: game/combatai.msg:36263 game/combatai.msg:36363 game/combatai.msg:36463
#: game/combatai.msg:36563
msgid "Bwahaha. Kaga didn't even have to duck!"
msgstr "Hahahahaha. Kaga se nemusel ani sehnout!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36202 game/combatai.msg:36202
msgid "You cannot kill the Great Kaga!"
msgstr "Nemůžeš zabít Kagu Velikého!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36203
msgid "You are in luck! Kaga has business elsewhere"
msgstr "Máš štěstí! Kaga má ještě nějakou práci."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36204
msgid "You and Kaga will meet again"
msgstr "Ty a Kaga se ještě setkáte."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36220 game/combatai.msg:36220
msgid "After I kill you, I will burn Arroyo to the ground!"
msgstr "Až tě zabiju, spálím Arroyo na popel!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36221 game/combatai.msg:36221
msgid "I am to be feared by all!"
msgstr "Všichni se mě budou bát!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36222 game/combatai.msg:36222
msgid "Kaga will have your head for a trophy!"
msgstr "Kaga si tvoji hlavu nechá jako trofej!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36223
msgid "Surrender and I'll make your death quick."
msgstr "Vzdej se a dopřeju ti rychlou smrt!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36243
msgid "Oooo, Kaga felt that one from here,"
msgstr "Oooo, Kaga z tebe cítí strach."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36245 game/cmbatai2.msg:36344 game/cmbatai2.msg:36445
#: game/combatai.msg:36245 game/combatai.msg:36344 game/combatai.msg:36445
msgid "I'm gonna carve your heart out with a spoon!"
msgstr "Vyříznu ti srdce lžící!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36246 game/cmbatai2.msg:36345 game/cmbatai2.msg:36446
#: game/combatai.msg:36145 game/combatai.msg:36246 game/combatai.msg:36446
msgid "Hope you don't die as quickly as the others!"
msgstr "Doufám, že nezemřeš tak rychle jako ostatní!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36249 game/combatai.msg:36148 game/combatai.msg:36249
#: game/combatai.msg:36348 game/combatai.msg:36449 game/combatai.msg:36548
#: game/combatai.msg:70140
msgid "Scream for me."
msgstr "Řvi pro mě."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36301 game/cmbatai2.msg:36401 game/combatai.msg:36301
#: game/combatai.msg:36401
msgid "Kaga needs more training."
msgstr "Kaga potřebuje ještě trochu potrénovat."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36302 game/combatai.msg:36302
msgid "I'll be back. Yada yada yada I'm gonna kill you."
msgstr "Já se vrátím. Bla bla bla a pak tě zabiju."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36303 game/cmbatai2.msg:36403 game/combatai.msg:36203
#: game/combatai.msg:36303 game/combatai.msg:36403
msgid "You are in luck! Kaga has business elsewhere."
msgstr "Máš štěstí! Kaga má ještě nějakou práci."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36304 game/combatai.msg:36204 game/combatai.msg:36304
#: game/combatai.msg:36404
msgid "You and Kaga will meet again."
msgstr "Ty a Kaga se ještě setkáte."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36320
msgid "Kaga and the Chosen One meet again!"
msgstr "Kaga a Vyvolený se opět setkávají."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36321
msgid "Let's end this!"
msgstr "Skončeme to."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36322 game/combatai.msg:36322
msgid "You will regret ever hearing the name Kaga!"
msgstr "Budeš litovat, že jsi kdy slyšel jméno Kaga!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36342 game/cmbatai2.msg:36443 game/cmbatai2.msg:36543
#: game/combatai.msg:36243 game/combatai.msg:36342 game/combatai.msg:36443
#: game/combatai.msg:36543
msgid "Oooo, Kaga felt that one from here."
msgstr "Oooo, Kaga z tebe cítí strach."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36402
msgid "This is not the last you will see of Kaga!"
msgstr "Toto není naposled, co vidíš Kagu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36404
msgid "You and Kaga will meet again!"
msgstr "Ty a Kaga se ještě setkáte."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36423
msgid "Let Kaga teach you new skills he has learned."
msgstr "Kaga tě naučí nové triky, které se naučil!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36441 game/combatai.msg:36441
msgid "Hold still so Kaga can get a good shot."
msgstr "Nehýbej se, ať se Kaga trefí kriticky."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36520 game/combatai.msg:36520
msgid "Kaga is ready for you now."
msgstr "Kaga už je na tebe připravený."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36522
msgid "Kaga will send you to next life."
msgstr "Kaga tě pošle do dalšího života!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36523 game/combatai.msg:36523
msgid "Kaga gonna miss you."
msgstr "Budeš Kagovi chybět."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36541 game/combatai.msg:36541
msgid "Kaga will be famous for killing you!"
msgstr "Kaga se proslaví až tě zabije!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36544 game/combatai.msg:36343
msgid "I'm gonna take your head back to the Elder."
msgstr "Tvoji hlavu vezmu zpátky ke Starší!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36545 game/combatai.msg:36545
msgid "It ends here Chosen One!"
msgstr "Zde končí tvá cesta, Vyvolený!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36546
msgid "Kaga has to kill you now."
msgstr "Kaga tě teď musí zabít!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36600 game/combatai.msg:36600
msgid "Ahhhgh! My face!"
msgstr "Áááááá! Můj ksicht!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36601 game/combatai.msg:36601
msgid "My face! You shall suffer!"
msgstr "Můj ksicht! Budeš trpět!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36602 game/combatai.msg:36602
msgid "Ahhhgh! I rend you into bits!"
msgstr "Áááááá! Roztrhám tě na kousky!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36610 game/cmbatai2.msg:36620 game/combatai.msg:36610
#: game/combatai.msg:36620
msgid "Ahhhgh!"
msgstr "Áááááá!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36611 game/cmbatai2.msg:36621 game/combatai.msg:36611
#: game/combatai.msg:36621
msgid "Ow! You almost hurt Chosen!"
msgstr "Au! Skoro zranili Vyvoleného!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36612 game/cmbatai2.msg:36622 game/cmbatai2.msg:36662
#: game/combatai.msg:36612 game/combatai.msg:36622 game/combatai.msg:36662
msgid "Ahhhgh! I snap your neck for that!"
msgstr "Ááááá! Za to ti zlomím vaz!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36632 game/combatai.msg:36632
msgid "I kill you for that!"
msgstr "Za to tě zabiju!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36633 game/combatai.msg:36633
msgid "You no hurt me when you dead!"
msgstr "Nemůžeš mi ublížit když z tebe bude mrtvola!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36634 game/combatai.msg:36634
msgid "I laugh at your feeble attack!"
msgstr "Směju se tvým slaboučkým útokům!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36636 game/combatai.msg:36636
msgid "I'm gonna dip you!"
msgstr "Namočím tě do kádě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36637
msgid "Grrr! You anger me."
msgstr "Grrr! Začínáš mě štvát!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36638 game/combatai.msg:36638
msgid "Agh!"
msgstr "Áá!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36639 game/combatai.msg:36639
msgid "I will return this pain to you!"
msgstr "Tohle ti vrátím i s úroky!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36642 game/combatai.msg:36642
msgid "Hmm, you might be trouble."
msgstr "Hmm, s tebou budou problémy."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36643
msgid "Grrr! I look forward to your death."
msgstr "Grr! Už se těším na tvoji smrt."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36644 game/combatai.msg:36644
msgid "You can hurt me but you cannot win!"
msgstr "Můžeš mě zranit, ale nemůžeš vyhrát!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36645 game/combatai.msg:36645
msgid "Ow! That wasn't a good idea to hurt me."
msgstr "Au! To nebyl dobrý nápad!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36660 game/cmbatai2.msg:36670 game/combatai.msg:36660
#: game/combatai.msg:36670
msgid "Ahhhgh! My leg!"
msgstr "Ááááá! Moje noha!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36661 game/cmbatai2.msg:36671 game/cmbatai2.msg:36691
#: game/combatai.msg:36661 game/combatai.msg:36671 game/combatai.msg:36691
msgid "You call that pain? I laugh!"
msgstr "Tomu říkáš bolest? Haha!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36672 game/combatai.msg:36672
msgid "Ahhhgh! I shall snap your neck for that!"
msgstr "Ááááá! Za to ti zlomím vaz!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36680 game/combatai.msg:36680
msgid "Ahhhgh! Miserable human! I am blind!"
msgstr "Ááááá! Mizerný člověku! Jsem slepý!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36681 game/combatai.msg:36681
msgid "Ahhhgh! Pain! What have you done!"
msgstr "Ááááá! Bolest! Co se stalo!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36682 game/combatai.msg:36682
msgid "Ahhhgh! I will torture you many days!"
msgstr "Ááááá! Budu tě mučit dlouho!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36690 game/combatai.msg:36690
msgid "That is human weakness!"
msgstr "To je lidská slabina!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36692 game/combatai.msg:36692
msgid "You are stupid, human!"
msgstr "Jsi hloupý, člověče!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36693 game/cmbatai2.msg:36695 game/combatai.msg:36693
#: game/combatai.msg:36695
msgid "Why you attack me there?"
msgstr "Proč útočíš na tohle místo?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36694
msgid "I will hurt you for many hours"
msgstr "Budu ti ubližovat dlouho!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36701 game/combatai.msg:36701
msgid "You will not kill me!"
msgstr "Mě nezabiješ!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36702 game/combatai.msg:36702
msgid "I will be back!"
msgstr "Já se vrátím!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36703 game/combatai.msg:36703
msgid "My friends get you for me!"
msgstr "Mí přátelé tě dostanou!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36704 game/combatai.msg:36704
msgid "You pay for this -- later!"
msgstr "Za to zaplatíš... někdy jindy!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36705 game/combatai.msg:36705
msgid "We are Chosen! You die later!"
msgstr "My jsme Vyvolení! Chcípneš někdy jindy!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36720 game/combatai.msg:36720
msgid "Your death comes!"
msgstr "Tvoje smrt přichází!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36721 game/combatai.msg:36721
msgid "Those who bother Chosen, bother no one again!"
msgstr "Ti, kdo obtěžují Vyvolené, už nikoho obtěžovat nebudou!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36722 game/combatai.msg:36722
msgid "Human weapons cannot harm me!"
msgstr "Lidské zbraně mi neublíží!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36723 game/cmbatai2.msg:36727 game/combatai.msg:36723
#: game/combatai.msg:36727
msgid "You will suffer, suffer great!"
msgstr "Budeš trpět... a hodně!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36724 game/combatai.msg:36724
msgid "When I fight, I kill!"
msgstr "Když bojuju, zabíjím!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36725 game/combatai.msg:36725
msgid "Who is stupid enough to anger us?"
msgstr "Kdo je tak hloupý, že nás chce naštvat?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36726 game/combatai.msg:36726
msgid "I see enemies to destroy!"
msgstr "Vidím nepřítele na zabití!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36740
msgid "Now you die"
msgstr "Teď chcípneš!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36741 game/combatai.msg:36741
msgid "Nobody save you now!"
msgstr "Už tě nikdo nezachrání!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36742 game/combatai.msg:36742
msgid "Let me see your pain!"
msgstr "Ukaž, jak řveš bolestí!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36743 game/combatai.msg:36743
msgid "Now you die burning death!"
msgstr "A teď tě usmažím zaživa!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36744 game/combatai.msg:36744
msgid "Die Human Fool!"
msgstr "Chcípni, lidský hlupáku!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36745
msgid "Now you die a screaming death"
msgstr "A teď chcípneš bolestivou smrtí!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36746 game/combatai.msg:36746
msgid "Suffer!"
msgstr "Budeš trpět!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36747 game/combatai.msg:36747
msgid "Now I crush you!"
msgstr "Teď tě rozdrtím!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36748 game/combatai.msg:36748
msgid "You cannot fight the Chosen!"
msgstr "S Vyvoleným se nemůžeš měřit!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36749 game/combatai.msg:36749
msgid "Suffer, human!"
msgstr "Budeš trpět, člověče!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36760 game/combatai.msg:36760
msgid "Why do you struggle?"
msgstr "Proč se vůbec namáháš?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36761 game/combatai.msg:36761
msgid "Is that best humans can do!"
msgstr "Nic lepšího lidi neuměj?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36762 game/combatai.msg:36762
msgid "You have no power!"
msgstr "Nemáš žádnou sílu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36763 game/combatai.msg:36763
msgid "You make me laugh hard!"
msgstr "Rozesmíváš mě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36764 game/combatai.msg:36764
msgid "Was that an attack?"
msgstr "To byl útok?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:36765 game/combatai.msg:36765
msgid "We are the Chosen!"
msgstr "My jsme Vyvolení!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44800 game/combatai.msg:44800
msgid "I'm thick skulled but that still hurt."
msgstr "Sice mám tvrdou lebku, ale stejně to bolelo."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44801 game/combatai.msg:44801
msgid "I've got one hell of a headache."
msgstr "Mám pěkně silnou migrénu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44802 game/combatai.msg:44802
msgid "Umph. Not the head!"
msgstr "Umph. Do hlavy ne!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44803 game/combatai.msg:44803
msgid "I can do head shots too you know!"
msgstr "Víš, taky tě umím trefit do hlavy!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44804 game/combatai.msg:44804
msgid "Arrrgh! Dizzy..."
msgstr "Ááááá! Závrať..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44810 game/combatai.msg:44810
msgid "I'll kill you with my other arm."
msgstr "Zabiju tě druhou rukou."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44811 game/combatai.msg:44811
msgid "I don't need both arms to ruin your day!"
msgstr "Nepotřebuju obě ruce na to, abych ti zkazil den!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44812 game/combatai.msg:44812
msgid "I don't use that arm anyway."
msgstr "Tuhle ruku stejně nepoužívám."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44813 game/combatai.msg:44813
msgid "Ouch! I can use a sling over here."
msgstr "Au! Hodil by se mi kousek obvazu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44814 game/combatai.msg:44814
msgid "One arm down, one to go!"
msgstr "Jedna ruka v háji, druhá zbývá!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44820 game/combatai.msg:44820
msgid "Hey, that's my fighting arm!"
msgstr "Hele, s tou rukou bojuju!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44821 game/combatai.msg:44821
msgid "Damn that arm hurts!"
msgstr "Sakra, ta ruka bolí!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44822 game/combatai.msg:44822
msgid "I can take the likes of you with only one arm."
msgstr "Takové, jako jseš ty, zvládám jednou rukou."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44823 game/combatai.msg:44823
msgid "Right arm... arrgh!"
msgstr "Pravá ruka... ááááá!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44824 game/combatai.msg:44824
msgid "You hit my arm. I tear off your arm!"
msgstr "Dostal jsem to od tebe do ruky. Za to ti urvu tu tvoji!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44830 game/combatai.msg:44830
msgid "Umph... can't... breathe."
msgstr "Umf... nemůžu... dýchat."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44831 game/combatai.msg:44831
msgid "I'm minus a couple of ribs after that one."
msgstr "Můžu si odečíst pár žeber."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44832 game/combatai.msg:44832
msgid "Ouch! I hate gut shots."
msgstr "Jau! Nesnáším rány do břicha."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44833 game/combatai.msg:44833
msgid "Arrgghh! Chest pains!"
msgstr "Ááá! Bolí mě hrudník!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44834 game/combatai.msg:44834
msgid "Solar plexus... eegad that hurts!"
msgstr "Solar plexus... bože, to bolí!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44835 game/combatai.msg:44835
msgid "Is this a fight or are you just trying to get my attention?"
msgstr "To je boj, nebo se jenom snažíš upoutat moji pozornost?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44836 game/combatai.msg:44836
msgid "Let me know if that was supposed to hurt. I'll cry for you."
msgstr "Dej mi vědět, jestli to mělo bolet, ať vím, jestli mám řvát."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44837 game/combatai.msg:44837
msgid "Did your mama teach you how to fight?"
msgstr "Kdo tě učil bojovat? Maminka?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44838
msgid "Oh the pain (yawn). Please don't hurt me any more."
msgstr "Och, to je bolest (zív). Prosím, nebij mě už."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44839 game/combatai.msg:44839
msgid "You call that a hit. Let me show you how it's done!"
msgstr "Tomu říkáš zásah? Já ti ukážu, jak se to má dělat!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44840 game/combatai.msg:44840
msgid "I'm going to kick your ass for that one."
msgstr "Za to ti nakopu prdel."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44841 game/combatai.msg:44841
msgid "Whoa! That stings a bit."
msgstr "Páni! To trochu štíplo."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44842 game/combatai.msg:44842
msgid "I left the vault for this!?"
msgstr "Kvůli tomuhle jsem odešel z Vaultu!?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44843 game/combatai.msg:44843
msgid "I'm going to need a vacation."
msgstr "Budu potřebovat dovolenou."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44844 game/combatai.msg:44844
msgid "Yeeeouch! That hurts!"
msgstr "Jaů! To bolí!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44845
msgid "That didn't hurt at all"
msgstr "To ani trochu nebolelo."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44846 game/combatai.msg:44846
msgid "Where's a stimpak when you need one?"
msgstr "Kde mám Stimpak, když ho potřebuju?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44847
msgid "As soon as I can move again, you've had it"
msgstr "Až se budu moct zase hýbat, tak dostaneš!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44848 game/combatai.msg:44848
msgid "I am impervious to pain!"
msgstr "Jsem odolný vůči bolesti!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44849 game/combatai.msg:44849
msgid "I'm going to do the monster mash on your face!"
msgstr "A teď se vyřádím na tvým ksichtu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44860 game/combatai.msg:44860
msgid "Great. I'll be the only deathclaw at home with a limp."
msgstr "Skvělý. Budu jedinej párač na světě, kterej kulhá."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44861 game/combatai.msg:44861
msgid "Ouch! My leg..."
msgstr "Jauvajs! Moje noha..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44862 game/combatai.msg:44862
msgid "You'll pay with your leg for what you did to mine."
msgstr "Za tohle zaplatíš svojí nohou."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44863 game/combatai.msg:44863
msgid "I'll miss that leg..."
msgstr "Ta noha mi bude chybět..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44864 game/combatai.msg:44864
msgid "I don't need two legs to kill you."
msgstr "Nepotřebuju dvě nohy na to, abych tě zabil."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44870 game/combatai.msg:44870
msgid "Great. A bum leg."
msgstr "Skvělý. Chromá noha."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44871 game/combatai.msg:44871
msgid "Damn it! The leg..."
msgstr "Zatraceně! Noha..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44872 game/combatai.msg:44872
msgid "Not the leg... can't walk right as it is."
msgstr "Do nohy ne... už takhle nemůžu pořádně chodit."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44873 game/combatai.msg:44873
msgid "You cripple my leg, I cripple your leg."
msgstr "Já mám zmrzačenou nohu, ty budeš mít zmrzačenou nohu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44874 game/combatai.msg:44874
msgid "Arrggh! That knee hurts!"
msgstr "Áááá! Bolí mě koleno!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44880 game/combatai.msg:44880
msgid "Can't see!"
msgstr "Nic nevidím!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44881 game/combatai.msg:44881
msgid "Not the eyes!"
msgstr "Do očí ne!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44882 game/combatai.msg:44882
msgid "Blood... in eyes... can't see."
msgstr "Krev... v očích... nic nevidím."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44883 game/combatai.msg:44883
msgid "I can't see you, but I can smell you."
msgstr "Nevidím tě, ale cítím tě."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44884 game/combatai.msg:44884
msgid "I'm going to need glasses after that one!"
msgstr "Budu potřebovat brýle!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44890 game/combatai.msg:44890
msgid "The groin is such a cheap shot!"
msgstr "Do rozkroku je to dost zbabělý!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44891 game/combatai.msg:44891
msgid "No... hitting... below... the belt!"
msgstr "Žádný... rány... pod... pás!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44892 game/combatai.msg:44892
msgid "That's fighting dirty. How about if I hit you in the crotch?"
msgstr "To bylo pěkně sprostý. Co kdybych tě do rozkroku trefil já?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44893 game/combatai.msg:44893
msgid "I HATE groin shots! Unngh..."
msgstr "NESNÁŠÍM rány do rozkroku! Unngh..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44894 game/combatai.msg:44894
msgid "Crotch shot... good thing I'm not human!"
msgstr "Rána do rozkroku... ještě, že nejsem člověk!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44900 game/combatai.msg:44900
msgid "Time to bail!"
msgstr "Beru roha!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44901 game/combatai.msg:44901
msgid "I'm leaving!"
msgstr "Odcházím!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44906 game/combatai.msg:44906
msgid "Out of the way, I'm moving out!"
msgstr "Uhněte, odcházím!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44907 game/combatai.msg:44907
msgid "I'm not retreating, this is a strategic withdrawal."
msgstr "Já neutíkám, to je jen strategický ústup."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44908 game/combatai.msg:44908
msgid "I've had enough of this shit!"
msgstr "Už mě to tu sere!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44909 game/combatai.msg:44909
msgid "I've got to get out of here!"
msgstr "Musím odsud vypadnout!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44920 game/combatai.msg:44920
msgid "Come here so I can hit you!"
msgstr "Pojď sem, ať ti můžu jednu fláknout!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44921 game/combatai.msg:44921
msgid "You're all mine!"
msgstr "Jsi jen můj!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44922 game/combatai.msg:44922
msgid "It's you or me... and I vote you!"
msgstr "Buď ty nebo já... a já hlasuju pro tebe!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44923 game/combatai.msg:44923
msgid "It's your funeral!"
msgstr "To je tvůj pohřeb!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44924 game/combatai.msg:44924
msgid "Come and get it!"
msgstr "Pojď si pro to!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44925 game/combatai.msg:44925
msgid "Prepare to meet your doom!"
msgstr "Připrav se potkat svoji zkázu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44926 game/combatai.msg:44926
msgid "Best kiss your ass goodbye while you still can."
msgstr "Rozluč se se životem dokud ještě můžeš."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44927 game/combatai.msg:44927
msgid "I'm going to paint you red!"
msgstr "Udělám z tebe rudej flek!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44929 game/combatai.msg:44929
msgid "I'm heading in!"
msgstr "Jdu na to!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44930 game/combatai.msg:44930
msgid "I'll see you on the front line!"
msgstr "Brzy se uvidíme!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44931 game/combatai.msg:44931
msgid "Time to reach out and touch someone!"
msgstr "Čas natáhnout pracku a přitáhnout si novou hračku!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44932 game/combatai.msg:44932
msgid "Advance and annihilate!"
msgstr "Kupředu! Zničte je!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44933 game/combatai.msg:44933
msgid "I'm going to fall on you like ugly on a human!"
msgstr "Spadnu na tebe jako deprese na člověka!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44934 game/combatai.msg:44934
msgid "Time to get physical!"
msgstr "Je načase se fyzicky sblížit!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44935 game/combatai.msg:44935
msgid "Getting up close and personal."
msgstr "Sblížíme se osobně."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44936 game/combatai.msg:44936
msgid "Bad ass moving in!"
msgstr "Velkej hajzl jde do boje!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44937 game/combatai.msg:44937
msgid "Incoming!"
msgstr "Útočím!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44938 game/combatai.msg:44938
msgid "Locked on target and homing!"
msgstr "Cíl zaměřen!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44939 game/combatai.msg:44939
msgid "There's a storm coming!"
msgstr "Přichází bouře!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44940 game/combatai.msg:44940
msgid "I'm going to hurt you... bad!"
msgstr "Ublížím ti... moc!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44941 game/combatai.msg:44941
msgid "This is going to hurt you a lot more than it does me!"
msgstr "Tohle tě bude bolet mnohem víc než mě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44942 game/combatai.msg:44942
msgid "Do unto others before they do unto you!"
msgstr "Nedělej ostatním to, co nechceš, aby dělali tobě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44943 game/combatai.msg:44943
msgid "If there's a part of you that doesn't hurt, it's next!"
msgstr "Jestli máš ještě nějakou část, která tě nebolí, bude další na řadě!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44944 game/combatai.msg:44944
msgid "Contact sports. I love it!"
msgstr "Miluju kontaktní sporty!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44945 game/combatai.msg:44945
msgid "Tell me your name so I can contact your next of kin."
msgstr "Řekni mi svoje jméno, ať můžu kontaktovat tvoji rodinu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44946 game/combatai.msg:44946
msgid "I'm the one who put the 'death' in deathclaw!"
msgstr "Víš, co v angličtině znamená slovo 'death'? SMRT!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44947 game/combatai.msg:44947
msgid "It's better to give than to receive!"
msgstr "Je lepší dávat než brát!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44948 game/combatai.msg:44948
msgid "I hope you're enjoying this as much as I am!"
msgstr "Doufám, že si to užíváš stejně jako já!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44949 game/combatai.msg:44949
msgid "Did that hurt? If not I can do it harder next time."
msgstr "Bolelo to? Jestli ne, tak se postarám o to, aby příště ano."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44950 game/combatai.msg:44950
msgid "We have a bleeder over here!"
msgstr "Někdo nám tu krvácí!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44951 game/combatai.msg:44951
msgid "It'll take more than a stimpak to fix you when I'm done."
msgstr "Až s tebou skončím, budeš potřebovat víc než jen pár Stimpaků."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44952 game/combatai.msg:44952
msgid "I hope you have medical insurance. You're going to need it."
msgstr "Doufám, že máš zdravotní pojištění. Budeš ho potřebovat."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44953 game/combatai.msg:44953
msgid "Here a rip, there a rip, everywhere a rip rip..."
msgstr "Seknu sem, seknu tam, seknu všude kam se podívám..."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44954 game/combatai.msg:44954
msgid "I don't care who started it, I intend to finish it!"
msgstr "Nezajímá mě, kdo si začal. Já to hodlám dokončit!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44955 game/combatai.msg:44955
msgid "I love the sound of tearing flesh, don't you?"
msgstr "Miluju zvuk trhajícího se masa. Ty ne?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44956 game/combatai.msg:44956
msgid "Just warming up, the best is yet to come."
msgstr "Jenom se rozehřívám, to nejlepší teprve přijde."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44957 game/combatai.msg:44957
msgid "Just sharpening my claws."
msgstr "Jenom si brousím drápy."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44958 game/combatai.msg:44958
msgid "Ooops! Hope you didn't need that!"
msgstr "Oou! Doufám, že tohle nepotřebuješ!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44959 game/combatai.msg:44959
msgid "If you fall over and stay there I'll go away!"
msgstr "Když padneš na zem a zůstaneš tam, tak půjdu pryč!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44960
msgid "Will you stop moving around so I can hit you?"
msgstr "Přestaneš se konečně hýbat, abych tě mohl trefit?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44961
msgid "Glasses. Must look into getting some glasses."
msgstr "Brýle. Opravdu budu přemýšlet o brýlích."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44962
msgid "Don't laugh. When I do hit you, it's going to hurt!"
msgstr "Nesměj se mi. Až tě zasáhnu, bude tě to bolet!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44963
msgid "Arrg! Grng! Ghrr! Thpt! (Deathclaw four-letter words)"
msgstr "Áááá! Grng! Ghrr! Thpt! (Páračův vztek)"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44964
msgid "I guess I shouldn't make a career out of fighting."
msgstr "Vypadá to, že bojová kariéra není nic pro mě."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44965
msgid "How could I possibly miss anything as big as you are!"
msgstr "Jak můžu netrefit něco tak velikýho, jako jsi ty?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44966
msgid "As soon as I get ranged in you're in trouble."
msgstr "Až tě zasáhnu, tak jsi v rejži."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44967
msgid "You're a nimble little shit aren't you."
msgstr "Jseš malej, ale šikovnej sráč, co?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44968
msgid "I'm glad my mother didn't see me do that."
msgstr "Jsem rád, že to neviděla moje máma."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44969
msgid "Why am I swinging over there when you're over here?"
msgstr "Proč máchám támhle, když ty jsi tady?"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44970
msgid "How embarrassing. Please don't tell anyone I did that."
msgstr "Och, to je trapné. Nikomu to prosím neříkej."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44971
msgid "That really pisses me off!"
msgstr "To mě fakt nasralo!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44972
msgid "Ok. I missed! It could happen to anyone!"
msgstr "Dobře, minul jsem! To se stane každému!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44973
msgid "I'll get you next time."
msgstr "Příště tě dostanu."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44974
msgid "Way to go, Grace!"
msgstr "Jen tak dál, šikulo!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44975
msgid "That was a shining example of missing the target!"
msgstr "Tohle byl krásný příklad minutí cíle."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44976
msgid "I'm beginning to think I'm not cut out for this."
msgstr "Začínám si myslet, že na to nemám."

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44977
msgid "Arrggh! I can't believe I missed you!"
msgstr "Ááááá! Nemůžu uvěřit, že jsem tě netrefil!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44978
msgid "I fanned the air on that one I did!"
msgstr "Máchám do vzduchu!"

#: game/cmbatai2.msg:44979
msgid "Did I just miss you or what!"
msgstr "Netrefil jsem tě nebo co?"

