#: game/combat.msg:5000 game/combat.msg:5100
msgid ". That really hurts"
msgstr ". Tohle docela ublížilo."

#: game/combat.msg:5001 game/combat.msg:5101
msgid ". Serious pain is inflicted"
msgstr ". Zásah způsobil vážné zranění"

#: game/combat.msg:5002
msgid " with no armor defenses"
msgstr " , protože na sobě nemá zbroj"

#: game/combat.msg:5003
msgid ". The damaging attack knocks him unconscious"
msgstr ". Drtivá rána ho zcela omráčila"

#: game/combat.msg:5004
msgid ". The blow knocks him to the ground"
msgstr ". Rána ho srazila na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5005
msgid ". The strong blow to the head knocks him out"
msgstr ". Silná rána do hlavy ho úplně knokautovala"

#: game/combat.msg:5006
msgid ". The attack crushes the temple. Good night, Gracie"
msgstr ". Rána mu urvala největší mužskou chloubu. Dobrou noc, Gracie"

#: game/combat.msg:5007 game/combat.msg:5107
msgid ". Death is instantaneous"
msgstr ". Smrt nastala okamžitě"

#: game/combat.msg:5008 game/combat.msg:5108
msgid ", causing severe tennis elbow"
msgstr ". Rána jí způsobila ošklivý tenisový loket"

#: game/combat.msg:5009 game/combat.msg:5109
msgid ", pushing the arm out of the way"
msgstr ". Rána jí utrhla ruku"

#: game/combat.msg:5010 game/combat.msg:5110
msgid ", leaving a big bruise"
msgstr ". Rána jí způsobila velikou podlitinu"

#: game/combat.msg:5011 game/combat.msg:5111
msgid ", crippling the left arm"
msgstr ". Rána zcela ochromila její levou ruku"

#: game/combat.msg:5012
msgid ", leaving the left arm dangling by the skin"
msgstr ". Rána zanechala jeho levou ruku houpající se na kousku kůže"

#: game/combat.msg:5013 game/combat.msg:5113
msgid ". That arm now looks like a bloody stump"
msgstr ". Z ruky jí zbyl jen krvavý pahýl"

#: game/combat.msg:5014 game/combat.msg:5114
msgid ", leaving a crippled right arm"
msgstr ". Rána zanechala její pravou ruku zcela zmrzačenou"

#: game/combat.msg:5015
msgid ". His right arm is pulverized by this powerful blow"
msgstr ". Jeho pravá ruka byla touto strašlivou ranou rozdrcena na kaši"

#: game/combat.msg:5016 game/combat.msg:5116
msgid " in a forceful blow"
msgstr " při tomto náhlém a brutálním útoku"

#: game/combat.msg:5017
msgid ", blowing through the armor"
msgstr ", protože rána pronikla skrz jeho zbroj"

#: game/combat.msg:5018 game/combat.msg:5118
msgid ", inflicting an extra helping of damage"
msgstr ". Útok ji obzvlášť těžce zranil"

#: game/combat.msg:5019
msgid " with no armor, knocking the combatant to the ground"
msgstr " a protože útok nebyl blokován zbrojí, srazil ho k zemi"

#: game/combat.msg:5020
msgid ", knocking the air out. He slumps to the ground out of the fight"
msgstr ". Rána mu vyrazila dech a složila ho na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5021
msgid ". Unfortunately, his spine is now clearly visible from the front"
msgstr ". Jeho páteř je teď zřetelně vidět zepředu"

#: game/combat.msg:5022
msgid ", putting a major hurt on his leg"
msgstr " a rána mu způsobila veliké zranění na noze"

#: game/combat.msg:5023
msgid ", knocking him to the ground like a bowling pin in a league game"
msgstr ". Zásah ho srazil k zemi jako kuželku"

#: game/combat.msg:5024
msgid ", bowling him over and crippling that leg"
msgstr ", přičemž ho rána srazila k zemi a zmrzačila mu nohu"

#: game/combat.msg:5025
msgid ", smashing the knee into the next town. He falls"
msgstr ". Jeho koleno bylo rozdrceno na krvavou kaši. V šoku upadl na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5026
msgid ". The intense pain of having a leg removed causes him to quit"
msgstr ". Strašlivá bolest z utržené nohy způsobila jeho vyřazení z boje"

#: game/combat.msg:5027 game/combat.msg:5127
msgid ", inflicting some extra pain"
msgstr " a vytrpěla příšernou bolest"

#: game/combat.msg:5028
msgid ". Unluckily for him, it causes blindness"
msgstr " a ke vší té smůle je navíc nadobro oslepen"

#: game/combat.msg:5029 game/combat.msg:5129
msgid ". With no protection there, it causes serious pain"
msgstr ", a protože útok nebyl blokován zbrojí, způsobil jí příšernou bolest"

#: game/combat.msg:5030
msgid ", and blinding him with a stunning blow"
msgstr " a ta omračující rána ho úplně oslepila"

#: game/combat.msg:5031
msgid ". The loss of an eye is too much for him, and he falls to the ground"
msgstr ". Ztratit oko, to už bylo na něj trochu moc. Upadl na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5032
msgid ". Sadly, he is too busy feeling the rush of air on the brain to notice death approaching"
msgstr ". Bohužel je teď příliš zaujatý vlahým dotekem větru na svém mozku, než aby vnímal svou smrt"

#: game/combat.msg:5033
msgid ". Ouch! That had to hurt"
msgstr ". Au! To muselo bolet"

#: game/combat.msg:5034
msgid ", and he's not wearing a cup, either"
msgstr " a poprvé v životě měl příležitost spatřit své koule"

#: game/combat.msg:5035
msgid ". Without protection, he falls over, groaning in agony"
msgstr ". Zlomil se v pase, upadl na zem a začal chroptět v agónii"

#: game/combat.msg:5036
msgid ". The pain is too much for him and he collapses like a rag"
msgstr ". Bolest ze zranění byla tak silná, že se zhroutil jako panák z hadrů"

#: game/combat.msg:5037
msgid ". He mumbles \"Mother\", as his eyes roll into the back of his head"
msgstr ". Zamumlal \"Mami\" a jeho oči se pomalu obrátily v sloup"

#: game/combat.msg:5102
msgid " with no armor"
msgstr ", protože na sobě nemá zbroj"

#: game/combat.msg:5103
msgid ". The damaging attack knocks her unconscious"
msgstr ". Drtivá rána ji zcela omráčila"

#: game/combat.msg:5104
msgid ". The blow knocks her to the ground"
msgstr ". Rána ji srazila k zemi"

#: game/combat.msg:5105
msgid ". The strong blow to the head knocks her out"
msgstr ". Silná rána do hlavy ji úplně knokautovala"

#: game/combat.msg:5106
msgid ". The attack crushes her temple. Good night, Gracie"
msgstr ". Rána zničila chrám jejího ženství. Dobrou noc, Gracie"

#: game/combat.msg:5112
msgid ". The left arm is barely attached to her shoulder"
msgstr ". Rána zanechala její levou ruku houpající se na kousku kůže"

#: game/combat.msg:5115
msgid ". Her right arm is turned into hamburger by the blow"
msgstr ". Její pravá ruka teď připomíná krvavý karbanátek"

#: game/combat.msg:5117
msgid ", piercing through her defenses"
msgstr " protože rána pronikla skrz její zbroj"

#: game/combat.msg:5119
msgid " with no armor, knocking the female fighter to the ground"
msgstr " a protože útok nebyl blokován zbrojí, srazil ji k zemi"

#: game/combat.msg:5120
msgid ", knocking the air out. She slumps to the ground"
msgstr ". Rána jí vyrazila dech a složila ji na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5121
msgid ". Unfortunately, her major organs have been exposed to the light"
msgstr ". Její důležité orgány si teď můžou všichni prohlédnout"

#: game/combat.msg:5122
msgid ", putting a major hurt on her leg"
msgstr " a rána jí způsobila veliké zranění na noze"

#: game/combat.msg:5123
msgid ", knocking her over like a bad blind date"
msgstr ". Rána ji zasáhla hůř než nevydařené rande naslepo"

#: game/combat.msg:5124
msgid ", knocking her down and crippling that leg"
msgstr ". Rána ji srazila k zemi a zmrzačila ji nohu"

#: game/combat.msg:5125
msgid ", smashing the knee into the next town. She takes the fast track to the ground"
msgstr ". Její koleno bylo rozdrceno na krvavou kaši. Skácela se na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5126
msgid ". She screams in pain from the broken leg"
msgstr ". Křičí bolestí a tiskne si zlomenou nohu"

#: game/combat.msg:5128
msgid ", causing blindness. She grimaces"
msgstr " rána ji úplně oslepila. Dělá legrační grimasy"

#: game/combat.msg:5130
msgid ". The wound causes severe blindness, as if there is any other kind"
msgstr ". Zranění ji téměř oslepilo"

#: game/combat.msg:5131
msgid ". She faints from the blinding attack"
msgstr ". Z oslepujícího útoku omdlela"

#: game/combat.msg:5132
msgid ". Sadly, she doesn't get to pray to her gods before she meets them"
msgstr ". Bohužel se nestihla pomodlit ke svým bohům, ačkoliv se s nimi už brzy setká"

#: game/combat.msg:5133
msgid ". She takes it like a man. That is to say, it hurts"
msgstr ". Přijala to statečně jako muž. To znamená, že to bolelo"

#: game/combat.msg:5134
msgid ", knocking her to the ground"
msgstr ". Utok ji srazil k zemi"

#: game/combat.msg:5135
msgid ". Her childbearing days are in trouble as she collapses in a limp heap"
msgstr ". Během několika vteřin absolvovala svou poslední a největší menstruaci"

#: game/combat.msg:5200
msgid ". The little kid starts to cry"
msgstr ". Dítě začalo plakat"

#: game/combat.msg:5201
msgid ". Unconscious, the small child falls over"
msgstr ". Dítě bylo omráčeno a upadlo na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5202
msgid ". Ouchie!"
msgstr ". Jauvajs!"

#: game/combat.msg:5203
msgid ". The blow is true, and the child is knocked unconscious"
msgstr ". Zásah to děcko omráčilo"

#: game/combat.msg:5204
msgid ", smashing the small child around like a limp rag"
msgstr ". Zásah naklepal dítě jako koberec"

#: game/combat.msg:5205
msgid ". The left arm of this kid now has an owie"
msgstr ". Levá ruka dítěte má teď bebí"

#: game/combat.msg:5206
msgid ", throwing the small child off balance"
msgstr ". Rána zbavila dítě rovnováhy"

#: game/combat.msg:5207
msgid ", breaking that arm with a loud snap. Some serious tears start to flow"
msgstr ". Ruka se s hlasitým křupnutím zlomila. Teď už začínají téct opravdové slzy"

#: game/combat.msg:5208
msgid ", easily snapping that arm like a small piece of candy"
msgstr ". Ruka se zlomila lehce jako kousek cukrkandlu"

#: game/combat.msg:5209
msgid ". The right arm starts to swell, like a balloon"
msgstr ". Pravá ruka dítěte otekla jako balón"

#: game/combat.msg:5210
msgid ", and starts to cry"
msgstr " a začalo plakat"

#: game/combat.msg:5211
msgid " in a sensitive spot"
msgstr " do citlivého místa"

#: game/combat.msg:5212
msgid ". The attack to a vital organ knocks the kid over"
msgstr ". Zásah do životně důležitého orgánu srazil dítě k zemi"

#: game/combat.msg:5213
msgid ", knocking the little kid over like a toy"
msgstr ". Rána odkopla dítě jako by to byla hračka"

#: game/combat.msg:5214
msgid ". Now this young child will never really experience life"
msgstr ". Tohle dítě už nikdy opravdu neprožije život"

#: game/combat.msg:5215
msgid ", inflicting a deep cut"
msgstr ". Zásah způsobil hlubokou tržnou ránu"

#: game/combat.msg:5216
msgid ". The attack bowls the child over, and breaks the leg"
msgstr ". Rána dítě porazila a zlomila mu nohu"

#: game/combat.msg:5217
msgid ", inflicting great harm to the small child"
msgstr ". Rána dítě těžce poranila"

#: game/combat.msg:5218
msgid ". The young child looks up and starts to cry"
msgstr ". Dítě pohlédlo nahoru a začalo plakat"

#: game/combat.msg:5219
msgid ", which blinds the youth"
msgstr ". Zásah dítě oslepil"

#: game/combat.msg:5220
msgid ", bashing in the youthful looking nose"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla dítě do nosu"

#: game/combat.msg:5221
msgid ". A cut appears above the eyes and the blood starts to flow freely"
msgstr ". Nad očima se mu objevila rána a začala z ní volně vytékat krev"

#: game/combat.msg:5222
msgid ", which opens an eye like an exploding grape. The child looks bewildered"
msgstr ". Oko prasklo jako vlašský ořech. Dítě vypadá dezorientovaně"

#: game/combat.msg:5223
msgid ", causing blindness. The young child drops to the ground"
msgstr ". Zásah dítě oslepil a poté upadlo na zem."

#: game/combat.msg:5224
msgid ", the blow continues into the small brain"
msgstr ". Rána pronikla lebeční kostí a zasáhla ho do mozku"

#: game/combat.msg:5225
msgid ". The child looks confused and shaken"
msgstr ". Dítě se třese a vypadá zmateně."

#: game/combat.msg:5226
msgid ", knocking this young target to the ground"
msgstr ". Rána tvůj malý cíl srazila k zemi"

#: game/combat.msg:5300
msgid ", hurting the mighty mutant"
msgstr ". Rána tohoto obrovského mutanta bolestivě poranila"

#: game/combat.msg:5301
msgid ", striking a vital spot"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla životně důležité místo"

#: game/combat.msg:5302
msgid ", striking a vital spot and knocking the giant to the ground"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla životně důležité místo a srazila obra k zemi"

#: game/combat.msg:5303
msgid ". The giant mutant looks around for a moment, and then slumps to the ground"
msgstr ". Obrovitý mutant se na tebe udiveně podíval a poté se pomalu sesunul k zemi"

#: game/combat.msg:5304
msgid ". The head explodes like a giant, bloody watermelon"
msgstr ". Jeho hlava vybuchla jako velký krvavý meloun"

#: game/combat.msg:5305
msgid ", severely hurting the mighty mutant"
msgstr ". Rána způsobila obrovitému mutantovi vážné poranění"

#: game/combat.msg:5306
msgid ", causing the giant to spend a moment cursing the universe"
msgstr ", což přimělo obra k tomu, aby proklel okamžik, kdy se narodil"

#: game/combat.msg:5307
msgid ", striking a nerve and forcing the giant to grab his arm in pain"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla nerv a obr si bolestí chytil svoji ruku"

#: game/combat.msg:5308
msgid ". The blow breaks the elbow and probably didn't feel too good"
msgstr ". Rána mu zlomila loket a pravděpodobně způsobila i hroznou bolest"

#: game/combat.msg:5309
msgid ", breaking the thick arm and spewing mutant blood over the ground"
msgstr ". Rána mu zlomila ruku. Mutantova krev vychrstla na zem všude kolem"

#: game/combat.msg:5310
msgid ", causing the giant to stumble for a moment and then collapse like a felled tree"
msgstr ". Obr se na chvíli zapotácel a poté padl jako podťatý strom"

#: game/combat.msg:5311
msgid ", and gallons of viscera spurt to the ground"
msgstr " a jeho vnitřnosti s hlasitým čvachnutím dopadly na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5312
msgid ", sending the giant flying to the floor"
msgstr ". Rána ho odhodila lehce jako pírko"

#: game/combat.msg:5313
msgid ". The mutant stumbles and falls, his leg barely able to support him"
msgstr ". Mutant se zapotácel a upadl. Jeho noha už mu bude k ničemu"

#: game/combat.msg:5314
msgid ", striking a vital location. The mutant crumples under a broken leg"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla životně důležité místo. Pod tíhou zlomené nohy se zhroutil na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5315
msgid ". The pain of a broken leg overwhelms the mighty giant"
msgstr ". Bolest ze zlomené nohy obrovského mutanta ohromila"

#: game/combat.msg:5316
msgid ", nearly blinding the mutant"
msgstr ". Zásah supermutanta téměř oslepil"

#: game/combat.msg:5317
msgid ", blinding the now-furious mutant"
msgstr ". Rána mutanta oslepila a rozzuřila"

#: game/combat.msg:5318
msgid ", nearly blinding the mutant but throwing him off balance"
msgstr ". Rána supermutanta téměř oslepila a zbavila ho veškeré rovnováhy"

#: game/combat.msg:5319
msgid ". The blinded mutant stumbles back, unprepared for the next attack"
msgstr ". Oslepený mutant se zapotácel, nepřipraven na další útok"

#: game/combat.msg:5320
msgid ", blinding the now-unconscious mutant"
msgstr ". Rána mutanta omráčila a oslepila"

#: game/combat.msg:5321
msgid ". The eyes of the mutant glow for a moment, and then the light fades - permanently"
msgstr ". Mutantovy oči na chvíli zazářily a poté jejich svit navždy pohasl"

#: game/combat.msg:5400
msgid ". The ghoul is surprised, and fails to defend against this attack"
msgstr ". Ghoul byl naprosto zaskočen a nezmohl se na sebemenší pokus o obranu"

#: game/combat.msg:5401
msgid ". The blow buries this ghoul"
msgstr ". Úder ghoula definitivně pohřbil"

#: game/combat.msg:5402
msgid ". The stunned ghoul's hand flies open"
msgstr ". Ghoulova ruka efektně odplachtila vzduchem"

#: game/combat.msg:5403
msgid ", sneaking through his armor and striking a critical joint"
msgstr ". Rána pronikla skrz zbroj a zasáhla důležitý kloub"

#: game/combat.msg:5404
msgid ", sneaking through his armor and lopping the arm off"
msgstr ". Rána pronikla skrz zbroj a utrhla mu celou ruku"

#: game/combat.msg:5405
msgid ". The ghoul moves the wrong way at the wrong moment, and loses an eye"
msgstr ". Ghoul byl ve špatný čas na špatném místě a přišel tak o oko"

#: game/combat.msg:5406
msgid ". The ghoul is wearing no armor there"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla nechráněné místo"

#: game/combat.msg:5407
msgid ", and without armor, the ghoul is blinded"
msgstr " a útok ho úplně oslepil, protože nemá zbroj"

#: game/combat.msg:5408
msgid ", causing the ghoul to look bewildered in his final moments"
msgstr ", což způsobilo, že ghoul vypadal v posledních chvílích svého života dosti zmateně"

#: game/combat.msg:5500
msgid ", knocking the big beast to the ground"
msgstr ". Rána to veliké zvíře srazila na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5501
msgid ", stunning both brains and felling the giant animal"
msgstr ". Útok pronikl skrz oba mozky a srazil obrovské zvíře na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5502
msgid ". The mutant cow gives a loud, startled cry"
msgstr ". Zmutovaná kráva ze sebe vydala hlasité, polekané zabučení"

#: game/combat.msg:5503
msgid ", breaking one of the Brahmin's legs"
msgstr ". Rána přerazila brahmíně jednu nohu"

#: game/combat.msg:5504
msgid ", seriously hurting the mutant cow"
msgstr ". Útok zmutovanou krávu vážně poranil"

#: game/combat.msg:5505
msgid ", easily penetrating the thick hide of the giant beast"
msgstr ". Rána lehce pronikla tlustou kůží obrovského zvířete"

#: game/combat.msg:5506
msgid ", penetrating straight through both hearts of the mutant cow"
msgstr ". Rána pronikla skrz obě srdce zmutované krávy"

#: game/combat.msg:5507
msgid ", blinding both sets of eyes with a single blow"
msgstr ". Jedinou ranou byly oslepeny všechny čtyři oči mohutného zvířete"

#: game/combat.msg:5508
msgid ", blinding both heads and stunning the mutant cow"
msgstr ". Rána oslepila obě hlavy zmutované krávy a omráčila ji"

#: game/combat.msg:5509
msgid ", completely blinding the Brahmin and knocking it out"
msgstr ". Rána zvíře odhodila stranou a úplně ji oslepila"

#: game/combat.msg:5510
msgid ". The large mutant bovine stumbles for a moment"
msgstr ". Veliká zmutovaná kráva se na chvíli zapotácela"

#: game/combat.msg:5511
msgid ". The Brahmin shakes with rage"
msgstr ". Obrovské zvíře se otřáslo zuřivostí"

#: game/combat.msg:5512
msgid ". The Brahmin snorts with pain"
msgstr ". Kráva zafuněla bolestí"

#: game/combat.msg:5513
msgid ". The Brahmin is most upset with this udderly devastating attack"
msgstr ". Útok rozdrtil zvířeti vemeno. Tváří se víc než naštvaně"

#: game/combat.msg:5600
msgid ", sending the Radscorpion flying on its back"
msgstr ". Radškorpion proletěl vzduchem a dopadl na záda"

#: game/combat.msg:5601
msgid ", separating the head from the carapace"
msgstr ". Útok oddělil jeho hlavu od krunýře"

#: game/combat.msg:5602
msgid ", seriously damaging the tail"
msgstr ". Rána těžce poškodila jeho ocas"

#: game/combat.msg:5603
msgid ", putting a major hurt on its claws"
msgstr ". Rána těžce poranila obě klepeta"

#: game/combat.msg:5604
msgid ". The blow slips between the cracks of the Radscorpion's tough carapace"
msgstr ". Úder pronikl mezerou v jeho tvrdém krunýři"

#: game/combat.msg:5605
msgid ", striking through the tough carapace without pausing"
msgstr ". Zásah prorazil jeho tvrdý krunýř"

#: game/combat.msg:5606
msgid ", passing through the natural armor and knocking the Radscorpion over"
msgstr ". Rána prošla jeho přirozeným brněním a odhodila ho dozadu"

#: game/combat.msg:5607
msgid ". The Radscorpion cannot cope with a new sensation, like missing internal organs"
msgstr ". Radškorpion se nedokáže vyrovnat s pocitem, že mu teď schází vnitřní orgány"

#: game/combat.msg:5608
msgid ", sending the 'scorpion flying and crippling some of its legs"
msgstr ". Rána odhodila radškorpiona dozadu a zmrzačila mu nohu"

#: game/combat.msg:5609
msgid ". The attack cuts through an unprotected joint on the leg, severing it"
msgstr ". Rána ho zasáhla do nechráněného kloubu, který přerazila"

#: game/combat.msg:5610
msgid ", seriously wounding and blinding the mutant creature"
msgstr ". Zmutovaná bestie byla těžce poraněna a oslepena"

#: game/combat.msg:5611
msgid ", penetrating almost to the brain. Talk about squashing a bug"
msgstr ". Rána pronikla téměř až do jeho mozku. Přesně takhle vypadá rozšlápnutý brouk"

#: game/combat.msg:5612
msgid ", almost penetrating to the brain, but blinding the creature instead"
msgstr ". Útok pronikl téměř až k mozku zvířete a navždy ho oslepil"

#: game/combat.msg:5613
msgid ". The attack is fiendish, and far too sophisticated for this simple creature"
msgstr ". Útok byl krutý a příliš sofistikovaný na tak jednoduché zvíře"

#: game/combat.msg:5614
msgid ". If it was human, you would swear it's pretty pissed off"
msgstr ". Být to člověk, tak přísaháš, že je teď pěkně nasraný"

#: game/combat.msg:5615
msgid ", knocking the poor creature senseless"
msgstr ". Rána zcela zbavila ubohé zvíře všech smyslů"

#: game/combat.msg:5616
msgid ", spiking the brain to the floor"
msgstr ". Rána rozstříkla jeho mozek po podlaze"

#: game/combat.msg:5700
msgid ". The rodent's skull makes several unhealthy sounds"
msgstr ". Hlodavcova lebka na několika místech praskla"

#: game/combat.msg:5701
msgid ", squashing the rodent's skull like a wet paper bag"
msgstr ". Hlodavcova lebka byla rozmačkána jako vlhký papírový pytlík"

#: game/combat.msg:5702
msgid ", and the left paw now looks a little flat"
msgstr ". Z její levé pracky je teď krvavá placka"

#: game/combat.msg:5703
msgid ". The left paw of the rat is blown off"
msgstr ". Levá pracka krysy byla utržena"

#: game/combat.msg:5704
msgid ". The right paw is heavily damaged"
msgstr ". Pravá pracka zvířete byla těžce poškozena"

#: game/combat.msg:5705
msgid ", blowing the right paw off"
msgstr ". Její pravá pracka byla urvána"

#: game/combat.msg:5706
msgid ". The rat is seriously wounded by this attack"
msgstr ". Krysa byla tímto útokem těžce poraněna"

#: game/combat.msg:5707
msgid ", seriously wounding the rat and knocking it around"
msgstr ". Rána krysu odhodila zpět a těžce ji poranila"

#: game/combat.msg:5708
msgid ", splattering the rat across the floor"
msgstr ". Strašlivá rána krysu doslova rozmázla po podlaze"

#: game/combat.msg:5709
msgid ", crippling the right leg"
msgstr ". Rána jí zmrzačila pravou nohu"

#: game/combat.msg:5710
msgid ", putting a big hole in the left leg"
msgstr ". Rána jí udělala velikou díru v levé noze"

#: game/combat.msg:5711
msgid ", doing some extra damage due to the sensitive location"
msgstr ". Útok zasáhl krysu do citlivého místa a způsobil jí vážné poranění"

#: game/combat.msg:5712
msgid ", summoning this creature to the great ratcatcher in the sky"
msgstr ". Rána poslala hlodavce přímo k velkému krysímu bohu v nebesích"

#: game/combat.msg:5800
msgid ". The floater drops to the ground"
msgstr ". Floater spadl na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5801
msgid ". The floater falls to the ground, seemingly lifeless"
msgstr ". Floater spadl na zem, zdánlivě mrtvý"

#: game/combat.msg:5802
msgid ", with serious consequences to the creature's continued existence"
msgstr ". Rána zanechala silné následky na budoucí existenci příšery"

#: game/combat.msg:5803
msgid ", stunning the foul creature"
msgstr ". Bestie byla omráčena"

#: game/combat.msg:5804
msgid ", hitting a sensitive spot there and stunning the floater"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla jeho citlivé místo a omráčila ho"

#: game/combat.msg:5805
msgid ". The blow causes the floater to shudder violently in a spray of crimson"
msgstr ". Po této ráně se floater změnil v krvavý vodotrysk"

#: game/combat.msg:5806
msgid ". The blow causing some sort of violent reaction in the creature"
msgstr ". Rána bestii rozzuřila"

#: game/combat.msg:5807
msgid ". The floater suddenly bursts into flames"
msgstr ". Floater náhle vzplanul"

#: game/combat.msg:5808
msgid ". It jerks wildly and quivers like a pudding surprise"
msgstr " a poté sebou prudce zaškubal a roztřásl se jako pudink"

#: game/combat.msg:5809
msgid ", with the blow hitting a sensitive spot"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla citlivé místo"

#: game/combat.msg:5810
msgid ". The creature is obviously agitated"
msgstr ". Bestie se očividně rozzuřila"

#: game/combat.msg:5900
msgid ". Pushed like a bad habit, the centaur falls over and is stunned"
msgstr ". Kentaur upadl a byl omráčen"

#: game/combat.msg:5901
msgid " as the blow strikes a critical spot"
msgstr " po zásahu do kritického místa"

#: game/combat.msg:5902
msgid ", causing massive neurological failure"
msgstr ". Rána způsobila masivní selhání všech nervových funkcí"

#: game/combat.msg:5903
msgid ", stunning it with your violent attack"
msgstr ". Tvůj brutální útok ho zcela omráčil"

#: game/combat.msg:5904
msgid ", crippling the arm"
msgstr ". Rána mu zmrzačila ruku"

#: game/combat.msg:5905
msgid ", striking a critical spot. The arm is crippled"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla kritické místo. Jeho ruka byla zmrzačena"

#: game/combat.msg:5906
msgid ", knocking the creature over and crippling the leg"
msgstr ". Rána ho odhodila stranou a zmrzačila mu nohu"

#: game/combat.msg:5907
msgid ", stunning the centaur as it is knocked over with a crippled leg"
msgstr ". Kentaur se na zmrzačené noze zakymácel a svalil se na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:5908
msgid ", blinding a head"
msgstr ". Rána ho oslepila"

#: game/combat.msg:5909
msgid ", surprising the centaur. It blindly stumbles for a moment"
msgstr ". Rána ho zcela překvapila. Chvíli se slepě potácel"

#: game/combat.msg:5910
msgid ", surprising the centaur. It collapses in a heap"
msgstr ". Rána ho zcela překvapila. Zhroutil se jako hromada růžové huspeniny"

#: game/combat.msg:5911
msgid ", surprising the centaur. It collapses in a pile of goo"
msgstr ". Rána ho zcela překvapila. Zhroutil se na zem a zbyla z něj jen hromada bezvládné hmoty"

#: game/combat.msg:5912
msgid ". The attack was not as effective as it could have been"
msgstr ". Útok nebyl tak efektivní, jak by mohl být"

#: game/combat.msg:6000
msgid ", inflicting some structural damage"
msgstr ". Útok poškodil jeho konstrukci"

#: game/combat.msg:6001
msgid ". Sparks fly and the robot goes momentarily out of control"
msgstr ". Z robota se zajiskřilo a na chvíli nad sebou ztratil kontrolu"

#: game/combat.msg:6002
msgid ", hitting a critical component and forcing the robot out of control"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla důležitou součástku a robot nad sebou ztratil kontrolu"

#: game/combat.msg:6003
msgid ", hitting a critical component and causing a massive malfunction"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla důležitou součástku a způsobila masivní selhání obvodů"

#: game/combat.msg:6004
msgid ". The robot attempts to compensate"
msgstr ". Robot se pokusil přemostit poškozené okruhy"

#: game/combat.msg:6005
msgid ". The robot strains to compensate"
msgstr ". Robot se při přemosťování poškozených okruhů pěkně zapotil"

#: game/combat.msg:6006
msgid ", hitting some key part and causing heavy damage"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla několik klíčových obvodů a způsobila robotovi těžké poškození"

#: game/combat.msg:6007
msgid ", inflicting heavy structural damage"
msgstr ". Rána těžce narušila jeho konstrukci"

#: game/combat.msg:6008
msgid ", hitting a critical component and causing severe damage"
msgstr ". Rána zasáhla důležitou součástku a těžce ji poškodila"

#: game/combat.msg:6009
msgid ". The robot shudders under this intense attack"
msgstr ". Robot se po tomto prudkém útoku začal klepat"

#: game/combat.msg:6010
msgid ", dismantling the robot"
msgstr ". Rána definitivně poslala robota do šrotu"

#: game/combat.msg:6011
msgid ". The robot attempts to compensate, but fails, falling to the ground"
msgstr ". Robot několik vteřin zkoušel přemostit vadné okruhy, ale selhal a zhroutil se na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:6012
msgid ". The robot strains under the pressure, falling to the ground"
msgstr ". Robot se pod nátlakem zhroutil na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:6013
msgid ", breaking the sensor lenses"
msgstr ". Rána vyřadila z provozu všechny jeho senzory"

#: game/combat.msg:6100
msgid ", knocking the pooch to the ground"
msgstr ". Rána srazila psisko k zemi"

#: game/combat.msg:6101
msgid ", right across the snout"
msgstr ". Rána ho zasáhla do čumáku"

#: game/combat.msg:6102
msgid ". The dog falls over, but it is still breathing"
msgstr ". Pes upadl na zem, ale stále dýchá"

#: game/combat.msg:6103
msgid ". The animal coughs up a spurt of blood"
msgstr ". Pes vykašlává krvavé hleny"

#: game/combat.msg:6104
msgid ", crippling the leg"
msgstr ". Rána mu zmrzačila nohu"

#: game/combat.msg:6105
msgid ", crippling the leg. The animal tries to remain standing, but fails"
msgstr ". Rána mu zmrzačila nohu. Pes se pokouší postavit, ale nedaří se mu to"

#: game/combat.msg:6106
msgid ". The blinded animal howls in pain"
msgstr ". Oslepené zvíře vyje bolestí"

#: game/combat.msg:6107
msgid ", neutering the poor animal"
msgstr ". Rána to ubohé zvíře vykastrovala"

#: game/combat.msg:6200
msgid ", knocking down this mutated insect"
msgstr ". Rána srazila zmutovaný hmyz k zemi"

#: game/combat.msg:6201
msgid ". It collapses"
msgstr ". Mantis se zhroutil"

#: game/combat.msg:6202
msgid ". The manti ponders whether or not to continue living"
msgstr ". Hmyz uvažuje, má-li vůbec ještě cenu žít"

#: game/combat.msg:6203
msgid ", crippling the limb"
msgstr ". Rána mu zmrzačila končetinu"

#: game/combat.msg:6204
msgid ", causing the manti to lick its wounds. It holds the limb oddly"
msgstr ". Hmyz si olizuje zranění. Podivně si drží končetinu"

#: game/combat.msg:6205
msgid ", bypassing the chitinous armor"
msgstr ". Rána prorazila jeho chitinový krunýř"

#: game/combat.msg:6206
msgid ". The manti shrieks and shivers most inhuman like"
msgstr ". Hmyz vříská a nelidsky se třese"

#: game/combat.msg:6207
msgid ", which causes the manti to fall over. A limb is bent at an odd angle"
msgstr ". Rána ho převrátila na záda. Jeho končetina je ohnutá do nepřirozeného úhlu"

#: game/combat.msg:6208
msgid ", shredding the wings"
msgstr ". Zásah mu roztrhl křídla"

#: game/combat.msg:6209
msgid ", bypassing the chitinous armor and throwing the manti around"
msgstr ". Rána prorazila jeho chitinový krunýř a odhodila ho stranou"

#: game/combat.msg:6210
msgid ", blinding the insect with an accurate blow"
msgstr ". Přesný zásah hmyz úplně oslepil"

#: game/combat.msg:6300
msgid ". Even this beast seems fazed by that stunning attack"
msgstr ". Dokonce i samotná bestie byla tímto omračujícím útokem zaskočena"

#: game/combat.msg:6301
msgid ", slipping past the huge claws to strike the monster. The deathclaw shakes and growls"
msgstr ". Rána pronikla přes obrovské pařáty až k samotné bestii. Párač se zachvěl a divoce zavrčel"

#: game/combat.msg:6302
msgid ". The result is massive damage to the deathclaw's eyes"
msgstr ". Výsledkem je masivní poškození páračových očí"

#: game/combat.msg:6400
msgid ", breaking past the plant's defenses"
msgstr ". Rána prorazila chabý pokus plevele zakrýt se listy"

#: game/combat.msg:6401
msgid ", tearing some of its leaves off"
msgstr ". Rána odtrhla několik listů"

#: game/combat.msg:6402
msgid ", breaking some of its fronds"
msgstr ". Rána mu přelomila stonek"

#: game/combat.msg:6403
msgid ", damaging its chlorophyll intake"
msgstr ". Útok mu poškodil několik kořenů"

#: game/combat.msg:6404
msgid ", knocking the pollen out of it"
msgstr ". Rána rozprášila pyl do okolí"

#: game/combat.msg:6405 game/combat.msg:6705 game/combat.msg:6805
#: game/combat.msg:6905 game/combat.msg:7005
msgid ", almost tipping it over"
msgstr ". Rána ho téměř odhodila dozadu"

#: game/combat.msg:6406
msgid ", damaging some of its branches"
msgstr ". Rána poškodila několik větviček"

#: game/combat.msg:6500
msgid ". You'll have a headache tomorrow, if you live that long"
msgstr ". Pokud se dožiješ zítřka, bude tě pořádně bolet hlava"

#: game/combat.msg:6501
msgid ". Your armor provides no protection from this well-aimed blow"
msgstr ". Proti tak skvěle mířenému zásahu ti tvoje zbroj nebyla nic platná"

#: game/combat.msg:6502
msgid ". You feel the pain for just a moment, and then darkness takes you.."
msgstr ". Na chvíli jsi pocítil příšernou bolest a poté tě pohltila tma..."

#: game/combat.msg:6503
msgid ", bypassing your armor. The blow knocks you off your feet"
msgstr ". Rána prorazila tvoji zbroj. Odletěl jsi dozadu jako míč"

#: game/combat.msg:6504
msgid ". The shock makes your vision go dark. After a moment, you notice that your vision has not returned"
msgstr ". Šok ti způsobil ztrátu vidění. Po chvíli jsi zjistil, že se ti zrak nevrátil"

#: game/combat.msg:6505
msgid ". You get a nice view of your body as your head sails through the air"
msgstr ". Poprvé v životě jsi měl příležitost si prohlédnout svoje záda, když tvoje hlava plachtila vzduchem"

#: game/combat.msg:6506
msgid ". Surprisingly, the damage feels no worse than normal"
msgstr ". Kupodivu to zranění nevypadá hůř než obvykle"

#: game/combat.msg:6507
msgid ", stunning you for a moment"
msgstr ". Rána tě na okamžik omráčila"

#: game/combat.msg:6508
msgid ". Feel the pain"
msgstr ". Cítíš bolest"

#: game/combat.msg:6509
msgid ". The attack leaves your arm useless"
msgstr ". Útok udělal z tvé ruky nepotřebnou část těla"

#: game/combat.msg:6510
msgid ", slipping past your armor. The blow cracks the bones in your arm like deadwood"
msgstr ". Zásah prorazil tvoji zbroj. Rána ti zlomila kosti v ruce jako by to byly uschlé větve"

#: game/combat.msg:6511
msgid ", bypassing your armor. Your arm now hangs limply at your side"
msgstr ". Zásah prorazil tvoji zbroj. Tvá ruka zůstala bezvládně viset"

#: game/combat.msg:6512
msgid ". The bruise will look nice, and maybe the scars will make good party talk"
msgstr ". Ta modřina bude vypadat krásně a s těmi jizvami se budeš moct chlubit na mejdanech"

#: game/combat.msg:6513
msgid ", crushing your internal organs. All you can do is gurgle blood"
msgstr ". Rána rozmačkala tvé vnitřní orgány. Ležíš na zemi a chrlíš krev"

#: game/combat.msg:6514
msgid ", sending you head over heels"
msgstr ". Tvoje hlava se protočila kolem dokola"

#: game/combat.msg:6515
msgid ", sending you flying and breaking your leg"
msgstr ". Rána ti zlomila nohu a efektním obloukem tě poslala k zemi"

#: game/combat.msg:6516
msgid ", melting through your armor. The blow knocks you over and seriously hurts your knee"
msgstr ". Rána roztavila tvoji zbroj a vážně ti poranila koleno. Byl jsi sražen k zemi"

#: game/combat.msg:6517
msgid ". The pain from your broken leg sends you into unconsciousness"
msgstr ". Bolest ze zlomené nohy byla tak silná, že jsi upadl do bezvědomí"

#: game/combat.msg:6518
msgid ". The painful blow makes you flinch, but does little else"
msgstr ". Zásah tě přinutil cuknout bolestí, ale nic víc"

#: game/combat.msg:6519
msgid ". Unluckily for you, it also causes immediate vision loss"
msgstr ". Zásah ti bohužel způsobil okamžitou ztrátu zraku"

#: game/combat.msg:6520
msgid ". It takes you a moment to wipe the blood from your eyes"
msgstr ". Chvíli potrvá, než si z očí otřeš krev"

#: game/combat.msg:6521
msgid ", slipping past your armor. You stand stunned as your realize you cannot see anymore"
msgstr ". Zásah prorazil tvoji zbroj. Když jsi zjistil, že nic nevidíš, omdlel jsi"

#: game/combat.msg:6522
msgid ". You feel a strange sensation in your head. You realize it's imminent brain-death"
msgstr ". Máš podivný pocit. Zřejmě to bude tím, že umíráš"

#: game/combat.msg:6523
msgid ", making you cringe"
msgstr ". Po tomto zásahu jsi šel do kolen"

#: game/combat.msg:6524
msgid ". You cup your groin and fall to the floor in pain"
msgstr ". Chytil ses za rozkrok a v bolestech jsi upadl na zem"

#: game/combat.msg:6525
msgid ". The pain is sufficient to knock you out. Ouch"
msgstr ". Bolest je tak hrozná, že tě srazila k zemi. Au"

#: game/combat.msg:6526
msgid ". There are not enough words in the universe to describe the pain you are feeling at this moment"
msgstr ". Ve vesmíru neexistují slova, která by popsala bolest, kterou teď prožíváš"

#: game/combat.msg:6700
msgid ", breaking past the lizard's defenses"
msgstr ". Útok pronikl geckonovým krunýřem"

#: game/combat.msg:6701
msgid ", tearing some of its slimy skin off"
msgstr ". Zásah odtrhl ještěrce několik velkých kusů slizké kůže"

#: game/combat.msg:6702
msgid ", breaking some of its digits"
msgstr ". Rána zlomila geckonovi několik prstů"

#: game/combat.msg:6703
msgid ", damaging its breathing ability"
msgstr ". Rána ještěrce vyrazila dech"

#: game/combat.msg:6704
msgid ", knocking the stuffing out of it"
msgstr ". Rána geckona odhodila nazpět"

#: game/combat.msg:6706
msgid ", damaging some of its limbs"
msgstr ". Rána zranila geckonovu končetinu"

#: game/combat.msg:6800
msgid ", sliding past the creature's defenses"
msgstr ". Zásah prorazil alienův chabý pokus o obranu"

#: game/combat.msg:6801
msgid ", smearing some of its slime off"
msgstr ". Po zásahu se do okolí rozstříkly cákance slizu"

#: game/combat.msg:6802
msgid ", mashing some of its suction-feelers"
msgstr ". Zásah mu rozdrtil několik chapadel"

#: game/combat.msg:6803
msgid ", damaging its air (?) intake"
msgstr ". Rána poškodila jeho dýchací otvor"

#: game/combat.msg:6804
msgid ", knocking the icky stuff out of it"
msgstr ". Jeho mozek se rozstříkl po okolí"

#: game/combat.msg:6806
msgid ", damaging some of its tentacles"
msgstr ". Rána rozmačkala několik jeho tykadel"

#: game/combat.msg:6900 game/combat.msg:7000
msgid ", breaking past the ant's defenses"
msgstr ". Zásah prorazil krunýř obřího mravence"

#: game/combat.msg:6901 game/combat.msg:7001
msgid ", ripping some of its antennae off"
msgstr ". Rána urvala mravenci několik jeho antének"

#: game/combat.msg:6902 game/combat.msg:7002
msgid ", breaking some of its feelers"
msgstr ". Zásah mu zlomil několik tykadel"

#: game/combat.msg:6903 game/combat.msg:7003
msgid ", damaging its health"
msgstr ". Zásah ho těžce zranil"

#: game/combat.msg:6904 game/combat.msg:7004
msgid ", knocking it around a bit"
msgstr ". Rána ho odhodila dozadu"

#: game/combat.msg:6906 game/combat.msg:7006
msgid ", damaging some of its exoskeleton"
msgstr ". Zásah mu poškodil část exoskeletonu"

#: game/combat.msg:7100
msgid ", blowing past the Bodyguard's armor"
msgstr ". Rána prorazila agentovu zbroj"

#: game/combat.msg:7101
msgid ", bringing the Bodyguard to his knees"
msgstr ". Rána ho srazila na kolena"

#: game/combat.msg:7102
msgid ", destroying his arm control mechanism"
msgstr ". Zásah zničil kontrolní mechanismus jeho zbraní"

#: game/combat.msg:7103
msgid ", destroying his leg rotator mechanism"
msgstr ". Zásah zničil kloubový mechanismus jeho nohou"

#: game/combat.msg:7104
msgid ", shattering his bionic eye"
msgstr ". Zásah roztříštil jeho bionické oko"

#: game/combat.msg:7105
msgid ", causing him to pause and shake off your massive attack"
msgstr ". Po tomto strašlivém útoku strnul a oklepal se"

#: game/combat.msg:7106
msgid ", compacting his chest plate"
msgstr ". Zásah pomačkal jeho hrudní plát"

#: game/combatai.msg:1003
msgid "You've torn off my head! Oh God, my head's gone!"
msgstr "Utrhli mi hlavu! Bože, moje hlava je pryč!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1004
msgid "By doath! Dew tore off by doath!"
msgstr "Boje fuba! Tyf mi utrh fubu!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1006
msgid "My face is gone, oh God nooooo!"
msgstr "Můj obličej je pryč! Ach bože néééé!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1007
msgid "Where's my ear?"
msgstr "Kde mám ucho?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1008
msgid "Why's everything spinning like that?"
msgstr "Proč se všechno kolem mě točí?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1009
msgid "No one will ever be able to look at me again!"
msgstr "Už se na mě nikdy nikdo nepodívá!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1013
msgid "Christ, my arm's been torn off!"
msgstr "Ježíši, mám utrženou ruku!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1014
msgid "Oh God, not my arm."
msgstr "Ach bože, ruku ne."

#: game/combatai.msg:1015
msgid "Stop, please stop."
msgstr "Přestaň, prosím přestaň."

#: game/combatai.msg:1017
msgid "My arm's so broken."
msgstr "Mám zlomenou ruku."

#: game/combatai.msg:1018
msgid "How will I earn a living now?"
msgstr "Jak mám teď uživit rodinu?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1019
msgid "You broke it."
msgstr "Je zlomená."

#: game/combatai.msg:1023
msgid "How can I support my family now?"
msgstr "Jak se teď postarám o svou rodinu?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1024
msgid "Bone, so white."
msgstr "Moje kost... je tak bílá."

#: game/combatai.msg:1026
msgid "Christ, just make the pain stop!"
msgstr "Ježíši, zbav mě tý bolesti!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1027
msgid "Not my fingers, anything but that. Noooooo!"
msgstr "Cokoliv, jen ne moje prsty. Nééééééé!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1028
msgid "My arm's been torn off. Oh God, no."
msgstr "Utrhli mi ruku. Bože, né."

#: game/combatai.msg:1029
msgid "Just don't kill me."
msgstr "Nezabíjej mě."

#: game/combatai.msg:1031 game/combatai.msg:32731
msgid "I think I'm gonna faint."
msgstr "Myslím, že asi omdlím."

#: game/combatai.msg:1037
msgid "I'm dying!"
msgstr "Umírám!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1038
msgid "Oh Christ, that hurt so bad...."
msgstr "Kristepane, to příšerně bolelo..."

#: game/combatai.msg:1039
msgid "I'm bleedin' out."
msgstr "Krvácím."

#: game/combatai.msg:1040
msgid "I'm a gonner."
msgstr "Je po mně."

#: game/combatai.msg:1041
msgid "Christ, why did you have to do that?"
msgstr "Kriste, za co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1042
msgid "Who'll take care of my family?"
msgstr "Kdo se teď postará o mou rodinu?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1043
msgid "Why me? Why?"
msgstr "Proč já? Proč?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1045
msgid "I never wanted to die like this."
msgstr "Takhle nechci zemřít."

#: game/combatai.msg:1046
msgid "I didn't mean nothin'. Just don't kill me."
msgstr "Já to tak nemyslel, jenom mě prosím nezabíjej."

#: game/combatai.msg:1047
msgid "Arrrgh, my spine!"
msgstr "Áááááá, moje páteř!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1048
msgid "W'wait, where's my spleen?"
msgstr "Počkat, kde jsou moje střeva?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1049
msgid "So much, blood."
msgstr "Tolik krve."

#: game/combatai.msg:1050
msgid "I'm starting to feel cold and sleepy."
msgstr "Cítím se nějak ospale a začíná mi být zima."

#: game/combatai.msg:1051
msgid "Christ, don't kill me, please!"
msgstr "Kristepane, nezabíjej mě prosím!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1052
msgid "I won't get in your way, just let me live."
msgstr "Nebudu se ti plýst do cesty, jenom mě nezabíjej."

#: game/combatai.msg:1053
msgid "Who'll take care of my family."
msgstr "Kdo se teď postará o mou rodinu?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1054
msgid "Don't hurt me anymore."
msgstr "Už mi neubližuj."

#: game/combatai.msg:1055
msgid "You're killing me!"
msgstr "Vždyť mě zabiješ!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1056
msgid "(Cough, cough) Can't breathe."
msgstr "(Echm, echm) Nemůžu dýchat."

#: game/combatai.msg:1057
msgid "Feeling faint, can't keep going."
msgstr "Chce se mi omdlít, už nemůžu dál."

#: game/combatai.msg:1058
msgid "Help me, eeeeellp meeeeee!"
msgstr "Pomozte mi, pomozte míííí!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1059
msgid "Oh God, oh God, oh God..."
msgstr "Ach bože, ach bože, ach bože..."

#: game/combatai.msg:1063
msgid "You tore my leg off."
msgstr "Utrhli mi nohu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1064
msgid "My knee's been ripped open!"
msgstr "Mám roztržené koleno!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1065
msgid "I can't walk."
msgstr "Nemůžu chodit."

#: game/combatai.msg:1066
msgid "Why does it have to hurt so much?!?"
msgstr "Proč to musí tak bolet?!?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1067
msgid "My toes are missing."
msgstr "Chybí mi prsty na noze."

#: game/combatai.msg:1068
msgid "My foot, where's my foot?"
msgstr "Můj kotník! Kde je můj kotník?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1069
msgid "I can't feel my foot!"
msgstr "Necítím nohu!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1073
msgid "I'll never dance again."
msgstr "Už si nezatancuju."

#: game/combatai.msg:1074
msgid "I'll never run again."
msgstr "Už nikdy nebudu moct běhat."

#: game/combatai.msg:1075
msgid "I can't feel my toes."
msgstr "Necítím prsty na noze."

#: game/combatai.msg:1076
msgid "Bone, so white, pain, so great..."
msgstr "Kost... je tak bílá. Bolest... je tak veliká..."

#: game/combatai.msg:1077
msgid "So much blood... it's everywhere."
msgstr "Tolik krve... je úplně všude."

#: game/combatai.msg:1078
msgid "I've been torn open."
msgstr "Čouhaj ze mě kosti."

#: game/combatai.msg:1079
msgid "It's a bad one, oh God, why me."
msgstr "Je to zlý. Ach bože, proč já?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1083
msgid "Oh God, I'm blind!"
msgstr "Ach bože, nic nevidím!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1084
msgid "You tore my eye out! Oh God, nooooo."
msgstr "Vypíchli mi oko! Ach bože neeeee."

#: game/combatai.msg:1085
msgid "Not my eyes, anything but that."
msgstr "Do oka ne, všude jen ne tam."

#: game/combatai.msg:1086
msgid "You've blinded me, noooooo."
msgstr "Nic nevidím, neeeee."

#: game/combatai.msg:1087
msgid "Not my eyes, please not that."
msgstr "Do oka ne, prosím, jenom ne do oka."

#: game/combatai.msg:1088
msgid "I'm blind, just kill me. (sob, sob)"
msgstr "Nic nevidím, tak mě zabij. (vzlyk, vzlyk)"

#: game/combatai.msg:1089
msgid "Where's my eye, if I could just push it back in...."
msgstr "Kde je moje oko? Třeba si ho tam budu moct nandat zpátky..."

#: game/combatai.msg:1096
msgid "And I wanted a family too."
msgstr "Už nikdy nezaložím rodinu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1097
msgid "Now I'll never have more kids."
msgstr "Už nebudu moct mít další děti."

#: game/combatai.msg:1098
msgid "Why there? Why?"
msgstr "Proč zrovna tam? Proč?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1099
msgid "It burns, it burns."
msgstr "To pálí, to pálí."

#: game/combatai.msg:1100
msgid "I think I need to sit down."
msgstr "Musím si na chvíli odpočinout."

#: game/combatai.msg:1101
msgid "That wasn't fair."
msgstr "To nebylo fér."

#: game/combatai.msg:1102
msgid "Cow... ard, unh...."
msgstr "Zba... bělče, ufff..."

#: game/combatai.msg:1106
msgid "I see stars!"
msgstr "Vidím hvězdičky!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1108
msgid "Do smathed by teef out!"
msgstr "Boje fuby! Vyravyf bi fuby!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1109
msgid "Hey, I part my hair on the *other* side."
msgstr "Hehe, já se češu na *opačnou* stranu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1110
msgid "Hah, at least you didn't hit anything important."
msgstr "Ha, ještě že to netrefilo nic důležitýho."

#: game/combatai.msg:1112
msgid "I feel kinda dizzy."
msgstr "Točí se mi trochu hlava."

#: game/combatai.msg:1116
msgid "My arm hurts, it's a bad one."
msgstr "Bolí mě ruka... a hodně."

#: game/combatai.msg:1117
msgid "My arm's all tore up."
msgstr "Mám ruku na cáry."

#: game/combatai.msg:1118
msgid "My arm's broken, here... and here...."
msgstr "Mám zlomenou ruku, tady... a tady..."

#: game/combatai.msg:1119
msgid "Bone sticking out of arm, arrrrrgghhh."
msgstr "Z ruky mi leze kost, áááááááááá."

#: game/combatai.msg:1120
msgid "I can't feel anything, my arm's all numb."
msgstr "Nic necítím, mám ochromenou ruku."

#: game/combatai.msg:1121
msgid "Someone bend my arm back, pleeeeeaassee?!?"
msgstr "Narovnejte mi někdo ruku, prosíííím?!?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1122
msgid "My thumb's been ripped right off my hand!"
msgstr "Utrhli mi palec přímo z ruky!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1125
msgid "My hand's almost torn off!"
msgstr "Skoro mi utrhli ruku!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1126
msgid "Arrrrgh! Help me find my fingers!"
msgstr "Ááááá! Pomozte mi najít prsty!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1127
msgid "I'll never write that novel now."
msgstr "Tak teď už ten román nenapíšu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1128
msgid "My arm's broken!"
msgstr "Mám zlomenou ruku!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1129
msgid "Unh, you tore my arm backwards."
msgstr "Uff, mám vykloubené rameno."

#: game/combatai.msg:1130
msgid "Holy Christ! I didn't think I could feel this much pain."
msgstr "Ježíši Kriste! Nikdy by mě nenapadlo, že zažiju takovou bolest."

#: game/combatai.msg:1131
msgid "Not the arm, why my arm?"
msgstr "Do ruky ne, proč do ruky?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1132
msgid "It hurts so bad."
msgstr "Strašně to bolí."

#: game/combatai.msg:1143
msgid "If it don't hurt much is it a bad one?"
msgstr "Když to moc nebolí, je to zlý?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1144
msgid "Heavy weight on chest, gasp, gasp, so thirsty."
msgstr "Bolí mě na plicích... nemůžu dýchat a mám strašnou žízeň."

#: game/combatai.msg:1145
msgid "*Gasp* Why can't I breathe right?"
msgstr "*Síp* Proč nemůžu pořádně dýchat?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1146
msgid "It hurts real bad."
msgstr "Strašně to bolí."

#: game/combatai.msg:1147
msgid "I think something's broken inside, I hurt real bad."
msgstr "Myslím, že se ve mně něco zlomilo, strašně to bolí."

#: game/combatai.msg:1148
msgid "Ack! Something tore loose inside my chest."
msgstr "Au! Něco se ve mně přetrhlo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1149
msgid "Why's it have to hurt so damn much?"
msgstr "Proč to musí tak strašně bolet?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1150
msgid "Oh Christ, not a gut wound!"
msgstr "Ach bože, lezou mi ven střeva!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1151
msgid "I just keep bleeding, it won't (cough, cough) stop."
msgstr "Pořád krvácím, nechce (echm, echm) to přestat."

#: game/combatai.msg:1152
msgid "I can't breathe and I keep coughin' up blood, that's bad ain't it?"
msgstr "Nemůžu dýchat a pořád kašlu krev. To je asi špatný, co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1153
msgid "I've got a hole all the way through me."
msgstr "Mám v sobě díru skrz naskrz."

#: game/combatai.msg:1154
msgid "I can see my insides, uh oh."
msgstr "A sakra, vidím svý střeva."

#: game/combatai.msg:1155
msgid "My insides are on the outside, that can't be good."
msgstr "Mý vnitřnosti už nejsou vevnitř, to není dobrý."

#: game/combatai.msg:1156
msgid "My lungs keep hissing and (cough, cough, gasp) burbling."
msgstr "V plících mi to nějak syčí a (ech ech, síp) bublá."

#: game/combatai.msg:1157
msgid "I'm feeling kinda warm and sleepy now."
msgstr "Je mi nějaký horko a cítím se ospale."

#: game/combatai.msg:1158
msgid "I think I just want to lay down for a while."
msgstr "Asi si na chvíli lehnu a trochu si odpočinu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1159
msgid "It's getting so dark now."
msgstr "Začíná být nějaká tma."

#: game/combatai.msg:1162 game/combatai.msg:1172
msgid "There goes my knee!"
msgstr "A koleno je fuč!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1163
msgid "My dance career's over."
msgstr "Moje taneční kariéra skončila."

#: game/combatai.msg:1164
msgid "My kneecap's just gone man, gone."
msgstr "Moje koleno je pryč, prostě fuč."

#: game/combatai.msg:1165
msgid "Where's the lower half of my leg? Where is it?!?"
msgstr "Kde mám zbytek nohy? Kde je?!?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1166
msgid "It hurts to move."
msgstr "Nemůžu chodit, strašně to bolí."

#: game/combatai.msg:1167
msgid "I've been hit. I can't feel my leg."
msgstr "Trefili mě. Necítím svoji nohu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1168
msgid "It hurts, somebody make it stop!"
msgstr "To bolí, zbavte mě někdo tý bolesti!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1169
msgid "The pain! Oh, the pain!"
msgstr "To je bolest! Ach, to je bolest!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1173
msgid "I can't feel my leg at all."
msgstr "Vůbec necítím svoji levou nohu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1174
msgid "I guess I better find myself a parrot and an eyepatch."
msgstr "Asi si budu muset sehnat papouška a pásku přes oko."

#: game/combatai.msg:1175 game/combatai.msg:1379 game/combatai.msg:41261
msgid "Just call me stumpy."
msgstr "Říkejte mi pahýl."

#: game/combatai.msg:1176
msgid "I'll never be able to support my family now."
msgstr "Jak se teď postarám o svou rodinu?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1177
msgid "Who'll hire me now?"
msgstr "Kdo si mě teď najme?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1178
msgid "I'm no good to anyone as a cripple. (sob, sob)"
msgstr "Jako kripl jsem k ničemu. (smrk, smrk)"

#: game/combatai.msg:1179
msgid "My leg, I can't feel it."
msgstr "Moje noha, vůbec ji necítím."

#: game/combatai.msg:1183
msgid "You tore my eye out."
msgstr "Vypíchli mi oko."

#: game/combatai.msg:1185
msgid "My eye! Aiiieeeee!"
msgstr "Moje oko! Jauuuuu!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1186
msgid "I sure wish I could see just one more sunset."
msgstr "Chci ještě naposled spatřit západ slunce."

#: game/combatai.msg:1187
msgid "My eye, I can't see anything!"
msgstr "Moje oko, nic nevidím!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1188
msgid "It's so dark, and lonely all of a sudden."
msgstr "Najednou je tu taková tma."

#: game/combatai.msg:1189
msgid "I'd give anything to see again."
msgstr "Dám cokoliv, jenom když budu zase vidět."

#: game/combatai.msg:1196
msgid "No more kids for me."
msgstr "A s velkou rodinou je konec."

#: game/combatai.msg:1197
msgid "*unh* low blow."
msgstr "*uff* Rána pod pás."

#: game/combatai.msg:1198
msgid "Eeeeeep!"
msgstr "Vííííí!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1199
msgid "Oh yeah, that hurts."
msgstr "Jo, to bolí."

#: game/combatai.msg:1203
msgid "You hit my fuckin' skull!"
msgstr "Dostal jsem to do lebky, kurva!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1204
msgid "Gotta try harder than that, but not much harder."
msgstr "Budeš se muset víc snažit, ale ne o moc."

#: game/combatai.msg:1205
msgid "Ouch, that's going to cost you."
msgstr "Jau, za to zaplatíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:1206
msgid "Oh, look at all the pretty birdies."
msgstr "A hele, lítaj kolem mě ptáčkové."

#: game/combatai.msg:1207
msgid "That hurt."
msgstr "To bolelo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1208
msgid "You fucked up my pretty face."
msgstr "Někdo mi zkurvil můj krásnej obličej."

#: game/combatai.msg:1209
msgid "That's going to leave a scar."
msgstr "Zůstane mi tam jizva."

#: game/combatai.msg:1213
msgid "Hah, I'm right handed."
msgstr "Hehe, já jsem pravák."

#: game/combatai.msg:1214
msgid "Only need one arm to kill you."
msgstr "Zabiju tě i jednou rukou."

#: game/combatai.msg:1215
msgid "I don't need those fingers anyway."
msgstr "Ty prsty stejně nepotřebuju."

#: game/combatai.msg:1216
msgid "I only need one finger for you bub."
msgstr "Na tebe mi bohatě stačí jedinej prst."

#: game/combatai.msg:1217
msgid "Damn, that's gonna take away from my swing."
msgstr "Zatraceně, ten prst mi bude při švihu chybět."

#: game/combatai.msg:1218
msgid "I can still take you out of the picture."
msgstr "Stejně tě dostanu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1219
msgid "Damn, snapped my arm right in two."
msgstr "Zatraceně, mám teď ruku vejpůl."

#: game/combatai.msg:1223
msgid "I can take you left handed."
msgstr "Dostanu tě i levačkou."

#: game/combatai.msg:1224
msgid "Hah, I'm a southpaw anyhow."
msgstr "Haha, já jsem stejně levák."

#: game/combatai.msg:1225
msgid "Trying to disarm me huh?"
msgstr "Chceš mě odzbrojit, jo?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1226
msgid "That's not going to stop me."
msgstr "To mě nezastaví."

#: game/combatai.msg:1227
msgid "I've still got another hand to use against you."
msgstr "Pořád na tebe můžu použít druhou ruku."

#: game/combatai.msg:1228
msgid "Damn, that hurt."
msgstr "Zatraceně, to bolelo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1229
msgid "Mmm, that's going to leave a mark."
msgstr "Mmm, zůstane mi tam jizva."

#: game/combatai.msg:1233
msgid "Yup, that cracked some ribs alright."
msgstr "Jo, to mi zlomilo pár žeber."

#: game/combatai.msg:1239
msgid "Yeah, that just got me started."
msgstr "Jo, aspoň mám motivaci."

#: game/combatai.msg:1240
msgid "Now you've got me pissed off."
msgstr "Tak teď jsem se nasral."

#: game/combatai.msg:1241
msgid "I didn't like that at all."
msgstr "To se mi vůbec nelíbilo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1242
msgid "Damn, you popped a goddamn lung."
msgstr "A sakra, praskla mi plíce."

#: game/combatai.msg:1243
msgid "Only a worm like you would try for a gut-wound."
msgstr "Jenom červ jako ty dává rány do břicha."

#: game/combatai.msg:1244
msgid "I'm going to replace those organs you just holed, with some of yours."
msgstr "Svoje děravý orgány vyměním za ty tvoje."

#: game/combatai.msg:1245
msgid "Damn, you're better than you look, 'spose you'd hafta be."
msgstr "Sakra, jseš lepší než vypadáš. Ale stejně tě dostanu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1246
msgid "That's not nice at all. I'm going to have to teach you some manners."
msgstr "To nebylo hezký. Asi ti budu muset dát lekci chování."

#: game/combatai.msg:1247
msgid "Lucky shot that time."
msgstr "To byla jen náhoda."

#: game/combatai.msg:1248
msgid "Hope you think it's just as funny when I do that to you."
msgstr "Chci vidět, jak se budeš tvářit, až ti udělám to samý."

#: game/combatai.msg:1249
msgid "I must be getting old. That actually hurt."
msgstr "Asi stárnu. Ono to docela bolelo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1250
msgid "You'll have to do a lot better than that."
msgstr "Budeš se muset víc snažit."

#: game/combatai.msg:1251
msgid "Everything's still workin' well enough to take you out."
msgstr "Ještě pořád tě bez problému dostanu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1252
msgid "Just missed my lung, I think."
msgstr "Těsně vedle plíce... aspoň myslím."

#: game/combatai.msg:1253
msgid "I sure do have a lot of blood in me, well, I used to anyway."
msgstr "Mám v sobě fakt hodně krve. Teda, už ne."

#: game/combatai.msg:1254
msgid "Goddamn that hurts!"
msgstr "Zatraceně, to bolí!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1255
msgid "Fuck! You bastard!"
msgstr "Kurva! Ty bastarde!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1256
msgid "Nobody hits me like that, and lives."
msgstr "Nikdo živej do mě takhle střílet nebude."

#: game/combatai.msg:1257
msgid "Soon as I catch my breath (cough, cough) I'm coming for you."
msgstr "Až popadnu dech (kuc kuc), tak si pro tebe dojdu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1258
msgid "You tore something up inside me."
msgstr "Něco se ve mně přetrhlo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1259
msgid "You don't know what you just started."
msgstr "To tě bude mrzet."

#: game/combatai.msg:1263
msgid "My achilles tendon!"
msgstr "Moje achilovka!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1264
msgid "Aaiiiieeee!!"
msgstr "Jaůůůůůů!!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1265
msgid "There goes my foxtrot."
msgstr "A mám po foxtrotu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1266
msgid "I'll teach you to tear my toes off."
msgstr "Já tě naučím trhat mi prsty na noze."

#: game/combatai.msg:1267
msgid "Break my leg? I'll tear you apart!"
msgstr "Mám zlomenou nohu! Za to tě roztrhnu vejpůl!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1268
msgid "Where's a tourniquet when you need one."
msgstr "Kde mám sakra obvazy?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1269
msgid "Fuck, my leg hurts."
msgstr "Kurva, bolí mě noha."

#: game/combatai.msg:1273
msgid "That's going to give me a nice limp for a while."
msgstr "Budu chvíli kulhat."

#: game/combatai.msg:1274
msgid "Come here, don't make me hobble after you."
msgstr "Pojď sem, to se mám za tebou belhat?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1275
msgid "Damn near tore my leg off."
msgstr "Sakra, to mi skoro utrhlo nohu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1276
msgid "That's going to slow me up for the whole season."
msgstr "To mě zpomalí na celou sezónu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1277
msgid "That'll bench me for sure."
msgstr "Budu muset jezdit na kriplkáře."

#: game/combatai.msg:1278
msgid "I've got another leg."
msgstr "Mám ještě jednu nohu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1279
msgid "Hah-hah, that was my prosthetic leg anyhow."
msgstr "Haha, to byla moje umělá noha."

#: game/combatai.msg:1283
msgid "I'm fuckin' blind here!"
msgstr "Kurva, nic nevidím!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1284
msgid "You prick, you blinded me!"
msgstr "Ty čuráku, nic nevidím!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1285
msgid "Just for that, I'm going to pop your eyes like ripe grapes."
msgstr "Za tohle ti rozmačkám oči jako citron!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1286
msgid "You tore my fucking eye out!"
msgstr "Kurva, mám utržený oko!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1287
msgid "Crap, my eye's dangling by the optic nerve here."
msgstr "Do hajzlu, oko mi visí jenom na nervu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1288
msgid "I can still hear where you are."
msgstr "Ještě pořád tě slyším."

#: game/combatai.msg:1289
msgid "Don't you ever touch my fucking eyes again!"
msgstr "Opovaž se ještě jednou šáhnout na moje zasraný oči!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1292
msgid "Fucking coward!"
msgstr "Zasranej srabe!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1294
msgid "That won't help you any."
msgstr "To ti ani trochu nepomůže."

#: game/combatai.msg:1295
msgid "Figures that you'd try that."
msgstr "Bylo mi jasný, že se o něco takovýho pokusíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:1296
msgid "Gettin' your jollies?"
msgstr "Bavíš se?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1297
msgid "I'm gonna tear yours off and make you eat them."
msgstr "Za to ti urvu ty tvoje a donutím tě je sežrat."

#: game/combatai.msg:1298
msgid "I think I need to sit down for a while."
msgstr "Musím si na chvíli odpočinout."

#: game/combatai.msg:1299
msgid "Got to try harder than that, my cup caught most of it."
msgstr "Budeš se muset víc snažit, nosím suspík."

#: game/combatai.msg:1303
msgid "That just makes me mad."
msgstr "To mě akorát tak naštvalo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1304
msgid "That ringing sound I hear is your death-knell."
msgstr "To zvonění, co slyším, je tvůj umíráček."

#: game/combatai.msg:1305
msgid "One more scar won't make me any uglier."
msgstr "Jedna jizva navíc mě hnusnější neudělá."

#: game/combatai.msg:1306
msgid "I didn't even feel that one."
msgstr "Trefil mě někdo, nebo se mi to jenom zdálo?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1307
msgid "At least you only hit my head."
msgstr "To bylo jenom do hlavy."

#: game/combatai.msg:1308
msgid "Youch, that hurt, a little."
msgstr "Jau, to bolelo... trochu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1309
msgid "I still have *some* teeth left."
msgstr "Ještě mi *pár* zubů zbylo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1311
msgid "I can take you one-handed."
msgstr "Dostanu tě i jednou rukou."

#: game/combatai.msg:1313
msgid "You can't stop me that easy."
msgstr "Mě tak snadno nedostaneš."

#: game/combatai.msg:1314
msgid "That was just my left arm."
msgstr "To byla jenom levá ruka."

#: game/combatai.msg:1315
msgid "I can still take care of little problems like you."
msgstr "I s jednou rukou se dokážu vypořádat s problémovejma sráčema."

#: game/combatai.msg:1316
msgid "Damn, you got my left arm."
msgstr "Zatraceně, to byla moje levá ruka."

#: game/combatai.msg:1317
msgid "Took out my elbow!"
msgstr "To byl můj loket!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1318
msgid "Crap, there go a couple more fingers."
msgstr "Do hajzlu, další prsty jsou fuč."

#: game/combatai.msg:1319
msgid "You take my finger, I'll take your Goddamn hand."
msgstr "Ty mě prst, já tobě celou ruku!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1320
msgid "I can take you left-handed."
msgstr "Dostanu tě i levou rukou."

#: game/combatai.msg:1322
msgid "You broke my arm, so I'm gonna break your neck."
msgstr "Já mám zlomenou ruku, ale tobě zlomím vaz!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1323
msgid "I only need one arm to take you out."
msgstr "Na tebe mi stačí jenom jedna ruka."

#: game/combatai.msg:1324
msgid "Took off another finger. That hurt."
msgstr "Další prst pryč. To bolelo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1325
msgid "I don't need that arm anyway."
msgstr "Tu ruku stejně nepotřebuju."

#: game/combatai.msg:1326
msgid "That's more than a scratch."
msgstr "To bylo víc než jen škrábnutí."

#: game/combatai.msg:1327
msgid "Goddamn that hurt."
msgstr "Zatraceně, to bolelo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1328
msgid "That'll need stitches."
msgstr "Budu potřebovat pár stehů."

#: game/combatai.msg:1329
msgid "I'll tear out your liver for that."
msgstr "Za to ti vyrvu játra."

#: game/combatai.msg:1337
msgid "Yeah, bring it on."
msgstr "Tak jo. Ukaž, co umíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:1338 game/combatai.msg:41760
msgid "That the best you can do?"
msgstr "Líp to neumíš?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1339
msgid "You hit like a baby-girl."
msgstr "Biješ se jak malá holka."

#: game/combatai.msg:1340
msgid "And I thought this was a fight."
msgstr "Neměla bejt tohle bitka?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1341
msgid "That'll take hours to slow me up."
msgstr "To mě zpomalí až za pár hodin."

#: game/combatai.msg:1342
msgid "Ouch, just a few ribs more or less."
msgstr "Jau, žebro sem, žebro tam."

#: game/combatai.msg:1343
msgid "I don't even slow down for gut wounds."
msgstr "Rány do břicha mě nezpomalej."

#: game/combatai.msg:1344
msgid "That got my interest."
msgstr "Máš moji pozornost."

#: game/combatai.msg:1345
msgid "I'll make sure that hurts you more'n it did me."
msgstr "Tebe to bude bolet o hodně víc než to bolelo mě."

#: game/combatai.msg:1346
msgid "You stupid bastard. Now I'll kill you slow."
msgstr "Ty parchante. Za to tě zabiju pěkně pomalu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1347
msgid "That hurt, a little."
msgstr "To bolelo... trochu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1348
msgid "Blood just makes me angry."
msgstr "Krev mě jenom víc naštve."

#: game/combatai.msg:1349
msgid "Just a scratch, I've had worse."
msgstr "Jenom škrábnutí, pamatuju horší."

#: game/combatai.msg:1350
msgid "That barely gouged me."
msgstr "Trochu to píchlo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1351
msgid "Thanks, my back feels much better now."
msgstr "Díky, moje záda se teď cítí mnohem líp."

#: game/combatai.msg:1352
msgid "I hope that was your best shot, you won't get another."
msgstr "Doufám, že to byla tvoje nejlepší rána. Další už totiž mít nebudeš."

#: game/combatai.msg:1353
msgid "OK, now it's my turn."
msgstr "Fajn, teď jsem na řadě já."

#: game/combatai.msg:1354
msgid "Damn, that almost hurt."
msgstr "Sakra, to skoro bolelo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1355
msgid "Hey, that stings a bit."
msgstr "Hej, to štíplo."

#: game/combatai.msg:1356
msgid "Damn, that burns a little."
msgstr "Sakra, to trochu pálí."

#: game/combatai.msg:1357
msgid "I'll have time to patch this up, when you're dead."
msgstr "Zavážu si to až chcípneš."

#: game/combatai.msg:1358
msgid "I've had worse."
msgstr "Pamatuju horší."

#: game/combatai.msg:1359
msgid "Let's see how you like that."
msgstr "Uvidíme, jak se to bude líbit tobě."

#: game/combatai.msg:1361
msgid "I'll get you if I have to crawl after you."
msgstr "Dostanu tě, i když se za tebou budu muset plazit."

#: game/combatai.msg:1363
msgid "Shit! I can't feel my leg."
msgstr "Do prdele! Necítím nohu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1364
msgid "A limp isn't going to stop me."
msgstr "Nějaký kulhání mě nemůže zastavit."

#: game/combatai.msg:1365
msgid "Ripped my fucking leg open, you bastard!"
msgstr "Mám roztrženou nohu, ty parchante!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1366
msgid "That coulda' been worse."
msgstr "Mohlo to být horší."

#: game/combatai.msg:1367
msgid "Let's talk about revenge now."
msgstr "A teď si promluvíme o odplatě."

#: game/combatai.msg:1368
msgid "That leg didn't work too good anyhow."
msgstr "Ta noha byla stejně na prd."

#: game/combatai.msg:1369
msgid "Talk about a hot-foot."
msgstr "A teď si už nezaběhám."

#: game/combatai.msg:1371
msgid "I still have one leg left."
msgstr "Ještě pořád mi zbyla jedna noha."

#: game/combatai.msg:1373
msgid "I was never much of a dancer anyhow."
msgstr "Stejně neumím moc tancovat."

#: game/combatai.msg:1374
msgid "Well, I guess I'll never be a Rockette now."
msgstr "No a je po sportovní kariéře."

#: game/combatai.msg:1375
msgid "That's gonna cost you *both* legs."
msgstr "To tě bude stát *obě* nohy."

#: game/combatai.msg:1376
msgid "I can take worse than that."
msgstr "Vydržím i horší."

#: game/combatai.msg:1377
msgid "I'm going to tear your leg off with my teeth."
msgstr "Ukousnu ti nohu zubama."

#: game/combatai.msg:1378
msgid "Damn, you took my toes off."
msgstr "Sakra, mám utržený prsty."

#: game/combatai.msg:1384
msgid "You fucking pansy."
msgstr "Ty zasraná buzno."

#: game/combatai.msg:1385
msgid "I can't see you but I can still kill you."
msgstr "Sice tě nevidím, ale pořád tě můžu zabít."

#: game/combatai.msg:1386
msgid "You'll pay for that one."
msgstr "Za to zaplatíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:1387
msgid "You fucked up my Goddamn eyes!"
msgstr "Mám zkurvený oči!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1388
msgid "Fuck! What happened to the lights?"
msgstr "Kurva! Co je se světlem?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1389
msgid "My fucking eyes are on fire!"
msgstr "Pálí mě moje zkurvený oči!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1392
msgid "Heh, heh, can't hurt that, it's brass-plated."
msgstr "Hehe. To mi nevadí, mám to tam opancéřovaný."

#: game/combatai.msg:1393
msgid "Whatta fuckin' sissy you are."
msgstr "Jseš zasranej zbabělec."

#: game/combatai.msg:1396
msgid "You cretin, I'm gonna neuter you."
msgstr "Já tě vykleštím, ty kreténe."

#: game/combatai.msg:1397
msgid "Fuck, that hurts."
msgstr "Kurva, to bolí."

#: game/combatai.msg:1398
msgid "That burns, a little."
msgstr "To pálí... trochu."

#: game/combatai.msg:1399
msgid "You better run after that one."
msgstr "Dej se radši na útěk."

#: game/combatai.msg:1401
msgid "Warning! CPU damaged! Processing impaired!"
msgstr "Pozor! CPU poškozeno! Výkon procesoru nedostatečný!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1491
msgid "Regulator damaged! Regulation impaired!"
msgstr "Regulátor poškozen! Regulace vyřazena!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1563 game/combatai.msg:1573
msgid "You would cripple me, coward!"
msgstr "Ty mě chceš zmrzačit, zbabělče?"

#: game/combatai.msg:1584
msgid "Seeking to blind me? You coward!"
msgstr "Chceš mě oslepit? Zbabělče!"

#: game/combatai.msg:1600
msgid "Oh, my pretty face."
msgstr "Och, můj krásný obličej."

#: game/combatai.msg:1688
msgid "Aiyeee! Aiyeee! My eye!"
msgstr "Jaůůůů! Jaůůůů! Moje oko!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2006
msgid "Somebody help meeeee!"
msgstr "Pomozte mi někdóóóó!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2007
msgid "Oh God, oh God, oh God...."
msgstr "Ach bože, ach bože, ach bože..."

#: game/combatai.msg:2008
msgid "Just don't kill me, pleeeeaaasssssee!"
msgstr "Jenom mě nezabíjej, prosíííím!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2010
msgid "Please don't kill me."
msgstr "Prosím, nezabíjej mě."

#: game/combatai.msg:2011
msgid "Help me! Oh, please! Heeeellllp!"
msgstr "Pomozte mi! Prosím! Pomóóóć!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2012
msgid "Just don't hurt me any more."
msgstr "Už mi neubližuj."

#: game/combatai.msg:2013
msgid "Please stop hurting me!"
msgstr "Prosím, přestaň mi ubližovat!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2014
msgid "No, stop, please, noooooo!"
msgstr "Ne, přestaň, prosím, neeeee!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2015
msgid "Don't, please, don't hurt me anymore!"
msgstr "Prosím, už mi neubližuj!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2016
msgid "I can't take it any more!"
msgstr "Už to nevydržím!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2017
msgid "For the love of God, just leave me alone."
msgstr "Pro lásku boží, nech mě být."

#: game/combatai.msg:2018
msgid "Not again, I've got to get out of here."
msgstr "Už zase? Musím odsud vypadnout."

#: game/combatai.msg:2019
msgid "Help! I'm being killed! Help!"
msgstr "Pomóc! Zabíjejí mě! Pomóc!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2026
msgid "Please don't make me do this."
msgstr "Prosím, nenuť mě k tomu."

#: game/combatai.msg:2027
msgid "Oh dear, oh my."
msgstr "Ach bože, ach jo."

#: game/combatai.msg:2028
msgid "I don't really want to do this."
msgstr "Opravdu se mi do toho nechce."

#: game/combatai.msg:2029
msgid "Shoo! Go away! Shoo!"
msgstr "Kšá! Jdi pryč! Kšá!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2030
msgid "Just leave and I won't get hurt."
msgstr "Odejdi a nic se mi nestane."

#: game/combatai.msg:2031
msgid "Don't make me do this."
msgstr "Nenuť mě k tomu."

#: game/combatai.msg:2032
msgid "Watch out, I'm really dangerous. Really. I am."
msgstr "Dej si bacha, jsem pěkně nebezpečnej. Opravdu. Fakt že jo."

#: game/combatai.msg:2033
msgid "You just better watch yourself, I've got a lot of friends."
msgstr "Dej si radši pozor, mám spoustu kámošů."

#: game/combatai.msg:2034
msgid "I'm really dangerous, you better run."
msgstr "Jsem fakt nebezpečnej, radši uteč."

#: game/combatai.msg:2035
msgid "Uh, I don't *want* to attack you."
msgstr "Eh, já na tebe *nechci* útočit."

#: game/combatai.msg:2036
msgid "Just go away, and no one will get hurt."
msgstr "Jdi pryč a nikomu se nic nestane."

#: game/combatai.msg:2037
msgid "Don't make me hurt anyone."
msgstr "Nenuť mě k tomu, nechci nikomu ublížit."

#: game/combatai.msg:2038
msgid "I don't want to kill again, please don't make me."
msgstr "Už nechci zabíjet, prosím, nenuť mě k tomu."

#: game/combatai.msg:2039
msgid "Why does it always come to this?"
msgstr "Proč to takhle vždycky skončí?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2047
msgid "Yeah, who's afraid now!"
msgstr "Jo a kdo se bojí teď?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2050
msgid "Y'you just better w'watch out!"
msgstr "R-radši si dá-dávej ppozor!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2051
msgid "I'm armed, and I'm uh, dangerous, yeah, that's it."
msgstr "Jsem ozbrojenej a eh, nebezpečnej. Jó, přesně tak."

#: game/combatai.msg:2052
msgid "Hey, this isn't so hard after all."
msgstr "Hele, ono to nakonec není ani tak těžký."

#: game/combatai.msg:2053
msgid "Wow, I really can do this!"
msgstr "Páni, to není těžký!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2054
msgid "I feel so empowered."
msgstr "Jsem tak nabitej energií."

#: game/combatai.msg:2055
msgid "Yeah! Feel the pain, bitch!"
msgstr "Jo! Užij si bolest, děvko!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2056
msgid "You're goin' down."
msgstr "Teď chcípneš."

#: game/combatai.msg:2057
msgid "Oh, yeah, I'm bad, I'm bad."
msgstr "Ou jéé. Jsem fakt zlej, jsem fakt zlej."

#: game/combatai.msg:2058
msgid "I'm gonna take you out!"
msgstr "Dostanu tě!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2059
msgid "I'm one bad ass. You just better watch yourself."
msgstr "Jsem pěknej drsňák, takže si radši dávej bacha."

#: game/combatai.msg:2060
msgid "I'm wilier than I look."
msgstr "Jsem lepší než vypadám."

#: game/combatai.msg:2066
msgid "I'm dead... hey, no I'm not."
msgstr "Jsem mrt... ne, nejsem."

#: game/combatai.msg:2067
msgid "Ouch! That... hey, you missed me."
msgstr "Jauvajs! To... hej, to bylo vedle."

#: game/combatai.msg:2068
msgid "Am I bleeding anywhere?"
msgstr "Neteče mi někde krev?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2069
msgid "You missed? I can't believe it."
msgstr "Vedle? Tomu nevěřím."

#: game/combatai.msg:2070
msgid "I knew you weren't really shooting at me!"
msgstr "Ha, ta rána nešla na mě!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2071
msgid "Hah, hah. You suck!"
msgstr "Haha. Stojíš za prd!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2072
msgid "(Thumbs nose at you)Nyah, nyah, nyah, nyah, nyah."
msgstr "(Ukáže na tebe posměšné gesto) Jéhé, jéhé."

#: game/combatai.msg:2073
msgid "(Raises a finger towards you)"
msgstr "(Ukáže na tebe prostředníček)"

#: game/combatai.msg:2074
msgid "You're not so hot."
msgstr "To bylo nic moc."

#: game/combatai.msg:2075
msgid "You suck, I can't believe I was afraid of you."
msgstr "Stojíš za prd. Nechápu, jak se tě někdo může bát."

#: game/combatai.msg:2076
msgid "I knew you wouldn't really try to kill me."
msgstr "Bylo mi hned jasný, že se mě nepokoušíš zabít."

#: game/combatai.msg:2077
msgid "That was too close."
msgstr "To bylo opravdu těsně."

#: game/combatai.msg:2078
msgid "Good thing I'm so shifty."
msgstr "Mě jen tak netrefíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:2079
msgid "Stop shooting at me!"
msgstr "Přestaň po mně střílet!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2106
msgid "Stop picking on me!"
msgstr "Přestaň na mě pořád útočit!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2107
msgid "Help me! Hellllllllp!"
msgstr "Pomozte mi! Pomóóóóc!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2108
msgid "I'm being killed! Help me!"
msgstr "Zabíjejí mě! Pomozte mi!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2109
msgid "Run for your life!"
msgstr "Kdo uteče, přežije!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2110
msgid "I don't have anything! Just let me live!"
msgstr "Já nic nemám! Nech mě žít!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2111
msgid "Hey, whatever I did, I'm sorrrrryyy!"
msgstr "Hele, ať už to bylo cokoliv, tak mi to proooomiiiiiň!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2112
msgid "Fuck, shit, crap!"
msgstr "Kurva, do prdele, do hajzlu!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2113
msgid "I don't want to go like this!"
msgstr "Takhle nechci umřít!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2114
msgid "Just leave us alone here!"
msgstr "Nech nás na pokoji!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2115
msgid "Oh God, oh God, oh God, noooooo!"
msgstr "Ach bože, ach bože, ach bože neeeeee!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2116
msgid "Not me, just don't kill me, please!"
msgstr "Mě ne, prosím, jenom ne mě!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2117
msgid "I didn't do nothin' to you!"
msgstr "Nic jsem ti neudělal!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2119
msgid "Heeeeelp! There's a psycho on the loose!"
msgstr "Pomóóóc! Je tu šílenec!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2120
msgid "Wait 'til I get you..."
msgstr "Počkej, já tě dostanu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:2121
msgid "That's it, I've had enough of your type."
msgstr "Tak a dost. Už mám po krk takových, jako jsi ty."

#: game/combatai.msg:2126
msgid "You can't just do anything you please here."
msgstr "Nemůžeš si sem jen tak přijít a dělat si, co se ti zlíbí."

#: game/combatai.msg:2127
msgid "You need to learn some manners."
msgstr "Potřebuješ lekci slušného chování."

#: game/combatai.msg:2128
msgid "I've had just about enough of you."
msgstr "Už tě mám tak akorát dost."

#: game/combatai.msg:2129
msgid "You and your kind, they're all the same."
msgstr "Ty a tvůj druh jste všichni stejní."

#: game/combatai.msg:2130
msgid "I didn't want to have to do this."
msgstr "Po dobrém to asi nepůjde."

#: game/combatai.msg:2131
msgid "I hate you and all that you stand for."
msgstr "Nenávidím tebe a tvoje názory."

#: game/combatai.msg:2132
msgid "It's varmints like you that make life hard for decent folks."
msgstr "Kvůli takovejm hajzlům, jako jsi ty, to mají slušní lidé těžký."

#: game/combatai.msg:2133
msgid "Somebody needs to put you away for what you've done."
msgstr "Někdo by měl s tebou zatočit."

#: game/combatai.msg:2134
msgid "You need to be spanked, hard!"
msgstr "Potřebuješ naplácat na prdel... pořádně!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2135
msgid "You just can't do some things and expect to get away with it."
msgstr "Nemůžeš čekat, že ti všechno projde."

#: game/combatai.msg:2136
msgid "Your days here are through."
msgstr "Tvé dny jsou sečteny."

#: game/combatai.msg:2137
msgid "Goddamn it, I'm not going to take that."
msgstr "Zatraceně, tohle ti neprojde."

#: game/combatai.msg:2138
msgid "I'm mad as hell and I'm just not going to take it anymore!"
msgstr "Jsem šíleně naštvanej a už to nevydržím!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2140
msgid "You shouldn't have done that."
msgstr "To byla opravdu chyba!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2141
msgid "We take care of our own."
msgstr "Nikomu ubližovat nebudeš."

#: game/combatai.msg:2145
msgid "Gonna feed you to the dogs."
msgstr "Bude z tebe žrádlo pro psy."

#: game/combatai.msg:2150
msgid "I hope this hurts."
msgstr "Doufám, že to bolí."

#: game/combatai.msg:2151
msgid "This'll teach you some manners."
msgstr "To tě naučí slušnému chování."

#: game/combatai.msg:2152
msgid "You have to learn sometime."
msgstr "Snad se z toho poučíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:2154
msgid "Feels good to be striking back!"
msgstr "Je to fajn pocit oplácet!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2155
msgid "I've had enough of your kind!"
msgstr "Už mám dost takových, jako jsi ty!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2156
msgid "Feel the pain!"
msgstr "Užij si bolest!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2157
msgid "You won't do this again!"
msgstr "Příště už to neuděláš!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2158
msgid "I'm striking a blow for all the little people!"
msgstr "Teď ti dám ránu za všechny slabé lidi!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2159
msgid "Yeah, take that!"
msgstr "Jo, jen si dej!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2160
msgid "I ain't that bad off, am I?"
msgstr "To nebylo špatný, co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2161
msgid "I've seen smarter Brahmin than you."
msgstr "I některý brahmíny jsou chytřejší než ty."

#: game/combatai.msg:2166
msgid "You aren't that good after all."
msgstr "To bylo slabý."

#: game/combatai.msg:2167
msgid "Hah hah, you suck!"
msgstr "Haha, stojíš za prd!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2168
msgid "I thought you had me for sure."
msgstr "Skoro bylo po mně."

#: game/combatai.msg:2169
msgid "I must be better at this than I thought."
msgstr "Zdá se, že jsem lepší, než to vypadá."

#: game/combatai.msg:2170
msgid "You can't hit me!"
msgstr "Mě netrefíš!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2171
msgid "You got me! Oh? Maybe you didn't!?!"
msgstr "Dostal jsem to! Co to? Tak asi ne!?!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2172
msgid "Yeah! You missed me!"
msgstr "Jo! Vedle!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2203
msgid "You got the better of me... this time"
msgstr "Byl jsi lepší... pro tentokrát."

#: game/combatai.msg:2206
msgid "You've gotta sleep sometime, and I'll be there when you do."
msgstr "Někdy musíš taky spát. A až usneš, já přijdu."

#: game/combatai.msg:2207
msgid "You got lucky."
msgstr "Máš štěstí."

#: game/combatai.msg:2208
msgid "This round is yours, but the fight's gonna be mine."
msgstr "Tohle kolo je tvoje, ale zápas bude můj."

#: game/combatai.msg:2209
msgid "You won this time."
msgstr "Tentokrát je výhra tvoje."

#: game/combatai.msg:2210
msgid "Next time the luck's going to be on my side."
msgstr "Příště bude štěstí na mojí straně."

#: game/combatai.msg:2211
msgid "Better to live again to fight another day."
msgstr "Lepší utýct a žít o chvíli dýl."

#: game/combatai.msg:2213
msgid "You're not worth the trouble."
msgstr "Ty mi za to nestojíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:2214
msgid "Shit, I didn't think you'd be so much work."
msgstr "Do prdele, kdo by čekal takovej odpor."

#: game/combatai.msg:2215
msgid "Crap, time to scram."
msgstr "Do hajzlu, čas vzít roha."

#: game/combatai.msg:2216
msgid "You're one nasty motherfucker!"
msgstr "Jseš fakt pěknej zmrd!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2217
msgid "I'm bad, but you're the baddest."
msgstr "Jsem drsnej, ale ty jseš ještě drsnější."

#: game/combatai.msg:2218
msgid "Asta la vista!"
msgstr "Asta la vista!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2219
msgid "Tasty bananas!"
msgstr "Sajonara!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2220
msgid "It's too late to run!"
msgstr "Na útěk už je pozdě!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2226
msgid "This is gonna feel good."
msgstr "Tohle bude skvělý."

#: game/combatai.msg:2227
msgid "I don't think you're going to like this."
msgstr "Myslím, že se ti to nebude líbit."

#: game/combatai.msg:2228
msgid "I'm really going to enjoy this."
msgstr "Tohle si fakt užiju."

#: game/combatai.msg:2229
msgid "Let the hurtin' commence."
msgstr "Nechť započne bolest."

#: game/combatai.msg:2231
msgid "Time to tango!"
msgstr "Čas na Tango!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2232
msgid "I think I'll kill you slow."
msgstr "Myslím, že tě zabiju pomalu."

#: game/combatai.msg:2233
msgid "I'm going to like seeing your guts spread out on the ground."
msgstr "Už se těším, až se ti budou válet střeva všude po zemi."

#: game/combatai.msg:2234
msgid "I wonder how much noise you'll make when I bleed you."
msgstr "Zajímalo by mě, jak moc budeš řvát, až tě budu kuchat."

#: game/combatai.msg:2235
msgid "Welcome to the major leagues, rookie."
msgstr "Vítej ve vyšší lize, zelenáči."

#: game/combatai.msg:2236
msgid "I love's to watch 'em squirm."
msgstr "Miluju, když se jídlo ještě hejbe na talíři."

#: game/combatai.msg:2237
msgid "I hope this is a challenge, for a change."
msgstr "Doufám, že to bude aspoň trochu výzva... pro změnu."

#: game/combatai.msg:2238
msgid "Oh yeah! I've been waiting for this."
msgstr "Jooo! Na tohle čekám už dlouho."

#: game/combatai.msg:2239
msgid "Let's see what you're really made of."
msgstr "Tak ukaž, co umíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:2243
msgid "I just want to hear your bones cracking!"
msgstr "Chci slyšet, jak ti praskají kosti!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2247
msgid "I'm gonna beat you like a red-headed stepchild..."
msgstr "Zmlátím tě jak nevlastní zrzavý děcko..."

#: game/combatai.msg:2249
msgid "You'll regret setting foot in here!"
msgstr "Budeš litovat, že jsi sem vkročil!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2250
msgid "Feel the burn."
msgstr "Užij si to."

#: game/combatai.msg:2251
msgid "Take the pain, motherfucker!"
msgstr "Užij si bolest, zmrde!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2252
msgid "Yeah, feels good don't it?"
msgstr "Jo, je to fajn, co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2253
msgid "That's a bleeder!"
msgstr "Vysaju z tebe krev jako pijavice!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2254
msgid "Starting to slow down a bit huh?"
msgstr "Nějak zpomaluješ, ne?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2255
msgid "Oh yeah, this is where it's at."
msgstr "Jo, takhle se to dělá."

#: game/combatai.msg:2256
msgid "Feel that one?"
msgstr "Bolelo to?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2257
msgid "Yeah buddy, lean into the blow."
msgstr "Jo, kámo, pojď mi."

#: game/combatai.msg:2258
msgid "Take it, take it hard!"
msgstr "Dej si, jen si dej!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2259
msgid "Love to taste the splashed blood."
msgstr "Miluju chuť čerstvý krve!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2266
msgid "Was that your best shot?"
msgstr "To byla tvoje nejlepší rána?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2267
msgid "And I thought this was going to be a *fight.*"
msgstr "A já myslel, že tohle má být *boj*."

#: game/combatai.msg:2268
msgid "Try aiming *at me* next time."
msgstr "Příště zkus mířit *na mě*."

#: game/combatai.msg:2269
msgid "You're just a fuckin' clown."
msgstr "Jseš fakt k smíchu."

#: game/combatai.msg:2270
msgid "Goddamn amateurs!"
msgstr "Zatracení amatéři!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2271
msgid "This your first time kid?"
msgstr "První bitka, zelenáči?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2272 game/combatai.msg:36875
msgid "I didn't even have to dodge that one."
msgstr "Ani jsem nemusel uhýbat."

#: game/combatai.msg:2307
msgid "See ya around."
msgstr "Uvidíme se později."

#: game/combatai.msg:2308
msgid "I'll be back, 'til then you can dream about me."
msgstr "Ještě se vrátím. Zatím si o mně můžeš nechat zdát."

#: game/combatai.msg:2309
msgid "You bore me."
msgstr "Nudíš mě."

#: game/combatai.msg:2310
msgid "I'm gonna go get sloshed, then I'll be back."
msgstr "Jdu se ožrat a pak se vrátím."

#: game/combatai.msg:2311
msgid "More of a challenge elsewhere."
msgstr "Tohle je na mě moc jednoduchý."

#: game/combatai.msg:2312
msgid "We'll have to do this again sometime."
msgstr "Musíme si to někdy zopakovat."

#: game/combatai.msg:2313
msgid "That was fun, ta ta."
msgstr "Jo, byla to sranda."

#: game/combatai.msg:2314
msgid "Whoa, time for my lunch-break."
msgstr "A hele, už je přestávka na oběd."

#: game/combatai.msg:2315
msgid "That was great, I broke a sweat!"
msgstr "Bylo to skvělý a dokonce jsem se i zapotil!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2316
msgid "Time for more ammo and stimpaks!"
msgstr "Musím sehnat nějaký náboje a Stimpaky!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2317
msgid "Hold it right there, I'll be back in a few."
msgstr "Vydrž, za minutku jsem zpátky."

#: game/combatai.msg:2318
msgid "I've got some friends that'll want in on this action."
msgstr "Skočím si pro pár kámošů."

#: game/combatai.msg:2319
msgid "Let's do that again, real soon."
msgstr "Někdy si to zopakujem... fakt brzo."

#: game/combatai.msg:2326
msgid "Mmm, gonna really enjoy this."
msgstr "Mmm, tohle si fakt užiju."

#: game/combatai.msg:2327
msgid "I want to take my time with you."
msgstr "Vychutnám si tě pěkně pomalu."

#: game/combatai.msg:2328
msgid "You're not going to like this, but I sure will."
msgstr "Tobě se to asi líbit nebude, ale mně určitě jo."

#: game/combatai.msg:2329
msgid "You've never been gone over by a real pro before, have ya?"
msgstr "Už tě někdy porazil opravdovej profík?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2330
msgid "This is going to feel real good."
msgstr "Tohle si fakt užiju."

#: game/combatai.msg:2331
msgid "Love to hear them bones crack."
msgstr "Miluju zvuk praskajících kostí."

#: game/combatai.msg:2332
msgid "This is going to feel good."
msgstr "Tohle si užiju."

#: game/combatai.msg:2333
msgid "Your guts sure are going to look pretty on the ground."
msgstr "Tvoje střeva budou vypadat na zemi fakt dobře."

#: game/combatai.msg:2334
msgid "I wonder how much blood you got in you?"
msgstr "Zajímalo by mě, kolik je v tobě krve."

#: game/combatai.msg:2335
msgid "I sure hope you have *some* staying power."
msgstr "Doufám, že *něco* vydržíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:2336
msgid "This sure doesn't look like much of a challenge."
msgstr "Tohle nebude moc těžký."

#: game/combatai.msg:2337
msgid "This won't take too long."
msgstr "Zabere to jenom chvíli."

#: game/combatai.msg:2338
msgid "Stand still and I'll get this over real quick for you."
msgstr "Nehejbej se a budeš to mít rychle za sebou."

#: game/combatai.msg:2339
msgid "At least you'll know you fell to the best."
msgstr "Aspoň zemřeš s vědomím, že tě porazil profík."

#: game/combatai.msg:2343
msgid "I hope you don't die too quick"
msgstr "Doufám, že nechcípneš moc rychle."

#: game/combatai.msg:2350
msgid "You've fought the rest, now it's time for the best!"
msgstr "To nejlepší na konec!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2351
msgid "Oh yeah! That's great!"
msgstr "Jo! To je skvělý!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2352
msgid "Love the way you're bleedin'!"
msgstr "Líbí se mi jak krvácíš!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2353
msgid "Ever see a skull open up like that, man?"
msgstr "Ukaž, máš v hlavě aspoň kousek mozku?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2354
msgid "Look at the blood-spray! Yeah, goin' the distance!"
msgstr "Hele, jak ta krev stříká! A jak daleko!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2355
msgid "You're one sorry motherfucker!"
msgstr "Ty podělanej zmrde!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2356
msgid "Goddamn, I love this!"
msgstr "Hergot, tohle miluju!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2357
msgid "Going to fuck you up, bigtime!"
msgstr "Vyjebu s tebou jako nikdo předtím!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2358
msgid "Yeah baby, yeah!"
msgstr "Jo, bejby, jo!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2359
msgid "Asta la Vista, Baby."
msgstr "Asta la Vista, Baby."

#: game/combatai.msg:2361
msgid "You bore me to tears."
msgstr "Nudíš mě k smrti."

#: game/combatai.msg:2365
msgid "This is gonna be easier than I thought."
msgstr "Bude to lehčí, než jsem si myslel."

#: game/combatai.msg:2366
msgid "Try aimin' *at* me next time."
msgstr "Zkus příště mířit *na* mě."

#: game/combatai.msg:2367
msgid "You got the shakes don'tcha kid?"
msgstr "Klepe se ti ruka nebo co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2368
msgid "Hit me! Come on you fucking wimp! Hit me!"
msgstr "Tak už mě tref! Dělej, ty posraná nulo! Tref mě!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2369
msgid "Shoot me right here in the fucking head!"
msgstr "Střílej přímo sem do mojí zkurvený kebule!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2370
msgid "You don't got the guts do ya?"
msgstr "Nemáš na to odvahu nebo co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2371
msgid "Shee-it, you suck."
msgstr "Kurva, stojíš za prd."

#: game/combatai.msg:2372
msgid "Shit, I thought this was gonna be some kind of challenge!"
msgstr "Do prdele, myslel jsem, že to bude výzva!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2401
msgid "Maybe this wasn't a good idea!"
msgstr "Možná to nebyl až tak dobrej nápad!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2425
msgid "Wait till I get you..."
msgstr "Však já tě dostanu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:2449
msgid "I'm putting you away for good."
msgstr "Bude od tebe nadobro klid."

#: game/combatai.msg:2460
msgid "Your mama teach you that move?"
msgstr "To tě naučila maminka?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2522
msgid "I'm gonna dance on your grave."
msgstr "Zatancuju si na tvým hrobě."

#: game/combatai.msg:2524
msgid "You ready bitch?"
msgstr "Připravená, děvko?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2543
msgid "You want more of this?!! Huh?!"
msgstr "Chceš ještě?!! Co?!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2546
msgid "Hope you don't die too quickly."
msgstr "Doufám, že budeš chcípat pomalu."

#: game/combatai.msg:2550
msgid "I'm gonna feed you to my pet iguana."
msgstr "Nakrmím s tebou svoji ještěrku."

#: game/combatai.msg:2601
msgid "The spirits bid me to save myself."
msgstr "Duchové mi nařídit utéct."

#: game/combatai.msg:2660
msgid "Your eyes are clouded with hatred."
msgstr "Tvé oči jsou zaslepeny nenávistí."

#: game/combatai.msg:2661
msgid "Your spirits have abandoned you."
msgstr "Tví duchové tě opustili."

#: game/combatai.msg:2662
msgid "Our magic is working!"
msgstr "Naše magie funguje!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2663
msgid "My magic makes me invincible!"
msgstr "Moje magie ze mě dělá nesmrtelného!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2664
msgid "Your life-force is weakening!"
msgstr "Tvá životní síla slábne!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2665
msgid "Fear is the mind-killer."
msgstr "Strach zabíjí mysl."

#: game/combatai.msg:2666
msgid "My battle-song is working!"
msgstr "Má válečná píseň funguje!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2667
msgid "Our children know more of battle!"
msgstr "Naše děcka znají umění boje lépe než ty!"

#: game/combatai.msg:2668
msgid "You have known peace too long."
msgstr "Žiješ v míru příliš dlouho."

#: game/combatai.msg:2669
msgid "Are all of your tribe so weak?"
msgstr "Jsou všichni tvého kmene tak slabí?"

#: game/combatai.msg:2744
msgid "This ain't just a job to us."
msgstr "Pro nás to není jenom práce."

#: game/combatai.msg:2747
msgid "You ain't even gonna make it to 6am."
msgstr "Nedožiješ se příštího rána."

#: game/combatai.msg:2749
msgid "See you in Hell."
msgstr "Uvidíme se v pekle."

#: game/combatai.msg:2940
msgid "Enjoy the last few seconds of your life."
msgstr "Užij si poslední sekundy svýho života."

#: game/combatai.msg:3002
msgid "Combat effectiveness minimal. Retreat advised."
msgstr "Bojová efektivita minimální. Doporučen ústup."

#: game/combatai.msg:3046
msgid "The target will be destroyed."
msgstr "Cíl bude zničen."

#: game/combatai.msg:3048
msgid "Target must be eliminated."
msgstr "Cíl musí být zneškodněn."

#: game/combatai.msg:3060
msgid "Analysis. Defensive program successful."
msgstr "Analýza. Defenzivní program úspěšný."

#: game/combatai.msg:3061
msgid "Analysis. Target offensive abilities negligible."
msgstr "Analýza. Útok cíle neefektivní."

#: game/combatai.msg:3065
msgid "Analysis. Target erred in tactical selection. Unit undamaged"
msgstr "Analýza. Cíl neúspěšný ve svém útoku. Jednotka nepoškozena."

#: game/combatai.msg:3126
msgid "More brains..."
msgstr "Další mozkýýýý..."

#: game/combatai.msg:3171
msgid "Shame that your first time is gonna be your last too."
msgstr "Škoda, že tvoje první bitka bude zároveň i tvoje poslední."

#: game/combatai.msg:3243
msgid "Nrrrg!"
msgstr "Nrrrg!"

#: game/combatai.msg:3244
msgid "Hiyaaaaaa!"
msgstr "Hajááááá!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10020 game/combatai.msg:10040
msgid "I Keeng Ra'at"
msgstr "Já krrááál krýsáááá."

#: game/combatai.msg:10021 game/combatai.msg:10041
msgid "Squeeee! Kill Keeng's children!"
msgstr "Písk! Zábit kráál děti!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10022 game/combatai.msg:10042
msgid "Keeng crack bones, you!"
msgstr "Krááál láámat tvoje kóóóst!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10023 game/combatai.msg:10043
msgid "Keeng feast on soft parts, you!"
msgstr "Kráál nažéré tý!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10024 game/combatai.msg:10044
msgid "Keeng big fight, Ra'at Keel!"
msgstr "Krráál bíjéé. Krááál Krýsááá!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10025
msgid "Big fight! Keel for Keeng and cave!"
msgstr "Velkááá bíítka! Zábít pro krállll Krýsá!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10026 game/combatai.msg:10046
msgid "Keeng kill now!"
msgstr "Kráál zábijééé tě!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10027 game/combatai.msg:10047
msgid "Hungry, hungry. Keeng kill, kill!"
msgstr "Hlad, hlad, krááál záábíít, záábíít!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10028 game/combatai.msg:10048
msgid "Keeng smell fear-stink on you."
msgstr "Kráál cítít smrad z ty."

#: game/combatai.msg:10029 game/combatai.msg:10049
msgid "Bald hind-leg ra'at, Keeng kill!"
msgstr "Dvojnohááá hóóláá krýsa, kráál zábijéééé!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10030 game/combatai.msg:10050
msgid "Kill, kill!"
msgstr "Zabít! Zabít!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10031 game/combatai.msg:10051
msgid "Fleshfeast! Fleshfeast!"
msgstr "Maso! Maso!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10032 game/combatai.msg:10052
msgid "Keeng Rippertear! Rippertear!"
msgstr "Krááál trrrháááát! Trrrháááát!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10033 game/combatai.msg:10053
msgid "Ra'at come! Come to Keeng!"
msgstr "Krýsááá póť! Póť ke krááálll!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10034 game/combatai.msg:10054
msgid "Keeng rippertear hind-leg one."
msgstr "Krááál trhááát dvojnohá!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10035 game/combatai.msg:10055
msgid "Keeng kill big noise one!"
msgstr "Král zábit velikej kráááváál!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10036 game/combatai.msg:10056
msgid "Keeng kill hairless rat."
msgstr "Král zábit bezchlupá krýsááá!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10037 game/combatai.msg:10057
msgid "Jump-claw with Keeng Ra'at."
msgstr "Krááál krýýýýsa HLAD."

#: game/combatai.msg:10038 game/combatai.msg:10058
msgid "Ra'at clawtear you! Clawtear!"
msgstr "Krýýýsa rozsááápat ty! Rozsááápat!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10045
msgid "Big figh! Keel for Keeng and cave!"
msgstr "Velkááá bíítka! Zábít pro krállll Krýsá!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10120 game/combatai.msg:10140
msgid "Number five is alive!"
msgstr "Číslo pět žije!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10121 game/combatai.msg:10141
msgid "Vee-jer, Veee-jer."
msgstr "Brrr zzzz vrrrr zzzz"

#: game/combatai.msg:10122 game/combatai.msg:10142
msgid "Error! Error Errrrrrrooooorrrr...."
msgstr "Chyba! Chyba! Chýýýýýýýbbbbbbáááááá..."

#: game/combatai.msg:10123 game/combatai.msg:10143
msgid "Who is the creator?"
msgstr "Kdo je stvořitel?"

#: game/combatai.msg:10124 game/combatai.msg:10144
msgid "Does not compute! Does not compute!"
msgstr "Nelze spočítat! Nelze spočítat!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10125 game/combatai.msg:10145
msgid "I'm sorry Dave."
msgstr "Promiň, Dave."

#: game/combatai.msg:10126 game/combatai.msg:10146
msgid "./~ Daisy, Daisy, give me your answer, do ./~"
msgstr "./~ Daisy, Daisy, odpověz mi ./~"

#: game/combatai.msg:10127 game/combatai.msg:10147
msgid "Danger Bill Williamson, Danger!"
msgstr "Pozor, Bille Williamsone, pozor!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10128 game/combatai.msg:10148
msgid "Gort! Klaatu Berada Nictu!"
msgstr "Gort! Klaatu Berada Nictu!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10129 game/combatai.msg:10149
msgid "Sssszzzzztt *POP*"
msgstr "Sssszzzzztt *POP*"

#: game/combatai.msg:10130 game/combatai.msg:10150
msgid "Would you like cream with that, ma'am?"
msgstr "Chcete na to šlehačku, madam?"

#: game/combatai.msg:10131 game/combatai.msg:10151
msgid "Yes sir, a Mr. Handy unit, sir."
msgstr "Ano, pane, Mr. Handy, pane."

#: game/combatai.msg:10132 game/combatai.msg:10152
msgid "I'm fully proficient."
msgstr "Jsem plně funkční."

#: game/combatai.msg:10133 game/combatai.msg:10153
msgid "But I'm a translator."
msgstr "Ale já jsem protokolární droid."

#: game/combatai.msg:10134 game/combatai.msg:10154
msgid "Nanoo-nanoo."
msgstr "Nanoo-nanoo."

#: game/combatai.msg:10135 game/combatai.msg:10155
msgid "I can't let you do that Dave."
msgstr "Tohle ti nemohu dovolit, Dave."

#: game/combatai.msg:10136 game/combatai.msg:10156
msgid "None shall pass."
msgstr "Nikdo neprojde."

#: game/combatai.msg:10137 game/combatai.msg:10157
msgid "Warning! Warning!"
msgstr "Varování! Varování!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10138 game/combatai.msg:10158
msgid "ZZzzzzzzzttt! Sprack!"
msgstr "ZZzzzzzzzttt! Cák!"

#: game/combatai.msg:10139 game/combatai.msg:10159
msgid "But the M-5 is invincible."
msgstr "Ale číslo pět je neporazitelný."

#: game/combatai.msg:12043
msgid "::I wanna be an airborne ranger...::"
msgstr "::Tak jdem! Tak jdem! Všechno tu rozbijem!::"

#: game/combatai.msg:12144
msgid "Time to die!"
msgstr "Čas zemřít!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12161 game/combatai.msg:41365
msgid "Missed me!"
msgstr "Vedle!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12300
msgid "Ngggg."
msgstr "Ngggg."

#: game/combatai.msg:12301
msgid "My... head... getting... dizzy."
msgstr "Moje... hlava... nějak... se... motá."

#: game/combatai.msg:12331
msgid "Hnrgggg."
msgstr "Hnrgggg."

#: game/combatai.msg:12400
msgid "Head... ringing..."
msgstr "Hlava... nějak zvoní..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12401
msgid "*Hrkkkk*...fucker just scalped me..."
msgstr "*Hrkkkk*... kurva, skalpovali mě..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12402
msgid "Dizzy... blood in my eyes... somebody..."
msgstr "Závrať... krev v očích... někdo..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12404
msgid "Aahhhk... got me in the... fucking head!"
msgstr "Aaaaach... přímo... do zkurvený hlavy!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12405
msgid "Ain't taken a hit like that since Tommy the Balls..."
msgstr "Naposled jsem takovou pecku dostal od Tommyho Tvrďáka..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12406
msgid "'Nother hit to the head like that an' I'm done for..."
msgstr "Ještě jeden zásah do kebule a jsem kaput..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12407
msgid "My ear! You tore off my goddamn ear!"
msgstr "Moje ucho! Mám utržený ucho!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12408
msgid "Head feels like it's in a vise..."
msgstr "Mám hlavu jak ve svěráku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12409
msgid "Nrgggg! Clocked me in the skull..."
msgstr "Nrgggg! Dostal jsem to do kebule..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12410 game/combatai.msg:12420
msgid "My arm! You broke my fucking arm!"
msgstr "Moje ruka! Mám kurva zlomenou ruku!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12411
msgid "Shit! My left arm's shot!"
msgstr "Doprdele! Trefili mě do levý ruky!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12412 game/combatai.msg:12422
msgid "Got me in the fucking arm...!"
msgstr "Trefili mě do zasraný ruky...!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12413 game/combatai.msg:12423
msgid "That hit dislocated my arm!"
msgstr "Ta rána mi vykloubila rameno!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12414 game/combatai.msg:12424
msgid "Owww! Fuck!"
msgstr "Uuuuf! Kurva!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12415 game/combatai.msg:12425
msgid "I got blood all over my arm...!"
msgstr "Mám krev po celý ruce...!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12416 game/combatai.msg:12426
msgid "My gunhand!"
msgstr "Moje ruka! Jak mám teď střílet?"

#: game/combatai.msg:12417 game/combatai.msg:12427
msgid "*Nfff*...nearly tore my arm clean off...!"
msgstr "*Nfff*... skoro mi to urvalo ruku...!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12418 game/combatai.msg:12429
msgid "*Urkkk*...can still....hit you... with the other hand..."
msgstr "*Urkkk*... ještě... furt... tě... můžu mlátit... druhou... rukou."

#: game/combatai.msg:12419 game/combatai.msg:12428
msgid "Gonna need some stims for my arm. After I kill you."
msgstr "Budu na tu potřebovat Stimpak, ale nejdřív tě zabiju."

#: game/combatai.msg:12421
msgid "Shit! My right arm's shot!"
msgstr "Doprdele! Trefili mě do pravý ruky!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12430
msgid "Can't... breathe..."
msgstr "Nemůžu... dejchat..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12431
msgid "*Oooooffff*"
msgstr "*Uuuuuffff*"

#: game/combatai.msg:12432
msgid "Dammit... knocked... the... wind... outta... me..."
msgstr "Zatraceně... mám... vyraženej... dech..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12433 game/combatai.msg:40844
msgid "*Unfffff*"
msgstr "*Unfffff*"

#: game/combatai.msg:12434
msgid "Think... I just snapped a rib..."
msgstr "Asi... se mi zlomilo žebro..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12435
msgid "Gonna need some stims for my chest. After I kill you."
msgstr "Budu potřebovat pár Stimpaků na břicho, ale nejdřív tě zabiju."

#: game/combatai.msg:12436
msgid "Nice... hit. Now I'm gonna break every rib in YOUR body."
msgstr "Hezkej... zásah. A teď ti zlámu všechny žebra v TVÝM těle."

#: game/combatai.msg:12437
msgid "Give... me a sec... to catch my breath... then I'll kill you..."
msgstr "Dej mi... chvíli... ať popadnu dech... a pak tě zabiju..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12438
msgid "*Hrkkk*"
msgstr "*Hrkkk*"

#: game/combatai.msg:12439
msgid "That... was stupid... let me show you why."
msgstr "Tohle... byla hloupost... ukážu ti proč."

#: game/combatai.msg:12440
msgid "I'm gonna carve you like a tribal."
msgstr "Vykuchám tě jako divocha."

#: game/combatai.msg:12441
msgid "Got me in the chest..."
msgstr "Dostal jsem to do břicha..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12442
msgid "Argghhh! Sonuvabitch..."
msgstr "Argghhh! Zkurvysynu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12443
msgid "Lucky... shot..."
msgstr "Šťastná... rána..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12444
msgid "*Unnffff*...need to wear more armor over my chest..."
msgstr "*Unnffff*... budu si muset pořídit lepší zbroj..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12445
msgid "Clipped my shoulder... that's all... keep fighting..."
msgstr "Mám jenom vykloubený rameno... nic víc... pokračujem..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12446
msgid "I'm going snap every bone in your body."
msgstr "Zlámu ti všechny kosti v těle."

#: game/combatai.msg:12447
msgid "I'm gonna rip out your teeth for that..."
msgstr "Za to ti vymlátím zuby..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12448
msgid "Chest's on fire..."
msgstr "Hoří mi tělo..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12449
msgid "Somebody got some stims?! My chest's bleeding bad!"
msgstr "Nemáte někdo Stimpaky?! Strašně mi krvácí břicho!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12450
msgid "Shit... this tribal hits like the Masticator..."
msgstr "Do prdele... tenhle divoch má ránu jak Ždímačka..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12451
msgid "You broke my ribs, now I'm gonna break your neck."
msgstr "Já mám zlomený žebra, ale ty budeš mít zlomenej vaz."

#: game/combatai.msg:12452
msgid "That all you got? Piss poor show, tribal."
msgstr "To je všechno? Tak to bylo pěkně slabý, divochu."

#: game/combatai.msg:12453
msgid "Chest wound... that's nothing."
msgstr "Zranění břicha... to nic není."

#: game/combatai.msg:12454
msgid "Dammit! Musta broke some ribs..."
msgstr "Zatraceně! Slyším praskat žebra..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12455
msgid "Think my spine just cracked..."
msgstr "Myslím, že mi praskla páteř..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12456
msgid "Let me show you how we kill people here."
msgstr "A teď ti ukážu, jak zabíjíme lidi u nás."

#: game/combatai.msg:12457
msgid "Fuck! Not my spleen! Anything but my spleen!"
msgstr "Kurva! Moje střeva ne! Cokoliv jenom ne střeva!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12458
msgid "*Urgggg*...think that knocked... some organs loose..."
msgstr "*Urgggg*... myslím, že se mi... utrhly nějaký vnitřnosti..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12459
msgid "Bleeding all over the fucking place..."
msgstr "Krvácím jak zapíchnutý prase..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12460 game/combatai.msg:12470
msgid "You broke my leg! Now I'm gonna break your face."
msgstr "Mám zlomenou nohu! Za to ti rozbiju ksicht."

#: game/combatai.msg:12461 game/combatai.msg:12471
msgid "I'm gonna make a dishrag outta your face."
msgstr "Udělám si z tvýho ksichtu hadr na nádobí."

#: game/combatai.msg:12462 game/combatai.msg:12472
msgid "Ahhh! Got me in the fucking knee!"
msgstr "Áááá! Trefili mě do zasranýho kolena!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12463 game/combatai.msg:12473
msgid "I'm gonna break both your kneecaps for that..."
msgstr "Za to rozbiju obě kolena..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12464 game/combatai.msg:12474
msgid "Clocked me in the leg..."
msgstr "Píchlo mě to do nohy..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12465 game/combatai.msg:12475
msgid "You got lucky, shithead..."
msgstr "Máš štěstí, sráči..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12466 game/combatai.msg:12476
msgid "Gonna have to keep off this leg for a while..."
msgstr "Na tu nohu budu muset dávat pár dní pozor..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12467 game/combatai.msg:12477
msgid "Leg's shot... time for some payback."
msgstr "Zásah do nohy... čas na odplatu."

#: game/combatai.msg:12468 game/combatai.msg:12478
msgid "I don't need that leg to kick your ass."
msgstr "Nakopu ti prdel i bez týhle nohy."

#: game/combatai.msg:12469 game/combatai.msg:12479
msgid "For that, I'm gonna rip off your leg and beat you with it."
msgstr "Za tohleto ti utrhnu nohu a zmlátím tě s ní."

#: game/combatai.msg:12480
msgid "Ahhhh, shit! My fucking eye!"
msgstr "No do prdele! Moje zkurvený oko!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12481
msgid "Erggg... lucky... shot..."
msgstr "Errrr... šťastná... rána..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12482
msgid "Fucking world's going dark..."
msgstr "Nějak se zatemnilo na tomhle zkurveným světě..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12483
msgid "Nothing... an eye patch... won't cure..."
msgstr "Nic... co by nedokázala vyřešit... páska přes oko..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12484
msgid "I'm gonna cut out both your eyes for that... slowly."
msgstr "Za tohle ti vypíchnu obě oči... pomalu."

#: game/combatai.msg:12485
msgid "I'm blind! Help! I'm blind!"
msgstr "Nic nevidím! Pomóc! Nic nevidím!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12486
msgid "Can't see... head spinning..."
msgstr "Nic nevidím... točí se mi hlava..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12488
msgid "Can't see a fucking thing! Where are you?! I'll kill you!"
msgstr "Nic nevidím kurva! Kde jsi?! Já tě zabiju!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12489
msgid "*Hrrkkkk*"
msgstr "*Hrrkkkk*"

#: game/combatai.msg:12490
msgid "*Uhhhnnnnnn*...need... to... lie... down..."
msgstr "*Uhhhnnnnnn*... potřebuju... si... na chvíli... odpočinout..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12491
msgid "I'm... gonna cut you... you for hitting my balls..."
msgstr "Za to tě rozsekám... já ti dám... trefit mě do koulí..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12492
msgid "*Hrkkkk*..."
msgstr "*Hrkkkk*..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12493
msgid "My balls! My fucking balls!"
msgstr "Moje koule! Moje zasraný koule!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12494
msgid "Low blow, asshole..."
msgstr "To byla rána pod pás, kreténe..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12495
msgid "Below the belt! Son of a bitch...!"
msgstr "To bylo pod pás! Ty zkurvysyne...!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12496
msgid "I ain't gonna look down. I ain't gonna look down."
msgstr "Nebudu se dívat dolů. Nebudu se dívat dolů."

#: game/combatai.msg:12497
msgid "You wait. I'm gonna tell Tommy the Balls to come get you!"
msgstr "Počkej tady. Řeknu Tommymu Tvrďákovi, aby tě přišel zmlátit!"

#: game/combatai.msg:12498
msgid "Ain't been hurt that bad since that whore clocked me..."
msgstr "Takovou bolest jsem nezažil od tý doby, co jsem tam dostal pěstí od tý kurvy..."

#: game/combatai.msg:12499
msgid "*Unnfffff*...I think my balls... are... in... my... stomach..."
msgstr "*Unnfffff*... mám pocit... že mám koule... až... v žaludku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:14000
msgid "Get him Zomak!"
msgstr "Na něj, Zomaku!"

#: game/combatai.msg:14003
msgid "You humans always act this way."
msgstr "Vy lidi jste všichni stejní."

#: game/combatai.msg:14004
msgid "Is this the only way you can deal with the unknown?"
msgstr "Copak si neumíš poradit s neznámými věcmi i jiným způsobem?"

#: game/combatai.msg:14005
msgid "Simple answers for simple minds."
msgstr "Jednoduché odpovědi pro jednoduché mysli."

#: game/combatai.msg:14006
msgid "I can't believe that you're acting this way."
msgstr "Nemůžu uvěřit, že se takhle chováš."

#: game/combatai.msg:14007
msgid "Shoo! Go away!"
msgstr "Kšá! Jdi pryč!"

#: game/combatai.msg:14008
msgid "I should have known better than to talk to a human."
msgstr "To mám z toho, že se bavím s lidma."

#: game/combatai.msg:14009
msgid "Must you destroy everything you don't understand?"
msgstr "Musíš zničit všechno, čemu nerozumíš?"

#: game/combatai.msg:14020
msgid "This is going to hurt me more than you."
msgstr "Tohle tě bude bolet mnohem víc než mě."

#: game/combatai.msg:14021
msgid "I don't like having to do this."
msgstr "Nechce se mi do toho."

#: game/combatai.msg:14022
msgid "Normally, I eschew violence, but in your case, I'll make an exception."
msgstr "Obvykle se násilí vyhýbám, ale v tvém případě udělám výjimku."

#: game/combatai.msg:14023
msgid "I'm really going to have to floss after this."
msgstr "Budu si pak muset pořádně vyčistit zuby."

#: game/combatai.msg:14024
msgid "You don't even *smell* good."
msgstr "Ani *nevoníš* nijak vábně."

#: game/combatai.msg:14025
msgid "This is going to make such a mess."
msgstr "To bude ale nepořádek."

#: game/combatai.msg:14026
msgid "You've pressed me too far this time."
msgstr "Donutil jsi mě k tomu, člověku."

#: game/combatai.msg:14027
msgid "Too bad, I almost liked you."
msgstr "Škoda, skoro jsem tě měl rád."

#: game/combatai.msg:14028
msgid "Now you'll have to die."
msgstr "A teď musíš zemřít."

#: game/combatai.msg:14029
msgid "I was so hoping that it wouldn't come to this."
msgstr "Doufal jsem, že k tomu nedojde."

#: game/combatai.msg:14040
msgid "Have at you then."
msgstr "A mám tě."

#: game/combatai.msg:14041
msgid "Touche!"
msgstr "Touche!"

#: game/combatai.msg:14042
msgid "En Garde!"
msgstr "En Garde!"

#: game/combatai.msg:14043
msgid "Hai-Kee-Baaa!"
msgstr "Haj-Kí-Bááá!"

#: game/combatai.msg:14044
msgid "I shall have you!"
msgstr "Dostanu tě!"

#: game/combatai.msg:14045
msgid "Put up your dukes."
msgstr "Vzdej to."

#: game/combatai.msg:14046
msgid "Uh, draw, Pilgrim-that's how you say it isn't it?"
msgstr "Eh, tas, poutníku... tak se to říká, ne?"

#: game/combatai.msg:14047
msgid "Hai-Yah!"
msgstr "Haj-jáá!"

#: game/combatai.msg:14048
msgid "This hardly feels sporting."
msgstr "Tohle mě vůbec nebaví."

#: game/combatai.msg:14049
msgid "Leave the earthman to me! Always wanted to say that."
msgstr "Nechte mi toho pozemšťana! Tohle jsem chtěl vždycky říct."

#: game/combatai.msg:14060
msgid "Hah, you clumsy biped!"
msgstr "Haha, ty neschopný dvojnožče!"

#: game/combatai.msg:14061
msgid "Off balance again!"
msgstr "Chybí ti obratnost!"

#: game/combatai.msg:14063
msgid "This is not a charade!"
msgstr "Tohle není žádná šaráda!"

#: game/combatai.msg:14064
msgid "What? You again?"
msgstr "Co? Zase ty?"

#: game/combatai.msg:14065
msgid "Were you really trying? How sad."
msgstr "Snažíš se vůbec? To je smutné."

#: game/combatai.msg:14066
msgid "It meant so much to you to hit me didn't it?"
msgstr "Chceš se do mě opravdu hrozně moc trefit, že?"

#: game/combatai.msg:14067
msgid "Faster that you thought huh?"
msgstr "Jsem rychlejší než si myslíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:14068
msgid "Not bad for an old rodent huh?"
msgstr "Na starou krysu to nebylo špatné, že?"

#: game/combatai.msg:14069
msgid "Try using the *other* end."
msgstr "Zkus použít ten *druhý* konec."

#: game/combatai.msg:18000
msgid "Not the face..."
msgstr "Do obličeje ne..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18001 game/combatai.msg:18010
msgid "Nffff"
msgstr "Nffff"

#: game/combatai.msg:18002
msgid "Good thing my brains are already shot..."
msgstr "Ještě že můj mozek už poškodit nemůžeš..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18020
msgid "Nffff "
msgstr "Nffff "

#: game/combatai.msg:18021
msgid "Ernhhh "
msgstr "Ernhhh "

#: game/combatai.msg:18030
msgid "Oooof"
msgstr "Uuuuuf"

#: game/combatai.msg:18034
msgid "Should kept my hand up..."
msgstr "Zapomněl jsem se krýt..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18035
msgid "No pain, no pain..."
msgstr "Žádná bolest, žádná bolest..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18061 game/combatai.msg:18071
msgid "You leg-hitting bitch..."
msgstr "Přestaň mě mlátit do nohy, ty svině..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18080
msgid "Aiming for the eyes, huh?"
msgstr "Míříš na oči, jo?"

#: game/combatai.msg:18082
msgid "There goes the eye of the tiger..."
msgstr "Tak a je po tygřím oku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18091
msgid "I knew I should have worn my cup."
msgstr "Měl jsem si vzít suspenzor."

#: game/combatai.msg:18092
msgid "You'll pay for that, you groin-kicking bitch!"
msgstr "Za to zaplatíš, ty děvko!"

#: game/combatai.msg:18103
msgid "Better go practice some more..."
msgstr "Půjdu ještě potrénovat..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18104
msgid "I knew I should have taken more buffout..."
msgstr "Měl jsem si vzít víc Buffoutu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18105
msgid "Let me go get some Psycho, and I'll be back."
msgstr "Jenom si dojdu pro Psycho a hned jsem zpátky."

#: game/combatai.msg:18106
msgid "Time to get outta here."
msgstr "Je načase odsud vypadnout."

#: game/combatai.msg:18107
msgid "Maybe I can go find some easier fight somewhere else."
msgstr "Půjdu si najít lehčího soupeře."

#: game/combatai.msg:18122
msgid "Time to make you a bitch..."
msgstr "Udělám si z tebe děvku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18123
msgid "Gonna beat you until you're ugly..."
msgstr "Zmlátím tě tak, že tě ani vlastní matka nepozná..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18124
msgid "Gonna make you ugly..."
msgstr "Rozmlátím ti hubu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18125
msgid "Time to get critical..."
msgstr "Už se s tebou nebudu mazat..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18126
msgid "Gonna take my time hurting you..."
msgstr "Budu tě mlátit pomalu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18152
msgid "SUPER... NUCLEAR... TORNADO... FIST... "
msgstr "SUPER... ATOMOVÁ... NIČÍCÍ... PĚST... "

#: game/combatai.msg:18153
msgid "I must break you. "
msgstr "Musím tě zlomit. "

#: game/combatai.msg:18161
msgid "Nothing but net."
msgstr "Vedle jak ta jedle."

#: game/combatai.msg:18162
msgid "I hit like a butterfly... you hit like my grandmother."
msgstr "Já mlátím jak mlátička... ty mlátíš jak babička."

#: game/combatai.msg:18163
msgid "Trash like you couldn't hit the broad side of a barn."
msgstr "Takovej tupec jako ty by netrefil ani vrata od stodoly."

#: game/combatai.msg:18164
msgid "Ha! If you tried to hit the air, you'd miss."
msgstr "Ha! Nebij do vzduchu, bij do mě."

#: game/combatai.msg:18165
msgid "Looks like we got a blindman here..."
msgstr "Zdá se, že je tu někdo slepej..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18166 game/combatai.msg:42162
msgid "You got nothing!"
msgstr "Vedle!"

#: game/combatai.msg:18167
msgid "You must be seeing double..."
msgstr "Nejspíš vidíš dvojitě..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18168
msgid "Last chance you're gonna have..."
msgstr "To byla tvoje poslední šance..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18169
msgid "You're fighting like a bum! "
msgstr "Biješ se jak břídil! "

#: game/combatai.msg:18173
msgid "What, you seein' three o' me?"
msgstr "Ty mě vidíš trojitě nebo co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:18174
msgid "That all you got?"
msgstr "To bylo všechno?"

#: game/combatai.msg:18175
msgid "If that's all you got, this is gonna be a short fight."
msgstr "Jestli tohle byla tvoje nejlepší rána, tak to bude krátkej boj."

#: game/combatai.msg:18176
msgid "Weak..."
msgstr "Slabý..."

#: game/combatai.msg:18177
msgid "Slow..."
msgstr "Pomalý..."

#: game/combatai.msg:32642
msgid "... something for your father..."
msgstr "...za tatínka..."

#: game/combatai.msg:32643
msgid "... something for your sister..."
msgstr "...za sestřičku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:32722
msgid "By Hubbell! My arm!"
msgstr "U Hubbella! Moje ruka!"

#: game/combatai.msg:32805
msgid "AHS-9! Help us!"
msgstr "AHS-9! Pomoz nám!"

#: game/combatai.msg:32824
msgid "Hubbell will smite you!"
msgstr "Hubbell tě rozdrtí!"

#: game/combatai.msg:32842
msgid "For Hubbell!"
msgstr "Za Hubbella!"

#: game/combatai.msg:32844
msgid "For AHS-9!"
msgstr "Za AHS-9!"

#: game/combatai.msg:32847
msgid "This is for AHS-9!"
msgstr "Tohle je za AHS-9!"

#: game/combatai.msg:33003
msgid "Don't kill me! I'm AHS-9!"
msgstr "Nezabíjej mě! Já jsem AHS-9!"

#: game/combatai.msg:33042
msgid "In the name of Hubbell!"
msgstr "Ve jménu Hubbella!"

#: game/combatai.msg:33044
msgid "Feel the wrath of Hubbell!"
msgstr "Pociť hněv Hubbella!"

#: game/combatai.msg:33061
msgid "Hubbell protects me!"
msgstr "Hubbell mě chrání!"

#: game/combatai.msg:33123
msgid "If AHS-9 says you're bad, you must be bad."
msgstr "Když AHS-9 říká, že jsi špatný, musíš být špatný."

#: game/combatai.msg:33124
msgid "For ... um... the glory of Hubbell!"
msgstr "Za... eh... slávu Hubbella!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36011
msgid "Ow! Good thing I'm right handed."
msgstr "Au! Ještě, že jsem pravák!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36035
msgid "Good shot. My turn."
msgstr "Dobrá rána. Teď já."

#: game/combatai.msg:36090
msgid "Oooooo, time out, I have to pick something up."
msgstr "Ooooo! Přestávka, musím si něco zvednout."

#: game/combatai.msg:36223
msgid "Surrender and I'll make your death quick!"
msgstr "Vzdej se a dopřeju ti rychlou smrt!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36320
msgid "Kaga and the Chosen One meet again."
msgstr "Kaga a Vyvolený se opět setkávají."

#: game/combatai.msg:36345
msgid "Hope you don't die as quick as the others."
msgstr "Doufám, že nezemřeš tak rychle jako ostatní!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36423
msgid "Let Kaga teach you new skills he has learned!"
msgstr "Kaga tě naučí nové triky, které se naučil!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36522
msgid "Kaga will send you to your next life!"
msgstr "Kaga tě pošle do dalšího života!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36542
msgid "I'm gonna enjoy this."
msgstr "To si vychutnám!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36546
msgid "Kaga has to kill you now!"
msgstr "Kaga tě teď musí zabít!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36637
msgid "Grrr! You anger me!"
msgstr "Grrr! Začínáš mě štvát!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36643
msgid "Grrr! I look forward to your death!"
msgstr "Grr! Už se těším na tvoji smrt."

#: game/combatai.msg:36694
msgid "I will hurt you for many hours!"
msgstr "Budu ti ubližovat dlouho!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36745
msgid "Now you die a screaming death!"
msgstr "A teď chcípneš bolestivou smrtí!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36800
msgid "Now I know why you're wanted!"
msgstr "Teď už vím proč je na tebe vypsaná odměna!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36802
msgid "This isn't the last you'll see of me."
msgstr "Ještě se uvidíme."

#: game/combatai.msg:36803
msgid "The good guys are supposed to win?"
msgstr "Dobráci by snad měli vyhrát ne?"

#: game/combatai.msg:36804
msgid "Why don't we talk about this?"
msgstr "Co kdybysme si promluvili?"

#: game/combatai.msg:36805
msgid "Mom was right. A person can get killed doing this."
msgstr "Máma měla pravdu. Při týhle práci můžu přijít o život."

#: game/combatai.msg:36806
msgid "I think I'll take up pig farming."
msgstr "Asi začnu farmařit."

#: game/combatai.msg:36807
msgid "The reward isn't worth dying for!"
msgstr "Ta odměna za to nestojí!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36808
msgid "Please let me go!"
msgstr "Prosím, nech mě být!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36810
msgid "Don't kill me, I have a family!"
msgstr "Nezabíjej mě, mám rodinu!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36811
msgid "Can't spend the reward money if I'm dead!"
msgstr "Mrtvýmu mi ta odměna bude na nic!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36812
msgid "You are a ruthless killer!"
msgstr "Jsi bezcitný vrah!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36813
msgid "Damn! I already spent my share of the reward money."
msgstr "Zatraceně! Už se mi podařilo utratit všechny prachy za tvoji odměnu."

#: game/combatai.msg:36814
msgid "It can't end like this."
msgstr "Takhle to přece nemůže skončit."

#: game/combatai.msg:36816
msgid "I'm supposed to be hunting you!"
msgstr "Mám přece lovit já tebe!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36817
msgid "I have money. Let me go and it's yours."
msgstr "Mám peníze. Nech mě být a jsou tvoje."

#: game/combatai.msg:36818
msgid "Hell has just frozen over."
msgstr "Právě zamrzlo peklo."

#: game/combatai.msg:36819
msgid "Damn you're good!"
msgstr "Sakra, umíš to!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36820
msgid "Do you know how long I've been searching for you?"
msgstr "Víš jak dlouho po tobě pátrám?"

#: game/combatai.msg:36821
msgid "You're wanted DEAD."
msgstr "Odměna je za tvoji MRTVOLU."

#: game/combatai.msg:36822
msgid "Surrender and I'll kill you quickly."
msgstr "Vzdej se a zabiju tě rychle."

#: game/combatai.msg:36823
msgid "I've been tracking you for days."
msgstr "Stopuju tě už několik dní."

#: game/combatai.msg:36824
msgid "I could sure use that reward money."
msgstr "Ta odměna by se mi hodila."

#: game/combatai.msg:36825
msgid "I'm gonna tear your heart out!"
msgstr "Vyrvu ti srdce!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36826
msgid "Your head is worth quite a bit."
msgstr "Tvoje hlava má slušnou cenu."

#: game/combatai.msg:36827
msgid "I'm gonna enjoy killing a bastard like you!"
msgstr "Bude mi potěšením zabít takovýho bastarda, jako jsi ty!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36828
msgid "Did you think you'd get away with killing the innocent?"
msgstr "Snad si nemyslíš, že ti zabíjení nevinných projde?"

#: game/combatai.msg:36829
msgid "Scum like you deserve to die."
msgstr "Odpad jako ty si zaslouží zemřít."

#: game/combatai.msg:36830 game/combatai.msg:36858
msgid "Prepare to die!"
msgstr "Připrav se zemřít!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36831
msgid "I'm gonna send you straight to hell!"
msgstr "Pošlu tě přímo do pekla!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36832
msgid "There's quite a reward on your head."
msgstr "Za tvoji hlavu je slušná odměna."

#: game/combatai.msg:36833
msgid "Don't take this personally, but I'm gonna kill you now."
msgstr "Neber si to osobně, ale teď tě zabiju."

#: game/combatai.msg:36834
msgid "Another day another murderer."
msgstr "Další den, další vrah."

#: game/combatai.msg:36835
msgid "You have to pay for your crimes."
msgstr "Musíš zaplatit za své zločiny."

#: game/combatai.msg:36836
msgid "I hear you like to kill innocent people."
msgstr "Prý rád zabíjíš nevinné lidi."

#: game/combatai.msg:36837
msgid "Let's see how good you really are."
msgstr "Tak se podíváme, co umíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:36838
msgid "A life for a life. That's how it works around here."
msgstr "Oko za oko, zub za zub. Tak to chodí."

#: game/combatai.msg:36839
msgid "Did you know you're worth more dead than alive?"
msgstr "Víš, že máš větší cenu jako mrtvola?"

#: game/combatai.msg:36840
msgid "Killing ain't so easy when your opponent shoots back."
msgstr "Zabíjení není tak jednoduchý, když se protivník brání, co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:36841
msgid "Try this on for size."
msgstr "Co si myslíš o tomhle?"

#: game/combatai.msg:36842
msgid "I just need your head, you can keep the rest."
msgstr "Stačí mi jen tvoje hlava, zbytek si klidně nech."

#: game/combatai.msg:36843
msgid "Not so fun when you're doing the dying is it?"
msgstr "Není to taková sranda, když chcípeš ty, co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:36844
msgid "The reward is as good as mine."
msgstr "Odměna je moje."

#: game/combatai.msg:36845
msgid "You're not so tough."
msgstr "Nejsi takovej tvrďák."

#: game/combatai.msg:36846
msgid "This is gonna hurt you more than it does me."
msgstr "Bude tě to bolet mnohem víc než mě."

#: game/combatai.msg:36847
msgid "I love my job."
msgstr "Miluju svou práci."

#: game/combatai.msg:36848
msgid "I think it's fate meeting like this."
msgstr "Myslím, že nás k sobě přivedl osud."

#: game/combatai.msg:36849
msgid "I wanna see what the inside of you looks like."
msgstr "Chci se podívat, jak to uvnitř tebe vypadá."

#: game/combatai.msg:36850
msgid "Your mommy ain't here to save you."
msgstr "Tvoje maminka tě nezachrání."

#: game/combatai.msg:36851
msgid "Here's a gift from the people you murdered."
msgstr "Tady máš dárek od lidí, který máš na svědomí."

#: game/combatai.msg:36852
msgid "Do you feel lucky?"
msgstr "Je dneska tvůj šťastnej den?"

#: game/combatai.msg:36853
msgid "Catch!"
msgstr "Chytej!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36856
msgid "You'd better start praying."
msgstr "Začni se modlit."

#: game/combatai.msg:36857
msgid "I'm sorry I have to do this. Just kidding."
msgstr "Je mi líto, že tě musím zabít... dělám si srandu."

#: game/combatai.msg:36859
msgid "I hope you made out a will."
msgstr "Doufám, že máš sepsanou poslední vůli."

#: game/combatai.msg:36860
msgid "Whoa! Be careful with that you might hurt someone."
msgstr "Hej! Dávej pozor, ještě s tím někoho zraníš."

#: game/combatai.msg:36861
msgid "Hey now! That almost hit me!"
msgstr "Hej! To mě skoro trefilo!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36862
msgid "Would it help if I painted a target on myself?"
msgstr "Pomohlo by ti, kdybych na sebe nakreslil terč?"

#: game/combatai.msg:36863 game/combatai.msg:70562
msgid "Not even close."
msgstr "Vedle jak ta jedle."

#: game/combatai.msg:36864
msgid "Excuse me, were you aiming at me?"
msgstr "Promiň, ale ta rána byla mířená na mě?"

#: game/combatai.msg:36865
msgid "That rock you hit wasn't even armed."
msgstr "Ten kámen, co to dostal, nebyl ani ozbrojenej."

#: game/combatai.msg:36866
msgid "I hope that wasn't your best shot."
msgstr "Doufám, že tohle nebyla tvoje nejlepší rána."

#: game/combatai.msg:36867
msgid "This is going to be easier than I thought."
msgstr "Bude to lehčí, než jsem si myslel."

#: game/combatai.msg:36868
msgid "You better put that thing down before you hurt yourself."
msgstr "Radši to polož, než si ublížíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:36869
msgid "Ha! You missed me!"
msgstr "Ha! Vedle!"

#: game/combatai.msg:36870
msgid "Close, but not close enough."
msgstr "Blízko, ale pořád moc daleko."

#: game/combatai.msg:36871
msgid "You should try aiming next time."
msgstr "Příště zkus mířit."

#: game/combatai.msg:36872
msgid "My mother's a better shot than you."
msgstr "Moje máma má lepší mušku než ty."

#: game/combatai.msg:36873
msgid "Your hands must be shaking pretty hard for you to miss."
msgstr "Musej se ti asi pořádně třást ruce, když se nedokážeš trefit, že?"

#: game/combatai.msg:36874
msgid "Now that was a wild shot."
msgstr "To byla asi rána od boku."

#: game/combatai.msg:36876
msgid "Looks like you need more practice."
msgstr "Potřebuješ víc trénovat."

#: game/combatai.msg:36877
msgid "Now that was a fatal mistake."
msgstr "To byla fatální chyba."

#: game/combatai.msg:36878
msgid "Either I'm lucky or you're a bad shot."
msgstr "Buď mám štěstí, nebo neumíš střílet."

#: game/combatai.msg:36879
msgid "The safest spot to be is right in front of you."
msgstr "Nejbezpečnější místo je přímo před tebou."

#: game/combatai.msg:40000
msgid "Spirits want out of skull, oh mahn de skull hurt!"
msgstr "Duchové chtíti ven z lebky, ou hlava bolí!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40001
msgid "De dark come early now."
msgstr "Tma nějak brzo přicházeti."

#: game/combatai.msg:40002
msgid "Pretty scar on me face now."
msgstr "Hezká jizva teď na mým ksichtu."

#: game/combatai.msg:40003
msgid "That almost broke Grampy-bone."
msgstr "To skoro zlomilo Dědek Kostěj."

#: game/combatai.msg:40004
msgid "Hah, Grampy-bone stop most of blow!"
msgstr "Haha, Dědek Kostěj zastavit skoro celou ránu!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40005
msgid "Sulik not need de teeth."
msgstr "Sulik nepotřebovat zuba."

#: game/combatai.msg:40006
msgid "Sulik still have one ear to hear de pain!"
msgstr "Sulik ještě jedno ucho míti, aby slyšela bolest!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40007
msgid "Grampy-bone fall out, must find de Grampy!"
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj upadnout, muset najít Dědek!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40008
msgid "Can you hear de spirit-bells ringing?"
msgstr "Slyšeti zvonění ducha taky?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40009
msgid "You see de bright night-stars too?"
msgstr "Ty vidět zářící hvězdičky taky?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40010
msgid "Me bone so white."
msgstr "Moje kost tak bílá."

#: game/combatai.msg:40011
msgid "Still de weapon can be used."
msgstr "Pořád moct používat zbraň."

#: game/combatai.msg:40012
msgid "One arm is extra for de man."
msgstr "Jedna ruka pro muž stačiti."

#: game/combatai.msg:40013
msgid "Unngg."
msgstr "Unngg."

#: game/combatai.msg:40014
msgid "That not hurt... much."
msgstr "To nebolet... moc."

#: game/combatai.msg:40015
msgid "Sulik, be thinkin' that you not want to hurt him."
msgstr "Sulik, on mysleti, že ty ho nechtít zranit."

#: game/combatai.msg:40016
msgid "Sulik now be takin' de turn."
msgstr "Sulik teď býti na řada."

#: game/combatai.msg:40017
msgid "Now we see how you and we like dat."
msgstr "Teď já a my uvidět, jak tobě se to líbit."

#: game/combatai.msg:40018
msgid "Sulik not need all de fingas."
msgstr "Sulik nepotřebovat všechny prsta."

#: game/combatai.msg:40019
msgid "Big de scar on me arm."
msgstr "Velká jizva na má ruka."

#: game/combatai.msg:40020
msgid "Now we be takin' your arm too."
msgstr "A teď my urvati tvoje ruka."

#: game/combatai.msg:40021
msgid "Tiny rat-brother be hittin' me harder."
msgstr "Malá bratšíček od krysa mě ubližovati víc."

#: game/combatai.msg:40022
msgid "Sulik wonder, is mosquito season now?"
msgstr "Sulik on zvědavá, komáři lítat?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40023
msgid "We not feel de pain... yet."
msgstr "My necítila bolest... zatím."

#: game/combatai.msg:40024
msgid "Uh oh. Sulik not feel de fingers."
msgstr "Oou. Sulik necítit prsta."

#: game/combatai.msg:40025
msgid "Grampy-bone tell de we to be strong."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj on říkati my muset být silní."

#: game/combatai.msg:40026
msgid "Go home and not hit us in de arm again!"
msgstr "Jít domů a netrefit nás do ruka znovu!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40027
msgid "Your heart be not in de fight!"
msgstr "Ty nebojovati se srdce!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40028
msgid "You hurt de arm dat we roll with."
msgstr "Ty poraniti ruka, kterou my používat."

#: game/combatai.msg:40029
msgid "We only need de one arm for you."
msgstr "My potřebovat jenom jedna ruka na teba."

#: game/combatai.msg:40031
msgid "De air not come so easy now."
msgstr "Vzduch teď špatně do břicha jít."

#: game/combatai.msg:40032
msgid "We feel warm and sleepy now."
msgstr "My cítiti unavená a ospalá."

#: game/combatai.msg:40033
msgid "We share too much blood now."
msgstr "My teď sdílet moc moc krva."

#: game/combatai.msg:40034
msgid "Grampy-bone show us de way!"
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj ukázat nám cesta!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40035
msgid "We and I not killed so easy."
msgstr "My a já ne tak lehcí k zabití."

#: game/combatai.msg:40036
msgid "We not feel any pain from that."
msgstr "Necítíme žádná bolest z tý rány."

#: game/combatai.msg:40037
msgid "De spirits make us strong."
msgstr "Duchové oni dělati nás silná."

#: game/combatai.msg:40038
msgid "You not hurt de inner heart dat way."
msgstr "Ty nezranit srdce takhle."

#: game/combatai.msg:40039
msgid "Sulik have too much blood anyway."
msgstr "Sulik mít stejně moc krve."

#: game/combatai.msg:40040
msgid "We think you not at peace wit us."
msgstr "My myslet ty nebýt s my mír."

#: game/combatai.msg:40041
msgid "De legs, day feel like day be gone."
msgstr "Nóhy, oni jako by ani nebyly."

#: game/combatai.msg:40042
msgid "Hard to breath for us as if we be takin' de dragon-hit."
msgstr "Těžko dýchat nám, jako kdyby my kouřiti vodnice."

#: game/combatai.msg:40043
msgid "We think dis not so good."
msgstr "My mysleti toto moc nedobré."

#: game/combatai.msg:40044
msgid "Grampy-bone say this what insides look like."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj říkat toto vypadat jako vnitřek člověka."

#: game/combatai.msg:40045
msgid "De lizard-bro' dat we eat before, wants out now."
msgstr "Jěšterák my jedli na snídaně, on chtít teď ven."

#: game/combatai.msg:40046
msgid "We like de insides just de way day are man!"
msgstr "Nám líbiti se vnitřnosti na správným místě!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40047
msgid "We never get used to dis part."
msgstr "Na to my si nikdy nezvyknout."

#: game/combatai.msg:40048
msgid "Grampy-bone say de spirits don't want us yet."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj říkat, že duchové, oni nás zatím nechtít."

#: game/combatai.msg:40049
msgid "You do de bad ting to us."
msgstr "Ty dělat špatná věc nám."

#: game/combatai.msg:40050
msgid "We and I had de bad tings happen to us."
msgstr "My a já zažít horší věc."

#: game/combatai.msg:40051
msgid "We not want de red, red wine come out."
msgstr "My nechtět, aby červená jít z nás."

#: game/combatai.msg:40052
msgid "You hurt us, we be hurtin' you back."
msgstr "Ty zranila nás, my vrátiti zpět."

#: game/combatai.msg:40053
msgid "Aiiiiiieeeeee!"
msgstr "Jaůůůůůůůůůůůů!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40054
msgid "Shing-ding-ding!"
msgstr "Břink-cink-cink!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40055
msgid "De dark-spirit ride on our shoulder."
msgstr "Duch temnoty sedět na rameně našem."

#: game/combatai.msg:40056
msgid "De sky so bright now."
msgstr "Obloha tak jasné nyní."

#: game/combatai.msg:40057
msgid "Grampy-bone not be lettin' us die."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj nás nenechati umřít."

#: game/combatai.msg:40058
msgid "We not be feelin' so mellow."
msgstr "My cítiti nějak divně."

#: game/combatai.msg:40059
msgid "We and I have de hole goin' true de middle."
msgstr "My a já mít díru uprostřed břich."

#: game/combatai.msg:40060
msgid "We not be doin' de spirit dance now."
msgstr "My už teď neudělati tanec ducha."

#: game/combatai.msg:40061
msgid "Oh man, you tear off de toe."
msgstr "Ty utrhnout Sulik prst na noze."

#: game/combatai.msg:40062
msgid "De foot burn us now."
msgstr "Noha nás pálet."

#: game/combatai.msg:40063
msgid "We kick rock, hurt us more dan you."
msgstr "Když my zakopnout, bolet to víc než od ty."

#: game/combatai.msg:40064
msgid "We only be needin' de one leg to kill you, man."
msgstr "My potřebovati jen jedná noha, aby mohli zavraždit teba, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40065
msgid "We not need to be workin' now."
msgstr "My teď nepotřebovat pracovati."

#: game/combatai.msg:40066
msgid "We see how you be likin' de limp."
msgstr "My uviděti brzo, jak ty ráda máš kulhání."

#: game/combatai.msg:40067
msgid "Oh dat hurt us."
msgstr "Och, to boleti nás."

#: game/combatai.msg:40068
msgid "Aaaaiiiiieeeeeee!"
msgstr "Jaůůůůůůůůůůůů!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40069
msgid "We be needin' some serious herb now."
msgstr "My teď potřebovati silná bylinky."

#: game/combatai.msg:40070
msgid "We not be movin' and groovin' now, man."
msgstr "My teď nemoct poskakovati."

#: game/combatai.msg:40071
msgid "Where de herb when we need it?"
msgstr "Kde bylinky, když my potřebovat?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40072
msgid "You have to be hurtin' for dat one now."
msgstr "Ty za to muset býti zraněn teď."

#: game/combatai.msg:40073
msgid "Leg-bone white as Grampy-bone."
msgstr "Kost v noha stejně bílá jako Dědek Kostěj."

#: game/combatai.msg:40074
msgid "De leg be hurtin' us now."
msgstr "Noha ona boleti nás teď."

#: game/combatai.msg:40075
msgid "Dat not be nice to my leg."
msgstr "To nebýti hezká věca udělat moja noha."

#: game/combatai.msg:40076
msgid "Grampy-bone send de pains to your leg now."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj teď poslat bolest do tvoje noha."

#: game/combatai.msg:40077
msgid "We not be doin' the limbo man, can't get as low as we can."
msgstr "My nemoct hrát limbo. Nedostat tak nízko, jak by chtěla."

#: game/combatai.msg:40078
msgid "We want to be jumpin' man."
msgstr "My chtěla skákati, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40079
msgid "You want to be makin' our leg nice and smooth?"
msgstr "Ty chtěla nechati naši nohu na památku?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40080
msgid "It be dark now."
msgstr "Být tma teď."

#: game/combatai.msg:40081
msgid "We still hear you."
msgstr "My tě pořád slyšet."

#: game/combatai.msg:40082
msgid "Grampy-bone still see you."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj on pořád viděti tě."

#: game/combatai.msg:40083
msgid "You take eye, Sulik take life."
msgstr "Ty vzít oko, Sulik vzít život."

#: game/combatai.msg:40084
msgid "You punctured our eye. That be hurtin' us."
msgstr "Ty vypíchnout naša oka. To boleti nás."

#: game/combatai.msg:40085
msgid "Hah, you leave me de one eye still."
msgstr "Hehe, ty nechat já pořád jedno oka."

#: game/combatai.msg:40086
msgid "We still see you, in our mind."
msgstr "My pořád vidět ty v naší mysli."

#: game/combatai.msg:40087
msgid "We become more powerful than you can imagine now, man."
msgstr "Teď my mnohem silnější, než si ty dokázat představit, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40088
msgid "We be seein' clear for de first time now bro'."
msgstr "Teď my viděti líp než kdy předtíma, kámo."

#: game/combatai.msg:40089
msgid "Grampy-bone do de seein' for us now."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj, on viděti pro nás teď."

#: game/combatai.msg:40090
msgid "Unnh!."
msgstr "Unnh!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40091
msgid "We be livin' in de women's hut now."
msgstr "My teď žíti v ženská chatrč."

#: game/combatai.msg:40092
msgid "Aaiiiiiiiiieeeeeeee!"
msgstr "Jaůůůůůůůůůůůůůů!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40093
msgid "We not be needin' more kids anyhow."
msgstr "My a já už nepotřebovati víc děcka."

#: game/combatai.msg:40094
msgid "You not be makin' our wives happy wit dat."
msgstr "Naša ženy nebýti šťastná z toho teď."

#: game/combatai.msg:40095
msgid "We think you hit us here because you're small."
msgstr "My myslet ty trefit nás tady, pač ty malá."

#: game/combatai.msg:40096
msgid "You aim for our big target, man."
msgstr "Ty mířit na naša velká cíl, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40097
msgid "Grampy-bone say we cut you off and make de sandwich for you."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj on říká, my uříznout ti ho a udělat pro teba sendvič."

#: game/combatai.msg:40098
msgid "We need a little off de top anyway."
msgstr "My potřebovat trochu zkrátit stejně."

#: game/combatai.msg:40099
msgid "We and I need some more o' de herb now, man."
msgstr "My a já potřebovat teď trochu bylinka, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40100
msgid "Sulik come back with bigger weapon."
msgstr "Sulik vrátit se s větší zbraň."

#: game/combatai.msg:40101
msgid "Sulik's magic weak."
msgstr "Sulikova magia slabá."

#: game/combatai.msg:40102
msgid "Bad magic too strong."
msgstr "Zlá magia moc silná."

#: game/combatai.msg:40103
msgid "Ancestor warn Sulik to leave."
msgstr "Předkové varovat Sulik, aby odejít."

#: game/combatai.msg:40104
msgid "Sulik have urgent appointment elsewhere."
msgstr "Sulik mít důležitá schůzka někde jinde."

#: game/combatai.msg:40105
msgid "Sulik need to go now."
msgstr "Sulik musela jít hned."

#: game/combatai.msg:40106
msgid "Sulik need to bleed lizard now."
msgstr "Sulik potřebovala vyprázdnit hadice."

#: game/combatai.msg:40107
msgid "Sulik confuse enemy by leaving now."
msgstr "Sulik zmást nepřítele útěkem teď."

#: game/combatai.msg:40108
msgid "Sulik goes to get help."
msgstr "Sulik jít pro pomoc."

#: game/combatai.msg:40110
msgid "Sulik think this fight not worth it."
msgstr "Sulik myslet tenhle boj nemít cena."

#: game/combatai.msg:40111
msgid "Sulik have bad feeling about this."
msgstr "Sulik mít špatná pocit z toho."

#: game/combatai.msg:40112
msgid "Sulik come back later."
msgstr "Sulik vrátit pozdějc."

#: game/combatai.msg:40113
msgid "Sulik need to take little break."
msgstr "Sulik potřebovat malá pauza."

#: game/combatai.msg:40114
msgid "Sulik go watch rear for attack."
msgstr "Sulik hlídat, aby nikdo neutekla."

#: game/combatai.msg:40115
msgid "Sulik advance in reverse."
msgstr "Sulik postupovat vzad."

#: game/combatai.msg:40116
msgid "Sulik not afraid of men, but these are evil demons!"
msgstr "Sulik chlapů nebojet, ale toto oni zlá démon!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40117
msgid "Sulik not fight demons-who-walk-as-men."
msgstr "Sulik nebojovat zlá démona maskovaná jako chlap."

#: game/combatai.msg:40118
msgid "Sulik not have lucky Gecko-claw, must find."
msgstr "Sulik nemít šťastná geckon packa, muset najít."

#: game/combatai.msg:40119
msgid "Sulik forget something, be back soon."
msgstr "Sulik něco zapomnět, byla zpátky brzy."

#: game/combatai.msg:40120
msgid "Yah, man, can you feel de rhythm?"
msgstr "Jou, člověk, cítíš rytmuse?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40121
msgid "We got de power now!"
msgstr "My mít síla teď!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40122
msgid "We and I have de strong magic now."
msgstr "My a já mít teď silná magia."

#: game/combatai.msg:40123
msgid "Grampy-bone can taste your fear."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj cítit tvoje strach."

#: game/combatai.msg:40124
msgid "We be ready to eat of your heart."
msgstr "My a já sežrat tvoje srdce."

#: game/combatai.msg:40125
msgid "We be smellin' de fear on you, man."
msgstr "My cítiti tvoje strach, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40126
msgid "Sulik be singin' de battle-song."
msgstr "Sulik zpívati bojová písňa."

#: game/combatai.msg:40127
msgid "De spirits, day watchen' over us now."
msgstr "Duchové, oni teď hlídat nás."

#: game/combatai.msg:40128
msgid "We be watchin' you go down."
msgstr "My podívati, jak ty padnout na zem."

#: game/combatai.msg:40129
msgid "You be takin' de long walk, man."
msgstr "Tebe čekati dlouhá cesta, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40130
msgid "De old-bones be eatin' your soul soon."
msgstr "Staré kosti sežrati tvoje duch brzo."

#: game/combatai.msg:40131
msgid "We be havin' de seven-demon bags!"
msgstr "My budem míti pytla sedm démon!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40132
msgid "Come to us now, man."
msgstr "Pojďa k nám, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40133
msgid "We be crushin' you into de jelly now."
msgstr "My a já namačkati tebe do dželé."

#: game/combatai.msg:40134
msgid "We be breakin' you up."
msgstr "My a já rozlámati tě na kousíčka."

#: game/combatai.msg:40135
msgid "We bring de pain to you and yours."
msgstr "My přinášet tebe moc bolest."

#: game/combatai.msg:40136
msgid "De pain come on you now, man."
msgstr "Bolest přicházeti pro ty, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40137
msgid "We be shooing you away now, man."
msgstr "My teď odstřeliti tebe, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40138
msgid "You best be runnin'."
msgstr "Ty radši utíkati."

#: game/combatai.msg:40139
msgid "We be ready to take a few heads now, man."
msgstr "My připravená získat pár hlava teď, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40140
msgid "We be crushin' you."
msgstr "My rozdrtiti tebe."

#: game/combatai.msg:40141
msgid "Grampy say we must be killin' now!"
msgstr "Dědek říkat my muset zabíjeti teď!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40142
msgid "Grampy be lovin' de sound o' bone crunchin', man."
msgstr "Dědek milovati zvuk, když kosti křupat, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40143
msgid "Grampy-bone be helpin' me now!"
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj mi pomáhati teď!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40144
msgid "The spirits be helpin' me now!"
msgstr "Duchové, oni mi pomáhati teď!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40145
msgid "You and me be watchin' all de blood fly now."
msgstr "Ty a já, my brzo dívati na krvotrysk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40146
msgid "We make de friend for Grampy-bone out of your bones!"
msgstr "My udělat Děděk Kostěj kamarád z tvoja kosti!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40147
msgid "Grampy-bone be tellin' us to do de killin' dis time."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj říkati my tentokrát zabíjet."

#: game/combatai.msg:40148
msgid "We be startin' to do de hurt-dance."
msgstr "My začínati dělat tanec bolesti."

#: game/combatai.msg:40149
msgid "We be startin' de bad dance on de enemy-head now, man."
msgstr "My začínati tančit na hlava nepřítel, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40150
msgid "We be lettin' de bad hatred out to play."
msgstr "My vypustit zlá nenávist teď."

#: game/combatai.msg:40151
msgid "Grampy be wonderin' what color de bad-blood is."
msgstr "Dědek zajímá, jakou barvu mít zlá krev."

#: game/combatai.msg:40152
msgid "U-Suthuuuuu!"
msgstr "U-Suthuuuuu!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40153
msgid "We be washin' de spear in your blood."
msgstr "My umejeme oštěp v tvoje krev."

#: game/combatai.msg:40154
msgid "We be wantin' de fresh meat, we be glad you here."
msgstr "My dostati chuťa na čerstvá maso, my rádi ty tady."

#: game/combatai.msg:40155
msgid "You want next dance wit Grampy and us?"
msgstr "Ty chtít taneček s my a Dědek Kostěj?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40156
msgid "We be here to dance."
msgstr "My tu chtít tancovala."

#: game/combatai.msg:40157
msgid "We do be ready to do da hurtin'."
msgstr "My připravená dělati bolest."

#: game/combatai.msg:40158
msgid "We be gettin' a taste for your blood now."
msgstr "My dostati chuťa na tvoje krev teď."

#: game/combatai.msg:40159
msgid "Grampy-bone be tellin' us to kill and den be killin' again."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj říkati my musela zabíjet a zase zabíjet."

#: game/combatai.msg:40160
msgid "We be havin' de stronger magic."
msgstr "My míti víc silná magia."

#: game/combatai.msg:40161
msgid "We be safe from de-man here."
msgstr "My bezpečná od člověk tady."

#: game/combatai.msg:40162
msgid "Sulik have strong magic."
msgstr "Sulik silná magia má."

#: game/combatai.msg:40163
msgid "We have de best magic."
msgstr "My mít nejlepší magia!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40164
msgid "You not be hittin' us."
msgstr "Ty netrefiti nás."

#: game/combatai.msg:40165
msgid "Grampy-bone make you miss."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj on udělala ty netrefit."

#: game/combatai.msg:40166
msgid "You attack like de little girl."
msgstr "Ty útočit jako malé holka."

#: game/combatai.msg:40167
msgid "You be attackin' us or some spirits near us?"
msgstr "Ty útočiti na nás nebo na ducha vedle my?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40168
msgid "You be aimin' at us? Really?"
msgstr "Ty mířiti na nás? Fakt?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40169
msgid "You be needin' more o' de sacred herb, man."
msgstr "Ty potřebovati víc svatá bylinka, člověk."

#: game/combatai.msg:40170
msgid "We make de happy at you for missin' us."
msgstr "My šťastná ty netrefit nás."

#: game/combatai.msg:40171
msgid "You be confused about what you're doin'?"
msgstr "Ty zmatená z toho, co ty dělat?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40172
msgid "You best be practicin'."
msgstr "Ty radši trénovati."

#: game/combatai.msg:40173
msgid "We be wonderin' what that was?"
msgstr "My zajímati, co to být?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40174
msgid "You make us laugh."
msgstr "My musela smát ty."

#: game/combatai.msg:40175
msgid "We tink you should go back to huntin' de mice until you be knowin' more."
msgstr "My myslet ty radši myši chytat, až ty věděti víc."

#: game/combatai.msg:40176
msgid "Grampy-bone wonder why de bad-ones so stupid."
msgstr "Dědek Kostěj zajímat, proč zlá lidi tak blbá."

#: game/combatai.msg:40178
msgid "We be wonderin' if you be wantin' to start over."
msgstr "My zajímati, jestli ty zkusiti od začátek."

#: game/combatai.msg:40179
msgid "We tink you must be dumber than you be lookin', but Grampy-bone not be thinkin' that possible."
msgstr "My myslet ty blbějšá než vypadati, ale Dědek Kostěj mysleti to nebýt možno."

#: game/combatai.msg:40800 game/combatai.msg:40896
msgid "*Nffff*"
msgstr "*Nffff*"

#: game/combatai.msg:40801
msgid "*Hrkkk*...Gotta... head wound... here..."
msgstr "*Hrkkk*... dostal... jsem to... do hlavy..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40802
msgid "*Nfff* Nearly... took...*nfff*...my head clean off..."
msgstr "*Nfff* Skoro... mi... *nfff*... to urvalo kebuli..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40803
msgid "Head... hurts... like... the... devil..."
msgstr "Hlava... bolí... jako... čert..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40804
msgid "Nearly... nearly got me... with that one... head spinning..."
msgstr "Skoro... skoro mě to dostalo... kebule... se mi točí..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40805 game/combatai.msg:40834
msgid "Can't... black out... gotta stay conscious..."
msgstr "Nemůžu... odpadnout... musím zůstat při vědomí..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40806
msgid "Another hit to the head like that, an' I'm a goner..."
msgstr "Ještě jedna taková rána do šišky a je po mně..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40807
msgid "Thank god for that metal plate in my head, or I'd be dead..."
msgstr "Díky bohu, že mám v kebuli tu železnou destičku, jinak by bylo po mně..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40810
msgid "Dammit! I got knifed in that arm back in '03!"
msgstr "Zatraceně! Už jsem tu ruku kdysi pořezanou měl!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40811
msgid "*Hrkkkk* Left arm... hurts like the devil..."
msgstr "*Hrkkkk* Levá ruka... bolí jako čert..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40812
msgid "Left arm's... useless..."
msgstr "Levá ruka... je teď na nic..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40813
msgid "Think that broke... my arm..."
msgstr "Asi mám zlomenou ruku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40814
msgid "Can't... feel my left arm..."
msgstr "Necítím... levou ruku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40815
msgid "*Nfff*...nice try... my arm's... taken worse..."
msgstr "*Nfff*... hezkej pokus... ale moje ruka... už na tom byla hůř..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40816 game/combatai.msg:40825
msgid "*Nfff*...just my arm... it's just my arm..."
msgstr "*Nfff*... jenom do ruky... to bylo jenom do ruky..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40817 game/combatai.msg:40827
msgid "*Nfff*...another... damn arm wound..."
msgstr "*Nfff*... další... zatracený poranění ruky..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40818 game/combatai.msg:40828
msgid "Dislocated my goddamn arm..."
msgstr "Zatraceně, mám vykloubenou ruku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40820
msgid "Dammit! I got shot in that arm back in '01!"
msgstr "Zatraceně! Už jednou mě do tý ruky kdysi střelili!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40821
msgid "*Hrkkkk*...right arm's... useless..."
msgstr "*Hrkkkk*... pravá ruka... je teď na nic..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40822
msgid "*Nffff*...nice try... my arm's... taken worse..."
msgstr "*Nfff*... hezkej pokus... ale moje ruka... už na tom byla hůř..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40823
msgid "Think that broke my arm..."
msgstr "Asi mám zlomenou ruku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40824
msgid "Can't... feel my right arm..."
msgstr "Necítím... pravou ruku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40826
msgid "Gonna... need... some... more... arm protection..."
msgstr "Budu... potřebovat... nějakou lepší... ochranu na... ruce..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40830
msgid "*Hrrrk*"
msgstr "*Hrrrk*"

#: game/combatai.msg:40831
msgid "*Hrkkk*...nearly got my damn spleen..."
msgstr "*Hrkkk*... skoro jsem přišel o blbý střeva..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40832
msgid "Feels like that shattered some ribs..."
msgstr "Asi mám roztříštěný žebra..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40833
msgid "*Nffff*...gotta stay conscious... heart pounding..."
msgstr "*Nffff*... musím zůstat při vědomí... srdce buší..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40835
msgid "Hell, a chest wound..."
msgstr "Sakra, rána do břicha..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40836
msgid "Hit opened up that old chest wound..."
msgstr "Ta rána mi otevřela starý zranění na hrudi..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40837
msgid "Gonna need some extra stitches across my chest..."
msgstr "Budu potřebovat pár dalších štychů na hrudníku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40838
msgid "*Unffff*...knocked... the wind outta me..."
msgstr "*Unffff*... mám... vyraženej dech..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40839
msgid "*Hrkkk*...dammit... chest... wound... damn... heart's seizing up..."
msgstr "*Hrkkk*... zatraceně... rána do hrudi... zatraceně... chytá mě srdce..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40840
msgid "Keep breathing, Cassidy... just a chest wound..."
msgstr "Dýchej, Cassidy... je to jenom zranění hrudníku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40841
msgid "*Nfffff*...that rattled... some organs loose..."
msgstr "*Nfffff*... to mi nějak... rozhodilo vnitřnosti..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40842
msgid "Shrapnel... in my chest... protected me some..."
msgstr "Střepina... v hrudníku... zachytila to nejhorší..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40843
msgid "Gonna...*hrkkk*...need... some... more... chest armor..."
msgstr "Budu... *hrkkk*... potřebovat... silnější... zbroj... na hrudi..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40845
msgid "*Unffff* Another... goddamn chest wound..."
msgstr "*Unffff* Další... zatracený zranění hrudníku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40846
msgid "*Nfff* Need some help... I've been hit in the chest... bad..."
msgstr "*Nfff* Potřebuju pomoc... dostal jsem to do hrudi... je to zlý..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40847
msgid "Anybody got some stims?! I've taken a hit in the chest!"
msgstr "Nemá někdo Stimpaky?! Dostal jsem to do hrudníku!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40848
msgid "*Unnffff* That snapped a rib... or two..."
msgstr "*Unnffff* Mám zlomený žebro... nebo dvě..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40849
msgid "*Nfff*"
msgstr "*Nfff*"

#: game/combatai.msg:40850
msgid "*Hrkkkk*"
msgstr "*Hrkkkk*"

#: game/combatai.msg:40851
msgid "Chest wound... heart's pounding..."
msgstr "Rána do hrudi... srdce buší..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40852
msgid "*Hrnnn*...chest's... gonna need a lotta stitches..."
msgstr "*Hrnnn*... hrudník bude... potřebovat hodně štychů..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40853
msgid "Think... my lung's been pierced..."
msgstr "Asi mám... propíchnutou plíci..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40854
msgid "Ignore the pain, Cassidy... it's just a chest wound... hang in there..."
msgstr "Ignoruj bolest, Cassidy... je to jenom zranění hrudníku... drž se..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40855
msgid "*Urkkkk* that hit... heart's... pounding..."
msgstr "*Urkkkk* ta rána... srdce... buší..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40856
msgid "That took some meat outta my shoulder..."
msgstr "Utrhlo mi to kus masa z ramene..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40857
msgid "*Unnnffff*...stomach..."
msgstr "*Unnnffff*... žaludek..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40858
msgid "Felt my spine crack..."
msgstr "Praskla mi páteř..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40859
msgid "Felt a rib snap..."
msgstr "Prasklo mi žebro..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40860
msgid "Dammit! I got shot in that leg back in '99."
msgstr "Zatraceně! Už jednou mě do tý nohy kdysi střelili."

#: game/combatai.msg:40861 game/combatai.msg:40871
msgid "*Nfff*...nice... try... my leg's taken worse."
msgstr "*Nfff*... hezkej... pokus... ale moje noha už na tom byla hůř."

#: game/combatai.msg:40862 game/combatai.msg:40872
msgid "That opened up the old wound in my leg..."
msgstr "To mi otevřelo starou ránu na noze..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40863
msgid "Gonna have to keep off my right leg..."
msgstr "Budu muset dávat pozor na pravou nohu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40864
msgid "*Nffff*...right leg's... useless..."
msgstr "*Nffff*... pravá noha... je teď na nic..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40865
msgid "Can't... feel... my right leg..."
msgstr "Necítím... pravou nohu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40866
msgid "*Nfff*...another... goddamn leg wound..."
msgstr "*Nfff*... další... zatracený poranění nohy..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40867 game/combatai.msg:40877
msgid "That fucked my knee up good..."
msgstr "A mám pěkně zkurvený koleno..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40870
msgid "Dammit! I got shot in that leg back in '95."
msgstr "Zatraceně! Už jednou mě do tý nohy kdysi střelili."

#: game/combatai.msg:40873
msgid "Gonna have to keep off my left leg..."
msgstr "Budu muset dávat pozor na levou nohu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40874
msgid "*Nffff*...left leg's... useless..."
msgstr "*Nffff*... levá noha... je teď na nic..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40875
msgid "Can't... feel... my left leg..."
msgstr "Necítím... levou nohu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40876
msgid "*Nff*...another... goddamn leg wound..."
msgstr "*Nff*... další... zatracený poranění nohy..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40880 game/combatai.msg:40895
msgid "*Hrrrkkk*"
msgstr "*Hrrrkkk*"

#: game/combatai.msg:40881
msgid "*Hrnnn*...my... eye..."
msgstr "*Hrnnn*... moje... oko..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40882
msgid "You... only got...*Nfff*...one of my eyes. *Hrkkk* I'm gonna get... both of yours."
msgstr "Dostali... jenom... *Nfff*... jedno oko. *Hrkkk* Já si od tebe... vezmu obě."

#: game/combatai.msg:40883
msgid "My eye... can't see..."
msgstr "Moje oko... nic nevidím..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40884
msgid "Can't see... just red..."
msgstr "Nic nevidím... jenom rudě..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40885
msgid "I don't... need... to see you... to kill you..."
msgstr "Nepotřebuju... vidět... abych... tě mohl... zabít..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40886
msgid "Thank god that eye was fake..."
msgstr "Díky bohu, to bylo moje skleněný oko..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40890
msgid "Hitting me in the balls... THAT'S a new one."
msgstr "Zásah do koulí... JE pro mě novinka."

#: game/combatai.msg:40891
msgid "Hell, you got my family jewels!"
msgstr "Zatraceně, dostal jsem to do koulí!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40893
msgid "My pecker's taken worse."
msgstr "Můj ocas už na tom byl hůř."

#: game/combatai.msg:40894
msgid "Hit me in the jimmy again, and I'm gonna kill you twice."
msgstr "Ještě jednou mě trefíš do šulina a zabiju tě dvakrát."

#: game/combatai.msg:40897
msgid "I'm gonna have to get a cup if this keeps up."
msgstr "Jestli to bude takhle pokračovat, budu si muset pořídit suspenzor."

#: game/combatai.msg:40898
msgid "Stay away from my groin, you bastard!"
msgstr "Na koule mi nešahej, bastarde!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40899
msgid "*Hrrrkk... we playing... rochambeau...?!"
msgstr "*Hrrrkk... my hrajeme... rošambo...?!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40900
msgid "Gotta fall back..."
msgstr "Musím ustoupit..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40901
msgid "Last time I get into a fight without more body armor."
msgstr "To je naposled, co jdu do boje s tak slabou zbrojí."

#: game/combatai.msg:40902
msgid "Next time for you, you sonuvabitch..."
msgstr "Příště to schytáš, zkurvysyne..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40903
msgid "Next time I'm packing a goddamn rocket launcher... and more stims."
msgstr "Příště si s sebou vezmu zatracenej raketomet... a víc Stimpaků."

#: game/combatai.msg:40904
msgid "If I was just twenty years younger, I coulda made it through this fight..."
msgstr "Bejt o dvacet let mladší, tak bych tendle souboj zvládnul..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40905
msgid "Bastards really working me over..."
msgstr "Ti bastardi mě pěkně dávaj..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40906
msgid "Thought that damn yellow streak of mine had faded..."
msgstr "Už jsem myslel, že jsem se toho zbabělství zbavil..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40907
msgid "True grit is knowing when to haul ass."
msgstr "Pravá odvaha se pozná podle toho, že víš, kdy vzít nohy na ramena."

#: game/combatai.msg:40908
msgid "Gotta know when to hold 'em, when to fold 'em, and when to run away."
msgstr "Musíš vědět kdy blafovat, kdy to položit, a kdy utýct."

#: game/combatai.msg:40909
msgid "Gotta get to some cover..."
msgstr "Jdu se někam schovat..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40910
msgid "Wait 'til I get my second wind..."
msgstr "Počkej, musím popadnout druhej dech..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40911
msgid "Goddamn old war wound's opened up again..."
msgstr "Zase se mi otevřela ta zatracená rána z války..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40912
msgid "Sorry, friend, I can't take much more of this..."
msgstr "Promiň, příteli, ale už toho víc nevydržím..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40920
msgid "You got about ten seconds to surrender..."
msgstr "Máš asi deset vteřin na odhození zbraně a zvednutí pracek do vzduchu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40921
msgid "Seems we're always getting into one scrap after another..."
msgstr "Vypadá to, že jdeme pořád z boje do boje..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40922
msgid "Time to correct another mistake of mother nature..."
msgstr "Je načase napravit další omyl matky přírody..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40923
msgid "The bomb shoulda weeded all you trash out..."
msgstr "Atomovky vás měly vyhladit všechny..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40924
msgid "I'm gonna beat your sorry ass into oblivion."
msgstr "Zkopu ti tu tvoji prdel do bezvědomí."

#: game/combatai.msg:40925
msgid "Dirty sonuvabitch..."
msgstr "Podělanej zkurvysynu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40926
msgid "*Huf*...I...*Huf*...need more...*Huf*.... action points."
msgstr "*Huf*... potřebuju... *Huf*... víc... *Huf*... akčních bodů."

#: game/combatai.msg:40928
msgid "You're one dead sonuvabitch to pick a fight with us..."
msgstr "To byla chyba se s náma dát do boje, už teď je z tebe mrtvej zkurvysyn..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40929
msgid "Time for Cassidy to show you how we do things in the big city..."
msgstr "A teď ti Cassidy ukáže, jak se to dělá u nás..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40940
msgid "Wish I had a limit break..."
msgstr "Škoda, že nemám berserk..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40941
msgid "Gonna knock out your teeth and use 'em as dice..."
msgstr "Vymlátím ti zuby a udělám si z nich hrací kostky..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40942
msgid "Nothing wrong with you a critical to the eyes won't cure."
msgstr "Neexistuje nic, co by nedokázal vyléčit kritickej do oka."

#: game/combatai.msg:40943
msgid "Gonna kill you, then kill you again..."
msgstr "Zabiju tě a pak tě zabiju ještě jednou..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40944
msgid "I got your number, you little cocksucker..."
msgstr "A máš to spočítaný, ty malej buzerante..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40945
msgid "You're a stubborn one..."
msgstr "Jseš paličatej..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40946
msgid "Yellow-gut summabitch..."
msgstr "Podělanej zkurvysyn..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40947
msgid "You ain't got the sand to take me down..."
msgstr "Nemáš odvahu mě sundat..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40948
msgid "Gonna whale the holy, howling tar outta you..."
msgstr "Vymlátím z tebe duši..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40949
msgid "Ain't used to someone who fights back, are you?"
msgstr "Nejsme zvyklí bojovat s někým, kdo se brání, co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40950
msgid "Nothing like breaking bones to make a man feel alive..."
msgstr "Není nad pár otevřenejch zlomenin, aby se člověk zase cítil naživu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40951
msgid "Don't worry, I'll comfort your widow when you're gone..."
msgstr "Neboj, o tvoji vdovu se postarám až tady nebudeš..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40952
msgid "Looks like you could profit from a beating or two..."
msgstr "Myslím, že pořádnej výprask ti jenom prospěje..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40953
msgid "Time to put you out of your misery..."
msgstr "Je načase tě zbavit utrpení..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40954
msgid "Time to do a little genetic weeding..."
msgstr "Je načase trochu pročistit lidskej genom..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40955
msgid "Hope you got your grave all picked out..."
msgstr "Doufám, že už máš vybranej flek na hrob..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40956
msgid "If you're looking to die, you came to the right place."
msgstr "Jestli chceš zdechnout, tak jseš na správným místě."

#: game/combatai.msg:40957
msgid "Gonna grind you into a thin red paste..."
msgstr "Namelu tě do karbanátků..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40958
msgid "I'm gonna reduce you to an undertaker's nightmare."
msgstr "Udělám z tebe hrobníkovu noční můru."

#: game/combatai.msg:40959
msgid "Gonna blast you into ground round..."
msgstr "Zakopu tě do země..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40960
msgid "Looks like your bark is worse than your bite..."
msgstr "Nejseš až tak nebezpečnej, jak se mi na první pohled zdálo..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40961
msgid "Not today, friend."
msgstr "Dneska ne, příteli."

#: game/combatai.msg:40962
msgid "You're slower than a dead turtle."
msgstr "Jseš pomalejší než zdechlá želva."

#: game/combatai.msg:40963
msgid "Sand in your eyes?"
msgstr "Nemáš v očích písek?"

#: game/combatai.msg:40964
msgid "You aim to please. I shoot to kill."
msgstr "Ty míříš pro potěšení, já střílím pro zabíjení."

#: game/combatai.msg:40965
msgid "You ain't got the sand to take me down."
msgstr "Nemáš odvahu mě sundat."

#: game/combatai.msg:40966
msgid "Looks like you're stupid AND blind."
msgstr "Vypadá to, že jseš blbej A ještě slepej!"

#: game/combatai.msg:40967
msgid "Missed me by a few percentage points."
msgstr "Tak tohle bylo jen o vlásek."

#: game/combatai.msg:40968
msgid "You must be one wall-eyed sonuvabitch"
msgstr "Musíš bejt asi pěkně šilhavej zkurvysyn."

#: game/combatai.msg:40969
msgid "Yer aim's off. Next turn, it's gonna be your head."
msgstr "Nějak ti to míření nejde. Dej si bacha, aby to příště neodnesla tvoje vlastní hlava."

#: game/combatai.msg:40970
msgid "Hell, I'm a fossil, an' I can hit better than you."
msgstr "Sakra, ze mě je už páprda a stejně mířím líp než ty."

#: game/combatai.msg:40971
msgid "Too bad YOU can't reload the game and try again..."
msgstr "To je ale smůla, že si nemůžeš nahrát uloženou pozici a zkusit to znovu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40972
msgid "That woulda connected if you had some skill."
msgstr "To by asi bolelo, pokud by to bylo od někoho, kdo to aspoň trochu umí."

#: game/combatai.msg:40973
msgid "Some advice: Next time, hit the target you're aiming at."
msgstr "Dám ti radu: příště zkus trefit cíl, na který míříš."

#: game/combatai.msg:40974
msgid "Close one..."
msgstr "Skoro..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40975
msgid "Close one, but no cigar."
msgstr "To bylo o chlup."

#: game/combatai.msg:40976
msgid "You ain't gonna get a second chance."
msgstr "Druhou šanci už mít nebudeš."

#: game/combatai.msg:40977
msgid "Slow ass sonuvabitch..."
msgstr "Pomalej zkurvysyne..."

#: game/combatai.msg:40978
msgid "Looks like Cassidy's gonna have to show you how we do things in the big city."
msgstr "Asi ti bude muset Cassidy ukázat, jak se to dělá u nás."

#: game/combatai.msg:40979
msgid "Looks like you need to lay off the sauce before gettin' inta combat."
msgstr "Příště zkus před bojem trochu vystřízlivět."

#: game/combatai.msg:41201
msgid "Dare goath by doath!"
msgstr "Opovaž se mě zase trefit do kebule!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41202
msgid "You hurt my ass-neck."
msgstr "Zranili mi krk."

#: game/combatai.msg:41203
msgid "I see stars."
msgstr "Vidím hvězdičky."

#: game/combatai.msg:41204
msgid "Oh dear, I think I lost more hair."
msgstr "Ajéje, asi jsem přišel o další vlasy."

#: game/combatai.msg:41205
msgid "That crunch couldn't have been good."
msgstr "To křupnutí neznělo moc dobře."

#: game/combatai.msg:41206
msgid "Just a little more off the top."
msgstr "A mám další skalp."

#: game/combatai.msg:41207
msgid "You crunched my face!"
msgstr "Mám rozdrcenou tvář!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41208
msgid "Have a piece of my mind."
msgstr "Tu máš, vem si kousek mojí mysli."

#: game/combatai.msg:41209
msgid "Uh oh. I can't remember anything."
msgstr "Oou. Nemůžu si na nic vzpomenout."

#: game/combatai.msg:41210
msgid "My breaststroke's never going to be the same."
msgstr "Už si nikdy pořádně nezaplavu prsa."

#: game/combatai.msg:41211
msgid "Hah, hah. Wrong arm, ya' putz!"
msgstr "Haha. Špatná ruka, gumo!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41212
msgid "Ack! That hurt."
msgstr "Jau! To bolelo."

#: game/combatai.msg:41213
msgid "Medic! Oh, that's me. Heh, heh."
msgstr "Doktor! Hmm, vždyť to jsem vlastně já. Hehe."

#: game/combatai.msg:41214
msgid "That hand was going bad anyhow."
msgstr "Ta ruka byla stejně špatná."

#: game/combatai.msg:41216 game/combatai.msg:41222
msgid "You disarmed me!"
msgstr "Odzbrojili mě!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41217
msgid "I only need one finger for you."
msgstr "Na tebe mi stačí jeden prst."

#: game/combatai.msg:41218
msgid "There goes my thumb!"
msgstr "A palec je fuč!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41219
msgid "That skin was starting to rot anyway."
msgstr "Stejně mi ta ruka už začala hnít."

#: game/combatai.msg:41220
msgid "That's really going to affect my swing."
msgstr "A mám pokaženej švih."

#: game/combatai.msg:41221
msgid "Jeepers that hurt!"
msgstr "Šmankote, to bolelo!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41223
msgid "There goes my game of eight-ball."
msgstr "A mám po kulečníku."

#: game/combatai.msg:41224
msgid "That's gonna kill me on the court."
msgstr "Na kurtu jsem asi skončil."

#: game/combatai.msg:41225
msgid "No more fastball for me."
msgstr "A s mým skvělým podáním je konec."

#: game/combatai.msg:41226
msgid "You broke my brittle bones!"
msgstr "Mám zlomený zápěstí!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41227
msgid "That crunching sound isn't good."
msgstr "To křupnutí neznělo moc dobře."

#: game/combatai.msg:41228
msgid "I really like my elbow the way it was."
msgstr "Svůj loket jsem měl opravdu rád."

#: game/combatai.msg:41229
msgid "Damn, there go some fingers."
msgstr "Zatraceně, další prsty jsou fuč."

#: game/combatai.msg:41230
msgid "Medic! I need a... Oh, that's me. Oops."
msgstr "Doktor! Hmm, vždyť to jsem vlastně já. A sakra."

#: game/combatai.msg:41231
msgid "I've got ribs."
msgstr "Mám žebra."

#: game/combatai.msg:41232
msgid "Arrrg! My spleen!"
msgstr "Ááááá! Moje břicho!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41233
msgid "There goes my gall bladder!"
msgstr "A mám po žlučníku!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41234
msgid "Heh heh... went right through me... didn't feel a thing."
msgstr "Hehe... proletělo to skrz... a ani jsem nic necítil."

#: game/combatai.msg:41235
msgid "Physician heal thyself."
msgstr "Lékaři, uzdrav sa!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41236
msgid "Uh oh, that's a bad one."
msgstr "Oou, to je vážný."

#: game/combatai.msg:41237
msgid "Hey, we've got a bleeder, and it's me!"
msgstr "Hele, někdo nám tu krvácí... a jsem to já!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41238
msgid "Anyone wanna see some anatomy?"
msgstr "Chce někdo vidět něco z mý anatomie?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41239
msgid "Nothing trims you down like a disembowelment."
msgstr "Není lepší způsob jak zhubnout, než se nechat vykuchat."

#: game/combatai.msg:41240
msgid "To understand life, you must fuck death... in the gallbladder."
msgstr "Pochopíš smysl života jen tehdy, když ojebeš smrt."

#: game/combatai.msg:41241
msgid "Arrrrrrgh! My spine."
msgstr "Áááááááá! Moje páteř."

#: game/combatai.msg:41242
msgid "That's one way to lose ugly pounds and inches."
msgstr "I takhle se daj ztratit přebytečný kila a centimetry."

#: game/combatai.msg:41243
msgid "My legs, I can't feel my legs!"
msgstr "Moje nohy, necítím nohy!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41244
msgid "It's getting so cold all of a sudden."
msgstr "Najednou je mi nějaká zima."

#: game/combatai.msg:41245
msgid "Not another damn scar."
msgstr "Další zatracená jizva."

#: game/combatai.msg:41246
msgid "Like I really needed *that* flensing."
msgstr "Nepotřebuju odtučňovací kůru."

#: game/combatai.msg:41247
msgid "Now, I'll have to patch my skin again."
msgstr "Zase si budu muset zašívat kůži."

#: game/combatai.msg:41248
msgid "If my vital organs weren't already preserved in a jar that woulda hurt."
msgstr "Kdyby moje důležitý orgány nebyly už dávno naložený v lihu, bolelo by mě to."

#: game/combatai.msg:41249
msgid "I outa wrap that with clothe before flies get in there."
msgstr "Budu to muset ucpat nějakým hadrem, nebo se mi tam dostanou mouchy."

#: game/combatai.msg:41250
msgid "Shit! I've got termites!"
msgstr "Do prdele! Lezou po mě termiti!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41251
msgid "I had no idea that I was so dry and brittle."
msgstr "Netušil jsem, že jsem tak vyschlej a křehkej."

#: game/combatai.msg:41252
msgid "Damn, anyone got some duct-tape?"
msgstr "Zatraceně, nemáte někdo lepící pásku?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41253
msgid "(Cough, cough, wheeeeeeeeze)"
msgstr "(Kuc, kuc, sííííííííp)"

#: game/combatai.msg:41254
msgid "Entry wound, exit wound, collect the hole set!"
msgstr "Vstupní rána, výstupní rána a máme celou díru!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41255
msgid "Damn, I've been filleted."
msgstr "Zatraceně, jsem naklepanej jako řízek."

#: game/combatai.msg:41256
msgid "That was my bad side anyway."
msgstr "To byla stejně ta špatná strana."

#: game/combatai.msg:41257
msgid "You cut my nipple off!"
msgstr "Uřízli mi bradavku!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41258
msgid "No thanks, I've already shaved there."
msgstr "Díky, ale tam už jsem se holil."

#: game/combatai.msg:41259
msgid "Even better than liposuction!"
msgstr "Lepší než liposukce!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41260
msgid "That leg was going bad anyhow."
msgstr "Ta noha stejně za nic nestála."

#: game/combatai.msg:41262
msgid "Just need a parrot and an eye-patch now."
msgstr "Teď už jen potřebuju papouška a pásku přes oko."

#: game/combatai.msg:41263
msgid "Gee, it feels as though it's still attached."
msgstr "Hele, zdá se, že pořád drží."

#: game/combatai.msg:41264
msgid "Just call me gimpy."
msgstr "Říkejte mi pajda."

#: game/combatai.msg:41265
msgid "I don't need those toes anyhow."
msgstr "Ty prsty stejně nepotřebuju."

#: game/combatai.msg:41266
msgid "No more line dancing for this old ghoul."
msgstr "Tak tenhle starej ghoul už si moc nezatancuje."

#: game/combatai.msg:41267
msgid "Shattered just like dry-rotted wood."
msgstr "Rozpadla se jako shnilá větev."

#: game/combatai.msg:41268
msgid "I wonder if I can reattach that somehow."
msgstr "Zajímalo by mě, jestli to půjde nějak přidělat."

#: game/combatai.msg:41269
msgid "Not my blue suede shoes!"
msgstr "To ne, moje modré semišové boty!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41270
msgid "No more Mr. Hustle."
msgstr "A se stepováním je konec."

#: game/combatai.msg:41271
msgid "That shin was starting to dry-rot anyway."
msgstr "Ta holeň už stejně začínala hnít."

#: game/combatai.msg:41272
msgid "Thanks for taking care of that for me, it was gangrenous."
msgstr "Díky, už mi ji stejně prožírala gangréna."

#: game/combatai.msg:41273
msgid "Hey, that makes me the gimp."
msgstr "Hej, teď budu kulhat."

#: game/combatai.msg:41274
msgid "There goes my electric hustle."
msgstr "To byla sice moje dřevěná noha, ale stejně to bolelo."

#: game/combatai.msg:41275
msgid "Anyone got a board and some nails to hammer this back together?"
msgstr "Nemá někdo kus prkna a pár hřebíků, ať si to můžu přibít zpátky?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41276
msgid "Who needs kneecaps anyway?"
msgstr "Na co je mi vlastně koleno?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41277
msgid "There go my toes!"
msgstr "A palec je fuč!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41278
msgid "Ouch, shin-splint!"
msgstr "Jau, moje noha!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41279
msgid "I can't feel my toes!"
msgstr "Necítím prsty na nohou!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41280
msgid "Guess I'll need an eyepatch-just call me Nick Dangerous."
msgstr "Pořídím si pásku přes oko a můžete mi říkat Nebezpečný Nick."

#: game/combatai.msg:41281
msgid "Arrrr, matey, brings a tear to me one good eye."
msgstr "Ááárrr, kámo, až mi vyhrkly slzy do oka."

#: game/combatai.msg:41282
msgid "Eye, yai, my, eye!"
msgstr "Oko, joj, moje oko!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41284
msgid "I've got my eye on you, uh, can I have it back now?"
msgstr "Nespustím z tebe oko, eh, vrátíš mi ho?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41285
msgid "I can still find you with my super-hearing."
msgstr "Stejně o tobě vím díky svýmu supersluchu."

#: game/combatai.msg:41286
msgid "Hah, that was my glass-eye!"
msgstr "Haha, to bylo moje skleněný oko!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41287
msgid "Eye'll get you for that."
msgstr "Za to tě dostanu."

#: game/combatai.msg:41288
msgid "Mother? It's getting dark."
msgstr "Mami? Nějak se stmívá."

#: game/combatai.msg:41289
msgid "Eye've had it with you!"
msgstr "Už tě mám fakt dost!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41290
msgid "If there were any ghoul gals, I'd be upset with you."
msgstr "Kdyby existovaly nějaký ghoulky, byl bych teď na tebe naštvanej."

#: game/combatai.msg:41293
msgid "I'd never sing Bass anyway."
msgstr "Už nikdy nebudu zpívat tenor."

#: game/combatai.msg:41294
msgid "Oy-vey!"
msgstr "Ouvej!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41295
msgid "Mazel tov!"
msgstr "Mazel tov!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41296
msgid "I kind of liked being a gentile."
msgstr "Byl jsem rád pohanem."

#: game/combatai.msg:41297
msgid "Like *that's* going to cramp my style."
msgstr "*To* můj styl rozhodně nerozhodí."

#: game/combatai.msg:41298
msgid "From a bull to a steer in one blow."
msgstr "Z býka na vola jedinou ranou."

#: game/combatai.msg:41299
msgid "I feel like I should be guarding a harem now."
msgstr "Myslím, že bych teď mohl dělat strážce harému."

#: game/combatai.msg:41300
msgid "Uh oh, my spidey-sense is tingling."
msgstr "Oou, můj pavoučí smysl mě varuje."

#: game/combatai.msg:41301
msgid "Damn, they've got kryptonite. I'm out of here."
msgstr "Zatraceně, mají kryptonit. Mizím odsud."

#: game/combatai.msg:41302
msgid "No one told me it would be dangerous!"
msgstr "Nikdo mi neřekl, že to bude nebezpečný!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41303
msgid "What do you mean they're armed!?"
msgstr "Co myslíš tím, že jsou ozbrojení!?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41304
msgid "Run awaaaaaay!"
msgstr "Utečtéééééé!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41306
msgid "Incoming!!!!!!"
msgstr "Už běžím!!!!!!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41307
msgid "My super-powers are useless against this foe!"
msgstr "Moje superschopnosti jsou proti tomuhle protivníkovi k ničemu!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41308
msgid "Uh, I've got to talk to a man about a horse."
msgstr "Eh, musím si promluvit s jedním chlápkem o jednom koni."

#: game/combatai.msg:41309
msgid "I'll be right back. Don't wait up."
msgstr "Hned jsem zpátky. Nemusíš na mě čekat."

#: game/combatai.msg:41310
msgid "No, no, no. You go ahead. I'll catch up-later."
msgstr "Ne, ne, ne. Ty jdi napřed, já tě pak dohoním."

#: game/combatai.msg:41311
msgid "I'm late for my root-canal. See you later."
msgstr "Přijdu pozdě na terapii. Zatím."

#: game/combatai.msg:41312
msgid "And then we get inside the giant rabbit and...."
msgstr "A potom jsme vstoupili do obrovského králíka a..."

#: game/combatai.msg:41313
msgid "Jesus Christ! Run for it!!!!!"
msgstr "Ježíši Kriste! Utečte!!!!!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41314
msgid "For the love of God, get me out of here!"
msgstr "Proboha, dostaňte mě odsud!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41315
msgid "Just let me live through this one."
msgstr "Nech mě prosím žít."

#: game/combatai.msg:41316
msgid "Oh, please, please, please, please."
msgstr "Ach prosím, prosím, prosím, prosím."

#: game/combatai.msg:41317
msgid "Feets don't fail me now!"
msgstr "Nožičky, zdrhejte! Nesmíte mě teď zklamat!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41318
msgid "I'm gonna make like a shepherd and get the flock out of here!"
msgstr "Beru nohy na ramena a mizím odsud!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41319
msgid "I'm makin' like a banana and splittin'!"
msgstr "Nezůstanu tu už ani vteřinu!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41320
msgid "I've got a bad feeling about this."
msgstr "Mám z toho špatnej pocit."

#: game/combatai.msg:41321
msgid "My spidey-sense is definitely tingling."
msgstr "Můj pavoučí smysl mě doopravdy varuje."

#: game/combatai.msg:41322
msgid "It's only a rabbit."
msgstr "To je jenom králík."

#: game/combatai.msg:41323
msgid "It's got teeth how many inches long?"
msgstr "Jak velký to má zuby?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41324
msgid "Yeah, they've gotta be scared now."
msgstr "Jo, už by měli bejt strachy bez sebe."

#: game/combatai.msg:41325
msgid "Watch out, here I come."
msgstr "Tak bacha, já přicházím."

#: game/combatai.msg:41326
msgid "Ready or not, here I come!"
msgstr "Připravenej nebo ne, já přicházím!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41327
msgid "Lenny to the rescue!"
msgstr "Lenny zachraňuje!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41328
msgid "Be vewy quiet. Wew hunting Wabbits."
msgstr "Vuťte fotiše! Louíme kuálíky!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41329
msgid "I'm not sure that this is such a great idea."
msgstr "Nejsem si jistej, že je to dobrej nápad."

#: game/combatai.msg:41330
msgid "You go first, I'll watch the rear."
msgstr "Jdi napřed, já tě budu krejt zezadu."

#: game/combatai.msg:41331
msgid "I don't know, it seems kinda dangerous."
msgstr "Já nevím, vypadá to docela nebezpečně."

#: game/combatai.msg:41332
msgid "Are you sure this is really necessary?"
msgstr "Víš určitě, že je to opravdu nutný?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41333
msgid "Well, if this is the only way."
msgstr "No, když to jinak nejde."

#: game/combatai.msg:41334
msgid "I just don't think I'm cut out for this."
msgstr "Já si prostě nemyslím, že se na takový věci hodím."

#: game/combatai.msg:41335
msgid "Hey, a fella could get hurt doin' this, ya'know."
msgstr "Hele, někdo by se mohl zranit, víš."

#: game/combatai.msg:41336
msgid "Isn't there another way to resolve this?"
msgstr "Nedalo by se to vyřešit nějak jinak?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41338
msgid "Someone's going to get hurt, probably me."
msgstr "Někdo tu přijde k úrazu... nejspíš já."

#: game/combatai.msg:41339
msgid "Tell, me when I have to open my eyes."
msgstr "Řekni mi, až budu moct otevřít oči."

#: game/combatai.msg:41340
msgid "Hai-Keeba!"
msgstr "Hai-kýbáá!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41341
msgid "He shoots, he scores!"
msgstr "Střílí a zasahuje!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41342
msgid "...and the crowd goes wild!"
msgstr "...a davy šílí!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41343
msgid "Tremble in fear, mighty Lenny now is here!"
msgstr "Třeste se strachy, mocný Lenny je tady!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41344
msgid "Yah, that's right, who's the badass now!"
msgstr "Jo, teď už nejseš takovej drsňák, co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41345
msgid "I'll give you *such* a pinch!"
msgstr "To jen štípne!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41346
msgid "I'll moiderize ya'!"
msgstr "Rozpůlím tě!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41347
msgid "I'm gonna git you sucka!"
msgstr "Já tě dostanu, ty hajzle!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41348
msgid "Nobody messes with *crazy* Lenny."
msgstr "Na *šílenýho* Lennyho si nikdo dovolovat nebude!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41349
msgid "You just better stop it or, or I'll, uh...."
msgstr "Radši toho nech, nebo ti, eh..."

#: game/combatai.msg:41350
msgid "I did it, I actually did it!"
msgstr "Dokázal jsem to! Já to vážně dokázal!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41351
msgid "You hate me, you really hate me!"
msgstr "Ty mě nenávidíš, ty mě fakt nenávidíš!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41352
msgid "Haii-yah!"
msgstr "Haj-jáá!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41353
msgid "Now you are the learner."
msgstr "Tak a teď tě něco naučím."

#: game/combatai.msg:41354
msgid "Oh, dear, oh me, oh my."
msgstr "Ach bože, ach ne, ach jo."

#: game/combatai.msg:41356
msgid "And this!"
msgstr "A tady ještě!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41357
msgid "Bifff!!"
msgstr "Pic!!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41358
msgid "Pow!!"
msgstr "Prásk!!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41359
msgid "Kablam!!"
msgstr "Bumbác!!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41360
msgid "Heh, heh, tricked ya."
msgstr "Hehe, zmátl jsem tě."

#: game/combatai.msg:41361
msgid "Phew, that was close."
msgstr "Uf, to bylo těsný."

#: game/combatai.msg:41362
msgid "Hey, watch it, you almost hit me."
msgstr "Hej, dávej pozor, málem jsem to dostal."

#: game/combatai.msg:41363
msgid "Oy vey!"
msgstr "Oj jej!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41364
msgid "Nyah, nyah-nyah, nyah-nyah"
msgstr "Hé-hé hé-hé hé-hé"

#: game/combatai.msg:41368
msgid "Betcha didn't expect that move didja?"
msgstr "To bylo pěkně nečekaný, co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41369
msgid "Swing, batta, batta. Swing!"
msgstr "Švih, bum, bum. Švih!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41370
msgid "This old ghoul's more spry than you bargained for huh?"
msgstr "Tenhle starej ghoul je na tebe kapku rychlej, co?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41371
msgid "You sure *talk* tough."
msgstr "Tvrdě *mluvit* umíš no."

#: game/combatai.msg:41373
msgid "Dis is not a chawade."
msgstr "Tofle není žádná šauáda!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41374
msgid "Dis wequires toto concentwation."
msgstr "Musíš se soustvuedit."

#: game/combatai.msg:41375
msgid "You can do better than *that*."
msgstr "Určitě to umíš i líp."

#: game/combatai.msg:41376
msgid "Oh, come now."
msgstr "Ale no tak."

#: game/combatai.msg:41377
msgid "Was that the best you can do? Was it really?"
msgstr "Líp to neumíš? Fakt?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41378
msgid "I just don't think you're trying."
msgstr "Myslím, že se ani nesnažíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:41379
msgid "Your heart's not in this is it?"
msgstr "Dej do toho srdce."

#: game/combatai.msg:41600
msgid "Oooh, my brains."
msgstr "Och, můj mozek."

#: game/combatai.msg:41601
msgid "Good Lord!"
msgstr "Dobrý bože!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41602
msgid "My noggin!"
msgstr "Moje šiška!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41603
msgid "I've taken worse."
msgstr "Zažil jsem i horší."

#: game/combatai.msg:41604
msgid "You call that a hit?"
msgstr "Tomu říkáš zásah?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41605
msgid "Human, you've got a lot of nerve."
msgstr "Človíčku, ty si teda troufáš."

#: game/combatai.msg:41606
msgid "Enough playing nice."
msgstr "Tak a teď budu zlý."

#: game/combatai.msg:41607
msgid "Okay, that does it. You're dead."
msgstr "Tak fajn. Teď zemřeš."

#: game/combatai.msg:41608
msgid "Ay-yi-yi!"
msgstr "Jaů-ů-ů!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41609
msgid "I think you took off an ear!"
msgstr "Myslím, že mi chybí ucho!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41611
msgid "My humerus!"
msgstr "Můj loket!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41612
msgid "That stings!"
msgstr "To štípe!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41613
msgid "I think you smacked my funnybone."
msgstr "Myslím, že mám roztříštěnou paži."

#: game/combatai.msg:41614
msgid "Okay, this isn't funny."
msgstr "Hele, to nebylo moc srandovní."

#: game/combatai.msg:41615 game/combatai.msg:41628
msgid "My bicep!"
msgstr "Můj biceps!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41616 game/combatai.msg:41629
msgid "My tricep!"
msgstr "Můj triceps!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41617
msgid "Ow, my wrist."
msgstr "Au, moje zápěstí."

#: game/combatai.msg:41618
msgid "If I can't type anymore, you're dead."
msgstr "Jestli už nebudu moct psát na stroji, tak tě zabiju!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41619
msgid "That's my writing hand!"
msgstr "Tou rukou píšu!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41620
msgid "Ow, my shooting hand."
msgstr "Au, touhle rukou střílím."

#: game/combatai.msg:41622 game/combatai.msg:41630
msgid "Mother of god!"
msgstr "Matko boží!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41623 game/combatai.msg:41631
msgid "I've taken worse in practice."
msgstr "Při tréninku jsem zažil horší."

#: game/combatai.msg:41624
msgid "Was that supposed to hurt?"
msgstr "To mělo bolet?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41625
msgid "Did a bee just sting me?"
msgstr "Nepíchla mě včela?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41626 game/combatai.msg:41632
msgid "I think you grazed me."
msgstr "Asi jsem se někde škrábnul."

#: game/combatai.msg:41627 game/combatai.msg:41633
msgid "Ouch! Dammit!"
msgstr "Jauvajs! Zatraceně!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41635
msgid "My liver!"
msgstr "Moje játra!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41636
msgid "My innards feel like jelly."
msgstr "Vnitřnosti mám jak ze želatiny."

#: game/combatai.msg:41637
msgid "Let me return the favor."
msgstr "Počkej, oplatím ti tu laskavost."

#: game/combatai.msg:41638
msgid "I've had ENOUGH!"
msgstr "Už toho mám DOST!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41639
msgid "Are you having fun yet?"
msgstr "Pořád se bavíš?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41640
msgid "Stop that."
msgstr "Nech toho."

#: game/combatai.msg:41641
msgid "Do you really think you're tough?"
msgstr "Fakt si myslíš, že jsi tvrďák?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41642
msgid "Violence never solves anything."
msgstr "Násilí nikdy nic nevyřeší."

#: game/combatai.msg:41644
msgid "Cut that out."
msgstr "Nech toho."

#: game/combatai.msg:41645
msgid "I've had about all I can take of you."
msgstr "Tak, a už toho mám po krk."

#: game/combatai.msg:41646
msgid "I am NOT a merry mutant."
msgstr "Já NEJSEM veselý mutant."

#: game/combatai.msg:41647
msgid "Ow! Quit it."
msgstr "Au! Nech toho."

#: game/combatai.msg:41648
msgid "God! My stomach!"
msgstr "Bože! Můj žaludek!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41650
msgid "My appendix!"
msgstr "Můj apendix!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41651
msgid "A little lower and I'd be sterile."
msgstr "Trochu níž a byl bych sterilní."

#: game/combatai.msg:41652
msgid "You are really pissing me off."
msgstr "Už mě fakt sereš."

#: game/combatai.msg:41653
msgid "Dammit, not my spleen!"
msgstr "Zatraceně, do břicha ne!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41654
msgid "Why, you little weasel..."
msgstr "Ty malej skunku..."

#: game/combatai.msg:41655
msgid "Stop hitting me!"
msgstr "Přestaň mi ubližovat!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41656
msgid "You're making a big mistake."
msgstr "Děláš velkou chybu."

#: game/combatai.msg:41657
msgid "::wheezes::"
msgstr "::síp::"

#: game/combatai.msg:41658
msgid "You knocked the breath outta me!"
msgstr "Vyrazili mi dech!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41659
msgid "Normal, you're going to pay for that."
msgstr "Za tohle zaplatíš, normále."

#: game/combatai.msg:41660
msgid "I guess I'll have a limp."
msgstr "Asi budu kulhat."

#: game/combatai.msg:41661
msgid "Ooh, my thigh."
msgstr "Och, moje stehno."

#: game/combatai.msg:41663
msgid "I said stop that."
msgstr "Řekl jsem nech toho."

#: game/combatai.msg:41664
msgid "I'm going to hop on you."
msgstr "Asi tě poskáču."

#: game/combatai.msg:41665
msgid "Oh, my bad leg!"
msgstr "Och, moje špatná noha!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41666
msgid "Gonna make it harder to kick your ass."
msgstr "Teď to bude trochu těžší ti nakopat prdel."

#: game/combatai.msg:41669 game/combatai.msg:41678
msgid "Stupid normal!"
msgstr "Blbej normál!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41670
msgid "Mother...!"
msgstr "Mami...!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41672
msgid "My ankle!"
msgstr "Můj kotník!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41673
msgid "My calf!"
msgstr "Moje lýtko!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41676
msgid "That's gonna scar."
msgstr "Zůstane tam jizva."

#: game/combatai.msg:41680
msgid "Aaah!"
msgstr "Aaach!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41682 game/combatai.msg:41689
msgid "My aqueous humor!"
msgstr "Moje nitrooční tekutina!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41683
msgid "My retina!"
msgstr "Moje sítnice!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41684
msgid "Arrr!"
msgstr "Árrr!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41686
msgid "Get me an eyepatch!"
msgstr "Sežeňte mi pásku přes oko!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41687
msgid "My cornea!"
msgstr "Moje rohovka!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41688
msgid "My iris!"
msgstr "Moje duhovka!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41690
msgid "Shit! Now I'm sterile for sure!"
msgstr "Do prdele! Tak teď už jsem určitě sterilní!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41691
msgid "Aieeeeeeeee!"
msgstr "Jaůůůůůůůůůů!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41692
msgid "My testicles!"
msgstr "Moje varlata!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41693
msgid "Oh... gods..."
msgstr "Ach... bože..."

#: game/combatai.msg:41694
msgid "Ow. Ow. OW!"
msgstr "Au. Au. AU!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41696
msgid "The horror... the horror..."
msgstr "To jsou muka... to jsou muka..."

#: game/combatai.msg:41697
msgid "::gasping::"
msgstr "::síp::"

#: game/combatai.msg:41698
msgid "That... hurts..."
msgstr "To... bolelo..."

#: game/combatai.msg:41699
msgid "Oh, bad form!"
msgstr "Och, takové zlé chování!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41700
msgid "Screw you guys, I'm going home."
msgstr "Seru na vás, já jdu domů."

#: game/combatai.msg:41701
msgid "Never thought I'd see the day..."
msgstr "Nikdy by mě nenapadlo, že přijde den, kdy..."

#: game/combatai.msg:41702
msgid "Stupid ::mumble mumble::"
msgstr "Pitomý ::mumly mumly::"

#: game/combatai.msg:41703
msgid "Strategic retreat! Let's go!"
msgstr "Strategickej ustup! Pryč!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41704
msgid "I am NOT a merry mutant!"
msgstr "Já NEJSEM veselý mutant!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41705
msgid "There is no honor in retreat."
msgstr "Na ústupu není nic čestnýho."

#: game/combatai.msg:41706
msgid "Man oh man... running away."
msgstr "Ouha... běžím pryč."

#: game/combatai.msg:41707
msgid "Shit. I gotta go."
msgstr "Doprdele. Musím běžet."

#: game/combatai.msg:41708
msgid "This just ain't right."
msgstr "Tohle prostě není dobrý."

#: game/combatai.msg:41709
msgid "I got your backs."
msgstr "Kreju vám záda."

#: game/combatai.msg:41710
msgid "Let's move it out!"
msgstr "Ustupte!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41711
msgid "Come on, yokels!"
msgstr "Nechte toho, křupani!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41713
msgid "Feet, don't fail me now."
msgstr "Nožičky, nezklamte mě."

#: game/combatai.msg:41714
msgid "Ye gods... if other mutants could see me now."
msgstr "Bohové... kdyby mě tak viděli ostatní mutanti."

#: game/combatai.msg:41715
msgid "::shakes his head and runs::"
msgstr "::třese hlavou a běží pryč::"

#: game/combatai.msg:41716
msgid "Never used to have to run."
msgstr "Nikdy jsem nemusel utíkat."

#: game/combatai.msg:41717
msgid "Must be slipping in my old age."
msgstr "Asi stárnu."

#: game/combatai.msg:41718
msgid "What the hell am I doing?"
msgstr "Co to sakra dělám?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41719
msgid "Here I go..."
msgstr "Tak já jdu..."

#: game/combatai.msg:41720
msgid "I got a can of Sh! with your name on it."
msgstr "Mám pro tebe rakev s tvým jménem."

#: game/combatai.msg:41722
msgid "You screwed with the wrong guy."
msgstr "To byla chyba mě takhle vytočit."

#: game/combatai.msg:41723
msgid "I'm gonna enjoy this..."
msgstr "To si vychutnám..."

#: game/combatai.msg:41724
msgid "Feet, hands, head... all going in your asshole."
msgstr "Nohy, ruce, hlava... všechno ti to narvu do prdele."

#: game/combatai.msg:41725
msgid "Bend over, pal..."
msgstr "Sehni se, kámo..."

#: game/combatai.msg:41726
msgid "This oughta be fun."
msgstr "Tohle bude sranda."

#: game/combatai.msg:41727
msgid "One asskicking, comin' up."
msgstr "Tady chce někdo dostat na prdel."

#: game/combatai.msg:41728
msgid "Idiots... flee!"
msgstr "Idioti... utečte!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41730
msgid "Don't make me kill you."
msgstr "Nenuť mě tě zabít."

#: game/combatai.msg:41731
msgid "Gonna have to break out the big guns, huh?"
msgstr "Asi na tebe budu muset vytáhnout pořádnou bouchačku."

#: game/combatai.msg:41732
msgid "Shit, it looks like you're outnumbered."
msgstr "Doprdele, vypadá to, že jsi v početní nevýhodě."

#: game/combatai.msg:41733
msgid "Here comes trouble."
msgstr "A máme tu problém."

#: game/combatai.msg:41734
msgid "Time to add another notch to the gun."
msgstr "Je načase přidat další zářez na pažbu."

#: game/combatai.msg:41735
msgid "You better run, suckah."
msgstr "Radši zdrhej, sráči."

#: game/combatai.msg:41736
msgid "Gun, meet enemy. Enemy, meet gun."
msgstr "Zbrani, seznam se s nepřítelem. Nepříteli, seznam se s mou zbraní."

#: game/combatai.msg:41737
msgid "Imagine this fist down your throat."
msgstr "Teď si představ ten pocit, až ti tuhle pěst narvu do krku."

#: game/combatai.msg:41738
msgid "This is going to hurt you."
msgstr "Tohle tě bude bolet."

#: game/combatai.msg:41739
msgid "This is gonna hurt you a lot more than it hurts me."
msgstr "Tohle tě bude bolet mnohem víc než mě."

#: game/combatai.msg:41740
msgid "Here... you... GO!"
msgstr "Tak... tady... MÁŠ!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41741
msgid "Just like the old days."
msgstr "Jako za starejch časů."

#: game/combatai.msg:41742
msgid "Head, meet ass."
msgstr "Hlavo, seznam se s prdelí."

#: game/combatai.msg:41743
msgid "Die, crapsucker."
msgstr "Zdechni, hovnocuce."

#: game/combatai.msg:41744
msgid "Why don't you just lie down and die?"
msgstr "Proč si prostě nelehneš a nezdechneš?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41745
msgid "Gonna give up?"
msgstr "Vzdáváš se?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41746
msgid "Lie down, shithead!"
msgstr "Padni, sráči!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41747
msgid "Take it like a little girl!"
msgstr "Ber to jako malá holka!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41748
msgid "You like this?"
msgstr "Líbí se ti to?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41749
msgid "You want more of this?"
msgstr "Chceš víc?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41750
msgid "Here it comes."
msgstr "A už je to tady."

#: game/combatai.msg:41751
msgid "People never learn."
msgstr "Lidé se nikdy nepoučí."

#: game/combatai.msg:41752
msgid "Sometimes I get tired of violence."
msgstr "Občas mě násilí nudí."

#: game/combatai.msg:41753
msgid "You got relatives?"
msgstr "Máš příbuzný?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41754
msgid "When was the last time you got spanked?"
msgstr "Kdy ti naposled někdo naplácal na zadek?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41755
msgid "Chris Avellone loves you!"
msgstr "Chris Avellone tě miluje!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41756
msgid "Here's a little mutant love tap."
msgstr "Tady máš malej mutantí pohlavek."

#: game/combatai.msg:41757
msgid "Regards, pal."
msgstr "S pozdravem, kámo."

#: game/combatai.msg:41758
msgid "Give my best to St. Peter."
msgstr "Pozdrav ode mě Svatýho Petra."

#: game/combatai.msg:41759
msgid "One fist, two fist, red fist, blue fist..."
msgstr "Jedna pěst, druhá pěst, červená pěst, modrá pěst..."

#: game/combatai.msg:41761
msgid "Let me know when you get scary."
msgstr "Dej mi vědět, kdy se mám začít bát."

#: game/combatai.msg:41762
msgid "Next."
msgstr "Další."

#: game/combatai.msg:41763
msgid "Take a number."
msgstr "Vyber si číslo."

#: game/combatai.msg:41764
msgid "Bzzt! That's a miss!"
msgstr "Eeeee! Vedle!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41765
msgid "You people ever quit?"
msgstr "Skončíš někdy?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41766
msgid "Yawn."
msgstr "Zív."

#: game/combatai.msg:41767
msgid "Amateurs."
msgstr "Amatéři."

#: game/combatai.msg:41768
msgid "Target practice, kid."
msgstr "Zkus trochu trénovat, dítě."

#: game/combatai.msg:41769
msgid "Keep at it. Maybe you'll hit me someday."
msgstr "Jen tak dál, třeba se jednoho dne trefíš."

#: game/combatai.msg:41770
msgid "When does the action start?"
msgstr "Tak kdy už bude nějaká akce?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41771
msgid "I need a nice cold drink. Nothing's happening here."
msgstr "Dal bych si vychlazený pití, je tu nuda."

#: game/combatai.msg:41772
msgid "Where's the excitement?"
msgstr "Kde je nějaký vzrušení?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41773
msgid "Oh! You were aiming at ME!"
msgstr "Aha! Ty míříš na MĚ!"

#: game/combatai.msg:41774
msgid "You practice missing that badly?"
msgstr "Ty si to střílení vedle trénuješ?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41775
msgid "Thanks, try again."
msgstr "Díky, zkus to znovu."

#: game/combatai.msg:41776
msgid "That's not it."
msgstr "Takhle ne."

#: game/combatai.msg:41777
msgid "::looks at his watch::"
msgstr "::dívá se na hodinky::"

#: game/combatai.msg:41778
msgid "Isn't this violence pointless?"
msgstr "Není tohle násilí zbytečný?"

#: game/combatai.msg:41779
msgid "Can't we just get along?"
msgstr "Proč spolu nemůžeme všichni vycházet?"

#: game/combatai.msg:42000
msgid "ignore the pain in my head ignore the pain in my head"
msgstr "Ignoruj bolest v hlavě, ignoruj bolest v hlavě."

#: game/combatai.msg:42001
msgid "Aighh! There's blood all over my face! Help! Stimpak! Help!"
msgstr "Ajajaj! Mám krev po celým obličeji! Pomóc! Stimpak! Pomóc!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42002
msgid "MY HEAD! MY HEAD! I'VE BEEN HIT IN THE HEAD! HELP! HELP!"
msgstr "MOJE HLAVA! MOJE HLAVA! DOSTAL JSEM TO DO HLAVY! POMÓC! POMÓC!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42003
msgid "Oooooooh. There goes a few Intelligence points."
msgstr "Oooooooch. Přišel jsem o pár bodů Inteligence."

#: game/combatai.msg:42004
msgid "Are these pieces of my brain in my hands?"
msgstr "Držím snad v rukách kousky svýho mozku?"

#: game/combatai.msg:42005
msgid "Where did my ear go?"
msgstr "Kam zmizelo moje ucho?"

#: game/combatai.msg:42006
msgid "Ooooh! My first head wound! I've never... ow. Owwwww. OWWWWW."
msgstr "Ooooch! Moje první zranění hlavy! Nikdy bych... au. Aůůůů. JAUUUUUU."

#: game/combatai.msg:42007
msgid "Hey! What is my ear doing on the ground?!"
msgstr "Hej! Co dělá moje ucho na zemi?!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42008
msgid "Either I've been hit in the head, or this is the worst migraine I've ever had."
msgstr "Buď jsem byl zasaženej do hlavy, nebo mám tu nejhorší migrénu, jakou jsem kdy měl."

#: game/combatai.msg:42009
msgid "My face! My beautiful bug-eyed pimply face!"
msgstr "Můj obličej! Můj překrásnej uhrovitej obličej!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42010 game/combatai.msg:42020
msgid "ignore the pain in my arm ignore the pain in my arm"
msgstr "Ignoruj bolest v ruce, ignoruj bolest v ruce."

#: game/combatai.msg:42011 game/combatai.msg:42021
msgid "Aighh! There's blood all over my arm! Help! Stimpak! Help!"
msgstr "Ajajaj! Mám krev po celý ruce! Pomóc! Stimpak! Pomóc!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42012 game/combatai.msg:42022
msgid "MY ARM! MY ARM! I'VE BEEN HIT IN THE ARM! HELP! HELP!"
msgstr "MOJE RUKA! MOJE RUKA! DOSTAL JSEM TO DO RUKY! POMÓC! POMÓC!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42013
msgid "Not my left arm! That's my strong arm!"
msgstr "Do levý ruky ne! To je moje silná ruka!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42014 game/combatai.msg:42023
msgid "Not my hand! Rosie! Rosie Palmer! Speak to me, girl!"
msgstr "Do ruky ne! Rosie! Rosie Palmerová! Řekni něco, holka!!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42015 game/combatai.msg:42024
msgid "Aighhh! My funny bone! I... I...I... must keep... from... laughing..."
msgstr "Ajajaj! Moje brňavka! Já... já... já... musím se... přestat... smát..."

#: game/combatai.msg:42016
msgid "Aieeee! I can't feel my left arm!"
msgstr "Jaůůůů! Necítím levou ruku!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42017
msgid "*Urkkk*...left arm... feels like it's on fire..."
msgstr "*Urkkk*... levá ruka... jako by hořela..."

#: game/combatai.msg:42025
msgid "Aieeee! I can't feel my right arm!"
msgstr "Jaůůůů! Necítím pravou ruku!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42026
msgid "*Urkkk*...right arm... feels like it's on fire..."
msgstr "*Urkkk*... pravá ruka... jako by hořela..."

#: game/combatai.msg:42027
msgid "Not my right arm! I use that one on weekends!"
msgstr "Do pravý ruky ne! Tu používám na víkendy!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42030
msgid "ignore the pain in my chest ignore the pain in my chest"
msgstr "Ignoruj bolest v hrudníku, ignoruj bolest v hrudníku."

#: game/combatai.msg:42031
msgid "My pocket protector!"
msgstr "Můj kapesní protektor!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42032
msgid "*Unfff*...hey... that... was my... last clean shirt."
msgstr "*Unfff*... hej... to... byla moje... poslední čistá košile."

#: game/combatai.msg:42033
msgid "Aighh! There's blood all over my chest! Help! Stimpak! Help!"
msgstr "Ajajaj! Mám krev po celým břiše! Pomóc! Stimpak! Pomóc!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42034
msgid "MY CHEST! MY CHEST! I'VE BEEN HIT IN THE CHEST! HELP! HELP!"
msgstr "MOJE HRUĎ! DOSTAL JSEM TO DO HRUDNÍKU! POMÓC! POMÓC!"

#: game/combatai.msg:42035
msgid "*Urkkk*...chest... feels like it's on fire..."
