#: game/pro_item.msg:57400 game/pro_item.msg:57600
msgid "Lightsaber"
msgstr "Světelný meč"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57401
msgid "An ancient weapon from a more civilized age. Not as clumsy or as random as a blaster. It was given to you by Obi-Wan-Killap. Min ST: 2"
msgstr "Starodávná zbraň z civilizovanější doby. Není tak těžkopádná a nepřesná jako blaster. Daroval ti ji mocný Obi-Wan-Killap. Min. SÍ: 2"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57500
msgid "Blaster"
msgstr "Blaster"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57501
msgid "Hokey religions and ancient weapons are no match for a good blaster at your side, kid. Min ST: 3"
msgstr "Sentimentální náboženství a starobylý zbraně se nedaj srovnávat s pořádným blasterem u pasu, mladej. Min ST: 3"

#: game/pro_item.msg:57601
msgid "An ancient weapon from a more civilized age. Not as clumsy or as random as a blaster. It was given to you by Empress Timeslip. Min ST: 2."
