#: game/pro_scen.msg:94900
msgid "Bed"
msgstr "Postel"

#: game/pro_scen.msg:3401
msgid "A bed, it looks pretty comfortable after what you have been sleeping on."
msgstr "Postel. Vypadá docela pohodlně ve srovnání s tím, na čem obvykle spíš."

#: game/pro_scen.msg:3501 game/pro_scen.msg:3601 game/pro_scen.msg:3701
msgid "A standard bed. Looks comfy."
msgstr "Obyčejná postel. Vypadá pohodlně."

